{"time": 1767933316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760354565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...还是不要啦...希望之后他们不会再找上我。\"吃的差不多，放下碗筷。"}
{"time": 1767933379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532802492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不做无法实现的梦）"}
{"time": 1767933927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826961189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1760354565]“大概也不是我们说了算？”舒蕾笑笑“向上的人际可是稀缺资源……嘛，现在说这些太早了”"}
{"time": 1767933996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298214739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过，今天发生的一切都值得庆祝”她似乎又多瞥了一眼伊恩，虽然即使盯着看，大概也不会有人觉得不妥"}
{"time": 1767934070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "900126083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，值得庆祝。\"也跟着笑一笑，\"现在总算有了进入新生活的实感了。\""}
{"time": 1767934219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "917477545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "最近值得庆祝的事似乎很多，也许...这么想着，拿出自己挎着的日记本靠着椅子背随意地翻开看看。"}
{"time": 1767934373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997057608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你知道的，我要睡了）"}
