{"time": 1767943115, "type": "reply", "message_id": "940841493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D20=6"}
{"time": 1767943117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2002875744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "扩招学生一共就三个班，不过你们并不在同一个班上。宿舍当然也不在同一栋"}
{"time": 1767943171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894858917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "至于舍友名单，现在也看不见"}
{"time": 1767943177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971573240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"不在一个班，稍微有些不太开心，放下说明。"}
{"time": 1767943181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1484254590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "当然看见了也不认识（）"}
{"time": 1767943243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "730764243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（入学考试好像有点邪恶）"}
{"time": 1767943250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911131840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？怎么这样...”有点失落，努力去调整过来“没关系啦...只是不能一起上课而已，下课了再聊也行”不知道在安慰舒茉还是安慰自己"}
{"time": 1767943541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203322056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"稍微有些低落，\"下课了还是能在一起嘛...\""}
{"time": 1767943578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "751049352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你们是去干啥的（））"}
{"time": 1767943590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101012013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(上课不耽误谈恋爱)"}
{"time": 1767943613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1919661916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是谈恋爱耽误上课）"}
{"time": 1767943782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773003462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只是不在一个班，有什么大不了的？”舒蕾翻了个白眼“在未白的时候也不见你们这么腻歪。”"}
{"time": 1767943864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617057066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘿嘿...毕竟现在是正常化了嘛。\""}
{"time": 1767943998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "861420757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"而且，唔...那时候也不知道真正的心意。\""}
{"time": 1767944093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534089366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“今非昔比么...”笑笑"}
{"time": 1767944403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1161415944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那我觉得不在一个班也算是好事”她叹气“也没到那种程度吧，你们两个”"}
{"time": 1767944477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506950649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦。\"凑到妈妈旁边，脑袋搭着肩膀，温声细语\"女儿马上要去上学了诶，妈妈一点都不担心?\""}
{"time": 1767944904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "845672865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她有点噎住了，过了会才开口“总要装装样子的……怎么会不担心呢？第一次要习惯一周只有两天能见到你，其实我更担心对你会越来越不了解”她的声音越来越轻“……恐怕以后你们在学校的时间会越来越长吧”"}
{"time": 1767945045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182166080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以你后续也）"}
{"time": 1767945050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1635222004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没加固啊（））"}
{"time": 1767945122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1353766943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（还真是）"}
{"time": 1767945177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636734559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不会的啦，妈妈实在担心的话，我要不要不住宿舍好啦?\"歪歪头"}
{"time": 1767945415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1839409154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（现在才说吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1767945458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496629405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……也不是不行？”她眨眨眼“如果你的舍友不太妙的话。什么时候回家都可以”"}
{"time": 1767945708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608978246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥，你的主观能动性呢）"}
{"time": 1767945716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622671439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:json,data={\"ver\":\"1.0.0.19\"&#44;\"prompt\":\"&#91;QQ小程序&#93;正义李哥，Faker对RH的ID进行举报\"&#44;\"config\":{\"type\":\"normal\"&#44;\"width\":0&#44;\"height\":0&#44;\"forward\":1&#44;\"autoSize\":0&#44;\"ctime\":1767945702&#44;\"token\":\"838abf71ad52f325476fc9b99fdfe2d3\"}&#44;\"needShareCallBack\":false&#44;\"app\":\"com.tencent.miniapp_01\"&#44;\"view\":\"view_8C8E89B49BE609866298ADDFF2DBABA4\"&#44;\"meta\":{\"detail_1\":{\"appid\":\"1109937557\"&#44;\"appType\":0&#44;\"title\":\"哔哩哔哩\"&#44;\"desc\":\"正义李哥，Faker对RH的ID进行举报\"&#44;\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/open.gtimg.cn\\/open\\/app_icon\\/00\\/95\\/17\\/76\\/100951776_100_m.png?t=1767859525\"&#44;\"preview\":\"https:\\/\\/qq.ugcimg.cn\\/v1\\/o3upv4dbsquu39i05lpnt57nms87ibl41lpug7dk4lrfr9t79f8mfu2pb1je590heq9bosdp9uc0kdhmo3vna078fob5po7olka3os4jcs93s8178c3obgs01ubvico8u5b13og90q9cr06dgv584vs8t4\\/e9vf2tsqr6j29hl2kodb3vahlc\"&#44;\"url\":\"m.q.qq.com\\/a\\/s\\/f19b7caea1bb37908310175624c6c903\"&#44;\"scene\":1036&#44;\"host\":{\"uin\":1040972910&#44;\"nick\":\"划船不靠桨の233\"}&#44;\"shareTemplateId\":\"8C8E89B49BE609866298ADDFF2DBABA4\"&#44;\"shareTemplateData\":{}&#44;\"qqdocurl\":\"https:\\/\\/b23.tv\\/R1UD0N9?share_medium=android&amp;share_source=qq&amp;bbid=XY987989FE130EACC8C8E16FA6F7F7D8D9EB3&amp;ts=1767945699571\"&#44;\"showLittleTail\":\"\"&#44;\"gamePoints\":\"\"&#44;\"gamePointsUrl\":\"\"&#44;\"shareOrigin\":0}}}]"}
{"time": 1767945717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903814530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(伟大无需多言)"}
{"time": 1767945728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749420199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=608978246]（别急）"}
{"time": 1767945742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1548345871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（很急）"}
{"time": 1767945753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861382429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走读也挺好的吧...”思索一下“要不就走读吧”"}
{"time": 1767945772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731880961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以你们为什么不早说要走读）"}
{"time": 1767945777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "959350462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（宿舍都分了（））"}
{"time": 1767946073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1078596803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是宿舍都分了诶...\"在母亲肩膀上咯咯笑，\"那——要是室友不尽人意，我就回来咯?\""}
{"time": 1767946101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "578358578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那样妈妈每天都能看见我啦。\""}
{"time": 1767946135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "935867497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实我有那么一会在想）"}
{"time": 1767946139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1342937875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（识字率的问题）"}
{"time": 1767946249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362898617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎呀，明明不走读也有时间回来看妈妈的吧？”她刮了刮你的鼻子“……开玩笑的，虽然不远，但是天天来回也很麻烦。看你觉得哪边舒服吧。这两天，可以先去收拾宿舍的”"}
