{"time": 1768279547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560172186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1508475637]“那都是小问题嘛，我来就好了。简单画个淡妆就行咯。不过我听说还有化装舞会……嘛，到时候再说”她肆意地伸了个懒腰，优美慵懒的曲线一览无余"}
{"time": 1768279739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "315398529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哇...\"有些羡慕"}
{"time": 1768280006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540511582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"感觉莫奈...对这些事都是得心应手呢...\"羡慕的感觉格外有些多"}
{"time": 1768280132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558153003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她后知后觉地有些不好意思地向下拉了拉衣角“只是喜欢好看的东西嘛……总之，我先睡个午觉，待会见”"}
{"time": 1768280152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687077114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你被莱特传染了？格外有些是什么说法）"}
{"time": 1768280252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160519894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有些格外的多)"}
