{"time": 1768282984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1039940182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也正常)"}
{"time": 1768286094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060425399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，时间很快来到四点。梅琳娜从下往上轻敲你和莫奈的床板“四点到了。”"}
{"time": 1768286101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1491881189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] ）"}
{"time": 1768286606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475821416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2060425399]\"嗯...\"睡得其实有点舒服，深深打了个哈欠，\"醒了...醒了啦...\"习惯性像在家里一样说出口癖"}
{"time": 1768286807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703157696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊，四点了。嗯……差不多差不多。”和你同侧的床轻响起来，是莫奈在下床"}
{"time": 1768287394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1316587496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊酱又睡着了？）"}
