{"time": 1768292206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "892502143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1121439477]“嗯嗯……如果我哪天早上睡过了头而且没被叫醒的话，帮我签到啦”她说完轻咳一声“开玩笑的啦，不收礼。”"}
{"time": 1768292607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763081188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=892502143]\"嗯...\"仔细想了想，\"我可以帮，莫奈，做一个好梦。这样的可以吗？\""}
{"time": 1768292762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1464152002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1599898852]“哦哦，走吧”亚克站起来，理了理衣角。夏洛克倒是没这种需求，他身上的衣服一直很服帖，但还是一副不苟言笑的样子"}
{"time": 1768292807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101458438", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，话说宿舍钥匙是在你们那吗？”"}
{"time": 1768292826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "200431390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你就当没有钥匙这种东西（））"}
{"time": 1768292840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573509597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不锁门吗（）"}
{"time": 1768292855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614413182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然校徽带识别功能听起来很那啥）"}
{"time": 1768292866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2106646759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是别管。魔法世界锁门有什么意义吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1768292931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243453376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“出发出发”前往社团那块“话说亚克和夏洛克你们有什么心仪的社团吗，夏洛克会去参加侦探社吗”"}
{"time": 1768292958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1603739973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=763081188] “梦？”莫奈歪了歪头“难道说，那就是舒茉擅长的魔法？听起来其实更像精神科诶”"}
{"time": 1768293133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "66384714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=243453376]“我不是侦探。魔法学院里也不会有侦探社。”夏洛克拿上一根木手杖，但是也不拿来撑地"}
{"time": 1768293228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "781743282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“社团不都是兴趣社团么，感觉有也正常吧”"}
{"time": 1768293277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449713705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1603739973]\"嗯...与其说是梦...\"有些不好意思地拨了拨额前垂下的刘海，\"其实我的魔法是雾啦...可以让人安眠的雾...\""}
{"time": 1768293320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628454169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（魔法学院没有侦探社的原因是）"}
{"time": 1768293331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370228590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（魔法世界不存在本格推理）"}
{"time": 1768293436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "746387168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=781743282]“那是侦探小说社团，一样没兴趣。”他走得不快不慢，和你们并肩"}
{"time": 1768293481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628762215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊”也没多说什么“亚克呢，有什么感兴趣的社团吗”"}
{"time": 1768293508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1240163003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1449713705]“诶……嗯……”她歪着头看你“嘛，等我哪天失眠了会来找你的。该出发了啦”"}
{"time": 1768293598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122235325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=628762215]“不知道，我还没见过什么社团呢”他摇摇头“也没什么特别的爱好”"}
{"time": 1768293617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804871062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯...\"有些不太好意思接上视线，只是轻微点点头，跟在莫奈身后，末了回头看向梅琳娜，\"梅琳娜要是需要的话...也可以找我...\""}
{"time": 1768293636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334535486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那亚克和我差不多啊”点点头“我也没什么头绪”"}
{"time": 1768294001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726629703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=334535486]“去了再看好了，说不定会有感兴趣的”"}
{"time": 1768294030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916788745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯”表示认同"}
{"time": 1768294102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744136042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1804871062] “……”梅琳娜跟在你背后，过了会才“嗯”了一声"}
{"time": 1768294145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584254500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之两行人来到另一个广场。占地面积当然比集市更大"}
{"time": 1768294165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260426065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那碰到了吗，侦查？）"}
{"time": 1768294218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655066922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "混乱程度倒是稍好，看得出来有人在维持秩序，不过出于展示特色的需要，实际上比集市还叫人不安心"}
{"time": 1768294224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "812766042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（侦呗）"}
