{"time": 1768386729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043976805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“以新生的水平而已，已经相当不错”"}
{"time": 1768386789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716209056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=927084159]反应过来的时候，手心已经湿润了一片，脸颊有些微红，先不管正在一通吃吃的莫奈，回过头看向还在维持着火候的梅琳娜，有些期待，又有些麻烦到她...纠结着开口，\"怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1768386819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929746826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=460751557]（没感觉到啊）"}
{"time": 1768386942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140468880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢学长...要填什么吗”"}
{"time": 1768387249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985480927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=716209056]看起来并没有勉强的样子。她神色如常，静立如雕塑“我没问题。”"}
{"time": 1768387339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1713519230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"点点头，靠近一些她，小声开口，\"梅琳娜之后可以教教我元素的掌控吗...也不能一直这么麻烦梅琳娜...\""}
{"time": 1768387404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308959272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=140468880]“嗯，在这里登记注册就行”他推给你一张表，和一枚十字星徽章"}
{"time": 1768387423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104790739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是说是有徽章，实际上徽章之间并没有什么区别）"}
{"time": 1768387451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832704750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没有身份认证，也没有可供识别的特征）"}
{"time": 1768387485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "324776459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以我现在有点好奇宿舍门到底是什么个机制，要不就当人人都有钥匙得了）"}
{"time": 1768387502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696360341", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好，谢谢学长”填一填，然后边填边问“emmm，学长，最近有没有社团活动之类的”"}
{"time": 1768387521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018634071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=104790739]（这不就跟我们zaca会员卡差不多）"}
{"time": 1768387523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609290342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是魔法世界但凡能弄出实体元素的哪里会缺一把钥匙，什么冰的木头的土的）"}
{"time": 1768387551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394881631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1696360341]（所以说这是特殊机构不是社团（））"}
{"time": 1768387622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058850104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好，谢谢学长”填一填，然后边填边问“emmm，学长，最近有没有什么活动之类的，就是那种培训之类的”"}
{"time": 1768387662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063768094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“凭借徽章，可以进入图书馆中的部分限制区域。在魔法公会购买的时候，也可以享受部分折扣。就学生阶段而言，这就是全部职能了。其余几位有兴趣吗？”"}
{"time": 1768387670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30754866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说做贡献，具体是怎么做贡献，接委托去冒险吗？”感觉自己问题有些问不完"}
{"time": 1768387941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1955237009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1713519230]“我想学院的课程上应该会教。”她注视着火光，金色的眼瞳因此显得有些闪耀“应该会教的比我好。不过我不觉得麻烦。”"}
{"time": 1768388101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2075351390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=30754866]“那的确是途径之一，不过冒险委托一般来说不对新生开放。除非已经抵达熟练级”对方摇头“其他委托，大多是社区服务，比如我现在在做的事”"}
{"time": 1768388153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1106493742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“熟练啊....我会努力的”信心满满"}
