{"time": 1768391077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "309847399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然我看到出来了，但是糊成啥了（）"}
{"time": 1768391102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "307232662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是你看酒桶两件物抗（）"}
{"time": 1768391141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1655809206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（打酒桶可能确实有说法吧，这个没法追着锤，打爆发还可以）"}
{"time": 1768391169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "416517218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=858468459]不保温的话...拜托梅琳娜?...不行不行，摇摇头，自己得赶紧学会元素的魔法才行...扣上盖子，一边神游天外一边等炖菜出锅。"}
{"time": 1768391242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "720112883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=416517218]（我会说有卖魔力转换器的地方）"}
{"time": 1768391265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "129956649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过警惕消费陷阱。大概只有莫奈会缺吧）"}
{"time": 1768391398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "221327420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(自己有那肯定不需要)"}
{"time": 1768391531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941597632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1322485371]“哈哈”他拍着你的肩膀笑得直爽“那我可要努力让你不白巴结了”\n亚克倒是对学长咨询着“日常委托，除了贡献值之外，有结工钱的类型吗？”"}
{"time": 1768391650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454107016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=416517218]水汽从锅盖上的孔洞挤出，锅里的汤汁越来越浓稠，直到学长把你喊回神“时间到了，可以熄火了。”"}
{"time": 1768391679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "581699663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "也听听，自己也不能一直都靠阿姨给钱"}
{"time": 1768391843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499045595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=581699663]“贡献度某种程度上和金钱可以相互转化。接取任务的时候是可以商量的。”他如是回答“直接给工会捐钱也可以提升贡献度。不过这样的贡献度只能拿来换取一些特供商品，不能用于晋升，转换比率也偏低”"}
{"time": 1768391959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165187762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=454107016]\"哦...哦!\"回过神来，刚刚自己好像有点呆?的样子，摇摇头，看向梅琳娜的同时打开锅盖"}
{"time": 1768392006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1172187603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=454107016]梅琳娜默默把火焰散去，看起来坚持这么久，多少还是有些负担。额角有些冒汗，目光有些暗淡。不过表情上看不出什么变化"}
{"time": 1768392111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1686115737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=499045595]（简而言之，比如说靠任务获得的每点贡献可以转换为20银币，靠捐钱可能就得40~60银币才能获得1点贡献）"}
{"time": 1768392136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789675469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1768392236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098836779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把锅盖放在一边，招呼莫奈过来，自己则是伸手拉起梅琳娜，语气带着些歉疚，\"我的魔力，补充给梅琳娜吧...\""}
{"time": 1768392395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "671940987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=499045595]亚克认真地记着什么，夏洛克已经自顾自地把手搭在了水晶球上了。液面上升，倒是比你和亚克明显低一些。"}
{"time": 1768392488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "848077517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“亚克也蛮不错的啊，以后我们一起努力吧”"}
