{"time": 1768470144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974711879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后打开）"}
{"time": 1768470150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2059905295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就是完全展开了（）"}
{"time": 1768470210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812327736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（那你先接着，问问是什么，我还有话要说）"}
{"time": 1768470244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283872785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "接过小箱子“这是？我现在可以打开吗”"}
{"time": 1768470276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655408689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你为什么要把整个盒子给他（）"}
{"time": 1768470290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080060816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一会他问你这勺子是你自己做的吗（）"}
{"time": 1768470308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648355432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（一会他问你这勺子是你自己做的吗（）"}
{"time": 1768470498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1992477438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...”偏过脑袋，“可以是可以...但是...”停了一下，扫了一下周围的人群，“果然还是晚饭的时候再打开啦，明天...明天还给我就行...”"}
{"time": 1768470604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399018617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯？好吧”舒茉送自己的礼物，一定得好好珍惜啊，点点头“谢谢舒茉”"}
{"time": 1768470871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462661132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摇了摇牵在一起的手，小声开口，“嗯...我打算去文学社...伊恩呢？”"}
{"time": 1768471040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013853076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“虽然..我也很想陪舒茉，不过我已经和别人约好了....而且舒茉..”看向她的室友，在转过头来，不知道以一种什么心情说出来“玩的开心..我就不去了”"}
{"time": 1768471118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "406923817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（角色有自己的生活.jpg）"}
