{"time": 1768805587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058995797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(鱼汤里洒胡椒粉不是很常见吗)"}
{"time": 1768805612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467411159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哪种鱼汤，黄的白的）"}
{"time": 1768805620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "957493857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好吧其实我都不喝）"}
{"time": 1768805749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062373343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好像菜还没有上，把舒茉给的盒子摆上来，看看里面是什么"}
{"time": 1768805769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1163218953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(白汤里加胡椒粉调味啦)"}
{"time": 1768805791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1602741641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你终于想起来了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1768805803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947819993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(本来也没忘"}
{"time": 1768806226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621907853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1013522955]做蒸鱼的窗口几乎就是现点现杀了。三个灶台上各架着一个三层蒸笼，大体上做的速度和来客的速度相同。鱼从出水到出餐总共也就半个多小时。不过价格自然偏贵，单人份的小鱼12银，大一些的一条接近30银了"}
{"time": 1768806385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417645684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1062373343]柯林斯见状，索性把菜单递给唯一还有空的亚克“亚克，你看着加点别的吧。”\n盒子里别有洞天，除了一副碗筷，还有些厨具和摸起来还有点热乎的饭盒"}
{"time": 1768806463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1950582530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“oh？”拿出饭盒，舒茉自己做的话，一定得好好尝尝了，打开看看是什么"}
{"time": 1768806625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "107564968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "当然是选择一条小鱼，端着餐盘靠在一边等待"}
{"time": 1768806751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909191608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=107564968]当然不用等.jpg。窗口阿姨给了你一碟，后厨没过多久就端出来另一份现杀好的入笼"}
{"time": 1768806826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998013911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1621907853]莫奈看起来只买了一个胡萝卜野菜馅饼。梅琳娜盘子里的则是配着土豆泥的蛋包饭，分量不多，还有两枚冬枣"}
{"time": 1768806949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460699213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1950582530]看起来有一点点像杂烩。因为茄子和浓稠酱汁的缘故色泽有些黑暗，但即便有些凉了也依旧酱香扑鼻"}
{"time": 1768807021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398303938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看起来蛮好吃的，不过好像量也不小，如果自己全吃完的话，好像也不用吃晚饭了，不过第一口肯定要归自己"}
{"time": 1768807054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "180008142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看上去自己好像点的有点多...有些不好意思地挠挠头在莫奈身边坐下，\"果然中午没怎么吃的话...晚上就会补回来啊...\""}
{"time": 1768807061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218681102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（全吃完不得咸死（））"}
{"time": 1768807343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933900494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "相信舒茉，直接尝一大口"}
{"time": 1768808086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "424898871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1933900494]吃起来倒是没有看上去那么不显山露水。口味相当到位，收的浓稠的酱汁之间还留着些许瓜类的脆嫩，很是下饭。\n亚克点着菜，偏头往你这边看了一眼“这是？你女朋友给你的？”"}
{"time": 1768808140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663369187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...她亲手做的，你们也尝尝吧，这么多我一个人也吃不完，很好吃的”"}
{"time": 1768808649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1386426455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=180008142]“当然啊，不过总感觉今天下午虽然没走多少路，但是经历了好多哦。”莫奈嘴里嚼着馅饼，有点含混不清地道“这个时候是不是该，碰杯来着？第一次宿舍聚餐诶”"}
{"time": 1768808916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1692658026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1663369187]“哦哦，谢谢。那我们可以少点一个菜了？”亚克有些喜出望外，划掉了点餐牌上的一个素菜"}
{"time": 1768808972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148583008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1386426455]\"嗯嗯!我去买饮料。\"放下餐盘，走到柜台买三份饮料"}
{"time": 1768809010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "26924859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "将烩菜推到桌子中间先，然后等上菜了"}
{"time": 1768809472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "983773934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=148583008]一瓶2银，无非是蜂蜜水、果茶之类。倒是也有小麦果汁"}
{"time": 1768809582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516910862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉那个缭乱大马路好洗脑）"}
{"time": 1768809658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308534127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "带着饮料回去，给每个人斟好"}
{"time": 1768809873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1862701134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那就，为了明天?\""}
{"time": 1768810628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762964475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=26924859]“淑女的作品，可拒绝不得”柯林斯颇有兴趣地夹走一块细品“嗯……很不错嘛，几乎要脱离业余水平了。”\n亚克品完同样两眼放光“嗯嗯，好吃。和我家那边味道不一样，但是也好吃”\n夏洛克终于把目光从他的b章鱼上挪开了，拧紧带网孔的盖子后把罐子放在一旁的窗台上，也尝了尝，不过没做任何点评"}
{"time": 1768810677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989352825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是吧，是吧”听他们夸舒茉，自己也开心的不得了"}
{"time": 1768810742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286960584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，我满脑子都是你女朋友真棒这种话）"}
{"time": 1768810878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774606582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（神了）"}
{"time": 1768810947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "801113087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1862701134]“好哦，为了明天~”莫奈咽下嘴里的食物，拿着杯子的手悬在桌面上\n“其实，今天就很好。”梅琳娜依旧轻声，同样举起杯子“不过，也可以。为了明天。”"}
{"time": 1768810957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "667172933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实这句话本意是好的）"}
{"time": 1768810966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "778328669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是执行坏了（对吗））"}
{"time": 1768811150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "315210499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=801113087]\"每天都会很好啦。\"碰完杯喝一口自己的饮料，\"呼，舒服...\"瞪了瞪眼睛，感觉似乎有些不太淑女，咳了两声，\"嗯。\""}
{"time": 1768811737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "992082134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1989352825] 总之，你们一边闲聊着，一边把炖菜当前菜吃得差不多了，硬菜总算上了桌。两块脸一般大、足有四五公分厚的牛肋排极尽豪横，紧随其后的是色泽金黄、表面结着一层焦糖壳的烤鸭。最后则是按人头算的煎秋刀鱼。在如此硬核的肉量前，主食和下饭菜都几乎失去了意义"}
{"time": 1768811927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891643987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哇😯”没见过这种排场，有些吃惊“先来干个杯吧 为之后的校园生活”"}
{"time": 1768812077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081272474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:json,data={\"ver\":\"1.0.0.19\"&#44;\"prompt\":\"&#91;QQ小程序&#93;【AI gumayusi】\\\"不属于zofgk的春日影\\\"\"&#44;\"config\":{\"type\":\"normal\"&#44;\"width\":0&#44;\"height\":0&#44;\"forward\":1&#44;\"autoSize\":0&#44;\"ctime\":1768812073&#44;\"token\":\"05ec444c76aa8d27f85c0b0eef94e098\"}&#44;\"needShareCallBack\":false&#44;\"app\":\"com.tencent.miniapp_01\"&#44;\"view\":\"view_8C8E89B49BE609866298ADDFF2DBABA4\"&#44;\"meta\":{\"detail_1\":{\"appid\":\"1109937557\"&#44;\"appType\":0&#44;\"title\":\"哔哩哔哩\"&#44;\"desc\":\"【AI gumayusi】\\\"不属于zofgk的春日影\\\"\"&#44;\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/open.gtimg.cn\\/open\\/app_icon\\/00\\/95\\/17\\/76\\/100951776_100_m.png?t=1768382285\"&#44;\"preview\":\"https:\\/\\/qq.ugcimg.cn\\/v1\\/qa0m914o2lsi0n44b3j7qiv2od7itb2rls74t3uuv890p5pm46qlukdqbsckgi62v053afnbao1v9gvhf8s1oijos71h08ler58ts8thcf3fdjm4po3728urnv19rtla4mofsojojsrl36ed49qe0jn0qg\\/e9vf2tsqr6j29hl2kodb3vahlc\"&#44;\"url\":\"m.q.qq.com\\/a\\/s\\/52f200fb2ab6fe7e9d6f9925a2fd23a4\"&#44;\"scene\":1036&#44;\"host\":{\"uin\":1040972910&#44;\"nick\":\"划船不靠桨の233\"}&#44;\"shareTemplateId\":\"8C8E89B49BE609866298ADDFF2DBABA4\"&#44;\"shareTemplateData\":{}&#44;\"qqdocurl\":\"https:\\/\\/b23.tv\\/ehtbzCJ?share_medium=android&amp;share_source=qq&amp;bbid=XY987989FE130EACC8C8E16FA6F7F7D8D9EB3&amp;ts=1768812072948\"&#44;\"showLittleTail\":\"\"&#44;\"gamePoints\":\"\"&#44;\"gamePointsUrl\":\"\"&#44;\"shareOrigin\":0}}}]"}
{"time": 1768812318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613147710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=315210499] 自然无人在意你的小小放肆。只是莫奈吃完的快，多少有些百无聊赖"}
{"time": 1768812506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448717021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "慢慢切着鱼片，小片小片入口，配合鲜咸的鱼汤倒是恰到好处，所以吃得格外不着急，\"莫奈吃完了可以先去买要用的东西哦?\""}
{"time": 1768813452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470066360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1891643987]“说得对，敬生活。我们已经比同级生落后了几个月，但这可难不倒我们”柯林斯也举杯，亚克紧随其后，夏洛克不紧不慢，但总归没扫兴“干杯”"}
{"time": 1768813647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1218849394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“干杯!”和大家碰杯，然后一饮而尽，然后开始吃饭!"}
{"time": 1768813916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "425950631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=448717021]“嗯……那我就先走咯？”莫奈挥挥手，起身离席。桌前就只剩你和梅琳娜慢悠悠地着。不对，慢悠悠的只有你， 梅琳娜动作不慢，只是被名为优雅的情节拖累了效率"}
{"time": 1768814321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "770865427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=425950631]慢悠悠送入一口鱼片入嘴，梅琳娜的速度倒也不需要自己加快进度，不过还是有事情想问，于是开了口，\"梅琳娜，待会一起去教学楼吗？那边应该有练习魔法的房间吧？\""}
{"time": 1768814776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337379253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1218849394]（炫饭的过程还是略过了吧.jpg）"}
{"time": 1768814833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "460173554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1768814983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97608963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1218849394]这餐饭足足吃了半个多小时，才勉强吃得七七八八。余下的菜还能装满一个打包盒。亚克和柯林斯倚靠在椅子上喘气，而夏洛克在拿边角料喂保罗"}
{"time": 1768815054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "472586872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "捂着自己的肚子“好撑啊....不过好好吃”"}
{"time": 1768815210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1493665988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=770865427]“我都可以。”梅琳娜咽下一口才回答，依然言简意赅"}
{"time": 1768815374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1445665755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"听到肯定的回答稍微加快进度，消灭掉自己点的清蒸鱼，\"麻烦梅琳娜了。\"坐在她对面等她用完餐。"}
{"time": 1768815422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "339055316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是不是差不多该回去了...”把舒茉给自己准备的盒子和餐具收拾起来"}
{"time": 1768824840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669986009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1445665755]时间相差无几，她也起身“走吧。”"}
{"time": 1768825399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601682023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"起身跟着离开"}
{"time": 1768826830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336110710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=339055316]柯林斯眼都不眨地付了接近五个金币的账，也站了起来，说话都有些费力“居然真的吃完了……回去，得加两组有氧”"}
{"time": 1768826893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1835122391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=601682023]你们一前一后，逆着人流往教学楼方向走。教学楼顶端时钟般的元素圆环此时由蓝色占上风"}
{"time": 1768826974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256223882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有些好奇地看着那上面的蓝色元素，指了指，问梅琳娜，\"那些是冰属性的元素吗？\""}
{"time": 1768827044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1268140527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（咦，我居然一直以为水才是基础元素）"}
{"time": 1768827046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1722713812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（坏了）"}
{"time": 1768827312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1276297075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(四大元素)"}
{"time": 1768827408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "339904964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不就是风火水土吗)"}
{"time": 1768827413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1260625396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1256223882]“没错。在黄昏时最为富集。”她解释到，轻车熟路地带你走进教学楼，一路向上，直到五楼"}
{"time": 1768827643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695691872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"定睛打量一会，转移视线跟着她上楼。"}
{"time": 1768827660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096584081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（实际上dnf是冰火光暗）"}
{"time": 1768827667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227223199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1768827670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821937680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（完全的能量元素，不带一点物质说是）"}
{"time": 1768827866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "996349053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "五楼，除了一两间管理室外，便只剩下联排的修习室。每一间看起来都不算大，充其量容纳三五个人。与先前楼下的办公室布局类似，这些修习室依据位置表现出明显的元素倾向"}
{"time": 1768828027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "147633153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟着梅琳娜的脚步，想必她应该有自己的目的地"}
{"time": 1768828064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649978477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 怎么不进麦"}
{"time": 1768828105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1021657646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "最后她走进一间红黄之间的修习室，留着门，等你跟着进去"}
{"time": 1768828362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1659664454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看了一眼，暗暗记住属性，进门"}
{"time": 1768828538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116896251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "自然是火与光"}
{"time": 1768828746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094743048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "当然是跟紧梅琳娜的脚步"}
{"time": 1768832016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776665383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（晚上有1吗，问下）"}
