{"time": 1768878522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1127036483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1707783531]“以及，虽然我不怎么感兴趣。”他指了指桌上的剩菜“有谁想打包吗？”"}
