{"time": 1768893385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2084228962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2034471587]“有……不太动了”亚克手里拿着打包盒，总感觉走路都恨不得要扶墙。夏洛克手里拿着玻璃罐，看起来倒是没怎么吃撑“我要回去训练保罗。”\n柯林斯也摇头“回宿舍，消食，然后预习。你呢？”"}
{"time": 1768893437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535131668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，我先回宿舍收拾一下吧，还有时间的话，看看学校静室还开门不”"}
{"time": 1768893667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "458102371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2102534394]“熟能生巧。”她答得没什么营养“也许老师会们会有别的技巧”"}
{"time": 1768893843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17855517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=458102371]\"嗯...\"不过今天打算去其他元素的房间都转一圈，最起码要熟悉其他的元素都是什么样子，对着梅琳娜点点脑袋，\"梅琳娜，我先去其他的元素那里看看，马上回来～\""}
{"time": 1768894246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533744636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1535131668]“应该还开着吧，我记得学院楼没写闭楼时间。”柯林斯杵着下巴“走吧，先回去。是不是该顺路买些消食片……”"}
{"time": 1768894289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935651733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“散散步应该就好了吧...大概”"}
{"time": 1768894303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "251877537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我有在认真思考，元素进修室要不要收费）"}
{"time": 1768894306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760419838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（算了）"}
{"time": 1768894393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108945908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=17855517]“嗯，晚些见。”她轻轻点头，随后默默吸收着静室中汇集的魔力"}
{"time": 1768894652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "7103264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1935651733]总之，路上当然没什么事。你们走的很慢，生怕胃疼。"}
{"time": 1768894792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475162106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说起来，只有四种基础元素?)"}
{"time": 1768894809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1268862017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "依次去其他的元素那边看看"}
{"time": 1768894826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001509494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是，不过过渡处也算有混合元素了）"}
{"time": 1768894832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454794043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（冰火光暗）"}
{"time": 1768894837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12784824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不过也有风）"}
{"time": 1768895194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1832734292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=7103264][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 慢慢走回去之后，把舒茉给自己的饭盒餐具都清洗一下，然后擦干整整齐齐的收起来"}
{"time": 1768895282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267541812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1268862017]冰、暗，除了这两个基础之外，打算去混合的那些也看看，应该对自己而言也没什么问题...."}
{"time": 1768895525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287541203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1832734292]看起来是很新的餐具。好在完全没受伤"}
{"time": 1768896178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493570286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "亚克说是要预习，不过看着似乎格外困，没看多久体态就越来越矮，最后在数次钓鱼后，最终还是选择了上床"}
{"time": 1768896208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043343365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=267541812]对你来说，现在倒是已经认识四大基础元素了"}
{"time": 1768896402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117724309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1043343365]至少凝聚简单的能量团和转化已经没有问题。你的身体自然也能容纳各种各样的基础元素魔力"}
{"time": 1768896509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1946272169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1117724309]简单记住这些基础元素的感觉，转头去混合的那些元素静室，不出所料的话，应该是由基础元素组成的才对..."}
{"time": 1768896575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1700932566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=493570286][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 悄悄出门，去静室了"}
{"time": 1768896853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716075117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1946272169]至少分辨魔力和借用空气魔力，对你来说并不困难"}
{"time": 1768897001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062412036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1700932566]那么你也钻进了学校的元素教学楼里。此时晚课刚下不久，陆陆续续有学生从里离开"}
{"time": 1768897079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1635357656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=716075117]\"呼...\"感觉到了一些安心感，准备回去找梅琳娜"}
{"time": 1768897150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619605407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1062412036][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 去找冰元素的那间，吸收，加固.jpg"}
{"time": 1768897624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012785860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1635357656]你重新回到梅琳娜所在的房间，里头的温度比你离开时高上好几度，空气中隐约可闻像是被阳光曝晒过的香味。梅琳娜依旧坐在原位，看起来正在中场休息，手里捧着课本"}
{"time": 1768897746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140195632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "反正有梅琳娜在这里的话，自己也不用担心时间的问题。坐下来，开始慢慢打磨自身，提高自己的元素转化的效率。"}
{"time": 1768897782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1257004248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1619605407]虽然事到如今，你的身体已经不靠心脏支撑。但引导寒流直入胸腔扎根的感觉，还是令你泛起阵阵鸡皮疙瘩。或者说，竟有种寒心的感觉"}
{"time": 1768898175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774061495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "嘶...感觉有点难受，稍微待一会，再去火元素的地方中和一下，这样反复"}
{"time": 1768898654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2038489402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=140195632] 自然也不能一蹴而就。不过比较下来，你发现，吸收元素力并转化成你独有魔力的过程实际上比你把自身魔力转化成其他元素力要轻松一些"}
{"time": 1768898954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799002803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1774061495]心寒的感觉消退得快，你去到火元素的房间中中和时，又有些心焦。现在你终于明白为什么米拉教授要用等分的晶块去做你的首次加固"}
{"time": 1768899048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402864694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看有没有那种全元素的房间"}
{"time": 1768899337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128785643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "至少这一层没有"}
{"time": 1768899357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411604260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1128785643][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 那去看看有没有那种导览图"}
{"time": 1768899609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1509970712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2038489402]自然知道自己的身体肯定更适应星与雾的魔力，但是不能让自己完全依赖它们，必须要开拓出新的路径才行...持续练习ing"}
{"time": 1768899733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119471767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=411604260]有的。显然学院楼不会只有五层。越靠近顶层的元素圆环，似乎修炼室的效用就越明显。6层就有那么几间全元素房间，再往上，就是一年级新生止步了"}
{"time": 1768899760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564422555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就上楼!"}
