{"time": 1769055880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434306160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=915122348]（那是不是也可以经典环节，回不去宿舍了，出去住（）"}
