{"time": 1769058396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341192402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过在这样多待一会也好吧，反正有绕过宵禁的方法"}
