{"time": 1769132927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1656221013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1384807656][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 盯着她的眼睛看，有点不知所措"}
{"time": 1769133330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597588329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她放下了头发，终于遮上了帘子“do，not，forget.你是为了什么找到这里。”"}
{"time": 1769133363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696639148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...嗯...”点点头“我不会忘记的...”"}
{"time": 1769133594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248076466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行了。”她调转方向，沿着先前的路离开“回去吧。”"}
{"time": 1769133639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920489664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "'‘教授再见...’如释重负的离开了"}
{"time": 1769134099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940005611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那么你离开了.jpg。虽然你总觉得有什么不太对劲的地方"}
{"time": 1769134386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1130539453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不过，宿舍的门不会因为这个为你敞开"}
{"time": 1769134419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612446842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "按照原有的计划慢慢跳上去"}
{"time": 1769134464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1980017423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你，再过个幸运）"}
