{"time": 1769158286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648868750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=627503661]\"知道啦。\"手心亮起星光，雾气四散涌向莫奈，\"明天见，晚安。\""}
{"time": 1769158299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1901990961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你又不是没见过它正常情况下是什么样）"}
