{"time": 1770194331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446373429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“学校食堂吗”"}
{"time": 1770194403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834974203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"都到这了诶?\"指着咖啡厅的门面，脑袋轻轻在伊恩肩膀上动了动，\"下午茶?我要吃草莓马卡龙\""}
{"time": 1770194423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300468434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？不吃午饭直接下午茶吗”"}
