{"time": 1773212473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401490834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1928731422]\"嗯...\"斑比似乎想到了什么，一小团血液具现化出一只蝙蝠出现在你的肩头，\"一般被选做祭品的东西。\"她停了一下，\"体质特殊，和我们本身或许也有些关联。\""}
{"time": 1773212504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1894145562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“原来还有这种说法吗”拿出断手再来看看"}
{"time": 1773212700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116529048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这可不是什么好事。\"小蝙蝠落到手上，\"证明，这东西的主人，曾经和你我有关，或是血缘相近。\""}
{"time": 1773212716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "797720093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*好像应该先看看教室里的情况和讲台上的人，总之先找空位吧"}
{"time": 1773212737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1238338316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(第一节课是什么来着，我之前说过吗)"}
{"time": 1773212784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "537864657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（各种意义上来说应该都是炼金术吧）"}
{"time": 1773212785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688507101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊.....”有些不敢细想“斑比酱别吓我....”仔细辨认一下这个手..."}
{"time": 1773212936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122394838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={2C7DF9DE-AD2A-C636-6A02-3FEF1A39DCFD}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-2C7DF9DEAD2AC6366A023FEF1A39DCFD/0,file_size=19215]"}
{"time": 1773212946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "577307715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我就知道会有这么个活）"}
{"time": 1773213153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929094539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=797720093]教室里坐得稀稀疏疏，并没有很满，你们倒是可以轻松找到空位。讲台上的老师看上去也是刚刚才来。"}
{"time": 1773213237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "80109249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=688507101]\"你有什么好怕的，这世上我予血之人成百上千，只要有我的血，就称得上有关。\"小蝙蝠落到你手上的断手上，\"不过...对我的眷属做这种事嘛...\""}
{"time": 1773213300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1219743465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "oh...原来是这方面有关，稍微松了一口气“确实...我们一定要狠狠教训那个幕后之人”"}
{"time": 1773213391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555857294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=929094539]老师本人看上去很小巧，一头银亮的头发，眼瞳是淡漠的蓝色，看见你卡点进来也没有说什么。穿着黑色的礼服，不过你感觉她看上去有些奇怪。"}
{"time": 1773213566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1615260802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“该不会是人偶之类的吧”心里胡乱猜想着，找位置坐下"}
{"time": 1773213617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628769317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1219743465]\"不过是些我放弃了的野兽。\"她说着，飞向你的前方，悬停在一处空地上方，\"不过野兽也有些可取之处，用你身上的血试着感应我的血，应该就能找到剩下的东西。\""}
{"time": 1773213655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "315769210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“oh，那还挺方便的...”开始感应，寻找其他的祭品"}
{"time": 1773213884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "824847812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "四周出现几个小红点，其中一个就在你正前方，小蝙蝠悬停的位置以下。"}
{"time": 1773213901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010864332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（呼唤祭品叠）"}
