{"time": 1773228273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082871933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=48006402]又过了一会才喊到妃花的名字，大概过了五分钟，她才从水晶球中拿出了两枚飘花的翠玉戒指。"}
{"time": 1773228316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1541426098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=357351488]（出门了，停一下）"}
{"time": 1773229523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2044054365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2082871933]只见妃花小脸红扑扑的，嘴角噙着笑，小跑到你身边，把手心的玉戒指递一个到你手上，\"伊芙，给。\""}
{"time": 1773231272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1858480390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来我昏迷了20min）"}
