{"time": 1773244464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348790541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2078430002]你的魔力输入进戒指，翠色的扳指发出温润的绿光，你感觉有温和的魔力接入你的体内。"}
{"time": 1773246150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56011501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有点意思……水井一般的功能吗？”把手放在眼前端详一番“教授还真是大手笔”"}
{"time": 1773246303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568734314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=56011501]\"嗯...水晶球先生说我的魔力很适合给予其他人...我就想到了...要这么一个道具。\"妃花轻轻笑着，\"应该...不讨厌?\""}
{"time": 1773246536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411412478", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1568734314]“很温和”点点头“谢谢希望某天会派上用场”"}
{"time": 1773246542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "719263017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1568734314]“很温和”点点头“谢谢，希望某天会派上用场”"}
{"time": 1773248022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513693341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=719263017]\"嗯...毕竟比起我自己使用...\"她点着脑袋，\"让伊芙用的话，会更好。\""}
