{"time": 1773260832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1978035347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“去随便转转吧，校园里的风景很不错”站起来“而且可以顺便练练魔导器”"}
