{"time": 1773263045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1509093618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（吞消息了）"}
{"time": 1773263140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265945244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（全天下紫色头发的就只有我家吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1773263231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741901193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "目光直愣愣地跟着那一抹紫色，一时间竟然在踌躇到底要不要追上去，却又不知以何种身份……自己上次正常地交朋友，是什么时候的事了？"}
{"time": 1773263391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "198675423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那倒不是，但是你大成功的话就会久别重逢)"}
{"time": 1773263416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329662247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=741901193]正在犹豫的你，眼看着对方要离开了。"}
{"time": 1773263416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1991576455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（再说下去要但为君故了）"}
{"time": 1773263593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530590304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "妃花在你旁边戳戳，打断了你的思绪，\"怎么了?\"橙黄色的团子挡住了你的部分视线"}
{"time": 1773263869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1443008901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有个……想见却又不知从何谈起的人”踮起脚来“我的……亲人，不知道这算不算一种近乡情怯”"}
{"time": 1773264001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1551497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在哪?\"团子从你的眼前溜走，妃花踮起脚看着人群，试图寻找你说的人，\"没看见诶...?\"她的语气倒是认真，\"如果是想见的人的话，无论如何都得去见吧。\""}
{"time": 1773264275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1467124286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这……哎，我很难描述我的心情……我和她其实不在同一个世界啊。我又能……说些什么呢？”纠结着看着那人越走越远，脚下似有似无地跟着迈步子"}
{"time": 1773264491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190489255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那又怎么样?\"妃花拉着你迈开腿，\"正因为在不同的世界，才能像这样...邂逅吧?\"随后她松开你，由着你惯性向前，她的声音在你身后响起，\"去吧——让初次的邂逅更美丽一些。\""}
{"time": 1773264653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651665227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（睡觉吧（）"}
{"time": 1773264660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357264704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=4F8EEDA6D4BD19012432D90393FBF279.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRe-8qeyvpD28xFe0UClHwC5uGDFRiJYCD_CijlqubQ5ZiTAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhBhwUOeohKGPx9wUsilkxATegI3NoIBAmd6&amp;rkey=CAQSMNBuyxkpUBankQmsXXBdFZq2RdWXWrn2bnsYqKZk2T4_5mSKl2vtDPutZW5f4KWRkg,file_size=12297]"}
{"time": 1773264743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853414587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=003DE103D207C2DAB0BC67D661D88887.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSUBeqoZ_93dvNUie-sWNb0h2_K2BjWq1kg_woorIvB-OWYkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQf5J6KCo3GY0h4vlNoZFw2HoCCcCCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMNBuyxkpUBankQmsXXBdFZq2RdWXWrn2bnsYqKZk2T4_5mSKl2vtDPutZW5f4KWRkg,file_size=1463766]"}
{"time": 1773284048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060796442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=190489255]“真是……”半推半就着向前走着，一边微笑一边皱眉“对我的事怎么比自己还上心……”但终究慢慢跟上某人，清了清嗓子，最后开口道“……同学你好？”"}
{"time": 1773284082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678988577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你怎么知道我醒了)"}
{"time": 1773284095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513389424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你大群里说话了）"}
{"time": 1773284113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628923827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我说我就今天一天没起来，导师刚好今天到实验室到的早）"}
{"time": 1773284491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658079286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=8FCB4136D3C7CD79ACFC1EF6A0482DEA.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQJWhfj__4BDbFCi7jllNgKOn8vEBjglAkg_woosczzwK-ZkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQfytp2bYNXSmLJnLvAVNXXHoCLQaCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMKlPALEBDIJw0g45XGoXca1cSYs_jkmo3exXrdbUqYXkTStcpEbxVIcpY3d06vzf8A,file_size=150112]"}
{"time": 1773284536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031809073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你就知道眉笔可能已经是与生俱来的了）"}
{"time": 1773284551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948977286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那很眉笔了)"}
{"time": 1773284875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1553991213", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2060796442]前面的人慢慢转过身，熟悉的面孔，不过格外的年轻，"}
{"time": 1773285093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616149150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2060796442]前面的人慢慢转过身，熟悉的面孔，不过格外的年轻。浅紫色的瞳孔闪耀，皮肤光滑如玉，虽然年纪尚小，但也是标志的美人胚子。\n不过此刻她有些疑惑，\"你好...怎么了？\"你注意到她稍微退后远离了你一些，旁边也没有其他同行的人，\"最好离我远一点哦...\""}
{"time": 1773285289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380906193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来已经不记得姨妈叫什么了）"}
{"time": 1773285537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "13723804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(伊斯塔吧)"}
{"time": 1773285718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "743906640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我叫辛德拉，西边来的”看着对方的脸，多少有些恍惚。在造成困扰前想起来行个贵族礼节“冒昧打扰了，我只是觉得……”有些吞吞吐吐，视线不知道该不该往脸上看“同学有些，似曾相识。而且……美丽殊胜”"}
{"time": 1773285847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789695982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有人两点睡还没醒说是)"}
{"time": 1773286221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1762607480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=743906640]对方一时有些愣住，显然是没有遇见过这样的事情，\"呃...\"过了半晌她才想起回了个礼节，\"我叫艾琳...艾琳 艾络温 摩根，谢谢您的夸赞，辛德拉小姐曾经见过我吗？\""}
{"time": 1773286746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1248575037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”摇头“没有亲眼见过，但是听人提起过。”"}
{"time": 1773286853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "477289112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我?\"她指了指自己，随后放下手，有些拘谨，\"我应该不是什么有名的人吧...你可能认错了...应该认成了我的姐姐。\""}
{"time": 1773287445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677929822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“伊斯塔学姐我亲眼见过的，和艾琳同学真是颇为相像。”摇摇头“不过感觉上，不太一样呢。说起来两位午饭不在一起吃吗？”"}
{"time": 1773287796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1635541940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=677929822]\"啊...见过姐姐...\"她突然意识到有些事态，清了清嗓子，表情认真，\"姐姐有自己的事要做，我不能在这种小事上打扰她。\""}
{"time": 1773288032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283636582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1333398539][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “还有这种事吗。。。我之前差点被太阳晒死来着”"}
{"time": 1773288046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157583128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我们快走吧”"}
{"time": 1773288108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477988613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这样……”事业狂这方面倒是一脉相承，这么想着，试探性开了口“那，艾琳同学愿意一起用个午餐吗？”"}
{"time": 1773288445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413002495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=157583128]\"...\"她有些虚弱地笑了一下，也不知道是在想什么，然后突然开口，不知为何心情好像好了一些，\"宠爱这种事...真是说不好。\""}
{"time": 1773288488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159641714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃饭了）"}
{"time": 1773288511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105415709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你发现自己就在酒店门口的广场上，周围稀稀疏疏地没什么行人，偶有目光扫向你，仅此而已。"}
{"time": 1773288557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265864150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1477988613]\"我...\"她拧了拧眉毛，很是纠结，\"不...不了吧...靠近我不是什么好事。\""}
{"time": 1773288691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041295270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1265864150]“为什么？”明知故问，不过想起来最近自己身边尽是些喜欢靠上来的人，忍不住想效仿一番，于是向前跨一步，一下子拉近一截距离“也没什么影响吧？”"}
{"time": 1773289369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793783597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2041295270]\"啊....\"她连忙摆着手后退好几步，小脸里写满了惊慌，\"不..不..\"随后紧张地开口，\"身体没什么不舒服吧...\""}
{"time": 1773289523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "471605083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么小医仙）"}
{"time": 1773289539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936443741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（小伊神）"}
{"time": 1773289672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358003480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(厄难毒体)"}
{"time": 1773289875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908360480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=793783597]“没有啊”抬起左右手各自夸张地看了看“什么事都没有，怎么了？”"}
{"time": 1773290124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636875119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1908360480]\"...\"她狐疑地盯了盯你，随后还是使劲摇了摇头，\"怎么会...\"不过也没有开口解释什么，\"总之，总之不行...待久了，太靠近了就会出事的\""}
{"time": 1773290437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564248513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2105415709]"}
{"time": 1773290497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "802526030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就快点回去了，直接坐电梯，去四楼"}
{"time": 1773290790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500601879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1636875119]“好吧，好吧”双手竖在肩前做投降状“都听你的……那，后会有期？祝你和姐姐幸福”"}
{"time": 1773290858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "367793504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=802526030]一路畅通无阻，你到了四楼的时候，电梯却没停直接去到了五楼，龙芙戴着她标志性的面具，正在这里等着你。"}
{"time": 1773290886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012997359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“龙芙小姐..正好，快，你快看看诺亚什么情况”"}
{"time": 1773290901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2093025525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把诺亚小心放下来然后转身抱起来"}
{"time": 1773291055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90281383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1500601879]\"嗯...\"语调里有些许疑惑，明明是第一次见面，她还是点点头，\"对..对不起...谢绝了您的好意，下次再见...\"然后她就转身，你看见她小心地保持着和周围的人的距离，离开了。"}
{"time": 1773291366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2132831479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2093025525]\"别急，小家伙。\"龙芙俯下身，掌心有些闪电状的能量流动，仔细看了看你怀里的人偶，\"腐蚀，勒伤，嗯...还有些别的?居然破坏了我的自律机关...\"稍微她抬起头，状若无意地扫了一眼卡缇娅，\"维护之后机能应该没什么问题，不过...\""}
{"time": 1773291514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78725936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=90281383]“呀……被母亲大人这么称呼总感觉有点……毛骨悚然”回到妃花旁边，搓了搓幻想中的鸡皮疙瘩“不过母亲原本是这种性格吗？”"}
{"time": 1773291552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1121652225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过？不过怎么样...”有点紧张"}
{"time": 1773291738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835557703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=78725936]\"嗯...总感觉发生过什么很重要的事...\"妃花看上去像是在想什么，\"妃花记得...她说过仅限现在，过去的事情可以改变...\"翠色的眼瞳看向你，你有些琢磨不透对方的情绪。"}
{"time": 1773291813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "252204112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1121652225]\"记忆可能会有所损伤。\"她皱了皱眉，\"我无法保证她百分之一百记得所有事。\"龙芙对你伸出手，示意你把诺亚交给她"}
{"time": 1773291850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761862071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊...”把诺亚小心的交给她，一时间不知道该说点什么"}
{"time": 1773292143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854448710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（午休）"}
{"time": 1773292195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693005235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她把诺亚拢在怀里，稍微点点头，\"我不打算追究这件事，不过这一位。\"你知道她在指谁，\"不介绍一下吗？\""}
{"time": 1773292257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "355128643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“oh，这位是卡缇娅...我在一个节点找到了她...当时她被当成了祭品，后来我在斑比酱的帮助下，把她复活了，现在算我的眷属”"}
{"time": 1773292755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1420073080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"祭品，复活?\"你注意到她的眼瞳转变成尖锐的竖瞳，莫名的压力压在你的肩膀上，\"不妨再说说看。\""}
{"time": 1773292776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "975719333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“先...把诺亚修好吧...”"}
{"time": 1773292998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961300461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=835557703]“改变过去……听起来真不可思议”叹了口气，目送着艾琳远去“不过……哪怕是假的，既然在我眼前发生……我当然要把它改成我喜欢的样子”"}
{"time": 1773293008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418651554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（睡了）"}
{"time": 1773293032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352654744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1418651554]（怎么感觉你说过一遍了）"}
{"time": 1773293051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589342276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=975719333]\"...\"回答的只有越来越凝重的氛围和沉默"}
{"time": 1773293070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3767570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧好吧~_~...我尽量长话短说”"}
{"time": 1773293207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335903495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我和诺亚去破坏节点的时候，地面突然出现了超级多的蜘蛛丝，我想带她逃跑...结果被不知道哪里来的雾气困住了，然后我通过提醒得知，周围有个类似阵法的东西在法师塔折叠了空间，我就去那里找到了很多节点...每个节点上都有着卡缇娅的一部分，我破坏节点之后..把她重新拼了起来，然后给了自己的血...大概就是这样了”"}
{"time": 1773293225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244722419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一口气快速说完，稍微有点累，喘几口气"}
{"time": 1773293530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462628693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1244722419]\"...\"你听到了一声悠长的叹息，\"没想到会有这么麻烦。\"她不知从哪递给你一杯温水，\"只要不犯事，我这里也可以收留这家伙。\"她眼瞳里的竖纹消散，气质重归温和，\"回去休息吧，诺亚我来处理。\""}
{"time": 1773293572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043167109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“多谢龙芙小姐了..”松了一口气“那拜拜了，我去找西莉丝姐姐了”"}
{"time": 1773293795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768322835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她点头，电梯降到四楼，直到龙芙彻底消失在你们眼前，大气不敢出的卡缇娅才敢开口，\"你知道刚刚那个是什么吗...\"声音很低"}
{"time": 1773293874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162253693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“听说好像是龙...”声音也不大"}
{"time": 1773294004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948755117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吓人...为什么这里有这么多这种家伙啊...\"她看上去又要哭了，不过这次大概是吓的"}
{"time": 1773294167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960463200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "电梯停在四楼，走廊里空空荡荡。她抓紧了些你的手臂，\"这里...\""}
{"time": 1773294186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1365207578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱也住在这里..你要去拜访一下吗”"}
{"time": 1773294487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013585575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她用力地摇着头，\"不要...\"几乎是本能地躲在你身后，尽量离那个散发着气息的房间远些，\"我们要去哪...\""}
{"time": 1773294557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191533350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“离那个房间也不远...”带她去到自己房间门口，然后打开“你稍微等我一下...我去跟斑比说一声，马上就回来”"}
{"time": 1773294832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685553587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(在哪等)"}
{"time": 1773294839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923161867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你现在的房间?)"}
{"time": 1773294848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004953747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（对）"}
{"time": 1773294899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1668958453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "客厅里没有人，卡缇娅眨了眨眼，听话地走进了房间，找了个位置坐下。"}
{"time": 1773294947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1889613903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去斑比门口“斑比酱，我回来了...这次多亏有你了...要不我还不知道会被困多久”"}
{"time": 1773295069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1385750295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "门扉向内敞开，斑比斜躺在沙发上，一头金发此时难得没扎起来，柔顺地流淌在沙发上，玫红的眼瞳看向你，\"然后呢?\""}
{"time": 1773295821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683536428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就是很感谢斑比酱么..”"}
{"time": 1773295833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474382091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱有什么想让我做的吗”"}
{"time": 1773295865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733170033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（入睡失败）"}
{"time": 1773295893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055507734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一进来就看到翔哥还在找斑比要任务）"}
{"time": 1773296108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802046455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1474382091]\"没有。\"她闭上了眼，看上去没什么精神，\"你来找我只是问这些吗？\""}
{"time": 1773296149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1248721994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“主要是想感谢一下斑比...顺便给您报个平安..斑比如果休息的话，我就先走了”"}
{"time": 1773296154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "303637665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1961300461]\"是嘛，这样才对啦。\"妃花笑了笑，\"现在去哪?\""}
{"time": 1773296314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864282679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“去吃饭吧”在无人的时候掏出匕首摆弄一番“不知道大事件什么时候才会浮出水面”"}
{"time": 1773296458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "458160008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1248721994]\"去吧。\"她开口，不过紧接着又冒出一句话，\"你可以告诉卡缇娅，我不追究她的事情，但告不告诉她，要不要挟她，随你。\"说完房门自然地合上了。"}
{"time": 1773296521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984812899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我知道了，谢谢斑比酱”朝房门口鞠一躬，然后去找卡缇娅了"}
{"time": 1773296796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "420752776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=864282679]\"按照她的说法，最少要一周的时间，甚至一个月。\"妃花回答着你的话，不过你确实还没试过通过匕首释放什么魔法，想来确实是爱璃西雅的傻瓜式戒指方便。"}
{"time": 1773296891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457455575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我真的有法表吗）"}
{"time": 1773297008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那个戒指不是，输入魔力傻瓜式施法)"}
{"time": 1773297049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261422424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实我的意思是）"}
{"time": 1773297061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524520876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*给匕首输入点魔力看看怎么个事"}
{"time": 1773297074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "861286960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1984812899]打开门，卡缇娅老老实实地坐在沙发上，正在翻阅客厅里自带的书架上的小说，似乎是一本时兴的小说，封面写着《夜访吸血鬼》"}
{"time": 1773297233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680159654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=524520876]你知道魔导器是用于施法的介质，如果你掌握了魔导器相关的那些魔法的话，可以施展任何已知的魔法，但现在...魔力流入晶莹的匕首，只是在刃上留下了淡淡的蓝光。"}
