{"time": 1773321264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "89429381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2108877]“是啊”本来也没想过要瞒着“也不能算和我没关系吧，那东西”"}
{"time": 1773321281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804203346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是豫走了不死鸟的蛋）"}
{"time": 1773321583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2107235610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=89429381]\"和你?\"她咂咂嘴，翘起腿来，手指捋着自己垂下的发丝，\"关系?——我已经送过你一个了吧。\""}
{"time": 1773321864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353962319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“研究研究嘛。”从口袋里掏出来“而且难道不是同一个吗？刚拿到的时候可没让我好受”"}
{"time": 1773322414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473935014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=353962319]\"你既然知道是同一个，难说有没有卡bug的嫌疑呢。\"她接过你手里的蛋，\"啧，活力去了七八，狠起来连过去的自己都不放过。\"她又扔回给你，\"再送你了。\""}
{"time": 1773323180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333390542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*稳稳接住，揣进兜里“说起来现在这儿有两个蛋，为什么没有两个你？”"}
{"time": 1773323255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400789492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1333390542]\"真是个好问题。\"她似笑非笑地看了看你，然后看了一眼妃花，\"因为，我把自己杀死了，这个理由你信吗?\""}
{"time": 1773323332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076681433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1804701884]（原来是我过）"}
