{"time": 1773334731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886977815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1643538750]卡缇娅撑着伞，与其说是在斗殴，不如说是在室内跳了一场优雅的华尔兹，所过之处只余留下面色涨红的扭动的人体。\n西里斯则是仅仅在招架，并不想沾染上血腥。\n至于诺薇拉"}
{"time": 1773334747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506316166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你自己描述一下?)"}
{"time": 1773334769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1620966595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是长夜月，那她会能量飞弹吗）"}
{"time": 1773334889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "422496772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这不是简简单单)"}
{"time": 1773334892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954063970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(夜色落幕了)"}
{"time": 1773334905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "781714396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉对付这群家伙没什么拔剑的必要，但是也不想直接碰到他们，感觉有点恶心，灵活的在人群中穿梭躲避，推波助澜，使他们互相伤害"}
{"time": 1773335388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64252854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=781714396]现场一片混乱，大概过了有十几分钟，随着倒地的人越来越多，终于你感受到了熟悉的威压。那股属于管理者的重压出现，立刻所有人都被迫安静了下来。"}
{"time": 1773335425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194849112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "终于来了啊，看向娜哈特"}
{"time": 1773335513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1582163670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "二层下往一层的平台缓缓降落，金发，带着一缕红色漂染的高个女子站在尽头，睥睨着你们，\"真有趣，又是你\""}
{"time": 1773335729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "624403695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....又见面了啊”想到上次的事情，还是有点紧张“不过我这次来，可不是找你打架的...”"}
{"time": 1773335751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "204171412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你还记得那哈特的立绘嘛)"}
{"time": 1773335764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3402788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（她有立绘吗）"}
{"time": 1773335797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547961921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1851498608]（图片已过期）"}
{"time": 1773336071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1467113398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=73ADD1EB77742CEE939B745F32D10C67.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQPml-PFF18g83OsOQEthO1xztQxRiVigkg_woo64y41O-akwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQWGH5J2yZ9j15JUz51aomInoCLIqCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMOaeBeG_JIB_EwGHxXzMxA_ZRotaGesQ-zO4__z-4XvlTB1P4MdoG0OAuyMDZzqT7A,file_size=148757]"}
{"time": 1773336082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271712642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉，原画网站我打不开)"}
{"time": 1773336086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573356590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1773336165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812999326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=624403695]\"把我这里闹成这样，不是来宣泄你的武力的吗？\"她的语气轻佻，似乎对这里的事不以为意，\"你是没有复仇的想法吗？\"嘴角挂着玩味的笑容，右手捏着黑色的旋转方块。"}
{"time": 1773336263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595719602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不这样做，怎么能见到您老人家呢，至于复仇...大敌当前，这些只能先放在一边了”"}
{"time": 1773336293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962415042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你肯定也注意到了吧..如果什么都不做的话，这里迟早会彻底毁灭，什么都不剩”"}
{"time": 1773336310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956251617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嚯，合作，你真是在说一件很好笑的事。\"她一步一步往下走，四周的人接连跪伏"}
{"time": 1773336450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989545864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在只有合作才有一线生机吧，虽然你是这块地界最强的几个人之一，不过据我所知，宾森特可能已经凶多吉少了，或者和蜘蛛勾结在了一起，无论那种情况，都是不折不扣的坏消息吧”"}
{"time": 1773336467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361054033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我发现一件很南蚌的事情，万一她和蜘蛛一伙的，我不就爆炸了）"}
{"time": 1773336593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "639753413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(hh)"}
{"time": 1773336733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "784270006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "咦，既然宾森特有勾结的可能，那娜哈特说不定也有呢..有点冒冷汗了"}
{"time": 1773336766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "801702113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“咳咳咳...总之要是人死光了，也没人能给你展示暴力了啊”努力保持平静"}
{"time": 1773336957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535797220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嚯，你也知道宾森特的事?\"她指了指自己的脑袋，\"而且，别人的死活与我何关?\"她做出开枪的姿势，\"人死完了，我依然是暴力。\""}
{"time": 1773337002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767436913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你聚集这么多人难道不是因为你喜欢看别人的暴力吗”"}
{"time": 1773337041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "5295931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等人都死光了，你就只能一个人拆建筑玩了...oh，不对，到时候你就只能对着一堆黑泥和蜘蛛丝诉诸暴力”"}
{"time": 1773337364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027089206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啧。\"她停了一下，\"你倒是油嘴滑舌，不过...暴力不会为谁停下，所以。\"她停了一下，\"你要，用你的暴力征服我。\""}
{"time": 1773337424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1738738677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "结果到头来还是要和这家伙打一架“行啊，咱俩1v1单挑？”"}
{"time": 1773337630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893754896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"Lord，你上吗？\"卡缇娅看了一眼你，\"我来吧?\"她收起阳伞，收起了闲适的表情。"}
{"time": 1773337668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1503060997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没关系...我来吧，既然是我提出的，我自己躲在后面算什么”"}
{"time": 1773338437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421117674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1503060997]\"嗯...\"她的手轻轻点在你的脑门，\"我会保护你，不会因此而死。所以，也不要太过拼命了，好吗？\""}
{"time": 1773338480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "931538439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我很耐活的...不用担心我啦”露出自信的笑容（并非）"}
