{"time": 1773391010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "278667939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*反抗不了，那就享受吧.jpg。反正也不是第一次了"}
{"time": 1773391045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723055766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "对预言也说不上毫无兴趣，还是愿意读读看的"}
{"time": 1773391257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199304865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（能不能看得到简单预言教程（））"}
{"time": 1773391583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774953404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "第一章无非就是，预言是什么，为什么要预言，不可滥用预言这种程度的常识性补全，不过倒是提到了，预言的几种常见形式，除开天赋的预言者之外，还有茶渍，水晶球，帷幕，然后就是所谓的预言的神术之类的。"}
{"time": 1773391608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34262386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（经典三段式，是什么，为什么，怎么做）"}
{"time": 1773391669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406259509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "等你一字一句细细品完，下课铃如期而至，\"结束了，下课吧。\"洋荷甩下这句话，起身就准备离开了，虽然束缚解开了，但教室里一时间依然鸦雀无声。"}
{"time": 1773391733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763608017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "第一时间站起来，朝着洋荷走去。手上自然拿着那枚金币"}
{"time": 1773391752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1521052246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2137168539][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 把血收回来“啧...”感觉也没什么交涉的必要了“你就抱着你的暴力溺死在幻想里吧”"}
{"time": 1773391844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614354610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走吧”转身看向卡缇娅和西莉丝“我们还是再去看看其他人吧”"}
{"time": 1773392417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "483264876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=763608017]她的目光扫向你，你没看出她的脸上有什么表情，\"怎么了？\""}
{"time": 1773392521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564597684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1614354610]\"哼。\"娜哈特冷哼了一声，反倒是西里斯似乎在思考着什么，一路上没人拦你们，想必也不敢拦，你们顺利离开了赌场来到了外面的大街上。"}
{"time": 1773392646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1753663311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么了，西莉丝姐姐”"}
{"time": 1773392806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518993896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=483264876]“师……教授。”把金币举起来，感觉和洋荷交流还是拒绝一切拐弯抹角比较好“我有一件魔导器被人偷了，这是那个贼给我留下的东西。教授可以帮我算出去哪能找到那人吗？”"}
{"time": 1773392831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1531422569", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"她提到了规则。\"西里斯看着身后的赌场，眼瞳折跃着红光，\"还记得我们之前说的么，这里被异化了什么?\""}
{"time": 1773392839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991652212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1753663311]\"她提到了规则。\"西里斯看着身后的赌场，眼瞳折跃着红光，\"还记得我们之前说的么，这里被异化了什么?\""}
{"time": 1773393252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982880163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1518993896]她的目光落到你身上，停了一会才开口，语气平静，没有什么平仄起伏，\"预言是很无趣的东西。小蛇，如果你想找到那个人，应该去安保科。\"\n教室里落针可闻，没有其他人从座位上站起身。"}
{"time": 1773393564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749032658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=991652212][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “西莉丝姐姐提醒下我...”挠挠头"}
{"time": 1773393648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1873232308", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1982880163]“我不在乎它有不有趣”听到久违的称呼，嘴角不自觉地有些上翘“其实东西能不能拿回来我也没那么在意，只是找回去站在她面前听起来比较有意思”"}
{"time": 1773393752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "376351143", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“毕竟，我不会魔法，要魔导器也没用”"}
{"time": 1773393812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573136540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“刚刚被打到头了，记得不太清楚”"}
{"time": 1773393828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572100246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=749032658]\"嗯...异化的三种规则。\"西里斯分析道，\"按照娜哈特所说，每一种都会寻找自己的主持人，也就是所谓的泰坦。\"她的眉头舒展开，\"成为了主持人，也就成了规则的一部分。\"她看向你，等待你补上她的话。"}
{"time": 1773393871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "657889651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果我们修复了异化，他们的权柄就会被夺去？”"}
{"time": 1773394385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "761033547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像有点不太对）"}
{"time": 1773394453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179126459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=657889651]\"恐怕不止如此，身在规则之中顶点的他们。\"西里斯摇了摇头，\"连反抗规则的权力都不会有。\""}
{"time": 1773394492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712666122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1982880163] “我不在乎它有不有趣”听到久违的称呼，嘴角不自觉地有些上翘“人想找的话总有办法，我更想知道的是怎么给她点颜色看看”"}
{"time": 1773394500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773434086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎...也对吧...我们还是想想其他帮手吧”"}
{"time": 1773394552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879840985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么在想帮手的事）"}
{"time": 1773394567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1850336666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（理论上是让你想办法让他们卡自己的bug）"}
{"time": 1773394571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "51434485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为现在就在摇帮手啊）"}
{"time": 1773394574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660404753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然我也不知道bug怎么卡）"}
{"time": 1773394582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563984265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为我连规则是什么都不知道）"}
{"time": 1773394815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181068938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=773434086]\"不过...\"西里斯继续开口，\"娜哈特还透露了一点别的信息。\""}
{"time": 1773394927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929107406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=712666122]\"所以?\"她收回了目光，迈步往外，\"你是来找我的?\""}
{"time": 1773394998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1257374226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“关键在于不存在的艾希连德凛克？”"}
{"time": 1773395053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "620627380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“为什么不存在呢？他反抗规则所以消失了吗.. 还是他不受任何规则的限制”"}
{"time": 1773395281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "491942427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=929107406]“嗯……”跟着她向外走“我想学魔法，不论到底是哪种”"}
{"time": 1773395366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "624615165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=620627380]\"规则...和他的规则。\"西里斯赞许地点点头，\"说到了一点点子上，不过我看来，那位神秘人大概不止于此。\"她收回投向赌场的目光，\"现在去哪?诺诺\""}
{"time": 1773395419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1169447917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“回去找龙芙小姐吧”"}
{"time": 1773395719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813415260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=491942427]\"那你应该也知道，你首先需要一个魔导器。\"随着你们走出教室，死一般的教室里突然喧闹了起来。不过眼前的人依然毫无表情，就像是刚刚的事都与她无关。"}
{"time": 1773395752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1070756478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么叫没有魔导器不能施法）"}
{"time": 1773396225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895917322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(基础魔法课应该讲过，人类本身只有魔力，却没有释放的开关。)"}
{"time": 1773396233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "945271184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(所以需要魔导器辅助，jpg)"}
{"time": 1773396255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "469108349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1070756478]（你又不是人）"}
{"time": 1773396339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1278863333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不知道，总之）"}
{"time": 1773396343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114646390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（小睡一会）"}
{"time": 1773396437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1360522436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(他是混血深潜者)"}
{"time": 1773396440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845274801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(理论上差不多)"}
{"time": 1773396515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512371151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这是好久好久之前就有的设定了)"}
{"time": 1773396527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1825514596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(服了，怎么我都记得)"}
{"time": 1773396541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260173714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哪个）"}
{"time": 1773396551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634511226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥不是龙么）"}
{"time": 1773396556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "863610388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么变深潜者了）"}
{"time": 1773396577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "164918806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(人类施法相关的设定，龙血亚种不也是类人吗)"}
{"time": 1773396579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697950049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(真的是)"}
{"time": 1773396596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "831922491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我还以为龙哥是龙裔啊）"}
{"time": 1773396615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711843664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1169447917]总之，一路无事，顺利回答了酒店。"}
{"time": 1773396645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702538838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我也休息会，找会宝箱）"}
