{"time": 1773416523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393730498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=813415260]*懒得管教室里的人了，事已至此，索性缠着洋荷“那，教授有没有多余的可以借给学生的？”"}
{"time": 1773416584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648563302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=849816109][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 那就走楼梯吧"}
