{"time": 1773468052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877106643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1805108919]“嗯，艾琳奈同学”好不容易面对面，稍微再观察一番“刚刚在讨论什么？没事，可以不用管我的”"}
{"time": 1773468116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237424502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2086237744][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “但我怎么记得诺亚说，权限已经转交给艾希连得林克了”"}
{"time": 1773468553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153893407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1237424502]\"那只是表面的说辞吧。\"西里斯凝着眉毛，\"实际上，从我们从未见过那个人这一点上...\""}
{"time": 1773468578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1142419657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她摇摇头，\"虽然我是不愿意怀疑龙芙小姐。\""}
{"time": 1773468586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1285842667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“难道西莉丝姐姐想说”小声“他被龙芙干掉了？”"}
{"time": 1773468604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655778602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（龙芙没看出来和黄金有什么关系）"}
{"time": 1773468643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341422657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（而且如果是夺取了的话，士兵该贴她的画像吧）"}
