{"time": 1773658989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703759932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我们等下去餐厅找点动物血吧..”"}
{"time": 1773659095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "232020907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“学姐有何贵干？”不知道自己还要等多久，被盯着总觉得不太自在，索性赶快打发人走“我这里什么也没有”"}
{"time": 1773659719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297332530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（快进到云庆用我的外貌去偷人，然后这位是仇家）"}
