{"time": 1773660139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1241767284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=703759932]\"嗯...\"她乖乖点了点头，\"诺诺在这里休息一会吧，我先下去吧。\""}
