{"time": 1773671390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "919610857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=495292488][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 感觉血液不能放太久，另一只手摇了摇卡缇娅“该吃晚饭了，卡缇娅”"}
{"time": 1773671811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540371719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(查阅一下资料)"}
{"time": 1773673088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730433866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=919610857]\"嗯...嗯...\"怀里的人悠悠醒转，微眯着眼瞳，没有立刻抬起头，而是换了一下姿势，正了正身子，仰视着你，\"我睡了多久...?\""}
{"time": 1773673257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "955262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没多久...先吃下晚饭吧”"}
{"time": 1773673378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "270662097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1191979633]\"...\"她轻轻喘着气，后退着跳开，电弧环绕在周身，\"我也有名字，我叫泉。\"目光狠狠瞪着你，但是语气依然没好气，\"和你这种打一半自残的人也没什么好说的了，难不成是想讹我吗？\""}
{"time": 1773673832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687792709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=955262]\"没力气，爬不起来诶。\"她闭上眼，语气有些做作，\"好饿...好累...\""}
{"time": 1773673890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743770646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？那我帮你吧...”先把自己杯子放一边，然后慢慢扶她起来"}
{"time": 1773674205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632151140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1743770646]\"...\"她自己抬起了身子，起身，离远了一点坐下，\"不解风情。\"说着自己伸手拿起一个高脚杯咕噜咕噜喝起来，\"不好喝，鸡血吗？\""}
{"time": 1773674301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2143811415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“凑合一下吧...人血也没那么好搞啦..或者你实在嫌弃的话”把手臂伸到她面前"}
{"time": 1773674406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28662893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不赖。)"}
{"time": 1773674408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910381723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=270662097]“我还没必要在别人身上找存在感”不退反进，把手尽力伸向对方的面部"}
{"time": 1773674733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "647805615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2143811415]\"这倒是不错。\"她露出尖牙咬破你的胳膊，血液流失导致的晕眩感再度传来，但很快又被一种刺激的快感覆盖，甚至有些上瘾。"}
{"time": 1773674993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702475706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉浑身有点想发抖"}
{"time": 1773675280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1659227728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1910381723]她倒是一直在后退，不过依然在恫吓你，\"我警告你，再过来我就发动攻击了!\"尽管在你看来有点色厉内荏。"}
{"time": 1773675286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "653471520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1702475706](那你抖啊)"}
