{"time": 1773675455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "529013441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=48700006]鲜血的味道四溢，在小小的客厅里久久不散。\n可以侦查"}
