{"time": 1773707762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301443808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉，刚刚出门总感觉自己意气风发，虽然疲劳得不得了，但是走路很有力气。有种很变态的感觉。)"}
{"time": 1773707882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228231617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=416545176](对谁说的。)"}
{"time": 1773707968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1155874674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（都一样吧）"}
{"time": 1773708126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513619077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=416545176]\"...\"泉眯着眼睛，最后摇了摇头，语气倒有些幸灾乐祸，\"得了吧，你根本就不知道那些家伙在哪。\"她脑袋上的角消失不见，周身的电弧也沉寂下来。值得一提的是，她给你的感觉完全没有血脉上的压制感。"}
{"time": 1773708258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685298338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*想来当然也不过是平辈，不过学院里的龙裔还真不少“有什么好笑的，大不了去保卫科报案”"}
{"time": 1773708328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795648715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(成不了龙(薪王)的家伙)"}
{"time": 1773708413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272509937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=685298338]\"还能不好笑吗？知道这种事不止我一个人遭了殃。\"她摊了摊手，有些不着调地看着头顶的天空。"}
{"time": 1773708605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1718042814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那你笑吧，反正我丢的不是什么值钱的东西。”又翻了个白眼“我是不找回来也活得下去”"}
{"time": 1773708673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "488781159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...啧。\"你听见她的咂嘴声，\"所以快点找啦，你就是为这个来的吧?\""}
{"time": 1773708797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982950642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“找？找栋那么大的教学楼这种事情落到一个魔导器导论教具被偷了的一年级新生身上，不觉得很搞笑吗？”"}
{"time": 1773709268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215201359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1982950642]\"那你来做什么?\"她皱起眉，一副理所当然的样子，\"既然来了，你没有不找的理由吧?\""}
{"time": 1773709526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "276001745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“别搞得好像都是我的事的样子，我们之间还没扯平呢。”有些受够了这个头脑简单四肢发达的家伙。再看一眼最近的路牌，试着闭着眼睛顺着方向走一走"}
{"time": 1773710628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614146109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=276001745]过个灵感。"}
{"time": 1773710643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060683529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+1"}
{"time": 1773710643, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2060683529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊芙]演奏出: 1D20+1={18}+1=19"}
{"time": 1773710651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "387320917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（善）"}
{"time": 1773713585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808381388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2060683529]所谓的路牌并没有带给你任何有关的指引，它只是作为一个标牌，在这里标明着阶梯的位置。但你兜兜转转，最终还是发现了一些不一样的地方，无论你往附近除了回头路的什么方向走，你最终都会回到这个路牌。"}
{"time": 1773713827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159495855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“迷宫啊……但是什么都看不见的迷宫还是第一次”思考一会，朝着路牌注入魔力"}
{"time": 1773714413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947538796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1159495855]路牌上的文字剥落，浮现了一行新的文字，‘什么东西对一个人刚好，两个人太多？’"}
{"time": 1773714456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2130215764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1773714761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1892582932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没有变化，依然是这么几个字，旁边两人也看到了路牌的变化，一时间都沉默了下来。"}
{"time": 1773715594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "562042079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这就是我讨厌玛纳利亚的记不清第多少个原因”扶额“我们给它一本字典慢慢翻吧”"}
{"time": 1773715957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877368507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“算了，我先来吧。”拳头捶在杆子上“思念？”"}
