{"time": 1773717490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "57360442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是你都这么表现了，我怎能拒绝共舞一曲的邀请呢)"}
{"time": 1773717527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854842652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且...抱歉...”真的不知道怎么说"}
{"time": 1773717545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308965295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这和里榭娜还有关系吗）"}
{"time": 1773717579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573290247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1854842652]\"我索求，你给予。\"她重复了一遍，\"吻我。\""}
{"time": 1773718248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924018023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1726743928]“偏爱？”绞尽脑汁想着，都有点想放弃去找防卫科了“回忆？秘密？隐私？”"}
{"time": 1773718316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737926917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哇，居然被你蒙对了)"}
