{"time": 1773718372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778565194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...我真的不知道该怎么办了...”把手伸到她面前“要不...你在吸点好了”"}
{"time": 1773718376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480177079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1668054299]（所以你怎么很自然的就给她膝枕了）"}
{"time": 1773718394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "345641432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为沙发很硬吧（）"}
{"time": 1773718793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515211669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1778565194]她拨开了你的手，然后在瞬间抓住往下用力一拉，一瞬间你们的眼距相距不过5cm，鼻尖碰在一起，她的呼吸轻轻砸在你的脸畔，那一汪红葡萄酒中满是得逞的狡黠。"}
{"time": 1773718935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261581669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1924018023]不知你是说到了哪个词汇，路牌上的字迹褪去，周围显露出一节节古朴的大理石阶梯，直通云天。"}
{"time": 1773718966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91375717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“唔....”"}
