{"time": 1773721996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229371648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1808059411][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “不..不要...”想要变成血雾逃离"}
{"time": 1773722075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096640694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1229371648]在她面前显然很难做到变成血雾这种事，\"为什么...?为什么要拒绝?\""}
{"time": 1773722097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597149012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2059208667]“这是什么侦探小说的情节吗……”不敢靠近边缘，但远远遥望已经感觉看不到底“猜错了就没得重来了喔”"}
{"time": 1773722100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "43040303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....我们只做朋友..不行吗”"}
{"time": 1773722357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "305414336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=43040303]她许是没了最后的耐心，你只看见危险的红光闪过，整个人被压在她的身上，彼此的唇间相交，一阵阵电流般的酥痒刺激着大脑，但紧接着她咬破了你的嘴唇，咸味和痛觉成了第二道刺激。"}
{"time": 1773722406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "933816473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“唔....唔....不....”动静越来越小"}
{"time": 1773722456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53125327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=597149012]\"嗯。\"妃花点了点头，抬起身子看向你，双手背在身后，笑靥如花，\"明知会这样的话，伊芙愿不愿意赌一次?\""}
{"time": 1773722670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371994436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=933816473]显然对方并不满足于此，而你又无形中默认了对方的放纵，血液顺着相交的唇缓缓流淌，与越来越小的动静形成对比的是越来越热的身体。"}
{"time": 1773722715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1765176003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想要反抗，但卡缇娅比自己还是厉害太多了..只能留下不甘的泪水（并非）"}
{"time": 1773722762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "271140241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=53125327]“听起来简直就像邀请一起自杀”嘴角抽了抽，虽然也觉得大概学院不会允许校内这么随便地出现伤亡“你倒是看起来会乐在其中”"}
{"time": 1773723017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025382758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=271140241]\"嗯...能在马纳利亚醒来对我而言很幸运嘛。\"她对你递出手，\"能认识伊芙和很多很好的人，还能...体验很多以前从来不敢想的事，尤其像现在...真切感觉自己还活着!\"\n泉在几级阶梯后有些无语地吐槽，\"我说，你们要是自杀能不能别拉上我，真是疯了，都在说些莫名其妙是话。\""}
{"time": 1773723036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "562121709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有点像藤本树）"}
{"time": 1773723062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680107052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那个什么吸血鬼医生）"}
{"time": 1773723248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786704780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1765176003]你不知过了多久，直到一声轻轻的咳嗽才唤回你的思绪，现在，在做什么来着?嘴角的痛感倒是一直在提醒着你。"}
{"time": 1773723299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "882597548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“唔.....”感觉感情债欠的越来越多了"}
{"time": 1773723393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338290327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“想多了，我们比谁都不想死。”闭着眼把手伸出去“只是不巧本人比较命大，还没那么容易死在这就是了”"}
{"time": 1773723774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025321665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=882597548](你继续)"}
{"time": 1773723795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582230781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你不是要睡觉了？）"}
{"time": 1773723832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816742076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=338290327]\"喂喂...\"泉看着你们的动作，再看着阶梯之下的几乎看不清的地面，\"...真的要跳吗？这种赌你也敢下注?\""}
{"time": 1773723895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737794565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=582230781](还没有睡呢)"}
{"time": 1773723940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651778529", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....”不知道该说什么，也不知道该做什么，静静的躺着"}
{"time": 1773724107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1413644313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1816742076]不太打算搭理她，等着妃花抓着自己的手带着跳。虽说是有九成把握不会出事，不过心脏还是跳得越来越快，额角几乎要冒出鳞片了"}
{"time": 1773724195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2104993941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1651778529](你是被按在卡缇娅身上)"}
{"time": 1773724202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1365320258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(所以你在上面，你躺着什么)"}
{"time": 1773724213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196355259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2104993941]（？）"}
{"time": 1773724246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "913704036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你没发现是她把你压下来的吗，)"}
{"time": 1773724253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1071704311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(所以是她躺着)"}
{"time": 1773724274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786471936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你....哎...”不知道该说些什么，先起身吧...“我去洗把脸...”"}
{"time": 1773724422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683240259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=786471936]你和西里斯擦肩而过，她没说什么，似乎在静静地思考着，卡缇娅则是心满意足地呼着气，让你有些心烦意乱。"}
{"time": 1773724540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588781331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐...算了...没什么”终究还是什么都说不出来"}
{"time": 1773724608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659107806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1413644313]一步，两步，紧接着跑了起来，下一秒牵着的手上传来下坠的力，连带着你脚下踏空，坠入云海之下。"}
{"time": 1773724635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1354508936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(大概是无伞跳伞，你自己形容一下感觉吧。)"}
{"time": 1773724809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "98308437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=588781331]\"嗯。\"她从思考中回过神，轻轻回了你一下，看上去不像是介意的样子，坐回了沙发上。"}
{"time": 1773724853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412677642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉有点失落..去卫生间狠狠的洗一把脸"}
{"time": 1773724866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "996193696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呜——哇——”因为风压，嘴巴和舌头都有些不利索。手脚不知道该怎么摆动，更不敢睁眼，反倒真的和冻僵的蛇一样定住了。只有脖子清楚地缩着。感觉要把肺里的空气全喊出来，才能停止惊叫"}
{"time": 1773724993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986140325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=412677642]（感觉到眼熟吗[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1773724999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974583667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总感觉见过好多次了（）"}
{"time": 1773725080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681997631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=412677642]镜子里的自己，嘴角还在渗出血珠，头发乱糟糟地，脸却红得吓人，身体的热感一直压不住。"}
{"time": 1773725179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683165863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=996193696]你大概是听到了背后的一声惊呼，但紧接着强风让你什么也听不见了。坠落，坠落，十几秒后，地面如同死神一般越来越近。"}
{"time": 1773725488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642777171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（用骨气突破大地吧）"}
{"time": 1773725490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2139714203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（sleep）"}
{"time": 1773725666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336818575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] (你也睡着了？)"}
{"time": 1773725700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629066303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=681997631][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 狠狠的洗一把脸，然后整理一下头发"}
{"time": 1773725706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881971115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1336818575]（想睡）"}
