{"time": 1773797846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780027957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是有办公室）"}
{"time": 1773797849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1875016657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={1A8B4920-EC5C-84A7-A538-4E854ACA01E8}.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-1A8B4920EC5C84A7A5384E854ACA01E8/0,file_size=28129]"}
{"time": 1773797861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462000692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来你要敲办公室门)"}
{"time": 1773797863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "538485452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可以)"}
{"time": 1773798413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795710967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你来到一扇标牌用烫金字体写着伊莉嘉的门前，与其他办公室不同，这里没有进进出出的学生。"}
{"time": 1773798660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "263045381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还挺气派的，不知道是不是主任的办公室？”在办公室门口站定“不知道敲门会不会被拉进什么幻境，我真受够了”"}
{"time": 1773798833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100744098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"幻术系就是这样子...拧拧巴巴的。\"泉在你身后中气不足地开口，尽管她可能已经有点拧巴了。"}
{"time": 1773798979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783305452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总之这是我给幻术系最后的尊重了”站直一些，抬手敲敲门"}
{"time": 1773799093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1608098249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"进。\"冷漠的女声传出"}
{"time": 1773799146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751262870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(CV，泽城美雪)"}
{"time": 1773799191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336210540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没绷住）"}
