{"time": 1773799605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590359352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（火影忍者）"}
{"time": 1773799605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1595619890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "首先印入眼帘的，是黑。单纯的视觉上的黑，整个房间的背景都是单一的黑色，显得氛围有些压抑。黑发的女子坐在房间的中间，正在摆弄着手里的一团更加漆黑的不定型的奇怪物质，她的黑发披散在身后，有些甚至垂落在地板上也不管不顾。\n唯一可以称得上有些不同的颜色是她身上穿着的纯白教授服饰和点缀着羽毛的宝石头饰，蓝色的披风堆在桌子的一角。"}
{"time": 1773799617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816005674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(尬黑，我很久没玩)"}
{"time": 1773799624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673692882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=EF0E9A5BAB7B0DD40FEBD01EBCA5ED1B.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQHuOnPpLEq3-g5Rha5smEMLRUQQBjpkQog_woo-JPKw66okwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ_MTlQD1ohC5zKQ_7SCFB1XoCwzKCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMHnz_RNz2hFhgu7vmXZrmNa1QknCbQ5bS9hO8cOoLyj3pqniYAeXEKX6hMBpLShCng,file_size=166121]"}
{"time": 1773800064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215806038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“教授好。”没想到外面看起来金碧辉煌的，里面倒是阴暗得和回了家一样“打扰了。我是今年的新生，想请问教授有没有听说过一个叫云庆的三年级学姐？”"}
{"time": 1773800161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1065127607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(想到声音是泽城美雪，就在想什么时候问鸟为什么会飞了)"}
{"time": 1773800552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104177156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1215806038]手中的漆黑逐渐隐去形体，她抬起头看向你们，\"芙蕾雅教授的学生，你们找她有事么？\""}
{"time": 1773800635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512793227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（泽城美雪其实问的是剑为什么会锻（））"}
{"time": 1773800670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "65942760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（问）"}
{"time": 1773800681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338618672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她偷了我们的东西。如果情报无误的话。”把金币拿出来“是明天要用的教具”"}
{"time": 1773800700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691945203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=18416697]（）"}
{"time": 1773801177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1692077496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1338618672]泉紧随着把手镯拿了出来。\n\"...\"对方皱了皱眉，语气倒是依然冷冷的，\"想找她不难，如果没有别的事的话，你们去找芙蕾雅。她会头疼这件事。\""}
{"time": 1773801214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "365725427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=18416697]服务生摇头，表示从未听过类似的传闻，但随后表示也说不好，毕竟这里是马纳利亚。"}
{"time": 1773801352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937848746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是能说得通的人就好了。”行礼致谢“芙蕾雅教授的办公室在哪里？”"}
{"time": 1773801513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78110652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=937848746]她本来没看着你们的眼神重新回到你身上，带着些不以为意地打了个响指，暗处走出一只刚刚根本没有看见的neko，舔了舔爪子，不紧不慢地往门外走去。"}
{"time": 1773801579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961540622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥会不会问neko是什么）"}
{"time": 1773801636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682024962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是猫）"}
{"time": 1773801649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1242855632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（跟你这种日本人没什么好说的（））"}
{"time": 1773801653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165868748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那说明你也算半个日本人了）"}
{"time": 1773801839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1889414721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢谢。”点头致意，跟着猫走了"}
{"time": 1773801940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "897236268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢...打扰你了”喝一口可可"}
{"time": 1773802210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "309603102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1889414721]黑猫走走停停，带着你们下了不知多少层台阶，最后停在了一个表面有些霉斑的木门前消失不见，木门上浅浅刻着芙蕾雅的名字。"}
{"time": 1773802267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682931538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（需要担心真菌感染吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1773802603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "641157101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "来都来了，敲门呗"}
{"time": 1773802633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773086320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=897236268]在夜晚喝可可多是一件美事，大概唯一需要担心的就是热量过高而已。\n\"诺诺想好之后去哪里了吗？\"西里斯突然开了口。"}
{"time": 1773802677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "217134718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（吸血鬼能喝可可，什么喰种）"}
{"time": 1773802711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940753465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姆.........去挖一下凉亭？”"}
{"time": 1773802738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342016396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉不是问这个）"}
{"time": 1773802837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828750798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(undead没那么多不便之处)"}
{"time": 1773802861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018699049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（居然不挑食）"}
{"time": 1773802915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631442805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=940753465]\"...是说这里的事情解决之后啦。\"她的可可上桌之后倒是一直没拿起来过。\n卡缇娅则是轻轻尝了一下樱花特调，随后一脸嫌弃地推开，开始鼓捣着菜单。"}
{"time": 1773803017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1671778930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“oh，原来是那么久远的之后啊...西莉斯姐姐有什么想做的吗，我的话，先去找团长学剑吧...然后学成之后就像师父那样，四处游历，行侠仗义之类的”"}
{"time": 1773803149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1672815205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=641157101]“你好，我找云庆”隔着门这么说着"}
{"time": 1773803675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1592389148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1671778930]\"我的话，有机会的话大概会留在骑士团吧。\"她说这话的时候揉了揉自己的眼睛。\n\"诶?\"卡缇娅不客气地插上话题，\"诺诺不跟着斑比走吗？她还在这里吧。\""}
{"time": 1773803751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1709969836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱....”摇了摇头“说的也是...终究还是要看她怎么说”"}
{"time": 1773803820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "478712747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1672815205]\"...\"里面本来有些吵闹，但听到你的话和敲门声瞬间安静了下来，过了几分钟，\"进来吧。\"声调有些偏高，但努力压得很低。"}
{"time": 1773803948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1786650681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "事已至此，那就推门进去"}
{"time": 1773804295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "207349784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（几分钟是不是过长了）"}
{"time": 1773804393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "660226719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（几分钟是不是过长了）"}
{"time": 1773804413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2104918080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1786650681]这个房间倒是很正常，虽然装潢极其简陋，除了一张桌子什么也没有。窗外的阳光明媚地洒满整个房间，穿着和服的小个子女子坐在办公桌后，看见你们进来立刻开口，\"云庆不在。\""}
{"time": 1773804483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928612506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "随后她像是意识到了什么，清了清嗓子，威严满满地重新开口，\"没有事的话请回吧。\""}
{"time": 1773804519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1113982628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这儿是芙蕾雅教授的办公室吧？”缓步走入，看着那个看起来形象不太和“芙蕾雅”这个名字有关的小个子女人"}
{"time": 1773804566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891316855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有事，我也找芙蕾雅教授”"}
{"time": 1773804673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1345984522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我其实还没描述完)"}
{"time": 1773804684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1190615034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(dont 急)"}
{"time": 1773805532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807416317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1709969836]\"嗯...所以这件事还是要好好考虑的。\"西里斯终于拿起杯子喝了一口，\"这里的事情，总感觉很快就会结束了。\""}
{"time": 1773805768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681477372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1113982628]其人扎着两个短短的马尾，纯白的头发中掺杂些金辉，翠色的眼瞳搭配微皱着的眉头显得有些‘威严满满’，但引人注目的是，她背后延伸出的一对翅膀。不过白红色的和服裙倒是穿得随意，\"我就是芙蕾雅。\""}
{"time": 1773806280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160761317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃饭）"}
{"time": 1773806287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688443832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=DDC6C603D53D5807F7A102E82CC6A2DC.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSvnlkaUQNSXQXxUCx6JXOzSkO6Ghj54Q4g_wooo-TxrMeokwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQIPprEVOud7FmPACNsuM3g3oCHuKCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMKIUsfwYm-3dYHIAAAl-xy-0rVYh9ziQNPtqFYAoqSSbNl219p_1K8KZRpprb4OMfw,file_size=241913]"}
{"time": 1773806491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "827824096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=681477372]“哦，芙蕾雅教授。”眼神带着些许狐疑“您知不知道您的学生云庆今天偷了点东西？我听说她是惯犯，所以应该说……又偷了点东西”"}
{"time": 1773806692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631697439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=827824096]\"...呃...\"她的眼神不自觉地瞥了瞥房间的角落，\"你们有没有饿了?先吃点桃酥怎么样?\"说着她从桌子下面拿出了一个小盒子来。"}
{"time": 1773806867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "147378338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*顺着她的眼神也看一眼房间角落，又转回来“不了。我只想拿回我的东西”"}
{"time": 1773807848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485900069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=147378338]那边空空荡荡，\"云庆这孩子嘛...哈哈...\"刚刚还威严满满的表情一瞬破了功，\"呃...要不先吃点东西，等她回来?\"\n\"教授，我要拿回我母亲的东西。\"泉倒是上前了一步，与其说是通知，不如说是在逼问。"}
{"time": 1773808126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210014307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1485900069]“她还大我们两届吧。”看着这房间里也没有坐下的地方“等，要等到什么时候？”"}
{"time": 1773808221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "259903110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她打开小盒子，里面放着整齐的桃酥，\"吃一点?\"随后收拢了一下滑到肩头的衣服，\"说不定待会就回来了。\""}
{"time": 1773808526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "728159945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不了”没打算交好，自然也不是很客气“我对幻术科范围内的东西都不敢入口”"}
{"time": 1773808879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1222213548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=728159945]\"是不是对幻术系误会太深了。\"她自己拿起一块塞进嘴巴里，显得鼓鼓囊囊。随后把盒子递给你们，只有妃花拿了一块，\"我自己做的，今年新开的桃花。\""}
{"time": 1773809017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "449415811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你这是哪种桃酥（）"}
{"time": 1773809066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357963833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(桃花酥)"}
{"time": 1773809272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1951247111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就当我是怪人吧。格格不入都是相互的。”依旧没有入口的打算“加上本人不太有安全感”"}
{"time": 1773809718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987844625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以，先自我介绍一下吧。\""}
{"time": 1773809959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785724799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她捏起一块桃酥，此时倒是换上了温声，轻轻开口，\"你们叫什么?云庆拿走了什么?\""}
{"time": 1773810213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "950014846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“辛德拉·伊芙。我来拿希姆教授发的，匕首魔导器”"}
{"time": 1773810370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771056283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"泉，我的玉佩被偷走了。\"泉咬着牙开口重复了一遍刚刚的话。"}
{"time": 1773810445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "385061304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"希姆的魔导器啊...\"芙蕾雅微微皱眉，犹豫了好一会才开口，\"我可以给你一件算作赔偿...\"看得出她很是下了点决心。"}
{"time": 1773810657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1243042075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1807416317][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “不要说这种话了，西莉斯姐姐”再喝一小口“听起来像是flag”"}
{"time": 1773810968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175508464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=385061304]“谢谢，不用了”摇头“我就要原来那件。”"}
{"time": 1773811149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "478865723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1243042075]\"flag?\"她看着窗外的夜色，\"也不能算吧...在这种时候不谈一些未来的事情，就没什么可以说的话题了。\""}
{"time": 1773811185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1001337077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"还是等...一切结束了吧，现在聊感觉还是太乐观了\""}
{"time": 1773811440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809090023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1175508464]\"呃...赔一件更好的...?\"她摘下挂在头发上的红绳，\"...\""}
