{"time": 1773819025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036568036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（只记得现在好像好了但没完全好）"}
{"time": 1773819099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343821924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2102257427]\"只是看看芙蕾雅会怎么应对咯。\"匕首顺滑地转了个圈，语调带着些好笑，\"她就是性子太软，不像你们，个个有理有据，都找到这里来了。\"\n\"我的玉佩!\"泉紧紧盯着对方的手腕，身旁的空气啪啪作响，但碍于教授当面，又不好立刻发作。"}
{"time": 1773819147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1238151579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2043848798]\"交易?\"卡缇娅忽然来了兴趣，连西里斯也扭过头看向你，\"用记忆做交易，什么人做的?交易了什么?\""}
{"time": 1773819545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803154670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“其实算我被骗了吧...里榭娜姐姐一开始说有个人要带我走，然后来了个人，叫菈菈，自称狩魂的冥使，我以为是她来着，求她别带我走...她就让我拿记忆换..”捂面有些尴尬“后来我才知道，里榭娜姐姐说的是应该是斑比...不过也有一点点好处就是了..她帮我清理了一些负面影响”再喝一口可可"}
{"time": 1773819653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "603126792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=343821924] 面无表情地看着她笑，随后带着些可怜地看回芙蕾雅。耸耸肩，默默地让出她们闹腾的空间"}
{"time": 1773820470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330208429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=803154670]\"负面影响?\"西里斯皱起眉，询问起来，\"什么事情?\"\n卡缇娅听到你说的名字也皱起眉，\"菈菈?嗯...菈菈?\""}
{"time": 1773820783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1369175490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“当时里榭娜姐姐给了我三股力量...让我整个人昏昏沉沉的..还很暴戾...菈菈帮我清除了”"}
{"time": 1773820869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1250160830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=603126792]\"好啦好啦...\"芙蕾雅连忙站起身，\"云庆，你就把东西给她们吧...\"\n\"当时惹我生气，报复一下怎么了？芙蕾雅还要送她自己的东西?\"云庆一挑眉，\"又不是不还给这些家伙，我来处理就好。\"她看向你，\"我说你也算因祸得福，干嘛纠着不放。\""}
{"time": 1773821089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328630527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1369175490]\"...\"西里斯稍微有些意料之外，不过语气立刻冷静了下来，\"诺诺还藏着什么没说?\""}
{"time": 1773821309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865600902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没了吧...就这些了..我也不是故意藏的，只是一直没机会说”戳手指"}
{"time": 1773821383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "921141676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=865600902]\"嗯...\"她的眼神停在你脸上，\"真的没有了？\"随后伸出手递给你，\"可以拉勾吗？\""}
{"time": 1773821439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2002309345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我不会瞒着西莉丝姐姐的”伸出小拇指，仔细思考一下，自己有没有什么事没说"}
{"time": 1773821616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485455569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1250160830]“和给教授添堵比起来，给你添堵显然不需要什么心理负担”手指绕着头发打圈圈“倒是你，看着教授焦头烂额帮你解围还笑得出来，你是不是心理变态？”"}
{"time": 1773821847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33237881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2002309345]\"说好了。\"她伸出小拇指和你勾在一起摇了摇，卡缇娅突然站起身，一只手成拳敲在另一只手手心，\"原来是菈菈!\""}
{"time": 1773821875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418793765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摇一摇“卡缇娅认识她？”"}
{"time": 1773822153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62101768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1485455569]\"真是严肃的指控。\"她倒是不以为意，\"只是厚脸皮找上门的也只有你们了。\"你手上的金币逐渐升温，感觉逐渐有些握不住，\"芙蕾雅这种性格，学不会拒绝的话，我也放心不下就此毕业离开呢。\""}
{"time": 1773822538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310384280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=418793765]\"嗯...她倒是没有在骗你。\"卡缇娅重新坐下，\"狩魂的冥使，她确实是来接你走的人，斑比也是。\""}
{"time": 1773822899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885182120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？什么意思”有点不太懂"}
{"time": 1773823225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1279480442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=885182120]\"嗯...就像是一个任务有两个人出。\"她皱着眉，\"这样说也不对。\"她停顿了一会，\"冥使，嗯...是魔王对王庭的管制者，所以会和斑比一起行动。\""}
{"time": 1773823264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "423476348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“魔王？王庭？”从来没听过的名词出现了"}
{"time": 1773823709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017995311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"就是地下那群家伙啦。\""}
{"time": 1773824166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470244453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2017995311]\"斑比是王庭之主，之前应该提过?\"她皱眉，\"诺诺难道不知道吗？\""}
{"time": 1773824209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588570444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摇摇头“斑比没跟我讲过她的事情...我还一直惹她生气”"}
{"time": 1773824662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "903417491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1588570444]\"嗯...\"她点头，\"诺诺要小心，那家伙应该还在。\""}
{"time": 1773824693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1972511572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谁，菈菈吗”"}
{"time": 1773824873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173278449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=62101768]比狠的话自己也没怕过，表情越来越狰狞，但是硬是要抓住金币，逐渐靠近她"}
{"time": 1773825818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414651790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1972511572]（望夫石说是）"}
{"time": 1773825841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302615316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我出门在路上)"}
{"time": 1773825851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777301099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（自助去了？）"}
{"time": 1773825852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1826466483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(别急，先去和芊神汇合再继续。)"}
{"time": 1773827016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696402230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1972511572]\"如果斑比没有离开，她自然也不会就此离开...应该?\"卡缇娅看着窗外，\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1773827138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2086704847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=173278449]对方自然也没有后退，由着你靠近，收起了那副玩世不恭的表情，一双眼睛眯起来。"}
{"time": 1773828079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1546700457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=696402230][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “那我应该算说完了吧...该你们两了”"}
{"time": 1773828113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2112314568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像我拿她也没什么办法）"}
{"time": 1773828761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1207240933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1546700457]\"呃...这就到我们了？八岁以后的部分呢？\"卡缇娅甩着手，\"继续嘛，我的故事可是很长的。\""}
{"time": 1773829037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2044416586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2086704847]“看在我今天心情还行的份上”两只手一起抬起来，金币躺在颤抖的左手上，声音尽量平静“一手交钱一手交货，我就既往不咎”"}
{"time": 1773829830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747175994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1207240933][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “我的生活很平凡啊....难道要直接从不平凡的地方开始吗”"}
{"time": 1773829916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803955802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=747175994]\"嗯哼?平凡的地方也很有趣，不是吗？\"她眨眨眼，一副洗耳恭听的模样"}
{"time": 1773829960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895046409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（骑车买个东西）"}
{"time": 1773830235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020373802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2044416586]匕首在她手心旋转，她重新笑着看了一眼你，电光火石间反手握住匕首用力往你空着的手心一扎!"}
{"time": 1773832272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448116107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我难道还有反应的空间吗（））"}
