{"time": 1773925072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878748673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=243176484]\"挖地属实有点不够淑女诶...\"她朝你伸出手，\"戒指?\""}
{"time": 1773925268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809877917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把戒指递给她“拜托你了”"}
{"time": 1773925633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773256221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1809877917]\"嗯。\"她接过戒指开始忙活去了，不一会儿就在地面上挖出了一个几米身的斜向坑洞"}
{"time": 1773925644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612710457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(怎么像是盗洞)"}
{"time": 1773925787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1378473081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（hh）"}
{"time": 1773926001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2038565488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么说....”在洞口问问"}
{"time": 1773926098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162089819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2038565488]里面传出她的回音，\"没什么东西诶，这下面厚实得很。\"说着又是一些土被魔力上赶着累到洞口附近。"}
{"time": 1773926152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1373380461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“再挖点看看？”"}
{"time": 1773926205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701264995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=708917904]（）"}
{"time": 1773926441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "149078543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1373380461]“嗯...”下面传来卡缇娅的声音，不过听上去已经有些远了。西里斯抬头看了看月亮，转头看向你，吐出了句轻语“有卡缇娅在诺诺身边的话，以后我也可以放心了。”"}
{"time": 1773926593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101158606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=708917904]“...”对方没有回答，而是轻轻松开手，羽毛落在你的手上如同无物，你感觉到不同于胸口那样炽热的温暖，恰到好处，这时她才开口，“可以的话，可以让云庆多看着一些。”"}
{"time": 1773926849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997773225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=149078543][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “？...什么意思...”牵住西莉丝姐姐的手"}
{"time": 1773926859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1282753639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...西莉丝姐姐不会要离开我吧...”"}
{"time": 1773926948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1655545564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1101158606]接着羽毛，感觉应该不需要特地放在哪里收纳。除了句“谢谢”以外，并没有应她最后的话。转头看看泉“这儿还有个要解决的人呢”"}
{"time": 1773927232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583615518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1282753639]\"嗯...\"她的语气依然很轻，\"诺诺，重复的邂逅和离别，是生命里的瑰宝，总有那么一天的。\"随后她转过头不再看你，\"我本来也没有能力，也没有...嗯...永远陪着你。\""}
{"time": 1773927580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208830333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1655545564]“...”你看见她的手心紧紧捏着自己的玉佩，听到你的话才反应过来抬头，“我，我怎么了？”一脸茫然。"}
{"time": 1773927696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1053322314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=583615518][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “...不..不会的....不想再..更多的离别了”"}
{"time": 1773927807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627328066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=208830333]翻了个白眼“也就欺负欺负我了。算了。该干的事都干完了，我和妃花就先走了”"}
{"time": 1773929517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "529262315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1053322314]\"没关系，她确实更适合和你一起。\"她的目光飘向洞口，\"我...\"默默地摇了摇头。"}
{"time": 1773929623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1515671050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1627328066]\"云庆，送一送她们。\"芙蕾雅坐回桌子后，低头思考着什么。云庆给你们打开办公室的门，先走了出去。"}
{"time": 1773929906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149128787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=529262315][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “....不好..缺一个都不行”"}
{"time": 1773929920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52608708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "抓住西莉丝姐姐的手又稍微用力了一些"}
{"time": 1773929928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573556880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1515671050]*跟着出去吧"}
{"time": 1773930369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "70682654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=52608708]\"...\"她也没再说什么，或许是早已笃定，\"没什么的，诺诺，我...\"\n卡缇娅在下面突然喊了一嗓子，\"找到了，下来看看?\""}
{"time": 1773930411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1576605110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....之后再说吧..而且西莉丝姐姐也还没给我讲自己的事情”"}
{"time": 1773930419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590272921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "下去"}
{"time": 1773930541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1048657712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=573556880]有云庆带路，你们倒是没再被幻术系的弯弯绕绕缠住。很快就重新走到了最初下来的那一阶"}
{"time": 1773930887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144652669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=590272921]沿着歪斜的洞口下去，不一会儿走到了一个露出的豁口前，里面黑黝黝的，伸手不见五指"}
{"time": 1773930929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "845515916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1048657712]\"从这里就可以离开了，哦。\"她歪了歪脖子，\"要我教你们咒语吗？\""}
