{"time": 1773983109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "989723819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就刚刚...我们下去前”"}
{"time": 1773983292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954988397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=989723819]\"唔...\"她撩了撩耳边的发丝，脸上挂着些笑，\"重复的离别和邂逅?\""}
{"time": 1773983322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768474711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以...西莉丝姐姐为什么觉得..会有离别”"}
{"time": 1773983604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1445654875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1835536602]\"没有...吗?\"她拖了拖语调，\"就算我在旁边看着，伊芙有时候也不管不顾的...\""}
{"time": 1773983646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104386293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1768474711]\"徒弟总会有出师的一天啦...没有师傅会永远陪着徒弟一起吧。\"她说这话的时候没看你，感觉有点心虚。"}
{"time": 1773983682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442308383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...家人是不会分开的...”"}
{"time": 1773983841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768588691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1445654875]“已经算少的了”声音小了些“我有分寸的，还有很多事要做呢，我没打算随随便便就生活不能自理”"}
{"time": 1773983902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526658005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=442308383]\"家人也会有分开的时候吧...孩子长大成人的那一天...家长总要看着孩子们运行的...\""}
