{"time": 1773989745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1450808436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=B9B488674BA04A0F3DFF4B01B97FBD1F.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSQGINmYTTzO_OOVLQYnxM_vpVekxigsRAg_woo49yb5PKtkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQQk3xE4Cv044f2QG7nbrJ53oCKwWCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMKaT6wX-9IvKrZhb55T_7n-tlPUl8rlKIsahQfbBPzU67xwzGcOKWOfvpDg0HDKlrA,file_size=268448]"}
{"time": 1773989896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747839816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*虽然有点不优雅，但是偶尔觉得垃圾食品也很……动人。整个肉排汉堡去。小食要蛋黄酱沙拉和苹果汽水。比琥珀色深一点的肉汁相当诱人“现在总算算有钱了”"}
{"time": 1773990291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837110438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=747839816]\"之前虽然窘迫，但也没见伊芙吃得很差呢。\"妃花端着口感很重的辣椒煎饼和咖喱长米饭坐了下来，\"真的有缺过钱吗？\"调笑着。"}
{"time": 1773990413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661232211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来翔哥还记得要杀我的事吗[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1773990578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "830076239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(他肯定记得啊不然等你干嘛)"}
{"time": 1773990585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789009990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(翔哥已经完整理过生平了)"}
{"time": 1773990591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1912633785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(别急，你也有这一天的)"}
{"time": 1773990617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122539087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“缺钱的时候不多就是了。”稍微捏一捏汉堡，不然张口咬不下“之前出发来玛纳利亚的时候钱没带够，一不小心又花的快了点”"}
{"time": 1773990762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475557110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2122539087]\"那时候真是...\"她笑着咬了一口煎饼，\"嘶...好辣...\"连忙短促地吸气，\"呼...呼...说不定就是从那个时候不喜欢马纳利亚的？\""}
{"time": 1773990874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1775696031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不，比那个早”满脸黑线“从进城之后见到的第一个会动的东西是投石陷阱开始就觉得城里神经病肯定比正常人多了”"}
{"time": 1773990918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700948369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么陷阱有点记不清了，反正有点像猫和老鼠）"}
{"time": 1773991376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1762802435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1775696031]\"唔...不过总体来说，还不错?\"她在你面前眨眨眼，一只手撑着自己的脸颊，因为咀嚼另一边的脸鼓鼓囊囊的"}
{"time": 1773991796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2107665283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“一般般吧”勺上一口沙拉“其实我向往的是平静的生活……”"}
{"time": 1773991937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1452989701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2107665283]\"诶?真的吗？\"翠色的眼睛瞪大了些，有些不可置信，\"完全看不出来诶，伊芙看着就是一副要当冒险者的样子。\""}
{"time": 1773992114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "586846204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这种时候说向往平静的生活——哦～我懂了，这就是所谓的理想和现实对吧？\""}
{"time": 1773992261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776789079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真的，在这之前我过了十几年死宅生活，一次徒步超过两公里我就会死”耸耸肩，喝果汁的时候视线飘到食堂的天窗上去，好像在回忆往昔“……后来日子变了，我只是试着让它回到正轨而已”"}
{"time": 1773992571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "684137270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1776789079]\"嗯...\"她没有继续触及这个话题，\"那现在的生活，算得上平静吗？\""}
{"time": 1773992711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1463207968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“再去其他节点的位置看看？总不可能每个都是这样吧”"}
{"time": 1773992767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "801334541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=684137270]“或许……？”没有细想“但是不是我想要的那种平静。少了人的。”"}
{"time": 1773993085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122858402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1463207968]倒是还有一些不大的节点盘踞在广场附近，如果说这里的是结，那些充其量只能算是疙瘩。"}
{"time": 1773993120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708027182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“清点小节点也挺好的...你们怎么看”"}
{"time": 1773993236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1623232819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=801334541]\"这个话让我怎么接啦。\"她泄了气地趴在桌上，\"大概不论怎么说，主要能抓住那一点希望，你都不会放手的吧。\""}
{"time": 1773993409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702694340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然。”说得干脆而理所应当“不然我会先坏掉的。”放下啃到一半的汉堡，顿了一会才说“不过现在总感觉要争的东西越来越多了，真累人”"}
{"time": 1773993448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981594972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1708027182]\"Your highness.\"卡缇娅提起裙摆，理所当然地鞠了个躬。\n西里斯点了点头，\"这些我们分开处理吧。\""}
{"time": 1773993699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "965216984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=702694340]\"也算越来越充实了?\"她咯咯笑起来，\"把自己逼得太紧啦，嗯...其实没什么特别要争的东西?\""}
{"time": 1773993747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1795233607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也可以...应该没什么危险，处理完，我们广场见？”"}
{"time": 1773993913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1056929480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=965216984]“作为其中之一说这话是不是有些不妙？”继续吃起来“倒不是说人是东西就是了。”"}
{"time": 1773994036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074177324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1795233607]两人分别应下，她们离开得很快，不一会儿广场上只剩下你一个人。"}
{"time": 1773994062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1495974662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "出发，破坏小节点去了"}
{"time": 1773994769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1656528999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1056929480]\"其中之一...?\"她的手指戳了戳自己的脸，\"我...我吗？\"脸颊飞起一抹红晕，\"不是吧...好坏心眼的话。\""}
{"time": 1773994987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1566748794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1495974662](过个幸运)"}
