{"time": 1773995008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1052825698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那很不幸了）"}
{"time": 1773995914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "75506409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1656528999]“怎么了。”自己倒是觉得理所当然“说我自负也可以，但是我不会放弃的”"}
{"time": 1773996079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2020017321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(刚到，看见有人选安琪拉)"}
{"time": 1773996081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1131643474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(看笑了)"}
{"time": 1773996166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170232746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=441047399]她们一个去了东边一个去了南边，虽然给你留了两个方向，但好在这边只剩下一个小疙瘩。\n你抵达的时候，一个空白的茧在夜色下流光溢彩(?)"}
{"time": 1773996480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884755499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？什么玩意....怎么还发光..”凝聚以太，小心靠近"}
{"time": 1773996518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768758762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=75506409]\"我有什么好争的...\"她低下脑袋，餐点吃了一半停了下来，\"伊芙...说这种奇怪的...唔...会让人很困扰的。\""}
{"time": 1773996933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "692731832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=884755499]那个茧没有任何变化，依然在发出五颜六色的霞光，在夜色中尤其夺目"}
{"time": 1773996998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1930001983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "先破坏再说？算了，好诡异，试图联系一下卡缇娅和西莉丝姐姐，看能不能成功"}
{"time": 1773997240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "874261837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=768758762]“我没说什么奇怪的话吧……？”摇了摇头“总不能看着你哪天回到玛门或者其他什么人手里去”"}
