{"time": 1774080875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "474627362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=113140744]你肉眼可见，一炮打上去并没有对里面的东西造成什么影响，只是把外面那层壳彻底击碎了，内在的白色的卵完完全全地露了出来。"}
{"time": 1774081240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "569120360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好硬.......这到底是什么”凝聚以太利刃，上前砍一刀试试"}
{"time": 1774081360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1554404699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这次你倒是看的仔细，在离卵身半寸的地方，你的利刃被严严实实地挡在了半空中。"}
{"time": 1774081385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "920792883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？屏障”撒一把血上去看看"}
{"time": 1774081746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1420557405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "理所当然，有一堵无形的屏障挡在了你们之间，血撒上去很快成股流下"}
{"time": 1774081776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133768299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "控制血沿着屏障流一下， 看看是个什么形状的"}
{"time": 1774082129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883138375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "大球套小球，三百六十度的壁障"}
{"time": 1774082191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1793083319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "试图联系一下斑比“斑比酱？在吗”"}
{"time": 1774082202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "35940674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（随身老爷爷说是）"}
{"time": 1774082473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "293393212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没有回应喵"}
{"time": 1774082514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "238218196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那试试能不能把这玩意给带走"}
{"time": 1774082715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108403033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(ok)"}
{"time": 1774082723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1879695004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(看看cg怎么写)"}
{"time": 1774082967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532289459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "放出更多的血液，凝聚成血网将屏障包住，随后带走"}
{"time": 1774083067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1001662178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=238218196]你继续靠近，那东西并没有任何动静，直到你尝试包住整个屏障，卵的表面逐渐出现碎裂的纹路，细密的黑沙从中流出，危险到来的第六感同时升起。"}
{"time": 1774083096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617932945", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”收回血液，往"}
{"time": 1774083105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329611459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”收回血液，然后立刻后退"}
{"time": 1774083556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735106200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=329611459]你只感觉脚下一空，连带着还没收回的血液，跌入了一片黑暗之中，开始坠落...坠落"}
{"time": 1774083690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328062604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "迅速凝聚血翼试图起飞"}
{"time": 1774083837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857136477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "黑暗如跗骨之蛆从四面八方缠了上来，你猛然惊觉，这黑暗似乎就是先前所见，被卡缇娅着重提醒不要接触的东西。\n血翼刚刚放出，就被无情地扯断"}
{"time": 1774084085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100877791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啧....可恶”摧动手上的以太和火，试图驱散开"}
{"time": 1774084556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860613121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2100877791]虽然坠落没有停歇，但好歹驱逐了你身旁的黑暗，暂时摆脱了黏腻的触感。"}
{"time": 1774086180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116842061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1000914333]过了半晌她放下了手里的勺子，显然对还剩小半盘的饭没有继续吃的意思了，\"伊芙晚上有什么安排吗？我想继续温习预习功课。\""}
{"time": 1774086823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1926714289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1860613121][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 重新凝聚翅膀，试图飞出"}
{"time": 1774086870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267646912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1116842061]“嗯，没什么想做的了”摇摇头“回宿舍吧……不过我应该要备些炼金材料”"}
{"time": 1774098617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102348317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=267646912]\"唔，我打算去图书馆找找有没有合适的教刊，伊芙要是准备炼金材料的话，嗯，应该是要去蜂巢那边?\"微微皱眉，随后舒展开。"}
{"time": 1774098669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572701862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1926714289]如第一次尝试一般，你的翅膀一旦展开，必会被无情地撕裂。坠落仍在继续，如跌入了奈落的落穴之中。"}
{"time": 1774099128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1302640764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=102348317]“要收集原材料好像只有去那边了。应该用不了多久”"}
{"time": 1774099165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1921937504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1572701862][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “可恶.........”用以太包裹自己，再试试"}
{"time": 1774099171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2024224574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "用花瓣强化"}
{"time": 1774099527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1015337507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1302640764]\"那，晚上在宿舍再见?\"妃花端起餐盘站起身，\"伊芙要什么书我也顺便一起找一找。\""}
{"time": 1774099707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "903416316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1921937504]一粒花瓣化为无形，纯白的光膜包裹住你，虽然不知道现在是什么情况，但你没有了失重下坠的感觉"}
{"time": 1774114670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "419385274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "试图起飞"}
{"time": 1774114785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260924533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1015337507]“书……”想了想“关于‘十诫’，主要是‘真实’，我几乎还没怎么了解呢”"}
{"time": 1774114847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1858427151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=419385274]也许是落得足够深，你尝试向上，虽然有这种向上的体感，但茫茫的黑暗让你无法有明确确认的信息。像是风暴的海上唯一漂泊的船只，只点着孤灯，与此同时抵达的，是面对幽闭的恐慌，这念头一经升起，就再也无法离开你的大脑。"}
{"time": 1774114979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1293960447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=260924533]\"诶?这种东西图书馆很难找到啦。\"身为十诫之一继承者的妃花指了指自己，\"就连我，也只清楚一点点浅显的东西。\""}
{"time": 1774114992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "935460782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比...斑比..”有些发抖，试图联系她"}
{"time": 1774115157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101900118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=935460782]这里应该有一个骰子"}
{"time": 1774115164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "348559092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd"}
{"time": 1774115164, "type": "reply", "message_id": "348559092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[诺薇拉]演奏出: 1D20=10"}
{"time": 1774115244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234290450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1293960447]“那就……呃，麻瓜也能用的通用魔法什么的”手指在太阳穴上转转“差不多那种东西吧”"}
{"time": 1774115369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555789565", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=935460782]传来的声音有些模糊，但确是你跌落至此第一次听到别的声音，\"还有...多久...?院长...\"声音很模糊"}
{"time": 1774115375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338612575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=935460782]传来的声音有些模糊，但确是你跌落至此第一次听到别的声音，\"还有...多久...?院长...\"声音很片段。"}
{"time": 1774115451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1132103905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=234290450]她点点头，\"那我就先走啦？我会争取找到合适匕首释放的魔法的。\"心情似乎好了一些，放好餐盘蹦跳着准备离开了。"}
{"time": 1774115661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299462883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=338612575][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “谁...有人吗，救救我”"}
{"time": 1774115775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987017862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1132103905]“嗯，晚些见。”自己出发去炼金巢室。伤药和毒药总得弄点备着"}
{"time": 1774115833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "882055830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=299462883]似乎是对方单方面在说，完全没有回答你的话，\"但是....里面的情况...我很担心...\""}
{"time": 1774115969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839109633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉没什么作用，似乎帮不上自己，继续试图和斑比联系"}
{"time": 1774115971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1242209011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=987017862]蜂巢这地方和未来相差无几，相同的布局，唯一变化的只有使用的人不同导致不同巢室布局不同。整个建筑的中心都是炼金废物收集皿，不过你也如愿找到了堆放材料的地下储存室。"}
{"time": 1774116275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "92283258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=839109633]你感觉到了话语里长长的停顿，不久之后才重新响起来，\"既然如此...我也要进去，这种事...办得到吧？\"声音也逐渐清晰起来，有些耳熟。"}
{"time": 1774116309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "294552006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1242209011](虽然我没有做过药学研究，不过要什么药，你自己随性拿吧，jpg)"}
{"time": 1774116317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "377322783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "努力辨识一下，谁的声音"}
{"time": 1774116494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "241085150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你可以猜一下吧)"}
{"time": 1774116506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910378139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我要是直接说到时候就变成果然如此了)"}
