{"time": 1774203177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821157025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=879878763]（那她们怎么不跑.jpg）"}
{"time": 1774203227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "280542184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(树林里也没路啊)"}
{"time": 1774203247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885124959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（树林里为什么要路（）"}
{"time": 1774203265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1158962532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(感觉也没到一定要跑的时候?)"}
{"time": 1774203390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518304784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1962044827]冲破黑暗的瞬间，映入眼帘的却不是天空的夜色，你只看见一个石制的拱面，上面点缀着十颗星星，其中两颗有些暗淡。周围全部都漆黑如墨，和你刚刚冲出来的黑暗一样。"}
{"time": 1774203437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700652313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？什么情况”感知一下西莉丝姐姐和卡缇娅的情况"}
{"time": 1774203612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "638499422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=879878763]“父系氏族的三小姐，有什么可耀武扬威的。”既然有人想当出头鸟，那就先看向她“还是要我来教教你什么叫三思而后行？”"}
{"time": 1774203816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "638628886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=638499422]对方那一头银发确实很是显目，让你有些幻视某人，不过她确实做不出眼前人的表情，咬牙切齿，发着狠，\"伊斯塔，你最好不要越了规矩。\"她手里颤巍巍地捏着一个黑色的棍子，尖端发着微光。"}
{"time": 1774203878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101700328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=700652313]至少在你感知中依然是安全的，\"唔...这是哪？\"露莉亚抬起脑袋四处看看，\"一个密室?\""}
{"time": 1774203891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285532753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（困😪）"}
{"time": 1774203904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1158095984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（晚安💤）"}
{"time": 1774204110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559588723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=638628886]法杖么？不管是什么，都有自信它肯定突破不了洋荷给的防护。事已至此，眯一眯眼，让孢子朝这个人聚集吧“到这个份上了，指望我就这么算了，可能吗？”"}
{"time": 1774204396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076135988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=559588723]\"啊...啊啊啊!别过来!\"魔杖的尖端爆开，一束火花朝你打来，却被拦在了身前，爆鸣声和风声掀飞了孢子，但对方似乎并不是打算和你打起来，旁边的女生拉起她就跑，其余的人见状真的动起手也纷纷四散躲进树林。"}
{"time": 1774204508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530898804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（为什么怀特家是用火花（）"}
{"time": 1774204653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871600081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(魔法又不是种族天赋，我的剑谁想学，我便教)"}
{"time": 1774204824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441554419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘁。”自然不打算就这么算了，对付这种多打少的，就得追着一个揍。盯着刚刚动手的那个，让地上的枯枝化作短箭飞出。至于能不能打中……随缘吧"}
{"time": 1774205027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2019543394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在想这种是过运气还是过命中)"}
{"time": 1774205042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727411680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是想了想好像差别不大，你挑一个过就是了)"}
