{"time": 1774239755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1865091471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=462181250]四周如同墙壁的黑暗表面像是有着无数蠕动的触须，你一靠近就张牙舞爪，试图缠住你"}
{"time": 1774240149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1526498820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露....拜托你了”"}
