{"time": 1774241361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "88899818", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2058582071]\"哦...\"她收回目光看向你这边，\"应该可以?不过...这是哪？露露有什么头绪吗？\""}
{"time": 1774241373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046271830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2058582071]\"哦...\"她收回目光看向你这边，\"应该可以?不过...这是哪？诺诺有什么头绪吗？\""}
{"time": 1774241428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "320431868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“什么意思...我们可能在茧里面..地理上的话，在中环的广场边上”"}
{"time": 1774241569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703543977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=320431868]\"...不是，不是这个意思。\"她指了指头顶，\"不会无缘无故有这样的地方，这里——是哪?\""}
{"time": 1774241652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1576412354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可能在一个茧里面...毕竟黑暗都是它放出来的..”"}
