{"time": 1774326813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1666931100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=586873451]卡珊德拉没回答，表情仿佛在说随你的便。妃花也没开口，只是蹦跳着到自己的座位上，开始琢磨自己的玉戒指。"}
{"time": 1774326838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779082698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1135679220]一路都很顺遂，很快就和她们两个离得很近了。"}
{"time": 1774327064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1958533010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我感觉离西莉斯姐姐很近了，是不是很快就能出去了”继续朝那边靠近"}
{"time": 1774327129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30374435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1958533010]\"这种能力还真是方便，有考虑过对我做同样的事吗？\"露莉亚的脑袋凑到你面前，指着自己笑着开口"}
{"time": 1774327170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2090277075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要说这种话啦....能当人肯定还是人类最好啊”"}
{"time": 1774327253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200665214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1666931100]*大概也没什么时间研究毒药了。稍微看看通用魔法，就准备上床咯"}
{"time": 1774328042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "340937496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2090277075]\"诶?\"她掐了掐你的脸，\"可是如果都是这样的话～那诺诺也会好受些吧？\""}
{"time": 1774328269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330130551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉斯姐姐变成这样，我已经很愧疚了....露露还是别说这种话了”"}
{"time": 1774328366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448128993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1200665214]通用魔法第一章!四元素三段，你稍微看了看，大致就是如何把自己的魔力转化为对应的元素魔力这种程度的说明。"}
