{"time": 1774338760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973923948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1407598753]\"是么～\"她只是浅浅地笑了下，然后就不说话了，和你并肩走在一起，在夜色里也撑着她的那把花伞。"}
{"time": 1774338804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747616031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（调制过程就别让我编了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1774338857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "765122099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（夜色落幕～）"}
{"time": 1774338858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1521745761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1528798059]过程倒是很顺利，滴定出一些无色的液体后，你听到一旁的床上传出声响，\"唔唔...伊芙?...几点了?\"声音的主人一边揉着眼睛一边开口，全然不顾肩头滑落的浴袍。"}
{"time": 1774338869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027604920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(夜色落幕了)"}
{"time": 1774339117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764660439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1521745761]*看看时间“差不多可以去上课了”随后小心地把毒液收集密封起来"}
{"time": 1774339253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077806399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"昨天都没怎么睡好...\"说着话的时候还在一直打哈欠，\"困...\"虽然坐着身子，但是一摇一摇的，随时要倒栽下去的样子。"}
{"time": 1774339378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577655731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1973923948]你们一起回了酒店，除了露莉亚一路上都有些好奇地张望惹了不少目光之外，总算全都完完整整地坐在了沙发上。"}
{"time": 1774339426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079859886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“接下来只用等待就行了吗”"}
{"time": 1774339552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2067440387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1077806399]“怎么……不会做了什么奇怪的梦吧”皱眉“安息的力量还在影响你？”"}
{"time": 1774339690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1009233184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(摸一会)"}
{"time": 1774348934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604511598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2079859886]\"嗯...\"露莉亚自然地坐在你旁边，\"虽然说是这么说，不过诺诺肯定闲不下来吧？\""}
{"time": 1774348991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "477464559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....”点点头“坐以待毙也不是我的风格，我们继续破坏节点的话，师父她们估计也会更轻松”"}
{"time": 1774349353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "917172237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2067440387]\"没...没有啦。\"她有些费力地睁开眼，\"我只是...有点兴奋?\"双手拍了拍自己的脸，\"昨晚迟迟没睡着啦...\""}
{"time": 1774349390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568325808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我要说我有50心理学的事了（）"}
{"time": 1774349468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28819349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=477464559]\"那就结论没变～我也已经和西里斯姐姐交代好了外面的情况。\"她一边点点头一边偏着脑袋看你，\"说起来，为什么会觉得我们死了呢?\""}
{"time": 1774349504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2087752622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=568325808](那你尝试性过一过吧。)"}
{"time": 1774349512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418322521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我....我亲眼看到了大家的尸体，西莉丝姐姐也看到了...”不太敢回想起当时的情况"}
{"time": 1774349633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659134731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd"}
{"time": 1774349633, "type": "reply", "message_id": "659134731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊芙]演奏出: 1D20=18"}
{"time": 1774349897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747257749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1418322521]\"只是这样?\"露莉亚伸出手扯了扯你的脸，随后松开，\"嘛，看来诺诺也不能不算因祸得福了。\"她的视线落到卡缇娅身上，带着些说不清道不明的意味。"}
{"time": 1774349940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197746248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=747257749][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “又不是只有我一个人这样觉得，西莉丝姐姐当时也...”反驳道"}
{"time": 1774350020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482076452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=659134731]她确实藏着什么没说，你能看出她有些慌张。\n\"我都在这里了...怎么可能还有那种事发生啦。\"说完又拍了拍脸。"}
{"time": 1774350254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001129813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有没有人和妃花说过你不太擅长撒谎？”眼皮耷拉下一半“说不说我都会担心，还不如让我知道我应该担心什么”"}
{"time": 1774350271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1382137693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1197746248]她没有接你的话，脸上露出些诡计得逞的笑，\"好啦，我又不是不信。我只是好奇当时在你眼中我们是怎么死的。\""}
{"time": 1774350655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598361189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2001129813]\"...\"她垂着脑袋，头发遮住了些面庞，沉默了半晌，才重新抬起头，用一个勉强的笑容开口，\"伊芙...如果真的要分开...我希望是一个happy end.\""}
{"time": 1774351068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621518252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1598361189]“我还没有打算end呢，别说这种话。”干脆坐到她面前“复活死人这种事情我都要去做，不管要面对什么，不会比那个难。”"}
{"time": 1774351126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2052497720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1382137693][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “那所以在露露的视角里，外面发生了什么”"}
{"time": 1774351790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "23278767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1621518252]她还是低着头，不敢看你，\"我能感觉到...他们来了...虽然还很远...但是，玛门大人...\"浑身抖了抖，\"训斥了我...\""}
{"time": 1774351813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759483118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（玛门是不是星期日alter）"}
{"time": 1774351844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790818325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2052497720]\"谁知道?只是睡了一觉，突然中环升起了帷幕，你和西里斯不知所踪。\"她皱起眉，\"说起来，那时候为什么会睡着呢?\""}
{"time": 1774352140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074443626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(其实和星期日差不多吧，我不觉得牢日会不夹杂私情。)"}
{"time": 1774352442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092875955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=23278767]“阴魂不散啊……我们明明不在同一个时空吧。”伸手抱住她的肩膀“说别怕可能有些强人所难了……但已经打算叛逃了吧？他会是我的敌人”说是这么说，不过稍有些心虚地摸了摸自己的腿"}
{"time": 1774352948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337665507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2092875955]她把脑袋搭在你的肩膀上，反手抱住了你，身子和语气都在抖，\"伊芙...妃花早就知道会有这一天...所以...到时候不要管我，好吗？我会自己解决...\""}
{"time": 1774353553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "22674962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“别看不起我，我也早知道会有这一天。”摇头，语气尽量自信起来“已经帮过你几次了，难道最后一次袖手旁观他就会放过我？”"}
{"time": 1774353580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2006308559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=790818325][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “怪...为什么只有我和西莉丝姐姐被卷进来了”"}
{"time": 1774353812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017978346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2006308559]\"这些事情想也没有意义。\"露莉亚率先站起身，\"睡哪?\""}
{"time": 1774353844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "840203414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这倒是个问题”思考，四个人，感觉怎么安排自己都感觉怪怪的"}
{"time": 1774353857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "944197056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（四间房（））"}
{"time": 1774353975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1056817151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=22674962]\"嗯...\"她轻轻叮咛了一声，过了一会才松开手，\"我想要happy end的结局...所以我也不会放弃的。\"深吸一口气，\"再抱着就显得妃花很软弱了...伊芙先出门吧，我收拾一下就去教室。\""}
{"time": 1774354013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814871450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=840203414]卡缇娅的视线也投了过来，西里斯倒是自己在想着什么，眉头微蹙。"}
{"time": 1774354082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533123109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "让西莉丝姐姐和卡缇娅睡一起？感觉不太能接受，万一卡缇娅对西莉丝姐姐做什么就不好了。。。“那露露晚上和西莉丝姐姐睡一起....？”"}
{"time": 1774354308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "181161140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1056817151]“……嗯。”走之前揉了揉她的脑袋“你知道，我又贪心又吹毛求疵……少了个能关心的人很麻烦的”"}
