{"time": 1774426713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197417734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1624470774]“不错，我喜欢这种课。”颇为满意地点点头，看向妃花“虽然真给我养我估计也养不来……早点去食堂？我想蹲一下伊斯塔。”"}
{"time": 1774427289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301020241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1197417734]\"嗯。\"妃花的心情看上去很好，点了点头，\"真想见伊斯塔学姐的话，问问卡珊德拉应该就清楚该去哪了吧?\""}
{"time": 1774427356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695561132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她还知道这个？.jpg）"}
