{"time": 1774510603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794778226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1928266187]\"嗯...\"妃花没有接这句话，点了点头跟着你一起走了。参天大树般的图书馆从不拒绝任何渴求知识的人，又一次站在面前依然可见其宏伟。"}
{"time": 1774510625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982357104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，杀我不是意义吗）"}
