{"time": 1774516587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697263163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(诶，那我要说了，目前在外面看来是空间的位置是可观测的，所以只要有坐标现在可以从外面进来。)"}
{"time": 1774516598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1191566044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你现在就知道漆黑是什么了)"}
