{"time": 1774526129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1030165439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(问)"}
{"time": 1774527045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1382113977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1588584654]\"小家伙应该还记得之前和你同房的两位客人——\"龙芙开口，但目光却落在斑比身上，\"毕竟相当于借人去出差，总要正主在场嘛。\""}
{"time": 1774527329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "679740914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=391723024]学习的时间总是转瞬即逝，不，也许有些难熬，不过但你从书卷里抬起头时，你对通用魔法的理解更深，与其说是它是专门的一类魔法，不如说这就是所有魔法的基础。越过元素转化，你几乎掌握了比较简单的初级护盾术，附魔盾牌这样的防护魔法。"}
{"time": 1774527578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2098418104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1382113977][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “你难道说的是伊芙她们..”"}
{"time": 1774527790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1039831202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2098418104]见斑比没有什么反应，她的目光重新落回来，赞许地点了点头，“中环之所以被放逐在时间里——三天前有人启动了大规模的时间魔法，嗯...与其说是时间魔法，不如说是一种追想的阵法，只要停下这种阵法，我们就可以确定自己的时间。小家伙，可以凭着之前的缘当做信标，去到对方所在的地方。”"}
{"time": 1774527930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1030876086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以我要去那个时间，找到那个阵法吗？”"}
{"time": 1774528122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069510912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1030876086]她轻轻颔首，\"或者，找到启用了阵法的人。\"在人字着重咬了音，\"以我的能力，最多可以送小家伙和选定的一个人一起过去。\"她调侃地开口，\"斑比女士要是愿意的话自然最好。\""}
{"time": 1774528152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028676167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（典中典之我去干嘛）"}
{"time": 1774528161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759294451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你什么冠军）"}
{"time": 1774528224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691743553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，一个人吗...”有些纠结，该带谁去比较好"}
{"time": 1774528264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2049431226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "戳手指思考"}
{"time": 1774528520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "852917476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=679740914] 腰颈有点疼，双手绞在一起狠狠伸个懒腰“原来我还能做到这种东西……怎么偏偏家里人没教过呢。师母也不教，净让人跑步了……”"}
{"time": 1774528592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267897722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你思考得怎么样了）"}
{"time": 1774528615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "686767614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2049431226]\"真是放肆。\"斑比没有开口，倒是是她旁边的空气出现了褶皱，随后露出了一对散发着不详的瞳孔，正座的龙芙面具下的瞳孔立刻切为了竖瞳，两边的对峙持续了一瞬，最后以空气复归平静告结。但刚刚周身感到的压力却让你冷汗直流。\n卡缇娅几乎贴到了你身上，斑比瞥了一眼摇摇头，\"我是没办法过去的，不过即使不过去我也可以提供一些眷顾。\""}
{"time": 1774528628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803342765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉我现在有点不能直视放肆这句话了)"}
{"time": 1774528633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1694752333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(凯隐入脑)"}
{"time": 1774528650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1148450596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我可以回去和她们稍微商量一下吗....”"}
{"time": 1774528659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1097199577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得还是同房两个字比较不能直视）"}
{"time": 1774528788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1302482423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=852917476]\"嗯...?她们应该有自己的考量吧？\"妃花的进度比你慢一点，下午才堪堪能转化一些元素，此刻趴在桌子上懒洋洋地开口，\"毕竟肯定不会害伊芙啦。\""}
{"time": 1774528898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1307969701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1148450596]龙芙轻轻点头，\"这件事的决定权交给你，准备好了上来找妾身即可。\"她示意你可以回去了。"}
{"time": 1774528953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128915724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1302482423]“搞不懂她们到底想做什么……”摇摇头，自己先站起来“你要再看会吗？我打算在图书馆里寻宝”"}
{"time": 1774529039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262117475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那斑比酱，龙芙小姐我就先下去了...”"}
{"time": 1774529072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1002795020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那你下去了。"}
{"time": 1774529104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "13824993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回到房间内...看看那两位醒了没"}
{"time": 1774529121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1758392027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2128915724]\"诶～?\"她抬起身子，不过没站起来，\"是谁中午说我们在图书馆也要小心谨慎，会遇到危险呢～好难猜啊——\""}
{"time": 1774529129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448867804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这有什么好选的吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1774529341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "284171139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=13824993]\"刚刚差点感觉自己死掉了...\"进了房间，卡缇娅松开你的手，在一旁缓和起心情。想来你现在的状态也不算好，面色苍白，冷汗淋漓。\n西里斯和露莉亚坐在客厅，\"怎么了？\"西里斯拿着杯子小口啜饮，露莉亚开的口。"}
{"time": 1774529404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105533248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“龙芙小姐刚刚找我”坐到她们身旁“我跟她说了露露说的事情，不过龙芙小姐告诉我了一些不太好的事情”"}
{"time": 1774529418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "958134992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1758392027]“这不是都过这么久了……”撇了撇嘴“你不放心就一起来吧。虽然我觉得浪费时间的事有一个人做就差不多了”"}
{"time": 1774529453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120248727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她说现在我们所处的这个空间其实是乱流的，不属于原本的时空，如果贸然把结界彻底摧毁的话，就会发生很恐怖的灾难”"}
{"time": 1774529482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370744479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(人类史上最凶最恶的事件)"}
{"time": 1774529684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402142286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“龙芙小姐说这一切是有人建了一个什么时空的法阵，龙芙小姐说伊芙那家伙现在就在那个时空，希望我根据她的坐标过去找到那个建法阵的人，龙芙小姐说我只能带一个人去”言简意赅的讲完"}
{"time": 1774529883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2066867577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=958134992]\"妃花怎么会不放心。\"她笑嘻嘻地，\"我百分百相信伊芙的判断哦?\"不过她还是指了指自己的戒指，\"要是遇见什么记得...\""}
{"time": 1774529921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335226459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=402142286]\"...\"沉默笼罩了这个客厅，大家都在等。"}
{"time": 1774529973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594273788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我不记得了，露露见过伊芙没）"}
