{"time": 1774530425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184592656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=805729759]\"唔...?\"她点点头，起身，\"那就是...分叉地探险时间?\""}
{"time": 1774530449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525861582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“说到伊芙...有件事我要跟露露说一下，村子里大家死的那天，那个叫伊芙的就在村子中间，大家的死和她脱不开干系...”"}
{"time": 1774530526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382581951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=184592656]“嗯，有一种开盲盒的感觉？虽然感觉九成九都是没什么惊喜的东西”歪了歪脑袋“走吧，就当锻炼身体……”"}
{"time": 1774530536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779940439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1525861582]（你可以说的更直白点对不对，都实锤了（）"}
{"time": 1774530543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "204394518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（供认不讳）"}
{"time": 1774530735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337935122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....而且..短时间的话，大概不能动她”"}
{"time": 1774530764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "717268364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1525861582]\"...\"露莉亚深吸了一口气，紧接着一次又一次深呼吸，但怎么也掩盖不了脸上的表情，\"我想去，至少要亲眼见见。\"眉头紧蹙。"}
