{"time": 1774531020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "849928116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（反正你们甚至有奶（）"}
{"time": 1774531031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769567242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”点点头“那拜托卡缇娅在我不在的时候帮忙照顾一下西莉丝姐姐”"}
{"time": 1774531341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "774706677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=769567242]\"诶...?我不去吗？\"卡缇娅抱着手臂，\"我去的话会更好吧？\""}
{"time": 1774531494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "503601383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，从实力考量的话，卡缇娅去肯定最好....但是去见那个伊芙对我和露露很重要，而且在那边...说不定还有机会可以彻底报仇...”握紧拳头“不用担心我的安危了，毕竟斑比也说会提供帮助了”"}
{"time": 1774532538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961086281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=503601383]\"但是我们的任务不是要去毁掉法阵嘛？\"卡缇娅有些不甘心，咬了咬唇。"}
{"time": 1774532700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1849217556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“......法阵是一方面，但仇也不能不报...”抱一下她“我会回来的，一定...”"}
{"time": 1774533468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1635062556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1849217556]\"....\"她最后叹了口气，对你伸出手，\"咬我。\""}
{"time": 1774533492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "271998090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然不知道hyw,但乖乖咬她一口"}
{"time": 1774534207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583204158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=271998090]些许甘甜的血液流入你的口中，和西里斯不同，她的血有效地缓和了你的饥渴感，而且随着血液的运行逐渐汇聚在你的脖子下面锁骨那里。\"现在，我们对等了。\"她掐了掐你的脸，\"明天见。\""}
{"time": 1774534407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1245354977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1427780493]整座树的设计好似一座繁复的迷宫，但每当你尝试拐入一些弯弯绕绕的深处时，你总是会发现那里有一条新的路等着你，结果总是通往大厅。该不该感叹设计的精妙呢"}
{"time": 1774534509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1373738809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=583204158][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “明天见...卡缇娅再见，西莉丝姐姐再见”挥手告别"}
{"time": 1774534531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299603836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1245354977]“看来今天不是个适合寻宝的日子”有点黑线“下次是不是该出门前准备一下预言？”"}
{"time": 1774534684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193776716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你们啥时候回）"}
{"time": 1774534771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558403293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1373738809]\"嗯...\"西里斯对你点点头，她一时之间竟拿不出什么可以帮上你，最后解下了腰间的细剑递给你，\"在那边要小心，我在这边等你回来...\""}
{"time": 1774534775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045027163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1193776716](路上)"}
{"time": 1774534811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394474139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢西莉丝姐姐”接过那把剑，有些开心"}
{"time": 1774534826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1557970204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我成罗罗诺亚索隆了）"}
{"time": 1774534862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891073386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=299603836]此刻你们站在大厅里，那几个主要的入口依然在眼前清晰可见。\"诶?伊芙什么时候偷偷学会了预言的魔法?\"妃花敲了敲附近的树干，\"不过所谓的图书馆，肯定有什么禁书区吧？\""}
{"time": 1774534876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315649262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1557970204](你现在也只有她的剑啊，什么时候三刀流了)"}
