{"time": 1774535051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435503124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(同人也带着三把剑的)"}
{"time": 1774535055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1965440891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是吗）"}
{"time": 1774535058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2104611868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(星爆气流斩的时候断了一把)"}
{"time": 1774535065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981135063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（三我没看）"}
{"time": 1774535072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "893856508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(然后用亚丝娜的剑继续舞的)"}
{"time": 1774535080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "874307373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(就一打牛头怪啊)"}
{"time": 1774535094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146462934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(逐暗者断了吧)"}
{"time": 1774535114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526197819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1891073386]“按理说是有吧。这么说来找不到也正常……果然应该找人帮忙带路的吧”"}
{"time": 1774535335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745098357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=394474139]\"这把剑可以承受一些魔法，嗯...如果有需要的话，你可以把它当做一个施法的媒介。\"西里斯解释完，轻轻呼了口气，学着之前说过的话，温声，\"明天见。\""}
{"time": 1774535374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "138088851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“明天见”再重复一遍，然后把剑放在腰间，牵起露露的手上楼去了"}
{"time": 1774535466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160199450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=526197819]\"那也得找有进入禁书区域权限的人吧？嗯...而且，什么人才会带我们去那种危险的地方?\"她摆摆手，微微阖眼垂眸，阴影之下显得有些忧郁。"}
{"time": 1774535748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741902105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=138088851]门在身后合上，你刚走到走廊尽头，却看见斑比就在电梯的入口等着你。她赤裸裸的目光毫不掩饰对露莉亚的厌恶，连带着对你也嫌弃了些，但她没开口，在等着你的恭敬。"}
{"time": 1774535793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005087409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱....”朝她挥手打招呼"}
{"time": 1774535812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "852966710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这位是我的朋友，露莉亚，我准备和她一起去”"}
{"time": 1774535920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136203528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1160199450]“当然是看热闹不嫌事大的人”低头看看“还是不浪费时间了。学姐？听得见吗？”"}
{"time": 1774535988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699436138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=852966710]\"一介人类。\"她显然不太满意你的话，出声的瞬间周围的空气顿时布满了寒意，猩红的目光盯在露莉亚腰间的典籍上，\"呵...还是他们的人。\""}
{"time": 1774536063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974285374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....”有点不知道该怎么说，感觉有些尴尬....“露露，这位..是我现在的主人，斑比酱”"}
{"time": 1774536302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858688674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1974285374]露莉亚不自觉地往后缩了缩，随后下定了什么决心，语出惊人，\"您好...斑比女士...的话，我也可以成为您的眷属。\""}
{"time": 1774536331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "22407402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2136203528]\"很忙。\"胸针里传出淡淡的回应。"}
{"time": 1774536400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "500717772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎....露露她开玩笑呢...斑比酱别在意...”"}
{"time": 1774536459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1392582385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=22407402]“希古娜怎么找？”既然都回了，索性直接问了"}
{"time": 1774536517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1995887488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（额，人是不是多了）"}
{"time": 1774549652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943544699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=500717772]（）"}
{"time": 1774549674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2009367336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，c了赢不了（）"}
{"time": 1774549883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1121537176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=500717772]\"我倒不认为在开玩笑。\"斑比的眸子闪烁着，\"不过，我从不给予这种人垂怜。\"说着的时候目光依然留在那册书卷上，\"既然你索求，那就在这一次证明吧。\"她的手心升起一只蝙蝠，\"仆人，这次特许你带上。\""}
{"time": 1774550017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1318304060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1392582385]\"嗯?那现在不忙了。\"她的语气突然活泼起来，带着些愉快，\"你要找希古娜?哦，你现在在维拉那里?为什么?\""}
{"time": 1774550043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688635618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1121537176][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “哎...这..”不知道该如何是好"}
{"time": 1774550062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342160242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢...谢谢...斑比”"}
{"time": 1774550156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1498779737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1318304060]“问问她时间相关的话题……她都抱着沙漏了，应该问的到？”"}
{"time": 1774550163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182386771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=342160242](那你接啊)"}
{"time": 1774550313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897383280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "接过那只蝙蝠“这是？”"}
{"time": 1774550328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341386617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1498779737]\"那还真是劳你费心诶。\"她似乎在憋着笑，\"不过希古娜可不是遵循固定路线就能见到的，像游戏里一样aabb上上下下连迷路这种程度都做不到，你应该见识过吧。\"偷笑"}
{"time": 1774550498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "200398956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1897383280]\"我的一点分灵。\"她的目光似乎在你的脖子上盯了一会，\"可能有那么一点用吧。\"紧接着打了个哈欠，慵懒的感觉再次回到她身上，\"还有什么要说的吗？\""}
{"time": 1774550525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861158993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，明天见，斑比酱”"}
{"time": 1774550557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1465166478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=341386617]（还有街机？）"}
{"time": 1774550557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1917410773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=341386617]“我要是知道怎么去就不用问你了”耐着性子，越急她肯定越不肯说“你们认识的吧”"}
{"time": 1774550849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845033373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1861158993]\"...\"她似乎是笑了一下，不过你不确信是不是真的看见了，\"如果你还能活着的话。\"她撂下一句话，直直地回了自己的房间。小蝙蝠在你的手上跳腾，然后钻到了你的头发里。"}
{"time": 1774550978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916147076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1917410773]\"嗯哼?\"她的回应算是认了下来你的问题，\"我要是说我也不清楚，你会信吗?\""}
{"time": 1774551007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1248890841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "等她进房间之后“露露....以后别说这种话了”"}
{"time": 1774551079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "117976095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=916147076]“不信”毫不犹豫“马纳利亚跟你家一样”"}
{"time": 1774551092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1922331330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1248890841]别走别和她说"}
{"time": 1774551114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436767182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“明明那么恋旧，怎么偏偏有的是变化的权能？”"}
{"time": 1774551131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1118705889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1922331330]边（）"}
{"time": 1774551211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "108488121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1248890841]\"嗯?\"灰色的眸子对上你血红色的眼睛，\"但是不这样的话，我就不能永远陪着诺诺了吧？反正至少——我不打算改主意。\""}
{"time": 1774551269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506145930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....没这种说法吧,而且血裔和神术听起来就很反义词..”"}
{"time": 1774551379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402407403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1436767182]\"现在倒是能说会道起来了。\"卡珊德拉似乎被噎了一下，\"咳咳...这种事小孩子不要追问，不过呢～我倒是可以公开另一个你可能会感兴趣的情报。\"她轻巧地把话题揭过。"}
{"time": 1774551421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "538781862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1506145930]\"但是刚刚答应下来了吧？\"露莉亚回头看了看空荡荡的走廊，\"她肯定有办法。\""}
{"time": 1774551477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658431044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那到时候怎么跟你师父交代呢...而且你的神术天赋很高,我不希望你为了我放弃”"}
{"time": 1774551566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766389133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=402407403]“直接说吧，我们都赶时间不是吗？”"}
{"time": 1774551623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1316491864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1658431044]\"那诺诺呢？\"你们一起上了云梯，缓缓爬升，她直直地看着你，目光有些冷，\"你怎么和莉夏姐交代?\""}
{"time": 1774551673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1969857919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我还好吧...这样也不影响我练剑，而且我本来也不是单纯的人，师父会理解我的”"}
{"time": 1774551773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809076635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=766389133]\"从入门左数第三个入口，数二十五步，然后跳下去。传说中就是这样寻找幽灵公主的呢～\"她说完理所当然地补充了一句，\"传说出自我，谨记不要闭眼。\""}
{"time": 1774551831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400700708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“从幻术科出来我已经再也不怕跳楼了”*耸肩，虽然她看不见“一会再说”"}
{"time": 1774551833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1121178116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1969857919]\"我也不是。\"她吐出这么一句话，\"这种牵强的话，我也可以说。\"偏过头不去看你。"}
{"time": 1774551851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1001062686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=400700708]“走吧”拉着妃花“去找幽灵公主”"}
{"time": 1774551977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "174663741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1121178116][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “你怎么不是了...”"}
{"time": 1774552000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274570687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1121178116][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 捏一下她的手"}
{"time": 1774552010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962768706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1001062686]\"知道得越多，知道得越少，不过呢～玩得开心。\"胸针暗淡了下去，而你们现在的位置就在大厅。"}
{"time": 1774552102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799458921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=274570687]\"我说不是就是不是。\"她倒是没挣开你的手，不过依然不看你，\"我已经做好决定了...真的...\"语气微微发颤。"}
{"time": 1774552142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595459750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎”叹口气..."}
{"time": 1774552147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1169334748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（晚安💤）"}
{"time": 1774552273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893104749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的喵，明天上午问。)"}
{"time": 1774552275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490327436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*按卡珊德拉说的，先找到那个地方呗"}
{"time": 1774552279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822476963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
