{"time": 1774601526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2014813347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=180574637]25步结束，刚好到了一个树杈的位置，先前你可能不会注意，但现在你倒是看得清楚，这里的一侧树壁上有一个豁口。"}
{"time": 1774601619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "69410907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（像什么美剧公寓里出现过的垃圾通道）"}
