{"time": 1774601708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "466500742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2014813347]“说是在这里。”看了看那个豁口“又要跳了，好消息是再怎么样树也没高到云上”"}
{"time": 1774601973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687770223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=466500742]\"最多只会摔得很疼这种程度?\"妃花咯咯笑，\"比起之前怎么都好太多了呢。\""}
{"time": 1774602006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949524532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1930228940][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 哎？那直接推开好了，反正门没锁"}
{"time": 1774602022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1615490856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（会不会是大黑塔）"}
{"time": 1774602034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1502595577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能是门口就是传送陷阱吧）"}
{"time": 1774602044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287673565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（盖 立 德）"}
{"time": 1774602123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1741456938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说的也是。那我先？”侧过头看她一眼，在想汇聚风元素魔力有没有可能有用"}
{"time": 1774602319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1048080975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1949524532]门的那一侧，刚刚的房间消失不见，夜色笼罩的小巷出现在你眼前。甚至有些眼熟，也许你在中环不经意路过过。"}
{"time": 1774602402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "161531711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1741456938]\"嗯。\"显然不会有什么意见啦"}
{"time": 1774602531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1967186612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那就汇聚够了风元素再扒着框往下跳咯，记得捂一下裙子"}
{"time": 1774602536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "112787457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1048080975][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “哎？这是...难道我们已经过去了吗...”挠挠头，看看情况"}
{"time": 1774603192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2142667749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1967186612]不消一秒你就理解了为什么要你睁着眼了，你发现下落的速度足够称得上慢悠悠，就像是轻飘飘的羽毛。也不知道是不是你汇聚的风元素起了作用。两侧都是浓密的树叶，伴随着莎莎的声音，身体倒是和它们亲密接触。"}
{"time": 1774603240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168041011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一环羽落术？）"}
{"time": 1774603332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1118169462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=112787457]你再回头的时候，酒店的场景已经消失不见，只剩下一个平平无奇空空荡荡的法师塔敞开的木门，里面积满了灰尘，看上去长时间没有人用过。月光洒在你身上，刚刚似乎还是清晨?"}
{"time": 1774603342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590168992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "有点怕地心引力对自己打快慢刀，惊奇于体验之余还是没把风元素全散去，低头看看大概有多高？"}
{"time": 1774603545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349478578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1590168992]视线被树叶挡住，但怎么想都不太正常，刚刚跳下来的位置真的可以飘这么久吗？"}
{"time": 1774603663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "705149362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“难道说在根系中？维拉这么大，应该……会挺深的？”抬头看看妃花到哪了"}
{"time": 1774603716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865948665", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1118169462][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “妃花小姐整的好突然啊，不过要从哪开始呢....露露，你怎么看”"}
