{"time": 1774604861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1081644752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也不赖了)"}
{"time": 1774604918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916006242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1190065441]\"唔...\"她眨眨眼，摊了摊手，\"这些钱在这边可以用多久，诺诺有数吗？\""}
{"time": 1774604956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1214616378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，能用好久好久吧...只要省一点花的话”"}
{"time": 1774604968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30667587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（莉夏没给露露点吗）"}
{"time": 1774604996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475073752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也没空给啊)"}
{"time": 1774605036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137967000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说进来前）"}
{"time": 1774605079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "294332709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1214616378]\"不知道诺诺有没有了解过啦。\"她捏了捏你的脸，露出了手腕上同款的手链，\"之前住的酒店，一晚上可是三位数诶。\""}
{"time": 1774605135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "520547251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以我说...省着点花的话”"}
{"time": 1774605145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1652791401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2068490257]大约过了十来秒，妃花才轻轻地落在旁边，脚底似乎是透明地面，从视觉上就像走在树叶上一样。"}
{"time": 1774605174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1723025786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2137967000](给了，然后买了三个同款手链)"}
{"time": 1774605177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "178368602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这个我真记得)"}
{"time": 1774605259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "251898343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1652791401]“居然，还在树梢？又是幻术么？”试着拨开树叶"}
{"time": 1774605296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410490692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=520547251]\"这下糟糕了——\"虽然这么说，但是她的表情倒是看不出很慌乱，\"那就用能用很久的省一点花的方案，先决定第一件事吧～我们住哪?\""}
{"time": 1774605365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "719595658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=251898343]周围维持着恰到好处的光照，既不刺眼，也不至于昏暗，然而你拨开一丛树叶，面前依然是一丛树叶。"}
{"time": 1774605453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1071579254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=410490692][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “最省的方法肯定就是，我看身后在法师塔也没人...不过我们还是去找点普通的旅店住着吧...”"}
{"time": 1774605493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "67629657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“或者还有一计，我们去上学吧”"}
{"time": 1774605530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004073740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=719595658]“还有第二关……”事到如今已经不会意外了，看看周围有没有说的上特殊的物体？"}
{"time": 1774605544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337583199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“中环一半是学院，一半是法师塔....你觉得那个施展时空阵法的家伙在哪边可能性更大点呢...”"}
{"time": 1774605558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "483096209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过我估计两边都要去看的....”"}
{"time": 1774605727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1559161920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=483096209]\"嗯。\"她点点头，\"但是马纳利亚学院的话...我们真的有办法进去上学吗？嗯...比起学院，反而是教会更容易收留我吧...\""}
{"time": 1774605747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1843846221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"至于诺诺...伊瑟尔院长可是天使诶...\""}
{"time": 1774605786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449156045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2004073740]侦查或者灵感吧"}
{"time": 1774605789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702465823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“说不定...有教无类...算了，我们还是先去找住的地方吧”"}
{"time": 1774605855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "908836399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1702465823]\"中环的旅馆...最便宜的也要一天十个金币。\"露莉亚叹了口气，指了指身后，\"要不...?\""}
{"time": 1774605898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1723515300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧....还是省着点花吧..”"}
{"time": 1774605909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890191920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd 懒得翻加值（）"}
