{"time": 1774606029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104067664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说不定该成长一下了)"}
{"time": 1774606039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026228786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不对啊，我怎么记得之前给过成长呢)"}
{"time": 1774606081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089623501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1237374082]（）"}
{"time": 1774606097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328828287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2004073740]你观察过世界上有没有两片相同的树叶吗？可能并不重要，但现在在你身边的每一片树叶，脉络，纹理，形状都是一摸一样。"}
{"time": 1774606150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845216503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(事已至此，常用技能说不定都能成长一下?属性之后单独再给吧。)"}
{"time": 1774606159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1243850923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1723515300](那你继续)"}
{"time": 1774606167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1740144176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（晚点吧）"}
{"time": 1774606222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225793821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1328828287]“这是何意……”看看能不能摘一片下来“要藏木于林？”"}
{"time": 1774606249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1380911749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回到身后的法师塔，把门关上，上楼看看有没有什么床之类的东西"}
{"time": 1774606291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358633841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，露露，我忽然想到一件事情，这个时代的夏日酒店的老板会不会也是龙芙小姐”"}
{"time": 1774606441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1870659724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1380911749]门关下的时候抖落了一层厚厚的灰，呛得你嗓子痛，而且你不免有些担心着破破烂烂的木门能不能起到门的作用。"}
{"time": 1774606451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "305611998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来酒店原来不在中环？）"}
{"time": 1774606457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1282068050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（在啊）"}
{"time": 1774606472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617010031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（整个中环都flash back了啊）"}
{"time": 1774606485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243545752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你去找龙芙没意义啊（）"}
{"time": 1774606492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "633994273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（为什么没有（）"}
{"time": 1774606500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431396261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（本来就是同一个人）"}
{"time": 1774606500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230583725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可能你会说龙芙不认识我）"}
{"time": 1774606516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031634788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（而且魔法阵又不在那）"}
{"time": 1774606519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814117555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但是我觉得是可以聊的）"}
