{"time": 1774678063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780858740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1734143024]“还真慷慨……”托着下巴思考起来“首先当然是……时间魔法的记录啦。那是什么？”"}
{"time": 1774678106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "958708016", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "桌子的抽屉里空空荡荡，不过你在开抽屉前注意到抽屉的握手上积的灰比起桌面只有浅浅一层。"}
{"time": 1774678118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1670028868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=275606131]桌子的抽屉里空空荡荡，不过你在开抽屉前注意到抽屉的握手上积的灰比起桌面只有浅浅一层。"}
{"time": 1774678159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617041946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“最近有人来这把东西取走了？”"}
{"time": 1774678326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "114696793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1617041946]露莉亚在你旁边稍微打量了一下，\"嗯...看来这里也被其他人光顾过啊...唉，这样不就没法知道，过去的侧写了吗\""}
{"time": 1774678422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1471746186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了...”继续动用魔力，把这边大概清理一下，如果往坏处想，接下来好多天都要住在这里"}
{"time": 1774678577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016923653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=780858740]夏弥竖起食指，\"马纳利亚的记录里，时间魔法只有一例存在证明，相信你也猜得出来——封印的沙漏，连带着，被封印的希古娜。\""}
{"time": 1774678735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530496033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1471746186]一番忙碌之后，这个塔顶的房间被你清理得稍微像是能住人的样子，木质家具经过炙烤，虽然表面黝黑，但也散发了些原木的清香"}
{"time": 1774678898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599901127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=CDE92BA0D1C6E66D245F6F3D8F0DF763.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSIhQT0f4EJdFHqM1SBncVC-Hpa0BiwuEMg_woo0bjpiPrBkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQVrNvcaEmgDV82Ox0Iv--53oCig6CAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAESME3DOzn1gu1wJw1DhkHkiJNDc8pRGaoe-xCI80WtqjK-4WOW88G2co0NPREXIw0mtA,file_size=1104944]"}
{"time": 1774678982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87626391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "用了不少魔力，也有点累了，打个哈欠“露露，睡吧...我有点累了”"}
{"time": 1774679118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513190711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=87626391]\"嗯，诺诺先睡吧。\"露莉亚搬着椅子坐在桌边，在桌上摊开自己的卷册，\"玛姆师傅交代的...每天的早课。\""}
{"time": 1774679165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1775337987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...好的...”也没推脱什么，毕竟自己真的很累，躺在床上开睡"}
{"time": 1774679609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "11521358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1775337987]蝙蝠从你的头发里钻出来，蹦跶着在床头附近扑腾了一番，似乎是有些不满意，轻轻落在你的鼻尖，拿翅膀拍着你的脸。"}
{"time": 1774679863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602648028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么了...斑比酱”睁开眼睛坐起来"}
{"time": 1774679997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604625832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=602648028]蝙蝠的眼睛眯着，尽管在你看来有些像撒娇，声音倒是斑比正常的声音，\"我睡哪?\""}
{"time": 1774680089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "846717472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃，我怀里？”"}
{"time": 1774680517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "345023465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"蝙蝠的身体化成一阵血雾，随后重组成人形，原身1/16大小的斑比坐在你的腿上，脸上写着不耐，\"你最好考虑考虑清楚再说话。\""}
{"time": 1774680824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883217558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“抱....抱歉”虽然只是小小班比，但看到还是有些害怕“.....我现在就帮你找...”想了想感觉那个抽屉似乎不错，然后用血弄一套不赖的床上用品mini"}
{"time": 1774680830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2016923653]“嗯，不出所料。不过具体的内容是？”"}
{"time": 1774681139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "841065589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=883217558]露莉亚听到你这边的动静，一早就合上书，坐在床边挂着一脸笑容看着，看你的动作，她帮你把抽屉抽了出来，放在床头的地方，\"这样?\""}
{"time": 1774681473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1252469048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1678252]夏弥竖起中指，看上去有点像在比耶，\"与其说是沙漏的原因，不如说是普通是器具承受了她的权能演变成了那个，最能体现时间本身模样的东西。\"她紧接着补充，\"上一次展现权能，逆流了整个马纳利亚十秒的时间。\""}
{"time": 1774681485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10335685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=841065589][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “多谢露露了”"}
{"time": 1774681775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1574463770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=10335685]斑比的小皮鞋有节奏地踩在你的腿上，血液逐渐开始有些变凉，\"动作快点。\""}
{"time": 1774681817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295032299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯...马上就好马上就好”稍微加快速度给她铺床"}
{"time": 1774681843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1180986328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1252469048]“但她看上去不像是会主动做这事的人。她回溯最久的一次是为了什么？”"}
{"time": 1774682140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17511162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=295032299]小小斑比悬浮着落在你铺好的床边，也就是抽屉里，这样看上去总觉得有点玩娃娃过家家的既视感，露莉亚显然也是一样的想法，憋着笑朝你瞥来。"}
{"time": 1774682185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627771301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然自己也有点类似的感觉，但笑还是不敢笑的，小心翼翼的铺完“好了..斑比酱就睡这里吧”"}
{"time": 1774682231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1100720702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1180986328]\"如果马纳利亚的记录知道的话。\"夏弥的目光微微下垂，\"时间的权能就不会是这么神秘的东西了，对吗？那次回溯的结果只有她知道，那次之后她就主动接受了封印。\""}
{"time": 1774682345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1192093357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“听起来就像……回到过去真的能改变什么一样。”低着头思考，没急着问下一个问题。还有什么是重要的……？"}
{"time": 1774682373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402056832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1627771301]\"不准打扰我休息。\"她回头赏了你和露莉亚一人一个眼刀，语气不容拒绝，\"出门的时候我要一起。\""}
{"time": 1774682387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54745463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谁，或者说哪些人有能力解封她？”"}
{"time": 1774682696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573491664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=54745463]\"有能力做到的人很少，或许有也不能为马纳利亚记录。\"她竖起无名指，\"能轻松做到的人更少，寥寥无几，但卡珊德拉是其中之一。\"嘴角微微上扬。"}
{"time": 1774682727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045798035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1402056832][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 乖乖点点头..."}
{"time": 1774682906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1141091865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=573491664]“那个我到时候再问吧……”摇摇头“看起来和希古娜有关的问题，我直接去问她就好了”"}
{"time": 1774682907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107850925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后小心翼翼静悄悄的到露露身边，小声对她耳朵说句“晚安..你也早点睡吧”然后也去睡觉了"}
{"time": 1774683109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2073589651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1107850925]斑比躺着你铺好的mini床铺上，被抽屉的边缘挡住，看不见的话也就没什么明显的压迫感。\n露莉亚明显愣了一下，然后手指绕了绕自己耳边的头发，\"真狡猾...诺诺可要睡得深一点哦。\""}
{"time": 1774683257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181771699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？...”不太懂露露什么意思，但好累，先睡了"}
{"time": 1774683318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803066273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1141091865]她只是笑了笑，\"那可说不好，卡珊德拉不能透露希古娜的存在。\"她的手指依然保持在三"}
{"time": 1774683521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "908263978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1181771699]塔顶时不时会有一些微风拂过，吹得你心情很好，很快就睡了过去。"}
{"time": 1774683536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018635328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(过一个d100～)"}
