{"time": 1774683619, "type": "reply", "message_id": "256662829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上真由理]试图在黑暗中窥见岁月史书"}
{"time": 1774683619, "type": "reply_private", "message_id": "256662829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "在演奏厅中[浅上真由理]演奏出: 1D20=17"}
{"time": 1774683724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634938423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1181771699]久违地做了一个梦，甚至可以清楚地感觉到自己就是在梦中，四周都是大片大片洁白的云雾"}
{"time": 1774683761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220669564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么又是雾...”感觉最近每次见到雾都会遇到不太好的事情"}
{"time": 1774683923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614237370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1220669564]你察觉这一场景和之前某一次梦中的相似度几乎达到了90%，身上的衣服还是那一身衣服，口袋里有什么在微微发烫。"}
{"time": 1774683967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "815788296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拿出来看看，哎？不会是天之守护那次吧"}
{"time": 1774684136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "619803384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不出意外是那枚徽章，此刻拿在手上才察觉烫的吓人。"}
{"time": 1774684210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "24256307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是埃忒儿姐姐找自己吗...”有点害怕，自己应该算辜负了她，感觉没什么脸见她"}
{"time": 1774684400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109245617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=24256307]云雾深处一个隐约出现一个人影，强烈的既视感传来，你几乎能猜到她的下一步动作了。"}
{"time": 1774684697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998765597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "既然都来到这了...自己大概也做不了什么了，朝她靠近算了"}
{"time": 1774684940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "698562959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=803066273]“哦，说起来……”摸着下巴“卡珊德拉到底是什么来头？”"}
{"time": 1774685098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "919800544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=998765597]对方拨开云雾，四周为之一清，露出了湛蓝澄澈的天空，蓝发六翼的天使站在你的面前。"}
{"time": 1774685129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "969620853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“埃忒尔姐姐...”低下头，不太敢看她“好久不见...”"}
{"time": 1774685287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642534244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=698562959]小拇指抬起，\"卡珊德拉，有史以来最有天赋的学生之一，在这个年纪掌握了权能。\"她眯着眼，\"但是来历却是一个偏远的村庄，连名字都没有。\""}
{"time": 1774685403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "4931216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=969620853]\"我倒是不知道好久不见在哪里。\"对方的语气不徐不疾，你感觉自己在她面前无所遁形，头顶被花冠隐住的蝙蝠耳朵冒了出来，\"我也不记得自己什么时候会将我的印痕留给一个魔族。\""}
{"time": 1774692365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2030164109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡着了刚刚 哭没那塞）"}
{"time": 1774692561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397385825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=4931216][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 坏了，她还不认识自己...不过应该可以解释的吧"}
{"time": 1774692582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415910810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“别....动手，我可以解释的，埃忒尔姐姐”"}
{"time": 1774692960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937004931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不是来自这个时空的....”直接一股脑的说完自己的来意"}
{"time": 1774693550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2113356630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你倒是说啊)"}
{"time": 1774693586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680798353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=642534244]“果然怎么听都很可疑？不如说真的有人能分得清她说的话是真是假吗？”摸着下巴“果然人缘不太好”"}
{"time": 1774693592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830775653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我是从未来来的，对了，埃忒尔姐姐，今年是几几年来着”"}
{"time": 1774693811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295662928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“简单来说就是，未来的马纳利亚中环被灾杰分离了出来，然后这个时空有人趁机用了什么时间类的法术，将被分割的中环和现在的时间联系到了一起...如果现在解除未来的分割话，就会发生恐怖的灾难”"}
{"time": 1774693878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369318009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“至于印信，未来的埃忒儿姐姐帮过我，给我的”"}
{"time": 1774693909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522789598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些惴惴不安，害怕被一巴掌拍死"}
{"time": 1774694178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487323552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的，但是我现在困得不得了)"}
