{"time": 1774799257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428971024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=522789598]（）"}
{"time": 1774799483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785506148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=522789598]\"...我会帮一个魔族?\"她的眼睛打量着你的脖间，最后摇摇头，\"我不认为...如果看到现在这样，沾满了血族王庭气味的你，我会帮你，还给你我的印痕。\""}
{"time": 1774799562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660424459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....真的，埃忒尔姐姐在未来帮了我...而且我也从来没伤过好人...”"}
{"time": 1774799703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611418453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且...印信，未来的姐姐要我会给她的...”"}
{"time": 1774799786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479129291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1611418453]\"血族总是满嘴谎言，但是像你这样，明目张胆到我头上的，还是第一个。\"她的表情冷下来"}
{"time": 1774799826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363762596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我没有说谎....我可以发誓...”虽然有些害怕，但还是说出来了"}
{"time": 1774799881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "409547222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐在未来给了我一个羽毛....我用它治好了朋友的眼睛..”"}
{"time": 1774799925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562565485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她摆出你继续说的架势"}
{"time": 1774800265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "907595869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（继续说什么，让我想想）"}
{"time": 1774800291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "478759619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“反正这个印信是未来的姐姐交给我...现在给你的话，我回去的话也没办法跟她交代”"}
{"time": 1774800420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063003931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我想知道的是，给我原因。\"她眯着眼，\"我现在，只能认为你在说谎。\""}
{"time": 1774800688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781182333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“当时...埃忒尔姐姐给了我一个考验...问我想做人还是想做魔族...我选择了做人，然后她把我撕碎重组，说重塑了我的肉体...经过了考验”虽然当时很痛，但事后真的治好了露露的眼睛，回想起那段记忆也没有很痛苦"}
{"time": 1774801050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295245191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1781182333]\"...\"她带着考量的目光看向你，随后轻声开了口，但似乎不是对你说话，\"你怎么看?萨雷法。\"旁边有一个女性的虚影，一头乌黑亮丽的长发。"}
{"time": 1774801319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "11732429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"无法确认。\"虚影看不清面容，嗓音有些空灵，但音色很好，\"不过看样子不像是说谎呢～天之守护也有这种闲情雅趣吗？\"\n埃忒尔稍微皱着眉，\"既然你认可的话...\"她再又看向你，\"重新报上名来。\""}
{"time": 1774801320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425869694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些紧张，感觉在接受审判一样“如果...姐姐不相信的话...大可以再把我拆开...看看有没有你熟悉的痕迹...不过前提当然是能复原好”悻悻的说到"}
{"time": 1774801349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "491282375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我叫诺薇菈，埃忒尔姐姐”"}
{"time": 1774801354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1701219993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=212120326]（）"}
{"time": 1774801392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888438387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“梦想是成为一个普通的人类，然后行侠仗义...虽然感觉好像离目标越来越远了，不过行侠仗义还是能做到的”"}
{"time": 1774801580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025112446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=9C903FE1D0A5B5FE42B6AEBD44683F13.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSVkxm8x93HnAuj4bAlhNkScWhvYRj8mwYg_woo37azjcPFkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQWOgkaznSZPd0MmTpi9kiqHoCtbeCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAQSMOL39BkrLrv3jaRKpTQpAiXNlmiRVTFckAR70mZV0DZwjoaockppaSNzOpDO5cgxAg,file_size=101884]"}
{"time": 1774801584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063019567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这个怎么说）"}
{"time": 1774801600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1510281051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还不赖吧）"}
{"time": 1774801635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "774940236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=212120326]\"这算是一个需要答案的问题吗？\"对方显然不打算就这么随便说出自己的看法，稍微有些狡黠地偏了偏头，侧目看着你。"}
{"time": 1774801642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215258552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2025112446](水大哥最爱)"}
{"time": 1774801778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791911933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1888438387]\"噗噗...\"旁边的虚影捂着嘴偷笑，\"染上血族王庭的气味，想要行侠仗义是不是有点难，有点奇怪诶?喂喂，埃忒尔，她说出这种话，拆开看看似乎也是可以考虑的。\"\n埃忒尔倒是没开口，没有答应也没有拒绝。"}
{"time": 1774801934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2053769146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那姐姐一定要复原我...我还得找到那个施展时间阵法的人...”"}
{"time": 1774802374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "236455591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2053769146]\"...\"过了一会，似乎是拿定了主意，埃忒尔摇了摇头，\"你为什么会回到过去?诺薇菈\"一旁的虚影感觉有些无趣的样子，摊了摊手，\"唉，无聊。\""}
{"time": 1774802444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "495207846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我之前解释过原因了....如果姐姐是说方法的话，是夏日酒店的龙芙小姐帮忙的”"}
{"time": 1774802876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369271711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=495207846]\"龙芙...天宫，他们怎么会在马纳利亚?\"天之守护扶了扶额头，她看向你，\"到底是谁?在未来入侵了这里。\""}
{"time": 1774803043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1946122962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“未来蜘蛛莎木纳刻雅用她的能力把中环分割了出来....”"}
{"time": 1774803121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799495293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=774940236]“不太重要就是了。”顿了顿“那我岂不是现在没办法知道她在哪了”"}
{"time": 1774803163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650212726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以姐姐，现在是哪一年来着”回想一下自己本来的时空是哪一年"}
{"time": 1774803192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1293869300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好问题，其实我也忘了最开始是哪一年了)"}
{"time": 1774803289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937938201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=650212726]\"只用纪年法的话，时间也许会用不同的刻度行走。\"她皱了皱眉，\"现在的话，‘炎灾’刚刚结束。\""}
{"time": 1774803347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924860305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=799495293]\"她难道有隐藏自己的行踪吗？\"对方还是歪头的姿势，\"学生会长，一般也只有一个去处吧。\""}
{"time": 1774803389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480000551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我说的是希古娜”"}
{"time": 1774803410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617836407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“炎灾？”上次听到炎灾好像还是说的加缪尔，但应该不是一回事吧，大概"}
{"time": 1774803428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489746924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1293869300]（那你快想）[CQ:at,qq=1252219916]"}
{"time": 1774803520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691415108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=617836407]\"不知道?\"一旁的虚影看着你，\"嗯哼?\""}
{"time": 1774803808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524468928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....说到炎灾我就只知道灾杰”挠挠头"}
{"time": 1774804132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1021934171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=524468928]\"那还是无趣诶。\"对方笑了笑，\"不过真要说的话...也不是什么很值得说的事啦，对守护而言。\"\n埃忒尔轻轻摇头，\"最近也没有什么大事件了。\""}
{"time": 1774804198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944152948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过年代对你而言不重要，对吗？\"萨蕾法的虚影轻笑着，\"和你的目的不相关呢\""}
{"time": 1774804371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312928475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...话是这么说没错啦，对了，话说姐姐你是”"}
{"time": 1774804757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "805396291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=312928475]\"人家是水之守护哦?\"她掬起手心，有流水从手心流下，\"可爱吗？\""}
{"time": 1774804972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1785168931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "点点头“水之守护姐姐...”忽然想起来师父之前告诉自己的事情，有些纠结不知道能不能说“话说我跟姐姐们讲未来的事情会有什么别的影响吗”"}
{"time": 1774805177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2038488270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=480000551]“卡珊德拉不能说的话……我猜你也不打算告诉我。”"}
{"time": 1774805218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855762645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1785168931]\"人家叫萨蕾法啦。\"她嘟着嘴，\"不过呢～确实会有一些影响啦，改变过去最坏的影响就是...连你本人的未来都不可观测。\""}
{"time": 1774805316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179305578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些纠结...不知道能不能说“那要是是关于萨雷法姐姐的事情呢，可能会极大影响你的未来”"}
{"time": 1774805582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1493778213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2038488270]\"看我心情，嘛，我现在属于心情还不错的样子?\"夏弥坐在吊椅上，和栗发的女孩靠在一起，\"不过，这种可不是用一个问题就能收买的呢。\""}
{"time": 1774805648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949864771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1179305578]\"我?\"虚影的面容清晰了一些，\"我怎么了?\""}
{"time": 1774805840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466421977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "算了，不管了，埃忒儿姐姐毕竟对自己有恩"}
{"time": 1774805871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "51567181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我师父告诉我.....不知道发生了什么， 那段历史似乎像被抹去了一样..但结果就是”"}
{"time": 1774805975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "283844893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“守护就剩下了埃忒儿姐姐，地之守护陨落，萨雷法姐姐沉睡了，火之守护疯癫被拘禁....风之守护下落不明...”"}
{"time": 1774806005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810995493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在找立绘，草)"}
{"time": 1774806131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1147292718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（加油）"}
{"time": 1774806170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1553099608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=D8C760B1CB3857FBF06DCB5F8A267163.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTzDRoJvhwfbJRo3p9Y5Yflt6AwixiAlQwg_wooyr32mdTFkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQmm9AgM3ye2kocn2NEemVznoCbomCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMEhyEXJjag4XQLeko62F9pzzK5tw9mztnwR4qabiImbDPWZrocH9h0YBAhaDbCasbQ,file_size=199296]"}
{"time": 1774806323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438087614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=283844893]她们似乎没有很意外的样子，\"你所不知道‘炎灾’，就是炎之守护权能不受控造成的活死人之祸哦\""}
{"time": 1774806357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1212620748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎....这样吗”"}
{"time": 1774806518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "902478450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟那家伙是个偏执，又不懂人心，只顾着自己的家伙。\"萨蕾法耸耸肩，摘下了面容上最后的面纱，\"所以一厢情愿创造这种谁都不会真正死去的世界。\""}
{"time": 1774806683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1701286307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那剩下几件事呢...除了萨雷法姐姐沉睡也都发生了吗？”"}
{"time": 1774806701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2104368931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过我居然会睡着嘛...那也许是世界只需要埃忒尔吧。\"她打趣道"}
{"time": 1774806883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221397952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "埃忒尔轻轻推开她，\"别胡闹。\"随后看向你点头，\"风和炎是一体的，至于地之守护卡塔莉娜...她会陨落也是迟早的事情。\""}
{"time": 1774806917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519321348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？为什么...不能避免吗”"}
{"time": 1774807081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "201963494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?毕竟保持理性总是很难的。\"萨蕾法伸出手摸了摸你的脑袋，手心有些冰冰的，\"那个时候...为了避免出现上次那样的灾厄...\""}
{"time": 1774807427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "816998663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "冰冰凉凉的，感觉有点舒服，有点享受"}
{"time": 1774807432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309920159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是磨损吗）"}
{"time": 1774807545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1856107270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(钟离)"}
{"time": 1774807575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871954014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“抱歉....好像什么忙都没帮上”"}
{"time": 1774807665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063346442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=816998663]她看你的样子，索性贴近了一些，两手并用，薅着你的头发和头上的蝙蝠耳朵，\"嗯哼?手感不错。\"\n\"没什么，这是守护应尽的事。\"埃忒尔回答了你，\"总有一天，我也会...\""}
{"time": 1774807690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1482374261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（蝙蝠耳朵不是消失了么）"}
{"time": 1774807696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1558131240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么又出现了）"}
{"time": 1774807768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228244659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "现在才注意到，之前蝙蝠耳朵消失过一段时间来着，怎么又出现了，不过夜不管了，像一只温顺的金毛一样，静静的享受着抚摸"}
{"time": 1774807826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150251552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....姐姐不要说这种话了，说不定之后就有什么解决的方法了”"}
{"time": 1774807829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611451089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(被逼出来了啊)"}
{"time": 1774807838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361632034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（水之守护是温迪啊）"}
{"time": 1774807840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1429292794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你仔细看初见的时候我给的描述)"}
{"time": 1774807843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1150893824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡了说是）"}
{"time": 1774808150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152291368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=150251552]\"嘛，那也是之后的事情。\"她耸耸肩，\"和现在，你那时要解决的事情无关呢。\""}
{"time": 1774808195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1174571212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "萨蕾法把蝙蝠翅膀打开，狠狠揉搓，\"呼呼...原来是这么个手感。\"冰凉的触感让你有些舒服。"}
{"time": 1774808359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318069908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哈...有点痒..”听到埃忒尔的话，想到了正事“oh，对了，埃忒尔姐姐，萨雷法姐姐，你们对那个施展时间阵法的人有什么头绪吗，中环好大，完全不知道该去哪里找...”有点不好意思"}
{"time": 1774808571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622729892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=318069908]萨蕾法看了一眼埃忒尔，\"嗯哼?\"随后松开手，梦里出现三把云做的椅子和一个桌子，她先坐下，一只手撑着脸，\"这世界上有时间权能的家伙只有一个，那家伙就在学院。不过...能支付代价施展时间阵法的人...找起来可就多如过江之鲤了。\""}
{"time": 1774808722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "709744004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自己应该也能坐吧...坐到她身旁先“嗯...那个人是谁”如果能寻求他帮忙的话，说不定他能找到谁施展了阵法"}
{"time": 1774808978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878102441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=709744004]\"封印的时之沙，希古娜。\"萨蕾法一脸轻松地开口，\"在学院图书馆的最深处，时间权能的持有者，曾经将整个马纳利亚的时间倒回了十秒。\""}
{"time": 1774809004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028498525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（妖精的尾巴？）"}
{"time": 1774809085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1629300936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那姐姐，有没有什么办法可以让我进学院呢..我这样应该很难进去吧”"}
{"time": 1774809139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1946622025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉你是懂的)"}
{"time": 1774809152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "307939245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(押上自己的全部，也只能将世界的时间倒回一秒吗？)"}
{"time": 1774809379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396102787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1493778213]“吼？”抬了抬眉毛“那，夏弥小姐有什么想要我代劳的事情吗？”"}
{"time": 1774809398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1044116787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1629300936]\"嗯...那可真是很难办。\"她捧着自己的脸看向埃忒尔，\"我倒是有办法...不过...\"\n\"...\"埃忒尔皱着眉，迟迟没开口。"}
{"time": 1774809427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710027933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过？”"}
{"time": 1774809686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103793387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=710027933]\"当然要守护首肯，然后去联系院长那边啦。\"她竖起一根手指摇了摇，\"不然这种拙劣的伪装会被一秒戳破的啦。\""}
{"time": 1774809734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "981263067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "期望的看着埃忒尔，希望她能帮自己"}
{"time": 1774809782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898303779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但忽然想到了什么"}
{"time": 1774809802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799416362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1396102787]\"明确的说，现在还没有。\"她的手指卷着自己的发梢，\"不过未来，在我救了你，几次?之后的未来，想必一定会发生...她遇到危险的事情。\"她停住话头，湛蓝的眸子看向你"}
{"time": 1774809831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "721384258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“会不会很困难啊...要是很麻烦姐姐的话 还是算了”"}
{"time": 1774809920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2020078488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1799416362]“放心放心，那时候你还在啦”扇风般摇了摇手“don’t worry”"}
{"time": 1774810140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548406805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=721384258]\"想让对方相信这种像是三流荒唐剧本一样的故事...\"埃忒尔的翅膀收拢，稍微有些无语的样子，\"萨蕾法，交给你了。\"她从始至终就没有落座，雾气开始逐渐隐去她的身形，\"毕竟...印痕都交给她了。\""}
{"time": 1774810182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1030658911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2020078488]“不过。”卷着头发“我也不是那种知恩不图报的人啦，不如说欠的人情有点数不过来了，有点头疼”"}
{"time": 1774810185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "500190098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“埃忒尔姐姐.....？”"}
{"time": 1774810250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466989969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1030658911]她却只是摇头，看向身侧的女孩，\"更久远的未来，我始终有这种预感。\"她的目光转回来，透着思虑，\"一个承诺，在这里留下姓名，交换——\""}
{"time": 1774810357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1121311500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=500190098]\"好啦，天之守护大人有自己的事要忙。\"萨蕾法冲你摇摇手，一面完全由水构成的如同平滑湖面的镜子出现在她手里，映照出你的模样，\"嗯嗯，你想要变成什么新样子?一般的伪装我姑且自认为天衣无缝哦?\""}
{"time": 1774810437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "346048824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm...把我身上看起来像是魔族 血裔之类的都隐掉吧..像个普通人一样就行”"}
{"time": 1774810477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572909026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1466989969]“嘛，如果我还活着的话。”倒是显得比较轻松“一报还一报——我最擅长这种交易了”"}
{"time": 1774810595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998523462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=346048824]镜子里的自己长着一对蝙蝠翅膀，双瞳猩红，脸色有些苍白，除此以外，最引人注目的便是脖颈上，一个鲜红如血的拇指大小的花瓣记号。"}
{"time": 1774810617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300051419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么4.0一上来就是犯罪预告）"}
{"time": 1774810622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065334119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我非得坠机吗）"}
