{"time": 1774810679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "577064744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=572909026]她点头同意，然后等着你继续开口。"}
{"time": 1774810711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1671988614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(翔哥有立绘来着，但是现在可以允许再挑一个临时立绘)"}
{"time": 1774810733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395014152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡了，晚安）"}
{"time": 1774810742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352921310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（明天找个伊莉雅发你（hh）"}
{"time": 1774810742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1081317541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=577064744]“有契约书……什么的么？”咀嚼着自己的名字"}
{"time": 1774811038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438697548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1081317541]\"在维拉的注目之下，僭越者无所遁形。\"静静开口，\"留下你的名字...诺言，它会记录一切。\""}
{"time": 1774811290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609566163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“以伊芙·艾络温·摩根之名，在我生命尚未行尽之前，当安小姐陷入危险，需要帮助……责无旁贷”同样伸出手“好久没说自己的全名了……不过总感觉每次说出来都很重呢”"}
{"time": 1774837317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700627038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（极限比导师早到五分钟，如何呢）"}
