{"time": 1774874959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361637720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=833626502](你洗完澡什么状态啦，身上什么打扮，穿什么衣服之类的，自己给啦。)"}
{"time": 1774875916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565404467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1158305771]\"如果不是亲口告知，谁又知道你并不属于这个时代呢。\"夏弥的一只手撑着自己的脸，\"这里也没有另一个你自己吧。\"说着闭上了眼，显得有些懒散。"}
{"time": 1774875992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998636576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我也没找到第二个卡珊德拉……虽然她想躲的话我也没有找的办法就是了”撑着下巴“哎好麻烦，我不擅长这些啦”"}
{"time": 1774876044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626326116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "总之把浑身洗了好几遍，然后用火加风把身上弄干，魔法还真是方便啊"}
{"time": 1774876110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093409141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "依旧使用老版穿着，感觉好像得去买一套衣服？这种血制品可能会被轻易发现来着"}
{"time": 1774876469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023594715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（原来你还是穿血）"}
{"time": 1774876563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682853564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=998636576]“毕竟你想干预其中。”她摊摊手，“只是在面前的事就想要去改变，该说是热心肠吗？”"}
{"time": 1774876701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802259027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真的假的。”撇了撇嘴“别开玩笑了，我不是那种人。只是这里有我喜欢的人。哪怕实际上并不能改变什么……”竖起一根手指“打个比方吧，就像看一本小说，而作者给了个很烂的结尾”"}
{"time": 1774876718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "843697148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1093409141]反复洗完澡，太阳已经悬在了半空。"}
{"time": 1774876851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "60056666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "下来自然是出去了，回到房间内“露露和斑比要洗澡吧”"}
{"time": 1774877219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1620249587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1802259027]\"和我说的也没差吧。\"她没有睁眼，笑了笑，\"这种都属于一种事，一种呢。\""}
{"time": 1774877366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777111651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“完全不一样。”反正她也看不见，翻个白眼“说的我好像很博爱一样”"}
{"time": 1774877381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "142756083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=60056666]\"我倒是没什么必要?\"露莉亚指了指自己，斑比连话都没说，变成蝙蝠搭在你的脑袋上。"}
{"time": 1774877545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728738058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，那露露陪我去买件衣服吧，我现在的衣服其实是变化出来的，被发现就不太好了”"}
{"time": 1774877743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893581611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=777111651]\"随你怎么说咯?\"她仰躺到椅子上，整个人都很放松的姿态，\"还有什么事吗？\""}
{"time": 1774878139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212136422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1728738058]\"嗯哼?\"她伸手摸了摸你身上的衣服，\"质感这么好，居然是假的吗？诶...?\""}
{"time": 1774878207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "606227532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“魔法，很神奇吧”双手叉腰.jpg"}
{"time": 1774878441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "945070534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1893581611]“嘛。”对着窗外看看“等人回来吧”"}
{"time": 1774879070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212583117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=606227532]\"洋洋得意诶?\"她的手从你的衣服放下，转而摸到你的开始，使劲扯了扯，\"该罚。\""}
{"time": 1774879107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944341753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=945070534]\"回来?你想见一见公主吗？\"她睁开眼看向你。"}
{"time": 1774879143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286541913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=212583117]（开始是什么）"}
{"time": 1774879146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072863001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯哼，就当是一些……好奇心。”点点头“虽然见过一次了”"}
{"time": 1774879429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622866462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=286541913](脸上，不好意思)"}
