{"time": 1774891013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "618147686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=466677941]\"谁知道呢？\"她扯了扯，松开手，\"在我想到之前就先欠着吧。\""}
{"time": 1774891074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333789130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1072863001]\"还以为你会更专注你要做的事呢。\"她重新躺回去，闭上眼，吊椅轻轻摇晃，\"这看上去不是很悠闲吗？\""}
{"time": 1774891114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64315989", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就先欠着...露露松下手”"}
{"time": 1774891243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "657268869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1333789130]“也不知道能做什么。希古娜也不是说见就见得到的吧。”站起来“这儿有记载灾桀的书吧？”"}
{"time": 1774891270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564449679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=64315989](不是松了手吗)"}
{"time": 1774891272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583972619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(nmd)"}
{"time": 1774891313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070169621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走吧，去买衣服吧...”牵起她的手“上次我们一起逛街感觉好像是很久很久以前的事情了”"}
{"time": 1774891382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023523925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=657268869]\"当然有啦。\"对方看上去很闲适，嘴角微微上扬，\"不过现在已经没有问问题的次数了呢～\""}
{"time": 1774891462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475798396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2070169621]\"嗯?其实也就是一个月左右的事情吧？\"露莉亚乖乖被你牵着，亮了亮右手上的手链，\"在前面那个镇子，嗯...稀望镇，记得吗？\""}
{"time": 1774891504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "728031077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...肯定不会忘记的”也漏出手上的手链“之前我以为你们不在的时候...就是靠这个激励自己活下去的”"}
{"time": 1774891866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "667072730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1023523925]“没事，我可以一会问问安……不过让我节约点时间也没有坏处吧？”"}
{"time": 1774891926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203400078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=728031077]\"难得现在有机会...不过就算想逛街消费，诺诺身上有钱吗？\""}
{"time": 1774892072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1750667417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哈哈...自然是没什么钱..”无奈的摇摇头“买完衣服之后就去上学吧”"}
{"time": 1774892515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96985256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1750667417]\"难道上学就会有钱了？\"她掩着嘴巴，眼睛微微眯着，\"诺诺总是觉得未来会更好呢。\""}
{"time": 1774892570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962132745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等出去就有钱了...”边走边说，找一个看起来稍微亲民点的店"}
{"time": 1774892576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "645906411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=667072730]\"那...你想知道什么?节约时间，快问快答。\""}
{"time": 1774892612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110047124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1962132745](那，你好像找到了，龙神同款小巷深处的店吗？过个幸运吧。)"}
