{"time": 1774892744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017881951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=645906411]（呵呵，想到了那个）"}
{"time": 1774892819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "159904540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=DFE81853DD193047FBA73B58CE2D031A.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQu3UF0HMD1-_boI1UVo0CPY_6rQRjY1Qog_woov_LG_5bIkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQOg85v5PMIaxYmpRHkKWbznoCdKCCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMJnlcm3yI5phNWN9EEmGlqfbTzdblq4gLKV8nWkRCWw3LrA4qUHfUr676CLItGieGg,file_size=174808]"}
{"time": 1774892939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042494371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1688470608]尽管店的位置相当偏僻，不过左拐右拐，好歹是在附近找到了一家外观看上去破破烂烂的服装店。老板躺在柜台后的安乐椅上，手上的烟斗点着刺激性很强的大烟。"}
{"time": 1774892964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68043015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这里的衣服应该挺便宜的感觉“老板，买衣服”"}
{"time": 1774893109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165780707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=851477777]\"包含继承者的话，真理的继承者，卡珊德拉。只考虑本身则是，奏绝的破坏之名，里榭娜。至于恩怨，不知。\""}
{"time": 1774893165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572948941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=68043015]\"自己挑。\"老板吞云吐雾，好不快活，\"每件衣服都有标价。\"\n你扫视一圈，没有一件低于十个金币。"}
{"time": 1774893198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1097975011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“中环的衣服这么贵吗...”有点难顶，买个最便宜的算了"}
{"time": 1774893233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973526246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=165780707]“里榭娜……”"}
{"time": 1774893236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135381208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我听说过吗）"}
{"time": 1774893238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1102795429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不记得了）"}
