{"time": 1774893351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "175906072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（最便宜的衣服长什么样不应该是你定么）"}
{"time": 1774893435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1219208961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(素一点呗，允许你自由发挥。)"}
{"time": 1774893580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78637469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1973526246]“她在马纳利亚有黑历史？虽然我觉得她对马纳利亚来说就是黑历史……”摇摇头“不过知道这些就差不多了。”"}
{"time": 1774893674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1039016260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一件浅灰色连帽长外套，面料看起来柔软厚实，袖口处缀着一圈玫红色的细边。配合一件玫红色的排扣内搭，纽扣沿着衣襟整齐排列，领口处系着一枚亮眼的橙黄色领结，下半身则是一条浅灰色灯芯绒百褶裙，长度到膝盖上方，裙边和外套袖口呼应"}
{"time": 1774893690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683796835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=78637469]\"黑历史?嗯，如果里榭娜出身马纳利亚也算的话。\"夏弥颔首，\"说不定你能在学校里找到一些她上学时的蛛丝马迹呢？\""}
{"time": 1774893727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "18855522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1039016260]这件衣服下面标价20个金币"}
{"time": 1774893744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613390691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=18855522]（这是最便宜的？）"}
{"time": 1774893785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744271171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "算了，在朴素一点，上身白衬衫，下身灰色百褶裙"}
{"time": 1774893859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1823478245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(hh)"}
{"time": 1774893894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773104378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=744271171]这件倒是标价比较低，只有13个金币，但和刚刚那件比起来，有些过素了。"}
{"time": 1774893956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318565002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "就这件好了，到学校之后说不定还买校服，去试衣间直接换好"}
{"time": 1774894154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394298903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=318565002]\"嗯...\"露莉亚从再见你开始一直穿的都是一条白色的百褶连衣裙，身上绣着一些蓝色丝线用作装饰，\"穿得好老气诶?诺诺。\""}
{"time": 1774894242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182524927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“凑合一下好了...毕竟现在资金很紧缺么”想了想好像确实太素了，再在胸口系一个粉色蝴蝶结好了"}
{"time": 1774894250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380159908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1683796835]“说不定还能找到她本人。毕竟我都在这了。”耸耸肩“虽然不知道为什么要把无关人员拉进来，但是如果她本人不做些什么的话，时间不就白回溯了”"}
{"time": 1774894469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383079928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=182524927]\"凑个整，一共十四金币。\"老板眼皮都没抬，抽了一口大烟开口。"}
{"time": 1774894542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56170783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一个蝴蝶结一个金币...有点被气笑了的感觉，但马纳利亚的逆天物价自己也不好说什么，掏出14枚金币在柜台一字排开“老板，给”"}
{"time": 1774894741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1630068080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=380159908]\"说得倒是信誓旦旦呢。\"一张画像朝你扔了过来，\"你旁边那位继承人暂且不论，你真的认得她么？\""}
{"time": 1774894793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1864213602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=56170783]\"谢谢惠顾。\"老板在烟雾缭绕里客套地感谢了你一下，注意力就不在你们身上了。"}
{"time": 1774894829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "708040047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎....”叹口气，一下子花了好多钱，不知道到时候学费怎么算"}
{"time": 1774894861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "955089101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“老板，你知道怎么加入学院吗”"}
{"time": 1774894874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726669027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自己买了东西，问点问题也理所当然吧"}
{"time": 1774894879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "847392087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1630068080]“原来有画像？”接过来看看"}
{"time": 1774895035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676736357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1726669027]对方有些不耐烦，\"入学这种事为什么问我?\"吐出一口烟，\"你不会去学院看吗？\""}
{"time": 1774895069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1384086706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧好吧...老板你这态度好差，这样怎么做生意”想到了另一个脾气差差，说话还抽烟的人"}
{"time": 1774895166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1386138134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=847392087]()"}
{"time": 1774895167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1725404316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=758605F44044D19B4E3CEE2EC4F3DA83.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRv_7vJGhs690Md99LtVcpDJyxwJRi30A4g_woolfrh3p_IkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQUM5M8ap0p-VxI6abCLG6PnoCVM-CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMJnlcm3yI5phNWN9EEmGlqfbTzdblq4gLKV8nWkRCWw3LrA4qUHfUr676CLItGieGg,file_size=239671]"}
{"time": 1774895174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "48598581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1384086706](谁)"}
{"time": 1774895236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "751964314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1725404316]“看起来和破坏什么的完全没关系啊？”左右歪来歪去看"}
{"time": 1774895247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794976877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=48598581]（龙芙啊）"}
{"time": 1774895268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522937333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1725404316]（坏女人（）"}
{"time": 1774895482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490211686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1384086706]\"关你什么事。\"对方无所谓地摆摆手，\"总会有些穷鬼送上门的。\"说这话的时候他的目光留在你的脸上。"}
{"time": 1774895544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073954284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哼，三十年河东，三十年河西，莫欺少女穷”拉着露露就走，去学院"}
{"time": 1774895650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577958879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=751964314]\"从外表上小看她可是会出事的哦?只凭歌声可以做到玩弄人心，走向自我毁灭，可以说是最差劲最成功的偶像了。\"夏弥好整以暇地只睁开了一只眼睛，\"我倒是很期待，你和她遇见的时候。\""}
{"time": 1774895788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "386792351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1577958879]“总感觉我在自我毁灭上的经验还挺丰富的。”把画卷还给夏弥“到算是超额完成目标了。接下来就……随便看点魔法书好了”"}
{"time": 1774895791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1318233231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1073954284]整条街道遍布活力，让你感觉轻松阳光，没有一丝阴霾。广场上人来人往，这个临近上午的时间点，不少穿着校服的少男少女三五成群，在这里享受上午的闲暇。"}
{"time": 1774895998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951755589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐姐姐，我要是想进入马纳利亚学院该怎么做呢”找到一个看起来和善的大姐姐问问"}
{"time": 1774896002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "924729964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=386792351]洪荒不计年，不知过了多久，你忽然福至心灵，抬起头正和垂眸的栗发少女对上视线。"}
{"time": 1774896005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1824693127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我是不是还有概率碰到里榭娜啊）"}
