{"time": 1774931595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "259748647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢姐姐，谢谢姐姐”紧紧跟在她身后“对了，姐姐怎么称呼啊”"}
