{"time": 1774943880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146404066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那你记得下节课早上的第一节课是炼金术，第二节则是古代咒文学"}
{"time": 1774944012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311683195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2146404066]“第一节炼金术好像没什么听头……古代咒文学听起来倒是有点意思……越古越强？”伸出手晃晃妃花“在这里不能睡的啦。安息没有又找上门来吧？”"}
{"time": 1774944197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1511240259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1116743485]你明显感觉到阻力小了许多，似乎有一层无色的膜包裹在以妮芙为中心的四周。然后，你顺利穿了过去，上一次你也来过，不过那次是以参观者的身份，这里的风景倒是和之后差不太多，或者说几乎没什么变化。"}
{"time": 1774944268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "988441263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "进来之后就恢复比较舒适的跟随距离“谢谢妮芙姐姐....”"}
{"time": 1774944641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153581451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=311683195]“要不，直接跟我去炼金巢室好了，入门课程我来教？顺便我也打算炼点东西”"}
{"time": 1774944750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036438629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=153581451]\"如果想睡的话，我这里提供床铺哦?\"安坐回椅子上，眼睛闪着光，嘴角微微扬起，\"不过嘛...不去上课的话，迟早被教授们追责吧。\""}
{"time": 1774944848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968167969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=988441263]\"没关系。\"她指了指学院广场右手边，\"走这边，我记得今年负责招生的是布莱克教授。\""}
{"time": 1774944896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "874591831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯...姐姐，这个布莱克教授是个怎么样的人啊”"}
{"time": 1774944922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "983936250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2036438629]“那历史教授可有的忙。妃花你觉得？”努力深呼吸，驱散倦意“我是暂时不准备听”"}
{"time": 1774944947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1264471424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=983936250]\"诶...伊芙教吗？\"妃花费力地眨巴着眼睛，\"但是...不去教室可以吗？我...现在还可以...吧?\"随后打了个长长的哈欠。"}
{"time": 1774945086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226782025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“反正现在去教室也会睡着的。”站起来“给手里找点东西做还稍微好点”"}
{"time": 1774945568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1350035060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=874591831]\"还好?我没上过他的课。\""}
{"time": 1774945586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "667549910", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉男女比例疑似91开了）"}
{"time": 1774945596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1813127963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉女男比例疑似91开了）"}
{"time": 1774945628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562168562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊...”继续跟着，想想等下该怎么说，然后回头看一眼露露"}
{"time": 1774946252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395871798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(91开在哪)"}
