{"time": 1774946646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1326658987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是啊，这不就是第二个男性npc么）"}
{"time": 1774946659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982512090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(尬黑，历史课不是无敌男人中的男人)"}
{"time": 1774946681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1465050462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（肯定是说他那边）"}
{"time": 1774946792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528810255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1562168562]露莉亚跟在你身后不远处，看见你看着她，对你眨眨眼，\"怎么了？\""}
{"time": 1774946809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "188623434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我不是牵着她手么）"}
{"time": 1774946821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518584209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看露露半天不说话，害怕你跟丢了”"}
{"time": 1774946919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267329830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1226782025]\"唔...\"她懵懵懂懂地点着脑袋，\"我跟着伊芙走啦...\""}
{"time": 1774946967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674862087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=518584209]\"怎么了姐姐，难道是觉得我还是小孩子吗？\"她走上前牵起你的手，\"年纪不小了诶\""}
{"time": 1774947009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433778781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没有啦，没有”继续跟着妮芙，有些紧张，希望接下来一切顺利"}
{"time": 1774947030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072995918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行，走着。”走之前回头看看安，简单行个礼“下次见。不用等我”"}
{"time": 1774947580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449036061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来埃忒尔和伊瑟尔有点分不清，院长是哪个来着）"}
{"time": 1774947591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "994000547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊瑟尔）"}
{"time": 1774947600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533973264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（埃忒尔是天之守护）"}
{"time": 1774948241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972816089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊酱呢）"}
{"time": 1774948276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116409270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不知）"}
{"time": 1774948432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2039442522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=433778781]你们跟着她在校园里穿行，最后停在了一个林荫下的红砖砌成的连排二层洋房旁，其中一间的门口写着烫金的Dr.布莱克"}
{"time": 1774948471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2071882712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢妮芙姐...谢谢妮芙姐”给她鞠几个躬"}
{"time": 1774948929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239145055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1072995918]\"好啊，不过如果是随机拜访的话，我也不确定自己会在呢。\"她对你摆摆手，木门在你眼前合上，再回头，已然在一处无人的树冠。"}
{"time": 1774949095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860201335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛……走？”扯了扯妃花“居然一不小心在图书馆呆了16小时……”"}
{"time": 1774949103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2056869534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2071882712]\"我就送到这里啦～\"她对你摆摆手，\"拜拜?\"她的领口扎着蓝色的领巾。"}
{"time": 1774949123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883305107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...姐姐再见..希望下次看到你能叫你学姐”"}
{"time": 1774949267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1201866318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1860201335]妃花看上去已经睡着了，走路像是在梦游，你一扯她就径直倒在你身上。"}
{"time": 1774949288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074938682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1883305107]\"我也很期待啦。\"她挥挥手离开了。"}
{"time": 1774949289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "180135262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "挥挥手告别，然后敲敲办公室的门"}
{"time": 1774949303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523159366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说起来叫这个名字确实是有立绘吧可能)"}
