{"time": 1774949565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879486289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1313089275](只是晨风)"}
{"time": 1774949812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "404064206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎我……”这一压顿时感到心肌压力骤增，憋着一口气才没倒下去。尝试用魔力强化一下体力，这下只能往宿舍走了"}
{"time": 1774950268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909199734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=180135262]\"进来。\"说话的是一个很有磁性的稳重的中年男性嗓音，听起来大概就很有故事。"}
{"time": 1774950295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1467997887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后里头一个日车？）"}
