{"time": 1774950337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "579333435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=404064206]也许魔力有些作用?但图书馆离宿舍确实有些距离，以现在的情况..."}
