{"time": 1774952940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1326373477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "算了，退而求其次吧...“那教授...可以让我们在学院参观一天吗...就一天”"}
