{"time": 1774953768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810794514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1632819426](你根本就没说守护会给你开后门这件事)"}
