{"time": 1774975938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051987546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我点了最喜欢的苕皮外卖)"}
{"time": 1774976182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343415949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=340611501]\"我想那和现在的事不会构成什么本质联系。\"布莱克下意识开口，随后皱了皱眉，伸手拿过你手里的印信，\"...这是?\""}
{"time": 1774976219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562618728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;哼哼&#93;,file=3EFB721EAF11F08478ED3AF19FC5D9FF.jpg,sub_type=7,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQd-o1iG6TRJ0n_lP_MsJPNEqrMuRiiWCD_Cij6qobYzcqTAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhCu9xpKl1E401p-KaEKjIZVegIDU4IBAm5q&amp;rkey=CAISMFBGbzKn7CYMPc2E5urJFk1lA_04McTzkDDsu4GSskHS4E1y3hOTI23jy7eeq7mG6g,file_size=11298]"}
{"time": 1774976238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513731284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“凭这个可以给我们特例一下吗”"}
{"time": 1774976591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826887413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=513731284]他深深皱着眉，\"这是守护的东西...?\"随后叹了口气，\"确实是有这么回事，你叫什么?\""}
{"time": 1774976666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2052900348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我叫诺薇拉，她叫露莉亚”"}
{"time": 1774976843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140909567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"既然守护愿意给你担保，也知会了我们。\"他放下交叉的双手， 从抽屉里给你们一人拿了一张空白的学生证，递给你们。"}
{"time": 1774976865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065982059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢布莱克教授”开心的接过"}
{"time": 1774977204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206160125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "他把印信也递还给你们，\"小心收好。\""}
{"time": 1774977282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1445329225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯”看看学生证“这个要手填吗”"}
{"time": 1774977505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812190976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1445329225]\"捏住它。\"他皱着眉，从刚刚开始他就一直皱着眉头，\"在心里想象自己的信息。\""}
{"time": 1774977539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "409863502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好的好的....”照着教授说的做"}
{"time": 1774977679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831712964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你想象啊)"}
{"time": 1774977714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1553180677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想象自己的信息，姓名诺薇拉，性别女，种族人类，还有自己现在的外貌"}
{"time": 1774978012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794681807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "空白的学生证上逐渐显现了你自己的名字性别等等基础信息，\"对了。\"布莱克开口，\"学生卡里有初始的金额。\""}
{"time": 1774978067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "713321430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢教授...那我们接下来？”"}
{"time": 1774978354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1824956324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过需要你们在校务那边充入一定的金额。\"他掩着自己的额头，你感觉他似乎有点头痛，\"剩下的事去校务那边吧。\""}
{"time": 1774978394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763540540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“校务在哪，教授”再问最后一个问题"}
{"time": 1774978672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1976115340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"去问咯?\"他笑了笑，\"既然已经成了这里的学生，找个人问问总不是问题吧。\""}
{"time": 1774978706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853455076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "点点头“那教授，我们走了，再见👋🏻”挥挥手"}
{"time": 1774978947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764987080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉。\"他似乎有些说不出的难过，对你摆摆手，\"再见。\""}
{"time": 1774979211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069653230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拉着露露的手出去，直到出门把门带上之后，小声在露露耳边说道“教授怎么看起来那么不开心啊”"}
{"time": 1774979326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047007668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2069653230]今天的天气很晴朗，早晨的太阳暖洋洋的，照在身上很是舒服，\"可能...他是那种不习惯规矩被人打破的人吧。\"露莉亚的嘴角勾着笑，\"毕竟他好像不怎么喜欢我。\""}
{"time": 1774979364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859758979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”有点疑惑“我还以为他更喜欢你，不喜欢我呢”"}
{"time": 1774979409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853206966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看周围有没有什么看着就和善的大姐姐或者熟人，虽然自己在这个时代大概率一个人都不认识"}
{"time": 1774979724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691026765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=853206966]在这个时代想要遇见熟人对你而言有些困难，环顾四周也没看见，\"嗯...其实他对教会的意见好像很大啦。\"露莉亚顺了顺自己的发梢，\"一直在明里暗里点我...\""}
{"time": 1774979787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768698536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”有些后知后觉“算了，反正咱们也已经入学了”那和善的大姐姐"}
{"time": 1774979789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593286983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有吗"}
{"time": 1774979874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "114890205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(天天找女学生?)"}
{"time": 1774979891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250451323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那还能找和善的大哥哥？）"}
{"time": 1774979894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250783290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是学校里应该不缺)"}
{"time": 1774979908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2115053367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "总之找看起来就很和善的人"}
{"time": 1774979913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "807100861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(就当你找到了吧)"}
{"time": 1774979950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431466986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个...学姐打扰一下，校务怎么走”"}
{"time": 1774979976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "70055312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我好奇，艾尔这个年代上学了吗）"}
{"time": 1774980073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1647829444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（艾尔是哪个来着）"}
{"time": 1774980093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956304612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(姐姐)"}
{"time": 1774980099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868024650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（爱璃西娅她姐）"}
{"time": 1774980121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040456127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（爱璃西娅的妹妹是不是叫昔涟）"}
{"time": 1774980122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1194822291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（应该没吧）"}
{"time": 1774980137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "847000781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这俩应该没隔那么远）"}
{"time": 1774980237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194260150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1431466986]她给你指了一下路，\"学院广场的喷泉后面，一座独栋的大楼，校务在那里。\""}
{"time": 1774980272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1985524560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢学姐，学姐再见”顺着她的指引去教务了"}
{"time": 1774980302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504281001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说露露...不管来几次都觉得，这学校好大啊”"}
{"time": 1774980605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "561751836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那当然啦。\"拜别了和善的学姐，露莉亚敲了敲你的额头，\"毕竟马纳利亚学院就是马纳利亚的中心啦。\""}
{"time": 1774980795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634647701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"而且...我们现在走过的地方，真的有学院的十分之一吗？\"露莉亚看着澄澈的天空，\"我之前真的没想过能来这里上学诶，我真的学得会魔法吗...\""}
{"time": 1774980819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "578414327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“神术和魔法感觉也差不了多少啦”"}
{"time": 1774980835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1653601478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“再说啦，校长不也是天使吗”"}
{"time": 1774980998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1534804012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不一样啦...\"她抱着手臂，\"这话就像在问我，我是不是天使一样。\"她戳戳你的侧腰，\"坏心眼。\""}
{"time": 1774981050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868146301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我的意思是...校长是天使的话，学校里肯定也有神术的分支啦”"}
{"time": 1774981218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699421864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1868146301]\"诶...\"她继续戳戳，\"刚刚教授的态度让我觉得很难啦...而且一般...神术的教习也是单独的...\""}
{"time": 1774981311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337267021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....不过我们应该也不会待很久啦”摸摸她的头“到时候会现代，不知道这还能用不”"}
{"time": 1774981388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977321018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在端详一下校园卡"}
{"time": 1774981512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1625790570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=977321018]校园卡背后有银制的校徽，正面的信息干干净净，写着你自己的姓名和一些基础信息。不过看上去价值不菲。\"嗯...应该还可以用?不过那个时候我们也没有继续上学的资格啦。\"露莉亚想了想，\"我以后是不是要藏一下我的这本笔记。\"她指了指腰上的卷籍"}
{"time": 1774981554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027028366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...可能稍微遮掩一下就好吧”"}
{"time": 1774981698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690706977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "说着话，你们回到了刚入门时的广场上。"}
{"time": 1774981737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810557277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去校务"}
{"time": 1774981837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1130088657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "负责校务的老师是个年纪轻轻的男老师，门开着，此刻正坐在自己的办公桌前处理公务。"}
{"time": 1774981988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "220382247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1130088657]不过这一块负责校务的老师不少，也有其他的临时窗口"}
{"time": 1774982020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655487431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“老师你好，我们俩是新来的，布莱克教授让我们找你”就跟那个年轻男老师说吧"}
{"time": 1774982243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87316219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "他的办公桌前放着法拉特的名片，\"这个时间点?\"他看向你们，眨眨眼，\"还有新生吗？\""}
{"time": 1774982309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904094650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有的有的，法拉特老师”把学生证给他看"}
{"time": 1774982657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165180273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=904094650]他接过，指尖蔓出些许可见的魔力，\"如假包换，布莱克怎么会在这个时候放人...?\"他轻咳了几声，整理了一下自己的表情，\"诺薇菈 温斯特和露莉亚 梅里?\""}
{"time": 1774982719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1659166020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "点点头“老师，我们现在该怎么做”"}
{"time": 1774982880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876008226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（晚安💤）"}
{"time": 1774982889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1275481909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1659166020]他递过一些纸质文件，\"现在宿舍比较紧张，优先给你们安排一些已经有人了的宿舍可以吗？\""}
{"time": 1774982910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "669111688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我已经知道会去哪了）"}
{"time": 1774982921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881789897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以啊...我没什么意见，不过可以让我们两一个宿舍吗”"}
{"time": 1774982969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195645678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（至少等我吃完外卖再睡吧）"}
{"time": 1774982978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316550948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（hh）"}
