{"time": 1774983384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1612044212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1881789897]\"那样的话...\"他皱着眉，\"尽量吧，这里是这学期的课表，还有校服，课本的领取凭证，稍微你们去地下室那边拿就可以。\""}
{"time": 1774983449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "213080278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“行...谢谢老师了”"}
{"time": 1774983579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448142227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1612044212](稍后)"}
