{"time": 1775010199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27393893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=846976533]两套爱璃西雅同款的校服，基本通识课的课本，包括炼金术，基础魔导器，预言学，魔法语言，魔法历史，古代咒文，当然不包含选修课的课本，这些东西垒起来差不多有半个你那么高了。"}
{"time": 1775010353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1640799506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嘶...居然这么多吗”看一眼宿舍号"}
{"time": 1775010581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351812999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1640799506]两套校服之外给了你好几条绿色的领巾，露莉亚那边也是相同的情况。学生证最下面一栏确实显出了现在的宿舍号，三号楼的201。"}
{"time": 1775010653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "280679728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "尝试一下，可能不能搬起来"}
{"time": 1775010877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867762194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你应该看看露莉亚和你是不是一间）"}
{"time": 1775010906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2085788277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露，你宿舍号多少”"}
{"time": 1775011094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510684161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一瞬间我的脑海里浮现了无数邪恶的计划)"}
{"time": 1775011121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780664048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(算了，我是守序善)"}
{"time": 1775011146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "933580563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（发生什么我都不会意外的）"}
{"time": 1775011205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661661020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2085788277]\"应该在一起吧？\"她把证件递给你，上面显示和你相同的房间，\"嗯...不过听说宿舍里还有其他人?\"眨眨眼"}
{"time": 1775011342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167283197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，我已经知道会发生什么了）"}
{"time": 1775011351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799751929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“太好了....确实在同一间”把卡还给她“希望是好相处的人”尝试一下子搬起那些东西"}
{"time": 1775011484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655151687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "换在以前可能有些困难，不过现在你倒是可以很轻松搬起半人高的书堆，露莉亚就没那么好运了，看着地上的这堆东西犯愁，\"不知道能不能借到小推车之类的东西诶...\""}
{"time": 1775011509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1817431607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得练剑的人搬个书还是绰绰有余的）"}
{"time": 1775011534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182243958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(她也不练剑啊)"}
{"time": 1775011588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697679127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没说露莉亚）"}
{"time": 1775011602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047898146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露，我来帮你吧...感觉还是蛮轻松的..”把书放在地上，然后把露露的叠上去"}
{"time": 1775011647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "652958994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（很考验平衡了）"}
{"time": 1775011679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "36939352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（很考验平衡了）"}
{"time": 1775011807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1429001591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这是不是太多了。\"她抽了几本下来，用自己刚领的校服包起来，\"露露的衣服我来拿吧。\""}
{"time": 1775011821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525883967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你要知道搬起一人高的东西）"}
{"time": 1775011837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703125501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就意味着有半人高的部分在你的头部以上（））"}
{"time": 1775011845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153170369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...谢谢露露了，你顺便帮我带个路，我有点看不清”"}
{"time": 1775011974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "49672709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那你可要跟紧一些～\"她笑嘻嘻地走出门，\"要是一不留神把自己弄丢了，我可不管哦?\""}
{"time": 1775012005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "661157921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...我尽量”跟在她身后"}
{"time": 1775012233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1390634511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(挡视线是对的)"}
{"time": 1775012241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "935149743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(待会遇见了只能用余光看见)"}
{"time": 1775012455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1224277504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=661157921]虽然是这么说，不过她的脚步放得很慢，仅仅领先你半个身位，在你的左边引着你走，偶尔还会停下来。绝对不是因为不认识路的原因，你总觉得你在兜圈子"}
{"time": 1775012491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "578558864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要不我们找人问问吧...露露”"}
{"time": 1775012576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493547671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事...这边的路牌很好认的。\"在第三次回到一个熟悉的路口的时候，她脸上的表情有些绷不住地抽动，\"那个...刚刚是往左还是右走来着...\""}
{"time": 1775012617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412878586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...记不太清了，毕竟我看不清路，露露我们找人问问吧”"}
{"time": 1775012855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473514810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"她没来由地叹气，你只感觉你再这么举下去，可能明天连笔都抬不起来。"}
{"time": 1775012864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754962134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可以侦查了)"}
{"time": 1775012900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937447694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd"}
{"time": 1775012900, "type": "reply", "message_id": "937447694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[诺薇拉]演奏出: 1D20=11"}
{"time": 1775013174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609869172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "额头渗出汗珠，已经有点累了“露露...”"}
{"time": 1775013272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "131664380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "露莉亚叹着气到路边找人询问的时候，你的余光瞥到了有些熟悉的身影被人背着从你身旁快速路过，白色的长发，侧颜像极了某个你认识的人。但是一方面胸前的书堆遮住了视线，另一方面对方动得很快，你有些不能确定"}
{"time": 1775013314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253401478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥？）"}
{"time": 1775013337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2049366545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那妃花背着她我应该能认出妃花吧）"}
{"time": 1775013409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463370572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(显然不是妃花背的。)"}
{"time": 1775013566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220221698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不对啊...按理说，自己在这边不应该有熟人啊..难道是伊芙？"}
{"time": 1775013596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812111874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不由的握紧拳头想追上去，算了..正事要紧，先不管她了"}
{"time": 1775013629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038711025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（搬着书怎么握紧拳头（））"}
{"time": 1775013802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1339403436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?\"露莉亚似乎是刚问完路，靠回来打量着你，\"怎么了？诺诺，刚刚看见什么了吗？\""}
{"time": 1775013856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1931542915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像看见熟人了...但也可能是看错了，算了，先去宿舍吧，好沉”"}
{"time": 1775013960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757887882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"熟人?这个时候哪来的...\"她突然反应过来，朝着四周张望，\"在哪?\""}
{"time": 1775013992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258620206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“太快了...已经没影了”"}
{"time": 1775014010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567709618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说书在地上放着也没什么关系对不对）"}
{"time": 1775014015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1517275562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又没下雨）"}
{"time": 1775014109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833544554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她揉揉眉心，\"怎么刚刚不喊一嗓子啦。\"她作势要掐你，但是看你辛苦的样子又收回了手，\"算了，我已经知道路了，从这里右拐再左拐再左拐再左拐就到了。\""}
{"time": 1775014140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651513744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有点没反应过来”"}
{"time": 1775014166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1390523936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“先回宿舍吧...反正她在学校里也跑不了”"}
{"time": 1775014212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "585489091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1833544554]（那不是回原地了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1775014318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "490198457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...应该没什么问题吧...\"露莉亚迈起步子，\"希望刚刚那位学姐指的路是对的...嗯...\"她皱着眉，\"老实说，这里是不是太大了。\""}
{"time": 1775014337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325691940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大城市是这样的”"}
{"time": 1775014380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "778694781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“第一次发现，原来露露是路痴啊”"}
{"time": 1775014663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1601405897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"才不是。\"她咬了咬唇，露出一个待会收拾你的眼神，\"这地方太大了，不知道怎么走而已。\""}
{"time": 1775014699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144307674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "继续跟着她走"}
{"time": 1775014716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "698789395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哼哼...好的，露露说的都对”"}
{"time": 1775014811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128947210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那你们兜兜转转，又回到了这个路口，看见路牌的时候露莉亚的脸一下就黑了，\"...\""}
{"time": 1775014847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562857061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....仔细一想，好像确实只是单纯转了个圈，露露找谁问的啊”有点无语"}
{"time": 1775014889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816319630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(虽然以现实龙神的作息，要一觉睡到晚上，但是伊芙差不多能醒了，吗)"}
{"time": 1775014911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160523895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（大概中午吧可能）"}
{"time": 1775015102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "966024665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1562857061]\"一个看起来很和善的学姐...两个粉色的丸子头，衣服有好宽的袖子...\"她皱起眉，咬牙切齿，\"这家伙骗起人一本正经，怎么会有这种家伙。\""}
{"time": 1775015182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748625429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？那确实很坏了，露露在找其他人问下吧...我歇一会”把书放在地上，稍微休息一下下"}
{"time": 1775015192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102398228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我说怎么感觉好眼熟，差点打出去了）"}
{"time": 1775015201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1911528289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是龙哥遇到的那个骗子）"}
{"time": 1775015502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588379742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1748625429]露莉亚板着脸，\"我不要...\"看上去气鼓鼓地，\"好不容易问一下路，遇到这种人，我不问了。诺诺跟着我走就行，总能找到的。\""}
{"time": 1775015520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "339657834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;？&#93;,file=FAF85F1E6203A9B9E37BFB6924939DF6.jpg,sub_type=7,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRmAM9tXqd6ENnqtCN1KZJADWP8JxivqwMg_woo9NGkjODLkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQrIVrjjiVQGzE2Rw4hvXyIXoC-b6CAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAESMAXWnbmwJ76thqbtRWmNk1RLvY_qcUAXa1URG8mwPcxwNQwexVHpxJRf9uQLpJ2v3g,file_size=54703]"}
{"time": 1775015546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019484824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我去问好了...”四周张望一下有没有靠谱又和善的大姐姐"}
{"time": 1775015880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016389458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拍拍她肩膀，然后四处张望一下"}
{"time": 1775016151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1677496673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "毕竟是路口，一路人来人往，想找个人问路确实不怎么难。"}
{"time": 1775016162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "585635130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你过个交涉好了)"}
{"time": 1775016187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414030262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（讨厌马纳利亚的第不知道多少个理由）"}
{"time": 1775016367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1353961271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd"}
{"time": 1775016367, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1353961271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[诺薇拉]演奏出: 1D20=19"}
{"time": 1775016430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173445783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1775016434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314708305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（hh）"}
{"time": 1775016465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1059647512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你从一个路过的女生那里问到了路，她帮你指了一下远处几栋红色的四层建筑群，\"那边就是宿舍啦。\""}
{"time": 1775016489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811390214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"谢谢学姐...”"}
{"time": 1775016501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1234452210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=FDC6906BF871EC4B9C39901674AB958A.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSIQARp9yLKKE1oS9zpBFwegiatMBibmgsg_woouPDQ3-PLkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQCCuuk48Y6CUDmx4T-PB-jXoCKdmCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAESMAXWnbmwJ76thqbtRWmNk1RLvY_qcUAXa1URG8mwPcxwNQwexVHpxJRf9uQLpJ2v3g,file_size=183579]"}
{"time": 1775016798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "492154672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "～"}
{"time": 1775016869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1566691263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1811390214]（那你走啊）"}
{"time": 1775016913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "207792614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "搬起书，朝宿舍出发！"}
{"time": 1775016925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401886675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“明明看起来挺明显的啊”"}
{"time": 1775016935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137994960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“早知道刚刚找老师要张地图了”"}
{"time": 1775017723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1024582338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1137994960]毕竟四层建筑也算得上高层，即使搬着书，你倒是也能看得清大致的方向。弯弯绕绕半天，你总算是到了宿舍楼的脚下。"}
{"time": 1775017747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710669970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "找下三号楼，然后上楼"}
{"time": 1775017931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300508549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "露莉亚跟在你后面，这一路上都没说话，大概是有些郁闷。201在走廊的另一边，不过这个时间点宿舍里不一定有人就是。"}
{"time": 1775018012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "490872421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真累啊，总算到了，露露开下门吧”"}
{"time": 1775018298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "579539410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=490872421]\"嗯...\"她打量了半天房门，最后拿出学生证在门把手上面比划，传出锁芯旋转的声音，她才长舒一口气，打开了房门。"}
{"time": 1775018365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908291997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "急忙进去，把书放在地上，然后找张椅子坐下“感觉今日运动量超标了...呼呼...好累”"}
{"time": 1775018485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "183020997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1908291997]里面是一个标准的四人间上床下桌的陈设，靠门的两个桌子上摆着东西，铺着床幔。"}
{"time": 1775018717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1032951421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像暂时没我事）"}
{"time": 1775018722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1542502658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（sleep）"}
{"time": 1775018729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1029284810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不过现在里面没有人，\"果然没有人诶...\"露莉亚坐在你对面的椅子上，\"不过我们也没什么行李...换洗的衣服...\"她自嘲地笑了一下，\"也只有几件校服。\""}
{"time": 1775018742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1155789866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你说你中午醒的话，那就再等等先)"}
{"time": 1775018751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383661583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(如果你现在醒，那也不赖)"}
{"time": 1775018754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "908769894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“反正，也不会待很多天啦”"}
{"time": 1775018763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248857928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（呃呃了）"}
{"time": 1775018774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210432320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我醒了也和翔哥不在一边吧）"}
{"time": 1775018860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986526876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我争取两点醒）"}
{"time": 1775018865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "444434376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是真的困了）"}
{"time": 1775018884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156551031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（如果没醒）"}
{"time": 1775018898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21244956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就是伊芙也没醒（）"}
{"time": 1775019432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "404410184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=908769894]\"唉，别说这种没有情调的话。这可是难得的机会诶。\"她把自己的书一本一本放到桌上，\"在真正的学校里上学...我以前一直觉得自己一辈子都没这种机会...\"她的话音越来越低，最后停了下来，\"但我...怎么也开心不起来。\""}
{"time": 1775019478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855008833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....”抱住她，一时也不知道该说些什么"}
{"time": 1775019592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1913189701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她把脑袋埋进你的怀里，语气带着些颤音，\"诺诺...我有些想...爸爸妈妈了...\""}
{"time": 1775020164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402368244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也...”声音也不自觉的哽咽起来"}
{"time": 1775020455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461247188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"一时无言，她依偎在你怀中，抱着你不松手"}
{"time": 1775020912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "627261513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "也开始抽泣起来，紧紧抱住她"}
{"time": 1775021813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1777434513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你哭好了自己动)"}
{"time": 1775021941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91400629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "哭的差不多了...拿手帕给露露擦擦眼泪“......好了，露露不是一直想上学么..等会我们就去上课”"}
{"time": 1775023252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717594755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=91400629]\"今天还有课可以上么？\"她打开课表，\"诶诶，只有上午有两节课诶，马上都要到中午了。\""}
{"time": 1775023433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402864251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "虽然你帮她把眼泪擦了个干净，但红肿的眼睛和明显的泪痕依然提醒着你她刚刚的情绪。"}
{"time": 1775028651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1492287529", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那去吃晚饭吧...我还没吃过学校食堂呢”"}
