{"time": 1775048760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "464382112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=528728641]\"逛了一圈发现这个最便宜嘛。\"她放下手里的盘子，\"毕竟要省着点花...嗯...之后还得想办法要到生血\""}
{"time": 1775048810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399693608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....无所谓了,对我来说熟血就够了”找个位置坐下"}
