{"time": 1775050155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383689945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=739387957][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “没关系...你钱不够了，用我的就行”"}
{"time": 1775050187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479098455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（什么时候到家）[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1775050194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748772025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（刚出发）"}
{"time": 1775050304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "252065487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=383689945]\"不行。\"她坚决地摆摆手，\"怎么样都是...我要负责诺诺的事。\"但你的注意力却被她身后的人吸引，那个侧脸，毋庸置疑，应该不会有一模一样的存在。"}
{"time": 1775050309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40594589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“？”皱了皱眉，眯着眼睛确认。虽说传送门还在的话，这人进来好像也，不奇怪？但是不打算有什么交集，不管是不是真的都绕远一点"}
{"time": 1775050402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1327696307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等下....露露，我又看到那家伙了”自己也吃的差不多了“露露在这里等我，还是一起？”目光死死锁住伊芙"}
{"time": 1775050403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "356353669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=40594589]她正在和一个背影是灰色齐肩短发，穿着白色连衣裙的女生用餐，本人则是一套很素的衬衣和百褶裙。"}
{"time": 1775050428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090972684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=356353669]（那我们岂不是目光正好撞上了）"}
