{"time": 1775052048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105804402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你他妈……”被咬了也不管伤口会不会撕裂，总之沉肩冲着牙口发力冲撞"}
{"time": 1775052109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "24674297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我说过很多次了，和我无关，他们咎由自取。”左手依旧抓着餐袋"}
{"time": 1775052138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938295963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（想象不到，我抓住你一只胳膊，另一只被占着（）"}
{"time": 1775052142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433099118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么打我）"}
{"time": 1775052172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153616405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "露莉亚的质问话音刚落，诺薇菈像是饿狼一样扑了上去，张开嘴就咬住伊芙的胳膊，伊芙则是下盘发力，用力一撞，把诺薇菈意图只是收个利息的轻咬撞开。"}
{"time": 1775052191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757430626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哪里打你了）"}
{"time": 1775052192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246935721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=463973826]虽然只有一瞬间，但那个味道你之前确实尝过。"}
{"time": 1775052205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1758829306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在想怎么默认就咬到了，但是你们都默认了)"}
{"time": 1775052209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1066879188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你咬我胳膊我就往你嘴里肘而已）"}
{"time": 1775052211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85212110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那就咬到了吧)"}
