{"time": 1775052259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "281290596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "擦了擦嘴角“确实是你...”好久没尝过甘甜的血液了，上次尝还是上次"}
{"time": 1775052321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "161985671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"咎由自取，他们怎么会咎由自取...大家...大家都是很好的人...\"露莉亚大口喘气，平常诺薇菈做这种事肯定会被她阻止，但今天她完全熟视无睹，\"诺诺说你做了什么...你到底做了什么!\"语气很高，但在这座食堂里，并没有引起什么注意"}
{"time": 1775052343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776417614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=24674297][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 拉住露露，害怕她冲动，她的逆天言论之前已经听过了"}
{"time": 1775052365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163964924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她挖出了村子底下的龙晶，大家才死了...”补充道"}
{"time": 1775052477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275161766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你这么清楚还带她来找我干嘛。”有些有气无力，手松开了就背朝住院部慢慢后退"}
{"time": 1775052491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567690665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"龙晶...?\"她显然没这方面的概念，一愣，\"什么...?\""}
{"time": 1775052516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "531660018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你不挖...不就什么事都没有，你至少占50的责任，那个埋龙晶的再占50”"}
{"time": 1775052595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434974898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥还没回来吗）"}
{"time": 1775052617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664519715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你搞错了，不说人话的村长才占50%，我最多占25%。”翻了个白眼“现在想来说不定你的交流方式就遗传的他吧”"}
{"time": 1775052621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "849310824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（刚到）"}
{"time": 1775052627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763993472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是伊神好像不在山庄）"}
{"time": 1775052649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "276515458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“村长都说让你别挖了😡，你还硬挖”"}
{"time": 1775052690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1925047189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(在吃饭，你们可以先喊人)"}
