{"time": 1775105405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876436008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我好讨厌花菜)"}
{"time": 1775106012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "291183012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=283893175]伊芙越走越远，再走几步就出食堂了。\"这里回村子...要好几个月诶。\"露莉亚终于理清了你说的话，\"而且我们...真的有办法解决那个东西吗。\""}
{"time": 1775106059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63637739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“问下萨雷法姐姐怎么处理就好了..或者直接拜托她去处理”"}
{"time": 1775106424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1450461806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(种因得因。)"}
{"time": 1775106517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "315308467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=63637739]那么你们都没有再追上去，经过这么件事，露莉亚对自己的杂烩也没什么胃口了，你们坐回去的时候她再没动过叉子。"}
{"time": 1775106605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129386286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1972129365]她们都没有追上来，你顺利离开了飘香的食堂，不过她最后的话你依然听得见‘如果...我们去把现在的摩根家族的人给杀了....大家是不是就能活过来了，或者...我们现在就去把那个龙晶处理了’"}
{"time": 1775106650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834435315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（她耳朵怎么这么好）"}
{"time": 1775106657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853763713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（都不用过聆听）"}
{"time": 1775106665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801491881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”摇头，吃饱饭再说.jpg"}
{"time": 1775106714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593371462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了，露露，今晚我就去找萨雷法姐姐，跟她说一下龙晶的事情”"}
{"time": 1775106737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382649234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1801491881]饭在哪?饭在手里，jpg"}
{"time": 1775106743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1174259616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "只是多个要处理的麻烦而已，事到如今还差这一个么？不管是艾琳还是伊斯塔……不会让她们出事的"}
{"time": 1775106751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "892170004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（当然是先回去）"}
{"time": 1775106834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1455007390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1593371462]\"我不确定...这样做好不好...但是...\"露莉亚攥着手心，\"能这么轻易改变么...诺诺\""}
{"time": 1775106839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "994043267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（艾琳和你什么关系来着）"}
