{"time": 1775106870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456211290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（✓）"}
{"time": 1775106877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "948370038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“总要尝试一下...露露也不想杀人吧”"}
{"time": 1775106919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347600041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且就算没有伊芙，说不定哪天还会来个贰芙叁芙”"}
{"time": 1775106935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1263693531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“把龙晶彻底处理掉才是完全之法”"}
{"time": 1775106962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "66496040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1174259616]怀抱着繁杂的思绪，你回到了住院部的房间，妃花依然静静地躺在床上，没有要醒的迹象。午后的阳光正好，房间里的暖风让人沉醉。"}
{"time": 1775107507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990468952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（睡）"}
{"time": 1775107561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480681743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了好了”双手托起她的脸“整天愁眉苦脸要长皱纹了，露露就不好看了”"}
{"time": 1775108000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047577266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1480681743]\"我本来也没多好看啦。\"她鼓着腮帮子，\"杀人的事...果然干不出来...\""}
{"time": 1775108039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "833237788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“胡说....谁敢说露露不好看，多笑笑”两根手指去抬起她嘴角"}
