{"time": 1775108720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783676280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=833237788]她的嘴角被你的手指拉起，\"嘛...也不是这个意思啦...\"随后她低头看着桌上的菜，\"呼...不过诺诺说得对...如果有机会的话，果然还是想试试\""}
{"time": 1775108763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253102124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了，现在先上学吧，晚上我去问问萨雷法姐姐去”"}
{"time": 1775109027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295052653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=253102124]\"下午也没有课诶。\"她拿起叉子，吃了一口蔬菜，\"呜啊...不好看，不想吃了。\""}
{"time": 1775109073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559135623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那露露吃点别的吧...下午我们去买点生活必需品，然后就去图书馆？”"}
{"time": 1775109693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398559536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=559135623]\"唔，突然就不知道吃什么了。\"她捂着肚子，\"感觉...什么都可以，但是又很一般诶。不如诺诺帮我选吧\""}
{"time": 1775109722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "233543895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“行啊，露露现在几分饱啊”"}
