{"time": 1775118082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1289060261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你终于发现了，可喜可贺）"}
{"time": 1775118093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195788391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我早发现了）"}
{"time": 1775118094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "561003089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1949797377]蛋糕入口松软，奶油鲜甜，但对于现在的你而言，即使有这样的味觉体验，也没感觉很好吃，反而有些涩涩的感觉，并不源于口感，而是发自内心。"}
{"time": 1775118109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "423561087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这次我都不想追，是露露想看你）"}
{"time": 1775118155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "84358337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然不好吃，但还是吃完了"}
{"time": 1775118158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1741980136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "擦擦嘴"}
{"time": 1775118296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782196490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实也不是完全没用，是你为数不多可以心安理得吸血的对象对不对）"}
{"time": 1775118303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191445014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1512059428]被你戳戳，她皱了皱眉头，但没有醒过来，很快就舒展开。"}
{"time": 1775118312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1125129529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=782196490]（你是对的）"}
{"time": 1775118385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878350104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=191445014]把吃的放在床头柜，干脆揉搓起她的脸来“起——床——啦——，至少吃点东西再睡吧”"}
{"time": 1775118563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028791838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1741980136]露莉亚似乎是看着你吃完，她自己的蛋糕还剩不少的样子。"}
{"time": 1775118579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943750848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露怎么不吃啦”"}
{"time": 1775118707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1120491040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=878350104]\"唔唔...\"她有些费力地睁了睁眼，看见是你之后又安心地闭上，\"好困...伊芙...\""}
{"time": 1775118848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434199937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1943750848]\"看着你吃完嘛。\"她漫不经心地挖起一勺吃一口，\"感觉很有意思诶，说不定可以当做研究的课题。\""}
{"time": 1775118883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760803846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这有什么好研究的。。。”托腮看她吃"}
{"time": 1775118927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146993585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "嘴角扯了扯，把她的那份拿出来在鼻尖逗一逗“摄入能量还是很重要的……不然遇到突发情况很麻烦，比如，打饭回来的路上看到了那个烦人的新血族”"}
{"time": 1775118957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "838272124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看到的说法好像不太准确，应该说被认出来了”"}
{"time": 1775119183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2019290740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=838272124]\"嗯...?\"她睁开一只眼睛，眉头带着深深的倦意，\"新血族?之前在地下的那一个吗？\""}
{"time": 1775119311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664066828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1760803846]\"诺诺不觉得很有意思?\"她笑着，\"就像看着小动物在吃自己不喜欢的东西。\""}
{"time": 1775119326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121814145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“对，诺薇拉。”撇了撇嘴，把橙汁吸管先送到她嘴边“还有个她们村的幸存者二号——不知道怎么进来的，传送门还在吗？”"}
{"time": 1775119345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2093076250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎哎，第一我不是小动物，第二谁说我不爱吃了”"}
{"time": 1775119799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "294762869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=121814145]\"嗯...不清楚诶...应该没什么传送门的说法吧。\""}
{"time": 1775120165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711148246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=294762869]\"但是我还是很感谢她啦...伊芙...嗯....\"妃花似乎有些为难，\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1775120196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404739617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2093076250]\"刚刚的样子不就是这样吗？\"她笑了笑，递出自己的手帕，\"擦擦嘴，都成小花嘴了。\""}
{"time": 1775120215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625344526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不是擦过了么）"}
{"time": 1775120226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "187470783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "接过手帕再擦了擦"}
{"time": 1775120232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "219055479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这下干净了吧”"}
{"time": 1775120563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104808248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=219055479]\"骗你的。\"她收回手帕，上面根本就没沾到奶油，\"虽然我说我基本没吃什么东西，不过是不是给我点太多了？\"她面前的辣椒炒肉还剩一小盘，\"根本就吃不完诶。\""}
{"time": 1775120616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594275719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“吃多少是多少吧...”自己反正是吃饱了，尤其伊芙的血还挺好喝，大补"}
{"time": 1775120706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211839732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=711148246]“没关系。”摇了摇头“一码事归一码，我看她这次也多少识相了点。”"}
{"time": 1775120799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516743859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（吸到了很多吗难道.jpg）"}
{"time": 1775120843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539845270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然，她要是真的敢动艾琳和伊斯塔的话。”声音冷了下来“那就另说了”"}
{"time": 1775120926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272409424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1594275719]\"诺诺，帮我吃完吧。\"她把盘子递到你面前，眨眨眼睛，很是可爱。"}
{"time": 1775120980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504364760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过现在总感觉我得把自己放贫血才能给人真的毒死）"}
{"time": 1775120988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "557203258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是...”摸摸自己的小肚子，但看着露露，也不好意思拒绝“好吧...”努力把剩下的吃完"}
{"time": 1775121128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584205496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(吸血种是这样的，你的血里的毒对于他们都是甜美的余味)"}
{"time": 1775121136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979580618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是对一般人还是有用的)"}
{"time": 1775121158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287376343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1539845270]\"诶?她说什么了吗？\""}
{"time": 1775121471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "554093868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=557203258]\"嗯嗯...🎵\"她哼着小调子，\"要是什么都没发生...我们也能在这种地方上学，那就好了。\""}
{"time": 1775121537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429071484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....既然我们都回到了过去，一切都会有办法的”"}
{"time": 1775121600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1360369135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“一些斩草除根釜底抽薪之类低俗的威胁。”按了按指关节，有些心烦意乱地咬上一口塔可"}
{"time": 1775121617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195615434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=429071484]\"好啦好啦。\"她站起身，甩甩头发，\"不要想这些事，今天已经完全空下来了哦?下午该做什么?\""}
{"time": 1775121634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478674400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（无敌了，我打心烦意乱能打出这种东西[CQ:image,file={4E428FF3-945A-0882-6EAF-71A93E59C949}.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-4E428FF3945A08826EAF71A93E59C949/0,file_size=2891]）"}
{"time": 1775121714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "862291100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那很厉害了）"}
{"time": 1775121729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "761602063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1195615434][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “买生活必需品啊，床单被子之类的”"}
{"time": 1775121873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1875095679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（mh手游宣发了）"}
{"time": 1775121888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189181313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（该抽测试资格了）"}
