{"time": 1775122191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "117783481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=727644947][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “然后和新室友聊聊，下来就该干正事了”"}
{"time": 1775122203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137852672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉天玑8000也就8.2/3吧印象里）"}
{"time": 1775122275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1852453248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=380162000]皱了皱眉，好像拿错了。先放下来“我在想……是不是真的该让艾琳换个宿舍……什么的”"}
{"time": 1775122583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112647064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=117783481]\"虽然不知道诺诺觉得做什么才是做正事。\"她对你伸出手，\"不过，能让我们先享受一下这样的时光，也不错。\""}
{"time": 1775122611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "466438604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“当然是去图书馆啊，露露不会忘记了吧”趁机也敲她一下"}
{"time": 1775122663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428291417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来我算地主吧，去村子里挖个东西真的需要谁的许可吗（）"}
{"time": 1775122687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1262656133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1852453248]妃花没有开口，毕竟这是属于你的思索，她闭上眼睛，轻轻呼吸。"}
{"time": 1775122909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137242041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=466438604]\"...\"她把手攸地收回去，瞪了你一眼，\"不知道，我不去。\""}
{"time": 1775122985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1921640575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1262656133]“这么困么？”有些无奈，用胸针联系一下卡珊德拉“喂？之前你不是说能把艾琳调到我们宿舍里去吗？”"}
{"time": 1775123035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153293059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“开个玩笑啦...我们下午在校园里逛逛好了，毕竟这么大”"}
{"time": 1775123411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968783131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1153293059]\"困了困了。\"她的手指抵着太阳穴转了转，打了个看上去就很假的哈欠，\"怎么突然好累...\""}
{"time": 1775123448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "554993840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“逛逛么”站到她身后给她捏捏肩“露露最好了，陪陪我么”"}
{"time": 1775123526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1132444436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1921640575]\"有这回事么？\"她的声音过了一会才传来，在你耳边响起，\"同样的要求要是再提一次会很无趣诶。\""}
{"time": 1775123866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062740665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=554993840]\"那我就大发慈悲，勉为其难，陪陪你好啦。\"说着她再次把手递给你。"}
{"time": 1775123900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "825267396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走喽...先去买东西吧，现在正好中午，回去估计还能看到舍友”"}
{"time": 1775123971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54639226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1132444436]“再提一次不答应的话就会再提一次。哦对了，你知道了吗？诺薇拉进学院了”"}
{"time": 1775124012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1524976182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你想叫卡珊德拉压我？我背后也是有人的（bushi）"}
