{"time": 1775125286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42359919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1752664265]“说是这么说了。”玩着头发“她能进来的话，灾杰们……算了，他们估计比我们到的还早。”"}
{"time": 1775125288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084849353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那我先回忆一下宿舍有配什么基础的吗"}
{"time": 1775125325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450645696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你不愿的话，我就自己去找艾琳了。有机会多卖个人情，你不打算把握一下？”"}
{"time": 1775125374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "863244567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1084849353]一套上床下桌，没了"}
{"time": 1775125388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "217152156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "床有床垫吗"}
{"time": 1775125640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2032847657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有的宝宝)"}
{"time": 1775125657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015212795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（床单被子枕头都有吗）"}
{"time": 1775125746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493351149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=450645696]\"就算你去找她，她就会老老实实搬出去?而且...你急着让她搬出去干嘛?\"对面依然是不紧不慢的语气，\"她又不是没有自己的宿舍。\""}
{"time": 1775125758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "958810238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2015212795](没有)"}
{"time": 1775125797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712156796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=682986751]那自然买床单枕头，被子，在买一些洗漱用品[CQ:at,qq=1252219916]"}
{"time": 1775125897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "831745954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就当我有焦虑症好了。24小时内见不到她一次我就会去报失踪。”无意识间扯下一根头发“何况真的有人想打摩根家的主意”"}
{"time": 1775126220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151909609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=712156796]那倒是大包小包，两人份的合计十个金币。"}
{"time": 1775126258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "187707139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=831745954]\"听上去时间很宽松嘛，余裕余裕。\""}
