{"time": 1775154160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684060395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=845216907]伸两只手"}
{"time": 1775154217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "6343480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=684207814]“……靠。”食物噎在嘴里，翻身下床，拿着橙汁路上补充糖分，就一路匆忙朝先前送艾琳的宿舍楼去"}
{"time": 1775154219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069751707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那就设定一下好了，温斯顿省的西部区域，艾洛温治下。)"}
{"time": 1775154233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2109612846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(感觉已经很具体了吗)"}
{"time": 1775154253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2093959470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "(感觉已经很具体了吗)"}
{"time": 1775154270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536199260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这还能认不出来吗，你们村要交地税的）"}
{"time": 1775154286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1591424056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(至于为什么叫温斯顿，就和东边会叫伊斯顿，南边会叫桑斯，北边会叫诺斯一样。)"}
{"time": 1775154389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885238305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（先熟络一下）"}
{"time": 1775154629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382905037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1684060395]艾琳先握了握你的右手，然后松开，艾琳奈看了一眼，也跟着握住，\"唔...这是什么必须的仪式吗？\"她把自己怀里的笔记本扔到桌上，又坐回自己的椅子。"}
{"time": 1775154660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375828689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（露露没觉得有什么不对吗（）"}
{"time": 1775154678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165829041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=6343480]\"随便你忙活吧～这事我可不管哦?\"她最后说了句胸针就黯淡了下去。"}
{"time": 1775154683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1346362599", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说艾琳奈，你家是住温斯顿西部？”"}
{"time": 1775154687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896097518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=375828689](肯定有啊，但是我还没说而已)"}
{"time": 1775154698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082992092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在领域展开)"}
{"time": 1775154728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261053782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（艾琳是艾琳，艾琳奈是艾琳奈）"}
{"time": 1775154738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2078678379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说艾琳，你家是住温斯顿西部？”"}
{"time": 1775154941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012577375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2078678379]你发现露莉亚自从听了自我介绍之后就没说过话，一双眼睛紧紧看着紫发的女孩，眼神有些晦暗不明，此刻听到你的问句紧紧盯着对方。\n\"啊，是啊。\"艾琳下意识眨了眨眼，似乎有些疑惑，\"怎么猜出来的?\""}
{"time": 1775155024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287443503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1165829041]非常没有形象的、效率至上的奔跑。虽然经历过那么一段时间的训练，不过终究是……能量不足，跑不了几步就开始喘"}
{"time": 1775155043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2135723981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们也是从那边来的...对艾络温家族也是略有耳闻，这样算来..我们也是同乡人了”"}
{"time": 1775155060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258423900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "用魔力增幅一下体能，就这么时快时慢地紧赶慢赶"}
{"time": 1775155073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1318284065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "稍微拉了一下露露，担心她做出什么"}
{"time": 1775155135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546646612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1287443503]几栋宿舍楼倒是不怎么远就是了，无视一路聚焦到你身上的目光，抛下没吃完的塔可，拿着杯橙汁，你用了最快速度赶到了 三栋的楼下。"}
{"time": 1775155184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "477574851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2135723981]“诶？你们也是那边来的吗？”她打量着你们，“之前我在那边跟着姐姐收税的时候都没注意到诶...”"}
{"time": 1775155237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2093784560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1318284065]她只是深呼吸了几下，到底是没做什么，“没事...”她挤出一个笑容，不知是对你还是对艾琳，“我们当时可能也不在村子里啦，毕竟我们很早就来了外环。”"}
{"time": 1775155288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1623369557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "哎，好像和刚刚自己说的有点对不上，算了，应该没影响吧"}
{"time": 1775155323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341066717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*进去，先找找宿管，问问今天是不是有新生入住。喘了喘“学生会长让我来了解一下情况”"}
{"time": 1775155522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101170008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1623369557]\"嗯...你们不是从好远的地方来的吗?\"艾琳奈挠了挠头，瞪着无辜的眼睛看着你们。"}
{"time": 1775155575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774323741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=341066717]对方表示确有此事，\"两个小姑娘，看上去不到入学的年纪，不过确实入了学呢...唔...\""}
{"time": 1775155591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "966389546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哈哈...”尴尬的笑了一下"}
{"time": 1775155598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940575653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你怎么自己反驳自己）"}
{"time": 1775155617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821613763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为角色有自己的生活（）"}
{"time": 1775155632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1849376635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={4E8827CD-2EB3-EB8D-7538-78B5FF547CA3}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-4E8827CD2EB3EB8D753878B5FF547CA3/0,file_size=405525]"}
{"time": 1775155635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "164797865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（这是什么）"}
{"time": 1775155638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084290807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那边离这里确实很远啊，马车都要三个月..我们甚至是走过来的”"}
{"time": 1775155660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "67042805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1849376635]（鲁智深是这样的）"}
{"time": 1775155690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1823623680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走了好久好久，好久好久才过来”"}
{"time": 1775155702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708661002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1774323741]“她们在哪个房间？”此时调整状态，逐渐挺直了腰“有一些例行宣传和需要同步的消息”"}
{"time": 1775155922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "643839764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1823623680]\"嗯...?\"艾琳疑惑地看向你们，\"可是我每年都会去一趟周边的村子诶，你们真是村里人吗？\"\n\"走了好久好久?唔...\"艾琳奈拍拍艾琳的肩膀，\"小艾琳，我懂了，她们就是那种朝圣者啦，三步一跪，九步一叩首啦。\"随后露出一副我懂我懂的表情看向你们。\n露莉亚的脸色有点黑，\"...\""}
{"time": 1775155960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844996201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1708661002]\"有学生会的文件吗？或者，证明。\"对方显然不会随便放你进去。"}
{"time": 1775156055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "867293905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……我是学生会长的妹妹”虽然感觉十有八九没用，但是死马当活马医，把学生证拿出来给她看“只是拜访而已，需要确认这些吗？”"}
{"time": 1775156142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1457189299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎呀，走过来是因为其他原因啦，当然，也不是全程走啦，稍微夸张了一点点”比个手势"}
{"time": 1775156434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108007890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1457189299]艾琳显然不信你的说辞，\"虽然不知道为什么你要装作艾洛温治下的人...嗯...\"她皱了皱眉，\"要接近也是接近姐姐吧...?\""}
{"time": 1775156516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649804595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？你姐姐是，感觉你好像在想什么很复杂的事情”"}
{"time": 1775156605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1469927781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=867293905]她扫了一眼，\"辛德拉同学，你要是找人的话，麻烦直说。\"她捂着半边脸摇摇头，\"进去吧，二零一。\""}
{"time": 1775156666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154811728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……好的”拿回学生证，201，应该很近，直接上楼"}
{"time": 1775156806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62096014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1649804595]\"...\"她皱着眉，\"你连这个都不知道，那你找我是做什么?\""}
{"time": 1775156822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859366960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好像，翔哥没关门)"}
{"time": 1775156864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212323583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1154811728]201的门没关，里面四个女生，两个坐着两个站着正在聊天"}
{"time": 1775156877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540298313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们只是很单纯的被分到这里啊”有些无奈“然后比较巧，可能这就是命运女神的眷顾之类的吧”"}
{"time": 1775157002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773411401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "站在门口，显得颇为突兀，胸口还在明显起伏，梗着脖子，看起来就颇为……不善"}
{"time": 1775157028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716264223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1540298313]你正说着，一个人急匆匆地冲到你们没关的门口，你转头一看，正是伊芙。"}
{"time": 1775157076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2077639174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，我关下门去先”去关门"}
{"time": 1775157106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "149167278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?\"坐着的两人有些疑惑地看着门口，\"辛德拉同学?\"艾琳奈先开口，\"你这是?\""}
{"time": 1775157167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1481065854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们认识？”确实没想到这三个人会互相认识"}
{"time": 1775157276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136637033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1481065854]\"昨天上课的时候，有过一面之缘啦。\"艾琳奈回答。艾琳没说话，只是眼神带着探究。"}
{"time": 1775157335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145280709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以这位伊...呃，辛德拉同学，你有什么事吗”握着门把手，挤出一个微笑看着她"}
{"time": 1775157338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1488725876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“艾琳……”调整一下体态，恢复贵族的样貌，朝着她的方向伸出手“跟我来一下……有事”"}
{"time": 1775157395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636290166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你要做什么?\"露莉亚不动声色地挡在艾琳的椅子前面，遮住你的视线，\"我想这里没人邀请你，辛 德 拉同学。\""}
{"time": 1775157609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205682684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我找她，没跟你们说话。”皱着眉“你谁啊？”"}
{"time": 1775157700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759816946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "算了，看见她就感觉来气😠，从门前让开，然后稍微拉一下露露"}
{"time": 1775157720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116073875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=205682684]\"诶...我?\"艾琳疑惑地看着你，\"找我做什么吗？\""}
{"time": 1775157825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215983905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“来就是了。”手依旧悬在半空“很重要的事”"}
{"time": 1775157937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "652993962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=759816946]露莉亚并没有退开，反而一直瞪着门外的人。艾琳哦了一声，从椅子上慢慢站起身，\"不能在这说吗...?\"艾琳奈把自己的椅子搬开，\"我能听吗?\""}
{"time": 1775158113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "142087625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=652993962] (公屏喵[CQ:at,qq=825734198] )"}
{"time": 1775158176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026725596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不想在这说。”维持原样，歪着头隔着露莉亚看着艾琳"}
{"time": 1775158216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133011080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好可疑啊...感觉要干什么坏事一样”"}
{"time": 1775158328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1053139664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "艾琳对着艾琳奈点了点头，从你们身边出门，露莉亚倒是没拦着。"}
{"time": 1775158396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004157457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "立刻牵住她的手腕，往走廊另一头走“……她们还没怎么你吧？”"}
{"time": 1775158466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418334636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摆摆手，有些无奈，回去开始整理床铺“对了艾琳奈同学，学校内有什么好玩的地方吗”"}
{"time": 1775158482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372127851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那么里面的诺薇菈看着伊芙像是做贼一样拉着艾琳就去了另一侧走廊。"}
{"time": 1775158599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867305691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2004157457]\"怎么我...什么?\"她看上去有些状况外，不过随后扬起嘴角，\"她们说自己来自我的家族治下，被我无情戳穿了。\"点头点头"}
{"time": 1775158683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962152747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=418334636]\"好玩的地方?\"她认真思考起来，\"图书馆?嗯...炼金巢室?呃...其实学校里的地方都很有趣啦...校外也不错，有好听的点心和咖啡...\""}
{"time": 1775158734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "732032465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”感觉有点云里雾里“艾琳奈同学下午有空吗？”"}
{"time": 1775158785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1819190754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊……嗯，这不是很聪明吗？”虽然好像确实来自家族治下，但先顺着她的话说“她们和摩根家族，有一些嫌隙……这是结论，原因比较复杂。”转过身来看着她“所以……我希望，你可以……嗯，换个宿舍，什么的”"}
{"time": 1775158952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "694112774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1819190754]\"嫌隙?\"她皱了皱眉，有些不以为然，\"可是我不认识她们啊?不是几个龙系的人...看上去是平民...我觉得和我扯不是关系吧?\""}
{"time": 1775158993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984743921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=732032465]\"下午，我想找艾琳...诶...\"她后知后觉，反应过来，\"没什么没什么...应该有吧\""}
{"time": 1775159122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957056604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=694112774]“她们原本住的地方因为一些事情和主家起了摩擦，伴生了不少流血事件。”简单解释到“作为舍友，我不放心”"}
{"time": 1775159159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357409930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那...那个...可以麻烦艾琳奈同学下午...陪我们一起在学校逛逛吗...”有些不好意思“要是艾琳奈觉得麻烦的话..我们也不会介意的”补充道"}
{"time": 1775159272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854133964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你们怎么玩上了）"}
{"time": 1775159272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506516007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1957056604]\"嗯...?\"她歪着脑袋，靠着走廊的栏杆看着你，\"你到底是谁?\"说这话的时候她的语气平静，完全没有了刚刚谈笑的态度。"}
{"time": 1775159297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1015775842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=854133964]（本来就准备去玩啊）"}
{"time": 1775159303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309100979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=357409930]\"呃...待会等艾琳回来，我问一下...\"她有些心虚地避开视线"}
{"time": 1775159368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1057920968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦哦，没关系的...”继续整理一下自己的东西“艾琳奈同学能考虑我已经很开心了”"}
{"time": 1775159405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308978562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1506516007]“……”意识到自己好像话确实有些密，视线不自觉下移了些，像是想避开她的视线“这很难解释……但我绝对、绝对不会害你”"}
{"time": 1775159471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "963913494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1057920968]\"哦...没关系没关系。\"她有些惶恐地摆着手，\"是不是让诺薇菈困扰了...我...\""}
{"time": 1775159491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011830949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（下一句话就该说非要说的话因为我爱你了）"}
{"time": 1775159532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878408475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1308978562]\"很难解释，刚刚我也听到了类似的话呢。\"她眯起眼睛，给你的感觉像是蛇在吐着信子，\"虽然在前天的事上我很感谢你，不过...我有自己的判断。\""}
{"time": 1775159545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558414632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=963913494]“哎？不会的，艾琳奈怎么会这么想啊”感觉好像看到了一位故人的影子"}
{"time": 1775159603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480194142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好巧，故人也姓艾"}
{"time": 1775159651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328246112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1878408475]“不行。”攥着她的手又用力几分，但是还是低着头“这件事上我不能……”"}
{"time": 1775159672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431854201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1480194142](故人是爱璃西雅?)"}
{"time": 1775159686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563976399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是啊）"}
{"time": 1775159760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "888619600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=558414632]\"不是...呃...\"她最后还是放弃了解释，\"没事...等艾琳回来吧...\"\n露莉亚在旁边戳戳你，在你耳边小声，\"蓝色的...\""}
{"time": 1775159797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521993036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？什么”不太懂露露什么意思"}
{"time": 1775159930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1048597017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（领巾）"}
{"time": 1775159948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910540174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她伸手拉了拉你的绿色领巾，\"嗯...诺诺，下午去做什么?\""}
{"time": 1775160042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144298966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“在学校里随便逛逛吧...顺便踩踩点”"}
{"time": 1775160077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809615242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "经露露提醒才意识到“对了艾琳奈...这个领巾的颜色有什么说法吗”"}
{"time": 1775160239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539623868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1328246112]\"我有自己的判断。\"她重复了一遍，\"换言之，我也有自己要坚持的东西。\""}
{"time": 1775160255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691918489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=809615242](居然真问了？)"}
{"time": 1775160272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "847398552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不能问吗）"}
{"time": 1775160282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258597554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(像撒盐)"}
{"time": 1775160318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1576432704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不会是那个魔力测量？）"}
{"time": 1775160322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1546034916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=809615242]\"呃...这个啊...\"她看了看胸前显眼的蓝色...没有解释，而是转移了话题，\"诺薇菈不知道吗？\""}
{"time": 1775160358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362956949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一看你就连入学的手册都没翻过，但这不重要，一看你就连之前遇见的学生领巾颜色不一样没问过)"}
{"time": 1775160388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "109849063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摇摇头“入学手册还没来得及看”"}
{"time": 1775160406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687222134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你给我领巾特写的）"}
{"time": 1775160461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749736531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=687222134]（好像只有艾尔 艾琳奈 艾琳）"}
{"time": 1775160528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224933206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1539623868]“比如说？”声音逐渐焦虑起来“你不明白，她们是怎样的……我不能放你和危险分子睡在一个屋里。要是哪天见不到你，我……”"}
{"time": 1775160690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860361598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=224933206]\"危险分子...?\"她哑然失笑，\"恕我拒绝，没有确认她们的话的真伪，我也不能确定你的。\"她从栏杆上起身，\"而且，我现在想试试看相信自己的判断，辛德拉同学。\""}
{"time": 1775160799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116241704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我要问了，洋荷的手链摘得下来吗）"}
{"time": 1775160812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338170370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=109849063]\"这是年级啦...年级。\"她有些窘迫，\"绿色是一年级...\""}
{"time": 1775160827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309374549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1116241704](可以吧，但是洋荷认定是不是被偷就不好说了)"}
{"time": 1775160943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411438986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“ohoh..这样啊，我还以为大家都是同龄人呢..该叫艾琳奈姐姐的，呃，学姐..更喜欢哪种？”"}
{"time": 1775160974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "525194503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=860361598]“……”咬着嘴唇，眼眶泛红，没被润够的嗓子声音又低了些“那样我会睡不着……”"}
{"time": 1775161388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528176151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=411438986]\"哈哈...\"她遮了遮自己的脸，\"怎么都好啦。\""}
{"time": 1775161467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906571781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“对不起……突然说了奇怪的话……”抬起手揉了揉眼睛，别过头去，声音又小了些“我……应该相信你的，我……”总感觉胸口郁结了一口气无处宣泄，最后牵着的手无力地放开，像溺水之人恢复呼吸一般吸一大口气“……对不起，我走……”"}
{"time": 1775161474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338389289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=525194503]\"好了。\"她伸手拂了拂你的眼睛，随后有些讶异自己下意识的动作，\"呃...我会好好的。\""}
{"time": 1775161504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159337341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（timing这一块）"}
{"time": 1775161626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "902534277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好像也能接上)"}
{"time": 1775161658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459177514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（睡了）"}
{"time": 1775161783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "633978805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（对不起，不小心，把命贷出去啦）"}
{"time": 1775161795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884577569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡了）"}
{"time": 1775161997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721785320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1775177354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1667516720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(下次记得说不小心死掉了)"}
{"time": 1775177528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1176647692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=338389289]“知道了……”低着头“有事找我……或者伊斯塔”"}
{"time": 1775177764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2085150984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1176647692]她继续伸出手，拂过你前额垂下的发丝，把它们轻轻别到你的耳后，\"不用这么担心，好吗...嗯...虽然我也说不上来...但是总是...想下意识相信你。\""}
{"time": 1775178173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "915320681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不担心什么的……我做不到。”摇摇头，始作俑者可是自己，不如说越亲近才越危险……这是无从告知的事，但没法保证无从得知“……让我再和她们说一句话吧”"}
{"time": 1775178262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685533088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=915320681]\"嗯...\"她欲言又止，最后咬了咬唇开口，\"总之...还是不能告诉我吗？\""}
{"time": 1775178505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2135066428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“什么？”不知道她指的是哪件事，虽然哪件事恐怕都不太好相信"}
{"time": 1775178825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "129913013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2135066428]\"你的身份。\"她紫色的眼眸盯着你的眼睛，\"我不知道...但我觉得，很重要。\""}
{"time": 1775179150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658179434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=129913013]“这……你读过穿越小说吗？”纠结一会最后问出这么个问题"}
{"time": 1775179372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2053228704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1658179434]\"穿越小说?\"她皱着眉，看了看四周，重新靠到了栏杆上，\"和现状有什么关系吗？\""}
{"time": 1775179688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1024664096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我确实是摩根家人……确切地说，是艾络温。”抿了抿嘴“来自一个……不，现在还不是时候”最终还是没有完全说出来“那是我要解决的事情，不该这么快把你扯进来……”"}
{"time": 1775180086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003638689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……好像现在说这个已经晚了”摇了摇头，纠结而矛盾“知道了就已经分不开了……还是说出来好了”"}
{"time": 1775180255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790898948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1003638689]\"...\"她的目光紧盯着你，不过表情很释然，就像是确认了一件早就了然的事情，\"我知道...\"她伸出手挡住你，\"知道了这件事，对我而言，已经足够了。\""}
{"time": 1775180463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32266801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我……哦……”话被噎了回去，对此感到庆幸“那就……行。不过我还是有话要对那两个人说。”"}
{"time": 1775180753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "807962608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=32266801]她躲开了视线，看向窗外的风景，\"我希望你去多帮帮姐姐...我的事...没那么重要。\""}
{"time": 1775181187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2054064815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“对我而言，都很重要。”摇了摇头“相比而言你更重要些……不过既然你这么说了……那就，告诉我一般去哪找伊斯塔？”"}
{"time": 1775181491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1102462027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2054064815]\"唔...\"她皱了皱眉，\"一般而言...姐姐大概会在自己的教室?不过她的课表我也不太清楚...只知道明天下午她有一节璐米欧尔教授的预言课。\""}
{"time": 1775181601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1601138471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=528176151][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “好的，艾琳奈姐姐”"}
{"time": 1775181666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799757172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我知道了。说到这个……昨天你们应该，有好好交流？”昨天有人没去上课.jpg“她怎么说？”"}
{"time": 1775181690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785510378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉伊神像昨晚没睡）"}
{"time": 1775181711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325017517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不用感觉）"}
{"time": 1775181717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555654368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（下午是肯定见不到他的）"}
{"time": 1775181836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1040784544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(咦)"}
{"time": 1775181935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900342229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是你怎么醒这么早）"}
{"time": 1775181944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364247471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（自然醒）"}
{"time": 1775182093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485888021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1601138471]\"可以的话，我还是希望不要叫我姐姐...\"她叹了口气，坐回自己的椅子上，盯着桌上的书发呆"}
{"time": 1775182298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616756215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧...艾琳奈？”"}
{"time": 1775182398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128240569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=799757172]（she.jpg）"}
{"time": 1775182451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114081488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "差不多也收拾完了"}
{"time": 1775182583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745219003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=799757172]\"...\"她把视线从外面收回，轻轻吐了口气，\"嗯...其实我不敢去找她...总是害怕自己...会拖她的后腿...姐妹之间应该是互相照顾的，但...我想多照顾她。\""}
{"time": 1775182731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036711357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1616756215]露莉亚已经到属于自己的床位开始收拾自己的东西，她几步爬上床开始铺起来。"}
{"time": 1775183048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771429711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "边铺床边等艾琳回来"}
{"time": 1775183129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108299122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=745219003]“会拖后腿那也是一家人。”只有这句话说得比较有底气“……找人帮忙照顾也算照顾了”"}
{"time": 1775183425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702358270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1108299122]\"嗯...\"她点点头，\"你刚刚不是说还有要说的话吗？\""}
{"time": 1775183464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594171275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……回去？”看向201的门"}
{"time": 1775183523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779873652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"她率先迈步，朝着还开着的宿舍门走去"}
{"time": 1775183695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757397273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*跟随"}
{"time": 1775183698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1214603517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1771429711]床大概铺了一半，走廊传来脚步声，艾琳走到了门前，见没人开口，回到了自己的座位上。"}
{"time": 1775183726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "167042494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "站在门口，很自然地等两个人的视线聚焦过来"}
{"time": 1775183745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430221902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "懒得看她"}
{"time": 1775183788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167791327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她们都在忙着铺床，一时都没看你，倒是艾琳奈一直看着你，似乎有些疑惑。"}
{"time": 1775183794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "365366130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "鞋尖敲地，弄出些动静来"}
{"time": 1775183841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "486709345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾琳奈酱，怎么说，下午？”"}
{"time": 1775183875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2066029684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不过事到如今，也不差等这一会了。非要说，就是有点饿"}
{"time": 1775183971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "282026203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊?这件事...\"艾琳奈站起身，凑到艾琳身边，跟她小声耳语说着什么，艾琳从有些惊讶到露出一副拿你没办法的表情，随后艾琳奈如释重负地呼出口气，\"可以哦...下午。\"然后她指了指门口，\"辛德拉同学好像是找你们的?\""}
{"time": 1775184394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "44675213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1775184403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031154856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1775184461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73235679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "事到如今，翻身下床，出门一气呵成，然后推着她到没人的地方"}
{"time": 1775184504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195438466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（推着谁（））"}
{"time": 1775184535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935650604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“辛德拉同学找我吗，那我们换个地方聊吧”"}
{"time": 1775184593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1988634778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“露莉亚也来吧，我看她之前有很多话想说的样子。”被推着走，倒也没什么怨言"}
{"time": 1775184774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395390345", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了，没必要，她看到你就来气”"}
{"time": 1775184791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "57406550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回头看眼露露，看她怎么说"}
{"time": 1775184873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864629239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她已经铺好了床，点了点头，临走前看了一眼艾琳。出门顺带关上了房门。"}
{"time": 1775184934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522198716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"去哪里?\""}
{"time": 1775184949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331466222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“四下无人的地方”"}
{"time": 1775184976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446751747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "等她们带着自己走咯，路上把匕首拿出来，手放在显眼的地方"}
{"time": 1775185008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "516314428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“辛德拉同学何意味，想在公开场所爆奇杀人吗”"}
{"time": 1775185014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223906823", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1775185023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1208399000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（起）"}
{"time": 1775185037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809038864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"露莉亚瞥了一眼，没什么感想的样子，\"去咖啡厅?\""}
{"time": 1775185100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140715069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你要是希望我的武器一直藏在你们看不见的角落我也没意见。”暂时没有收起来的打算"}
{"time": 1775185216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1901270567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我觉得其实在天台好像也不错，很有感觉”"}
{"time": 1775185306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280777023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(外面全是警察?)"}
{"time": 1775185319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037970521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“随你的便，反正这几天我已经跳过两次楼了。”试着转个刀，但是完全没有经验"}
{"time": 1775185329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "624168176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "露莉亚耸耸肩，\"诺诺带路咯。\""}
{"time": 1775185356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473267233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我只是觉得没必要，反正我要是想杀你，你用那玩意肯定拦不住”上天台"}
{"time": 1775185399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236510654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你拿刀了吗就拦不住）"}
{"time": 1775185443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2071258161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我现在还需要拿刀吗，神奇的血魔法这一块）"}
{"time": 1775185453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305695224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（而且我两把剑一直带着的啊）"}
{"time": 1775185478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810189459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你手上拿着两把凶器问我手里为什么拿匕首吗（））"}
{"time": 1775185525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1641128092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "白眼要翻到天上去了“我都跟你们走了，还在乎这个吗？”"}
{"time": 1775185529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "995842776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你在学校还随身带两把剑?)"}
{"time": 1775185540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858755566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我觉得带个西里斯的细剑都不得了了)"}
{"time": 1775185562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "735921797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我剑放哪，神秘的血魔法？）"}
{"time": 1775185568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550693170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你有四次元背包吗）"}
{"time": 1775185586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1817982501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可能有）"}
{"time": 1775185615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513406538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（nsbb）"}
{"time": 1775185627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937760730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能有都来了）"}
{"time": 1775185627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1504221610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（呃）"}
{"time": 1775185746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711740575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之跟着到了天台"}
{"time": 1775185775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853891183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以你要说什么，快点说吧”"}
{"time": 1775185799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457186093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我不认可在校内一直带三把剑)"}
{"time": 1775185810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182726432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(之前可能跨在身上，但你没给我描述过)"}
{"time": 1775185814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "171612112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(nmd)"}
{"time": 1775185868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "469351451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "总之到了这栋宿舍的天台，不怎么高，也就四层楼的样子，可以望见一整片宿舍群，再远一些也可以看见一些广场的角角"}
{"time": 1775185869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12244430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“听我说句话还用得着特意跑这么远？”在想着之后要不要想办法给匕首柄末端加个环，这样可以和苦无一样转着玩“又不是什么很有攻击性的话，是不是把我想的太坏了”"}
{"time": 1775185890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "927201985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谁知道你要说什么”"}
{"time": 1775185915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383887800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "趴在栏杆上，看着远方"}
{"time": 1775185975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810749234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“很简单的话啦。”靠在天台门旁的墙上“我和你们不是一类人，现在不是，以后多半也不会是”"}
{"time": 1775185992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651272448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“所以别当下一个我。我说完了”"}
{"time": 1775186000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923841096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“讲人话，谢谢”"}
{"time": 1775186039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85953836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我倒是想说“有什么事冲我来”这种话（））"}
{"time": 1775186054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "297153977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是说不了）"}
{"time": 1775186129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "761149518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”叹了口气“我还以为我说得很清楚了。算了，换个我更擅长的方式吧”"}
{"time": 1775186186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77898250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你在学院里没有什么血源吧。”"}
{"time": 1775186213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "55672316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你要为我提供？”"}
{"time": 1775186283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984931598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...什么?\"露莉亚有些吃惊"}
{"time": 1775186321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812115554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“可以这么理解”手上一直在拙劣地翻动的匕首总算停下来“作为交换，你，你们，不准对她透露我们的事，更不准伤害她”"}
{"time": 1775186395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "726935868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这种事情不用你提醒，那一天一次？”"}
{"time": 1775186466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159491186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我在想多少毫升比较合适）"}
{"time": 1775186533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1330212234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"露莉亚沉默了一下，\"我们本来也不打算伤害她，改变过去很诱人...但我绝对不会...不会用杀人这种事...\""}
{"time": 1775186569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "541843336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（成年人每天造血30-50，每天一次怎么这么害怕把你吸死啊）"}
{"time": 1775186583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "256927290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我怎么知道一次是多少）"}
{"time": 1775186639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418828978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "内心尝试和斑比沟通下“斑比酱...你现在出来会被发现吗”"}
{"time": 1775186660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749237510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，也就是说会变成手臂上带条形码的地雷妹）"}
{"time": 1775186662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "801046854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有点变态）"}
{"time": 1775186770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246302845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“最多75毫升”想了想，不确定自己能不能自给治愈魔法的前提下，报出一个也许还算说得过去的数字"}
{"time": 1775186872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3304030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你们以前怎么想的我不在乎。我要用我的方式确保她的安全”"}
{"time": 1775186885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634324598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你讲”"}
{"time": 1775186927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326737163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我有什么不能的?\"她的语气随意。\n在场的人只见诺薇菈的发丝渗出鲜红的血痕，逐渐汇聚在一起，除了诺薇菈之外的人都感觉到了高位者带来的压力和浓厚的血腥气。"}
{"time": 1775187026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1379071425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……还行，不如洋荷……”倚靠在墙上，还站得住“也就和贾斯珀一个水平吧。”"}
{"time": 1775187100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "292134878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“少吸点...把她吸死了，后面几天就没稳定的来源了”害怕斑比生气，提醒一下"}
{"time": 1775187149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1716462838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(她本体在酒店吓你的时候你怎么不放话不如xxx)"}
{"time": 1775187158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749216424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（蝙蝠真敢suck不死鸟吗）"}
