{"time": 1775187947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972507816", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哪方面的约，血的量还是，都说了，我们不会对艾琳奈下手的”"}
{"time": 1775187953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "419765958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那我就去找人处理你。”抬了抬眉毛“虽然不知道你们怎么进来的。”"}
