{"time": 1775188096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812468335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就按你说的那样吧..”捂着头，希望斑比能少吸点"}
