{"time": 1775188203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1071499336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=08B45CECF31D4AF4E358AD0D04FBC2D6.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRbbS4CIiu_TIigM0SdGKkUio4WmRiibCD_Ciigi4ay49CTAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhDg9tYqucto4SJTVP_tFCBcegL0DIIBAmd6&amp;rkey=CAMSMEFD4PW4UU8XZraBJA_ygH8nmwhBoOOQJ4C3Zq3gAGULWEciDJv6Iiv4Vm33dKXumg,file_size=13858]"}
{"time": 1775188245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "994233420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你继续说”"}
{"time": 1775188286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1296069412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呵...\"一声冷笑打断了你们，\"处理我?\"斑比站起身，语气变得冰冷，\"你要做什么——处理我?\"天台瞬间被一股凉意笼罩，血色的纹路浮现在你的脚底，蔓延向四周。"}
{"time": 1775188568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590413971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没听清的话我可以重复一遍。你继续展开下去的话甚至都不用我花心思找人了。”有些抬不起头。即便似乎只是分身，压力也有些难顶，左手握住右手手腕上的手链，才觉得有些底气"}
{"time": 1775188575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1376219674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（狂！）"}
{"time": 1775188660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1716423690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啧...你，哎..”一时间不知道该怎么办，感觉自己才是最为难的那个"}
{"time": 1775188709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "146735186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露...要不你先离开？到时候要是我被赶出去了，起码你还能继续找”小声在她耳边说道"}
{"time": 1775188718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1729946657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（人奸屋檐了）"}
{"time": 1775188762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446748318", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“图书馆找一个叫希瓦娜的人..”再嘱咐一遍"}
{"time": 1775188771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457617950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（希古娜）"}
{"time": 1775188776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561471728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（tmd希瓦娜是龙女）"}
{"time": 1775188782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778301436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“图书馆找一个叫希古娜的人..”再嘱咐一遍"}
{"time": 1775189032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "770750275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"露莉亚看着地上的纹路，摇了摇头，\"跑是来不及的...\"\n斑比嗤笑了一声，\"仗着谁给你的保护，就有胆子压到我的头上了？\"她看着天台的地板，\"在你仰仗的人来之前，我有信心让这栋楼的人全部消失。\""}
{"time": 1775189093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564378612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱...别生气，你要抹消把她抹消就好了....还有你，快点给斑比道歉”"}
{"time": 1775189424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546062070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“可惜，我不像你。”看着诺薇拉，“我没有那种幻想……罩我的人也没有你们想的那么不堪。血族，血魔……能来马纳利亚念书的都是什么阶级的人，你不会不知道吧？”"}
{"time": 1775189449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538279168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这栋楼里，可有一位银龙……”"}
{"time": 1775189523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "873120343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "捂着脸，感觉一切都要完蛋了，自己对不起送自己过来的龙芙，对不起放自己进来的萨雷法........"}
{"time": 1775189577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361503599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哈哈，我已经在畅想回现代之后的死法了）"}
{"time": 1775189627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "551375031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你疯了吗，她现在抹消这栋楼所有人，艾琳不也死了？”"}
{"time": 1775189681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1369198612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那不就是赌她不敢，在说什么）"}
{"time": 1775189693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1782958619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（她像不敢的样子吗？）"}
