{"time": 1775380488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1566838269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我说你拦的办法太低级了，你用血鬼术不就好了)"}
{"time": 1775380516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50975693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伊芙在诺薇菈动手之前抢先拉开了门"}
{"time": 1775380544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456893823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "眼看她要逃走，又拉不住，用血快速凝成网试图直接挡住她下楼的路"}
{"time": 1775380636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "226059422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "鲜血编织的网格生生挡在了下楼的楼梯上"}
{"time": 1775380720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865630137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "既然匕首一直握在手上……虽然本质不是用来劈砍的，但事已至此……咬着牙，朝着网上砍去"}
{"time": 1775380725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891481770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，我还没吃饭）"}
{"time": 1775380833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253465367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "当匕首与网接触时，直接控制一部分血沿着她匕首逆流，与网一同将她捆绑缠住"}
{"time": 1775380930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "122114434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "匕首斩开了一部分的血网，但更像是有意避开了你的刃锋，猩红的血液沿着刀身蔓延向上，作势要缠住你的手臂。"}
{"time": 1775381052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073133011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呃……”踩着楼梯，右手尽力拉扯着，左手把那瓶出血性毒素拿出来泼在血网上，寄希望于能破坏凝血性"}
{"time": 1775381180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "674097163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "网逐渐向后收缩，同时连同地面也覆盖，从四面八方向伊芙身上收缩"}
{"time": 1775381307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191551340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "毒药里的抗凝血素确实起了作用，你面前的血网坍缩，化为血水，但未触及到的部分则按照预期向你收缩而来，尽管正面出现了极大的缺口。"}
{"time": 1775381477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1071385452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "绝对不要成为那种东西，否则自己的来路和去路都会崩塌的。所以面对楼梯的选择是……跳！摔伤什么的之后再考虑吧"}
{"time": 1775381486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "633153525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（要是会鱼跃就跃了）"}
