{"time": 1775383730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791432063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你刚准备动嘴，\"做得倒是不错。\"寂静的楼梯间响起斑比的声音，\"过了这么久也算有了些长进。\"你刚刚弄出去的血逐渐汇拢向伊芙，停在她周围打着圈。"}
{"time": 1775384019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1752563364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”眼看血网成型，和逐渐逼近的两个人，心中闪过一瞬间的死志，眼神曾有那么一丝放空。不过随后想起了什么，用最后的魔力尽量拖延血网收缩的时间，把凤凰的羽毛盖在胸前，随后用尽全力把匕首朝羽毛所在的位置扎去，像是要把自己扎个对穿"}
{"time": 1775384615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987384183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这动作是不是太显眼太长了)"}
{"time": 1775384622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209948245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(翔哥没有反应吗？)"}
{"time": 1775384625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2050194786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...咳咳...谢谢斑比酱夸奖..”吃那一下还是不太好受，随后便看到伊芙又动了起来，虽然不知道她要干嘛，但拼尽全力拦住她"}
{"time": 1775384629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "992266233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（刚刚在洗澡）"}
{"time": 1775384827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "255276392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伊芙伸手欲要够到羽毛的手腕被诺薇菈抓住"}
{"time": 1775384878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264791523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啧...你要干嘛”把她手捆住，然后匕首直接拿走"}
{"time": 1775385100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "852570376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……你还真是，不遗余力”挣扎无果，此刻当真是万策尽了。卡珊德拉应该知道这里的事，但她没吱声，多半是叫她也没有。各种意义上都虚弱得不成样子，坐在墙角低着头，只有眼睛能朝上看，死死地盯着这两人"}
{"time": 1775385106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706001321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "呃，这俩血族"}
{"time": 1775385146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "430713431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱...血裔之间是不是不能自相残杀啊”问一下先"}
{"time": 1775385389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "913268011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（该换位血战了）"}
{"time": 1775385665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236613908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有这种规定吗？\"地上的血汇聚成人形，比起刚刚似乎大了些的样子，她伸出手挑起伊芙的下巴，\"刚刚不是还在叫嚣吗？让我再听一遍，现在。\""}
{"time": 1775385735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2141044035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就好...”松一口气，到时候复仇的话应该不会被斑比拦住“但是斑比酱...把她转变了会不会被发现啊”指指天，小声在斑比耳边问道"}
{"time": 1775385765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2097235207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呵……”声音虚得很，眼皮疲惫地抬起来“会有那么一天……你们会后悔没直接杀了我”"}
{"time": 1775385921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "875831646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要不吸她几口血算了...”"}
{"time": 1775385942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690260815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（居然不是先抽干？）"}
{"time": 1775385949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588109400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（现在不抽以后没得抽了）"}
{"time": 1775386799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "699150073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（抽干有四升呢.jpg，够撑一个月）"}
{"time": 1775386897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858030899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊神呢）"}
{"time": 1775386900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622211740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真是无趣。\"斑比收回手，金发映照得眸子更加猩红，\"被发现了也无所谓，这世上能威胁我的存在寥寥，不过...\"她玩味地抓起伊芙的手腕，看着上面的手链，\"我倒是可以卖个面子。\""}
{"time": 1775386966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027277526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算你运气好，这次就放你一马”在旁边狗仗人势的说道"}
{"time": 1775387289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1827809253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "事到如今，得了便宜好像就不适合再卖乖了。真撕破脸她可能会很麻烦，但自己是真的会完蛋……所以只是沉默不语"}
{"time": 1775387587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1228336384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"继续说吧。\"斑比低头看着你，手转而拿住了一时微微闪烁的胸针，\"刚才的交易，准你复述。\""}
{"time": 1775387878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53269307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”稍作修改“每日100ml血液供应，换取你们……三个，不伤害艾琳，也不告知她相关事宜。相应地，我不会和其他人透露你们的消息”"}
{"time": 1775387895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1104209441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“洋荷要来的话……我会去劝她”"}
{"time": 1775388922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792796775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在其他人眼中，你最多是失联了一会。\"斑比摊摊手，她放开胸针，伸手点在你的手心，一个红色的点，像是一颗普通的痣。"}
{"time": 1775389058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1172360033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你要干嘛？”下意识要缩手"}
{"time": 1775389388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826982983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"一个标记，不重要。\"她转头看着你，\"顺便，她也是来解决这里的事态。\"斑比伸手指向诺薇菈。"}
{"time": 1775389487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2132513665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃个饭）"}
{"time": 1775389631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285028628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦。”简单地哦一声，不打算发表评论，当然也没打算合作"}
{"time": 1775389671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "684874006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你来的早，有听过希古娜这个名字吗”"}
{"time": 1775389802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1222866689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我要是说没有呢.jpg）"}
{"time": 1775390112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2042075172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有。”拍了拍身上的灰“不难打听吧，那么独一无二的存在”"}
{"time": 1775390132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433182923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你找到了？”"}
{"time": 1775390222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118813173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不知道她在哪”"}
{"time": 1775390661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "550485265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过她是不会闹出这种动静的”"}
{"time": 1775390716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "278010629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这是你们的事情。\"手办一般的斑比伸了个懒腰，随后人形消散，血液收拢回到诺薇菈身体里"}
{"time": 1775390895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336378288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那她应该可能大概也会对当前的处境有什么头绪吧，总比无头苍蝇强点”边说边把周围的血全部收回来"}
{"time": 1775390929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439365850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（如果玩mc你们想玩什么[CQ:at,qq=825734198] [CQ:at,qq=1252219916]"}
{"time": 1775390940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144596360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（huh）"}
{"time": 1775391045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636971867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我说过了，我不知道她在哪。”"}
{"time": 1775391081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629615169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那种事你得问她本人”"}
{"time": 1775391085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844232868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我知道啊，我只是解释找她干嘛”回收的也差不多了“你还能走吗”"}
