{"time": 1775393183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383649258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1837822269][CQ:at,qq=825734198] \"我们也回去吧\"看向露露"}
{"time": 1775393296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189583362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1383649258]\"发生什么了？\"露莉亚瞪了一眼伊芙的背影，走到你身边，小声询问。"}
{"time": 1775393355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "551045411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"没什么..\"摇摇头“斑比说给她背后的人一个面子，然后重新约法三章，让她走了”"}
{"time": 1775393363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1612865040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1837822269]离开了楼梯，你方才感受到寂静之外的喧嚣，鸟叫虫鸣再度回到你的耳边，刚刚的事情就像不曾发生一般。"}
{"time": 1775393540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448895562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*该回去吃饭了"}
{"time": 1775394094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504237977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=551045411]\"嗯。\"露莉亚点点头，看样子松了一口气，看了看你的头发，然后摇了摇头，没继续说什么。"}
{"time": 1775394098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "732565271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=448895562](回哪)"}
{"time": 1775394107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "890206579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么说，要不要mc）"}
{"time": 1775394117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239363980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（现在？）"}
{"time": 1775394118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037461672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（明天吧）"}
{"time": 1775394122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099570525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=732565271]（住院部啊）"}
{"time": 1775394134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2044464011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=A8456474D457B4CC2E842B5E6E107D24.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR8hTfd0jEbKSYN2dBrcBf4vndhwRjKXiD_CijZubrF4taTAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhCFwdyplQ483WTj7MR46gx4egKyVoIBAm5q&amp;rkey=CAISMM6vgYDacJzDW49Pnh2UhssgA8eRV8zSKFMn5t2mrq5xGJbRqSG63u2lGSWE5H_HeA,file_size=12106](你在三角洲？"}
{"time": 1775394146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092385708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（✓）"}
{"time": 1775394965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779381506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=504237977][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “那我们也差不多回去吧”"}
{"time": 1775395340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1330250998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=448895562]你离开了三栋宿舍，回到住院部的时候妃花已经醒了，正捧着你带回来的塔可小口小口吃着，看你回来，她慌忙地把面包放下，擦擦嘴，\"去哪了?\""}
{"time": 1775395354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479044766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=779381506]理所当然，艾琳问起你们去做了什么"}
{"time": 1775396098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1312099312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“聊了会天，然后她就走了”摊摊手"}
{"time": 1775396413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "80258832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "握紧拳头“……去找艾琳了。确保了一下她的安全”"}
{"time": 1775396809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013859612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1312099312]\"只是这样?\"艾琳盯着你，\"刚刚总有种...发生了什么不太好的事情的感觉...\"随后她低下头，\"呼...\"欲言又止，最后没说什么。"}
{"time": 1775396828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342739179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=80258832]\"刚刚调动了我的魔力，嗯...做了什么吗？\""}
{"time": 1775397069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138293408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有人来闹事而已。”摇摇头“弄醒你了？不过，量倒是超乎想象……谢了。”"}
{"time": 1775397087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565043120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*琢磨着买手套的事，说起来胸针还回来了吧"}
{"time": 1775397147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757782488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "胸针倒是没有拿走。\"嗯...\"她点点头，\"伊芙要多小心...我刚刚感觉到你那边有很深的恶意...幸好，你用了我的魔力。\""}
{"time": 1775397292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036664244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呼，不过饭还没来得及吃就着急忙慌过去还是太有负担了……”坐回床上，重拾自己的午饭“好累……”"}
{"time": 1775398663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1633587051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2036664244]\"嗯...吃过饭好好休息一下。\"妃花揉着自己的眼睛，\"熬夜好难受...下次不许这样了。\""}
{"time": 1775399016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485736680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1013859612][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “没事啦...再说在学校内还能发生什么事吗”"}
{"time": 1775399269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716174471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1633587051]“嗯。”有些疲惫“下午有什么打算吗？”"}
{"time": 1775399345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "486032436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1485736680]\"嗯...很难形容那种感觉...就像是下意识地...起了鸡皮疙瘩?\"她皱了皱眉，然后摇摇头，\"你们之间有什么矛盾吗？\"她的目光在你和露莉亚之间来回打量。"}
{"time": 1775399541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "119785523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....是有一点啦，对了，艾琳，下午我们准备和艾琳奈一起在校园里逛逛，你要去吗”"}
{"time": 1775399841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157194503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=716174471]\"继续睡一会...吧？\"妃花再次拿起刚刚放下的塔可小口小口吹起来，低着头，带着些笑看向你，\"呼...虽然护士小姐有说过...但是真没想到...居然会住院，什么的...\""}
{"time": 1775399944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017589746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=119785523]\"嗯...\"艾琳奈似乎眼睛一亮，认可地点头，\"我怎么没想到，艾琳一起去的话...\"她拿起桌上的笔记，\"我也不耽误...\"随后她想起了什么一样放下，\"艾琳要是有自己的事的话...就算啦...\"她的目光却落在你的身上。"}
{"time": 1775400001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380282457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=157194503]“哦……说起来，忘了问谁把我们送过来的了”回想一下“昏迷之前好像瞥到一眼，好像是金发？”"}
{"time": 1775400030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421069375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾琳怎么说”期待的看着她"}
{"time": 1775400212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328031527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=421069375]\"唉...\"她叹口气，\"好吧，既然都这么说了，那我也就一起吧。\""}
{"time": 1775400340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "44157178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=380282457]\"嗯...得好好感谢她才行...\"妃花也点点头，\"但是完全没留下什么信息...\"她闭上眼，\"虽然最好是回宿舍啦...不过在这里躺下也很舒服...\""}
{"time": 1775400409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372001562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……休息一会再去好了。”揉揉眉心，也闭上眼，就这么先躺下"}
{"time": 1775400607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "926935079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“太好了...”开心“那我们什么时候出发”"}
{"time": 1775400704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026831069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=926935079]\"如果想休息一下的话，就午休之后吧。\"艾琳淡淡开口。艾琳奈则是看上去随时都可以的样子。"}
{"time": 1775400726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1268830431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好，那就午休之后吧”自己自然也没什么意见"}
{"time": 1775400811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800567395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1372001562]毕竟是住院部，松软的床垫和被子里里铺着天鹅绒，锁住了正午刚好的阳光，软得恰到好处，暖得也恰到好处。"}
{"time": 1775400829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584952442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "睡！"}
{"time": 1775400870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588379435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1268830431]露莉亚和艾琳先后上了自己的床，只剩艾琳奈还留在下面。"}
{"time": 1775401074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103028471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自己也去睡了"}
{"time": 1775401549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878288918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "午后片刻闲暇，再醒来的时候已经将近半下午。\n一边是安静的病房，另一边，宿舍里除了你以外已经全部醒了过来，露莉亚在整理自己的教材，艾琳奈咬着笔头，皱眉看着笔记本。艾琳似乎在进行魔力放出的练习，一直有些呲呲的声音"}
{"time": 1775401941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348159252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "揉了揉脑袋，看看妃花有没有醒。打算去医疗区"}
{"time": 1775406548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294399480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "()"}
