{"time": 1775412478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043566572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] ）"}
{"time": 1775412494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1951632421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1228391483]（然后呢.jpg）"}
{"time": 1775412544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1465428367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去艾琳奈身旁“艾琳奈看起来好苦恼的样子，作业吗？”"}
{"time": 1775412598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860398750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1465428367]\"嗯...\"她打了个哈欠，\"功课好难...\""}
{"time": 1775412641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050757129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1348159252]妃花睡得很香，不如说中午醒来这件事反而很奇怪。"}
{"time": 1775412660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1603004731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那自己肯定帮不上什么忙了“加油”自己能做的也就这些了"}
{"time": 1775412757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "610612163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1050757129]反正只是去打听下人，自己去就好了。顺了顺头发就出发"}
{"time": 1775412770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "719467307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1603004731]\"没事没事。\"她合上本子，\"反正艾琳会教我啦。\"拍拍手，\"怎么说?\""}
{"time": 1775412807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287499021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么说，艾琳，露露”问问她们两个"}
{"time": 1775413441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246982024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=287499021]\"嗯...那就走吧。\"两人收拾了一下桌面，整洁地和旁边的艾琳奈形成了鲜明对比"}
{"time": 1775413459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30349921", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=610612163](去哪，做什么)"}
{"time": 1775413510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "449867457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=610612163]住院部和静思室隔了十来米，只是出门往右，就看见了那座红砖的小教堂"}
{"time": 1775413560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747323883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那拜托艾琳奈和艾琳带路了，带我们两个在校园内随便逛逛”"}
{"time": 1775413592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1673768339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“上次来这儿还是上次呢……”推门而入，直接找前台“你好”"}
{"time": 1775413689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "345543102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=747323883]\"随便是很要命的词诶?\"艾琳开口，一本正经，\"轻易说出这样的话，会让做决定的人很为难。\""}
{"time": 1775413716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409724757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm”看眼学校地图"}
{"time": 1775413794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "381695465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1673768339]里面还是和之前一样，暖色调的墙壁，几个软垫，看着不像是急诊的医院，反而像是心理咨询室。前台坐着一个你不认识的陌生女性。"}
{"time": 1775413805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696841948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1409724757](如此如此，这般这般)"}
{"time": 1775413824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1004981457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那先去教学楼看看？”思考一下"}
{"time": 1775413929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394916738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=381695465]“我应该是今天上午被抬过来的，吧。”指了指自己“请问上午是你值班吗？”"}
{"time": 1775414077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749023762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1004981457]点头，\"走吧，我们先去一年级的教学楼。\"\n这里你其实曾经来过，在走廊曾看见罚站的粉毛，不过那是很久以后会发生的事情了。"}
{"time": 1775414128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2023715815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "像小弟一样跟着艾琳后面"}
{"time": 1775414143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762197356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1394916738]她摇头，\"上午是耶拉小姐值班。\""}
{"time": 1775414234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708065890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦……这样，那你们有登记什么的吗？”想到要去找耶拉有点头疼“我想知道是谁把我送过来的”"}
{"time": 1775414236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1172069975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这位橙色长发的女性看上去天然带着庄重典雅的气质，甚至有些不近人间烟火，回答话起来声音也不高不低。"}
{"time": 1775414267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102594132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2023715815]她带着你很快转了一圈，\"你应该知道课表吧？明天下午有魔导器的课程...嗯...你收到过希姆教授的魔导器吗\""}
{"time": 1775414305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1346062056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“课表倒是有，不过魔导器”摇摇头“这个真没收到”"}
{"time": 1775414405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083683483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=27D09D2B726C4B4C8E58F0A0246F248D.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQFMFuQAdqWdoD938-4iIJ4lUXJzxid7wsg_woops6Ah67XkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQr1P-I3nTi1piDuF3c70CpHoCVDWCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMBGj5LjOZfuz2HiNqFxrc-cE6pQTYAEqviEngnnSvl69zBb-cCkgtQyK-_ClVzUcOQ,file_size=194461]"}
