{"time": 1775414445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58120118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1708065890]\"送你过来?这种事不会登记的。\""}
{"time": 1775414456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1476688009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可能是有过出场)"}
{"time": 1775414479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "233378273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（大大天使（）"}
{"time": 1775414554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1775653504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好……的吧。”叹气“我去找她……再见”按着之前的记忆，去找耶拉的办公室"}
{"time": 1775414583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116670329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1346062056]\"嗯...希姆教授给每个人都发过魔导器...没有的话...可能不太方便授课诶...\""}
{"time": 1775414631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804167526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“毕竟我们两刚入学么...要不去她办公室找下她？”"}
{"time": 1775414644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "9516232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“麻烦艾琳奈和艾琳带个路了”"}
{"time": 1775414691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120290863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1775653504](她真说了办公室吗)"}
{"time": 1775414781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1334756018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能没有（）"}
{"time": 1775414804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723834194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能去负责的病房区域找找门牌吧）"}
{"time": 1775414864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392794622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=9516232]\"嗯...如果你自己有魔导器的话，也许能和她申请一下?\"艾琳皱着眉开口"}
{"time": 1775414890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2057165805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（什么意思）"}
