{"time": 1775414900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1218955022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（难道不是没有才申请吗？）"}
{"time": 1775414988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112897110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你要是一开始自带也不需要)"}
{"time": 1775415056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2054225002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”从手上将风和土的戒指摘下来给露露递过去“这种应该也可以吧”"}
{"time": 1775415140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985274581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2054225002]\"这是魔导器吗？\"艾琳看着，倒是无法确认"}
{"time": 1775415179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382784665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这是吧”摧动水戒指在手上生成一个水球"}
{"time": 1775415212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132302665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=715209579]（总之去办公区找找吧，还是说这儿只有前台（）"}
{"time": 1775415269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569962496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=132302665](只有前台喵)"}
{"time": 1775415291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1306179638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*计划有变，去生命科"}
{"time": 1775415384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1048352165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=382784665]\"居然真的是诶...\"她看着你手里的五个戒指，有些吃惊，\"这些...都是吗？\""}
{"time": 1775415453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2106133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是啊...这是别人送我的礼物”"}
{"time": 1775415503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663959801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1306179638]生命科的所在地是一处恒温的花圃，无色透明的膜处在整个花园的上空。"}
{"time": 1775415647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422040453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "花园上有着数个大大小小的白色小屋"}
{"time": 1775415735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "166633833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这儿的环境倒是不错……明明纬度差不多吧。”看着遍地的植被“家附近只有无聊的树丛……找个人问问路好了。”"}
{"time": 1775415762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1134966379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2106133]\"哇啊...\"她捂了捂嘴，\"这么多...\""}
{"time": 1775415768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629725400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*随机找个看起来是本专业的问问耶拉教授的办公室在哪"}
{"time": 1775415904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727694068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1134966379]\"这些看上去品质都很优秀...一枚拿起来都可以做毕业的魔导器了...更别说还是定向元素类型...\""}
{"time": 1775415966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228029756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“原来这么珍贵吗...”爱璃西娅姐姐对自己真好"}
{"time": 1775416110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089454198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=629725400]\"耶拉教授...嗯...有名牌啦。\""}
{"time": 1775416231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1521264678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（话分两头，艾尔这边可就亏了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1775416283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1665210957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1089454198]“办公区在哪一块？不好意思，我刚入学……还没怎么来过生命科”"}
{"time": 1775416658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055298510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=228029756]\"嗯...\"她点点头，\"每一个都可以说是毕业级的。\""}
{"time": 1775416747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687951087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡了，晚安）"}
{"time": 1775416815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678414788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1665210957]\"这里的房子都差不多啦。\"她指了指里面的一小排房子，\"教授有单独的居所。\""}
{"time": 1775416893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767344865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢谢”那就去那联排房，找找耶拉的所在"}
{"time": 1775417170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1097004155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=767344865]左数第一间 华兹。左数第二间 亚必迭。你依次数下去，到了四五间的地方才看见耶拉的名字。"}
{"time": 1775417300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146502623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "敲门.jpg"}
{"time": 1775417599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27354813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"请进。\"门内传来轻轻的声音，\"这个时间会来的人...\""}
{"time": 1775417740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "101034141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“打扰了”推开门“下午好，耶拉教授。”"}
{"time": 1775417867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1275008588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"果然是你呢，辛德拉小姐。距离你上次来我这里也没多久的样子。\"她坐在自己的床前，看向你，\"你想知道什么?\""}
{"time": 1775418019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1097950813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好吧，我确实不只是专程道谢的”倒也不藏着掖着，开门见山“我想知道今天上午是谁把我们送去修道院的”"}
{"time": 1775418287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "293357968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1097950813]\"泉。\"她开口，背后的羽翼展了展"}
{"time": 1775418373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "434011792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……看来我没猜错。”顿了顿“说起来，您好像不吃惊”"}
{"time": 1775418421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311457936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我想你们应该认识，但是她走得很匆忙。\"她开口，\"毕竟不会有人连着搬两个人过来。\""}
{"time": 1775418819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934194679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"除此之外还有什么事吗？\"她看向你，\"看起来你好像很疲惫。\""}
{"time": 1775419202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1834273741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=934194679]“嗯……虽然拿来麻烦您有点没必要。”想了想“教授有什么推荐的入门治愈法术，或者相关的教材吗？”"}
{"time": 1775419500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2055780546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"治愈系?为什么会对这个感兴趣?\"她歪歪头看向你，\"这种魔法近似神术，并不是很受待见。\""}
{"time": 1775419655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391940076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“最近想进行一些，血液相关的研究。难免需要经常取些自己的血。”正视着她“因此……”"}
{"time": 1775419957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2131368095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"她哦了一声，\"可以哦，不过如果...你觉得自己可以接受一些片面的...评价的话。\""}
{"time": 1775420261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2124302997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不在乎那种东西”点点头，关上门走近了几步“怎么来的、为什么、谁说的什么评价我都不在乎。”"}
{"time": 1775420274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515374682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只要能派上用场就好了”"}
{"time": 1775420479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506922852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那还真是...\"她笑着摇摇头，\"这种旁门左道的魔法还真是适合你，你也算找对人了。\"手心流转出橙黄色的流光，\"这种魔法，在生命科只有我会哦?\""}
{"time": 1775423104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "332969159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=506922852]“是吗，那我还真是幸……”说到一半顿了顿，随后改口到“就当我时来运转了吧。我一定好好学。”"}
{"time": 1775424198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1188001854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=332969159]\"我还真是幸运，能遇见什么...愿意学习这种旁门左道的魔法的学生。\"她替你把话说完，\"好啦，你的疲劳很严重，需要好好修养。或者...\""}
{"time": 1775425816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681902745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“或者？”顺着她的话说"}
{"time": 1775426151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1541432997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我现在也可以帮你抚平一些伤痛——\"她后仰着身子，\"不过这终究不是自然的事情啦，对身体不太好呢。\""}
{"time": 1775426616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208890282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，不必了。”摇摇头“……会上瘾的”"}
{"time": 1775428098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885368715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=208890282]\"这样就好。\"她开口，\"大家讨厌这种魔法的一大原因...就是，很多人认为这是一种僭越...\"轻轻叹口气，\"毕竟...是对神术的拙劣模仿。\""}
{"time": 1775428294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "995592388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“模仿又不是坏事，替代品也……”说到这里好像想起了什么，叹了口气“算了，反正我真的见过天使，我觉得她们应该没意见”"}
{"time": 1775429178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970733731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=995592388]\"真的?\"耶拉笑了笑，机械的翅膀完全收拢于身后，\"嘛，是不是都无所谓嘛，反正这种模仿已经存在，就算不被认可，也是独属于我的东西。\"她对你点点头，\"每周的第一天第三天晚上来我这里。\""}
{"time": 1775429837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429550394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没问题。”点点头，总算露出些微笑"}
{"time": 1775429839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854352757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（今天周几）"}
{"time": 1775430033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81398816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(四吧)"}
{"time": 1775430443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "406249157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=429550394]\"如果别有安排的话，也可以自由发挥。我不在意考勤，毕竟这是你自己的事情。\"她看了看你的眼睛，转而递给你一张签了自己名字的通行证，\"虽然晚上生命科不开放，但是凭这个可以进来。\""}
{"time": 1775430575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "486731851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢谢教授。”双手接过来“……如果有机会，教授介意我宣传一下吗？”"}
{"time": 1775430746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "862075319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(耶拉的立绘应该不用再放一次吧)"}
{"time": 1775430850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1709944732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=486731851]\"我想你最好不要随意宣传，理由我已经说过。\"她比了个嘘声的手势，\"天使若是无意，却也是教会的禁脔呢。\""}
{"time": 1775431006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446968612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只会和亲近的人说啦。”点点头“那今天，我就先走咯？”"}
{"time": 1775431244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525144685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1446968612]\"祝你有一个愉快的周末。\"耶拉微微颔首。"}
