{"time": 1775499802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372523496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1328075620]\"嗯...\"她伸出右手欲要接过两个戒指，不过伸了一半停了下来，悬在你面前，五个指头都是空的，\"帮我戴上吧。\""}
{"time": 1775499855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336461297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎...好吧”将一个带在中指上，一个带在无名指上"}
{"time": 1775499879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412686438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（会相互磨其实）"}
{"time": 1775499899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1899085814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过五个指头都有的都戴上了）"}
{"time": 1775499933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470624808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我只能说想象一下五个指头都在戒指，感觉有点南蚌）"}
{"time": 1775499949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190097059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(怎么，你没见过阿米娅?)"}
{"time": 1775499991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1666966917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1997437530](去哪，自习什么？)"}
{"time": 1775500012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515639897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（先回住院部啊）"}
{"time": 1775500071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712964793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1336461297]她晃了晃手，看着手指上的戒指，露出些淡淡的笑容。\n艾琳没说话，避开了视线。艾琳奈很没眼力见地‘咦’了一声，随后被艾琳拉开了一些。"}
{"time": 1775500127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428580278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎哎...”想一下明天都有哪些课"}
{"time": 1775500130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117566209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1997437530]你回去的时候已经到了四点左右，某人不像是醒了，侧身躺着，头发遮住了一半的脸。"}
{"time": 1775500167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1273942991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可以，明天就能mc了（）"}
{"time": 1775500358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "586938083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=428580278]明天上午的第二节课是预言，下午第一节课是希姆教授的基础魔导器，晚上有一节每周五的班会例课。"}
{"time": 1775500560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505806450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说，艾琳姐，艾琳奈，预言课是？预言这种东西，感觉给人一种很玄的感觉啊”"}
{"time": 1775500603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1064042855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1117566209]过去拍拍“该醒了睡美人……总不能一直睡在这边。回宿舍去休息吧？”"}
{"time": 1775500739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "944437522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=505806450]\"就是...字面意思啦。\"艾琳开口，\"算是对未来轨迹的一种预测?嗯...听着很玄乎吧？其实没有相应天赋的人...也根本不可能懂的啦。\"\n艾琳奈认可地直点头"}
{"time": 1775500804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544539118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "点点头“未来如果能预测的话...说明一切发展都是注定的？”"}
{"time": 1775500822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1967895830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1064042855]\"唔唔...\"妃花睁了睁眼，睡眼惺忪，你不确定她有没有听完你的话，但是确实听见她用虚浮的语气嘟囔着，\"这里好软...又暖和...\""}
{"time": 1775500907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544646032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1544539118]艾琳摇头，\"正因为未来不是注定的，所以才会有预言这样的东西...在既定的未来发生前，一切对它的观测都是有意义的。\"她的话很公式，如果你翻开课本可能在其中会有一模一样的话。"}
{"time": 1775501070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2611814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1967895830]“宿舍里也一样的吧……”有些无奈，把她拖起来一点坐着，随后皱了皱眉“等等，你说的这里是被窝吗？”"}
{"time": 1775501229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277678887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2611814]\"嗯...?\"她似乎精神了一点，也回了些神，晃了晃脑袋，\"伊芙?现在几点了...?\""}
{"time": 1775501235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1723473786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可能明天上完课之后理解会更深点吧”摇摇头"}
{"time": 1775501482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247479176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1723473786]\"嘛，这些都是照本宣科。\"艾琳继续开口，你留意到她刻意和其他人都保持了一些距离，\"记住教室了吗？接下来去哪?\""}
{"time": 1775501549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "281840155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1277678887]“下午四点……睡了有一会了。”松开手“有梦到什么吗？”"}
{"time": 1775501596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "708545315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾琳姐和艾琳娜平常闲暇时候会去做什么？”"}
{"time": 1775501698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934498191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=281840155]\"没有啦...就是这里太暖和了，舍不得醒过来。\"她眨了眨眼，\"伊芙担心过头了。\""}
{"time": 1775501713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725539693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡了，晚安💤）"}
{"time": 1775501782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848433073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=708545315]\"我的话...\"艾琳奈嘻嘻接过话，\"会去街上到处逛逛，看看有没有什么新奇的东西吧，毕竟学校里的都看过...\"\n等她说完艾琳才开口，\"我一般只会在宿舍。\""}
{"time": 1775501821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527141908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=934498191]“嗯……”揉了揉额角“可能吧……抱歉。接下来就……办下出院，早些吃饭？然后回宿舍自习怎么样”"}
{"time": 1775502061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979091273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=527141908]\"明天是什么课诶...\"她转了下身子，从侧身变成平躺，一边碎碎念\"自习是对的...但是多睡睡也是对的...都是对的...\""}
{"time": 1775502099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2000670453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我怎么知道明天什么课.jpg）"}
{"time": 1775502217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018699737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“明天下午我要去找伊斯塔……”回想了一下“可能有魔导器的课……再说吧”"}
{"time": 1775502238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "367478759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(课表我都报过一次了)"}
