{"time": 1775502488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654703312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"妃花挪了挪，靠在了床头支起了半边身子，\"嗯...那今天确实要练习一下魔导器...不然会通不过教授的检验...\""}
{"time": 1775502549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894152891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（才发现终于100级了（）"}
{"time": 1775502559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532463920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（睡了）"}
{"time": 1775502635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737419602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1775522160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1879002740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=654703312]“走吧走吧。”"}
{"time": 1775523220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556173159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我去，你居然醒了)"}
{"time": 1775523226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628599397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1775523477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316656548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1879002740]\"诶...我现在好怀念当时的轮椅啦。\"妃花侧目看向你，瞳孔温润如翠玉，只是语气里带着些好笑，\"不用自己走路真是一件好事。\""}
{"time": 1775523628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1912717156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说不定魔导轮椅也是有的。”倒也不急，坐下来歇会“要是正常入学的话，说不定会选修这个吧”"}
{"time": 1775523636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1191991358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“魔导器制造什么的”"}
{"time": 1775523936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2145351635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"应该会有相关的课程?\"妃花闭了闭眼，靠着床头发呆，\"嘛...真希望能正常上完学啦...\"说完摇摇头，\"算了...能体验这种事情...本来就是奢望。\"她掀开被子，挪到了床边坐在你身边，微微喘息"}
{"time": 1775524213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "155280339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看着她沉默了一会，这才开口“……嘛，住院部当然也是会有轮椅的。再要一架就是了”"}
{"time": 1775524606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519629514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"算啦。\"她笑眯眯地靠到你的肩膀上，\"伊芙走得动的话，带着我就好啦...我又不想，做什么迷途之子诶——\"拖着长音"}
{"time": 1775524675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1492948270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（诶不是）"}
{"time": 1775524676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1727129288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={FA337AFD-D697-4D5D-B4CD-F41B286061B3}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-FA337AFDD6974D5DB4CDF41B286061B3/0,file_size=59048]"}
