{"time": 1775525005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2108511122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(本质迷路的孩子)"}
{"time": 1775525049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1873754509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“实话实说，我又不是肌肉派”拍拍自己的腿“虽然听起来有点变态，但说不定常备个轮椅真的很安心？”"}
{"time": 1775525258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644008150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“学校里有什么比较有趣的地方吗”"}
{"time": 1775525365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1185417544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1873754509]\"诶...这种话说出来就像默认之后会受伤一样。\"她用靠着的脑袋轻轻撞了撞你的肩膀，\"好不吉利的话。\""}
{"time": 1775525740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045073593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不是啊，走不动的时候坐在轮椅上会比趴在对方背上更心安理得一点嘛。”自己也懒得动“会飞就更好啦”"}
{"time": 1775525756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401035379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（3r是几级有属性点来着）"}
