{"time": 1775527063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737398378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“相互扶持也不是非得是字面意思……嘛，都行吧。现在要吗？”"}
{"time": 1775527339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720528494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=391010685]\"虽然我推荐啦...\"艾琳奈挠挠头，\"大部分地方都很有趣...不过最好玩的地方...果然还是炼金科的巢室\""}
{"time": 1775527480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369912151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那艾琳奈带路吧，就去那看看吧”"}
{"time": 1775528292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268193019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"艾琳奈点头，走在前面带路。"}
{"time": 1775528648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757602077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=737398378]\"不需要吧，伊芙在的话就够了嘛。\"她笑着拉了拉你，\"走吧?\""}
{"time": 1775529020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32663778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“走吧”拉着她站起来"}
{"time": 1775529163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1655397690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=32663778]你们顺顺利利回了宿舍，里面没人"}
