{"time": 1775530316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572425155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "走在路上随便聊聊“对了，学校内有没有什么勤工俭学的地方啊，马纳利亚的消费水平有点太高了”"}
{"time": 1775530489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1502430212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1572425155]\"应该有?\"艾琳探究地看了你一眼，\"一般都会是什么...嗯，类似图书馆管理，教授的助教，各系的一些特殊席位。\""}
{"time": 1775530538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619564253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“咦？那有没有那种，猎杀魔物之类的，就像小说里的冒险者协会那样的东西”"}
{"time": 1775530598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "874365575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*大概等到点了就去吃晚饭吧.jpg。好像没什么活"}
{"time": 1775530948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446037174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1619564253]\"有是有啦。\"艾琳点点头，\"不过学校里不会有这种东西。\""}
{"time": 1775531172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "847536241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（欢愉主有点搞笑，第一版是绯英专辅，第二版是狼尊专辅，第三版结果在狼尊和绯英中间选择了和）"}
{"time": 1775531324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513471847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊”若有所思的样子"}
{"time": 1775531574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1709237606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1513471847]\"而且，一般也不提倡，嗯...学生就参与冒险者的事宜。\"她继续开口，\"毕竟一般认为学生是没有能力完成冒险的任务。\""}
{"time": 1775531661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1713405709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这里不是咒术高专（））"}
