{"time": 1775545344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748789489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你的手指透过了这层透明的膜，虽然感觉到液体流动的冰凉感，但完全没有被打湿的触感。"}
{"time": 1775545382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631640523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1763650403](有吧，因为我很可爱，请给我钱)"}
{"time": 1775545403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820233549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好厉害....不过既然说是预言系的东西，他们平常就用这个做预言吗”"}
