{"time": 1775545626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1293296880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=820233549]艾琳奈眨眨眼，比了个继续往前的手势，可以卖了个关子。"}
{"time": 1775545655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176772705", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟在她身后，同时像四周张望"}
