{"time": 1775550736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226458308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=433948094][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “下面？感觉得是预言系高手才能去吧”"}
{"time": 1775550857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017466938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1226458308]\"嗯...教授和教授的弟子?\"艾琳解释道，\"一般来说每个系都有其核心的地方啦。\""}
{"time": 1775550924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665629058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真厉害啊...对了，刚刚提到的花圃？”"}
{"time": 1775551374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920707802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=665629058]\"那是生命科的地方啦，一个满是鲜花的温室。\""}
{"time": 1775551403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567365538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“听起来好像也很好看的样子”看看时间"}
{"time": 1775551522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373054001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "已经将近黄昏，下午的时间转瞬即逝。"}
{"time": 1775551644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "449411260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "吃饭去.jpg"}
{"time": 1775551754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2071242101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过看样子只改天去了....谢谢艾琳和艾琳娜，愿意带我们两个逛，让我们看到了这么好看的景观”"}
{"time": 1775552487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438790754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2071242101]\"嗯哼?既然都带你们出来了，今晚想好去哪里吃饭了吗?\"艾琳奈期待地看向你"}
{"time": 1775552581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87797029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=449411260]妃花一回宿舍就上了床，此刻依然没有起床的意思。"}
{"time": 1775553339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089370379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“额，没想好...艾琳奈有什么推荐的吗”"}
{"time": 1775553802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "842159160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=438790754]“妃花想吃什么？”站到她床位旁边，随口喊一嗓子“不愿动的话，我帮你带”"}
{"time": 1775555098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275501021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1089370379]\"校外的咖啡厅?我有一款想吃的梦龙蛋糕。\"艾琳奈摸了摸自己的嘴角。引得艾琳翻了个白眼。"}
{"time": 1775555214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "466316603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊.....”想下自己还有多少钱“那个....”不知道该怎么说"}
{"time": 1775555223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1629253435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个蛋糕多少钱呢”"}
