{"time": 1775555681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "94401520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1629253435]\"唔...两三个金币?\"她眨眨眼，\"怎么了？\""}
{"time": 1775555726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96105221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没什么，那我们走吧...”"}
{"time": 1775555738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122027317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "勉强大概还负担的起"}
{"time": 1775555806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1049574096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1501664168]“……”终于还是把气叹了出来“所以果然还是出问题了吧，妃花”"}
{"time": 1775555988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "99124765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2122027317]\"或者，今天去食堂吃也可以。\"艾琳奈看了看你，突然改了口，\"正好诺薇菈也没有去过食堂吧？\""}
{"time": 1775556031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795038539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“今天中午倒是去过一次食堂，感觉还蛮好吃的”"}
{"time": 1775556048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457538797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，就不能借坡下驴（）"}
{"time": 1775556437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325376474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1049574096]\"没...\"床上的人的声音很闷，\"伊芙...瞎操心...只是今天很想睡...睡过去就好了...\""}
