{"time": 1775562973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438827742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（问题不大）"}
{"time": 1775563198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511826738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1656176226]\"恐怕在你解释中午为什么不告而别之前，都不会收到类似的问好了。\"她收回手，双手抱在胸前，脑袋微微扬起，斜视着你。"}
{"time": 1775563254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286878397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=321319120]\"那种东西真的是蛋糕吗？\"艾琳奈皱眉，你们已经走到了校门前，\"说是蛋糕，更像是奶...嗯...奶油泡芙?\""}
{"time": 1775563326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "751997853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不用鸡蛋的蛋糕？感觉是布丁吧”"}
{"time": 1775563343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790180818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "努了努嘴，眼神飘向银币“我觉得这个也算问好的一种……中午，只是和她们商量了些事情，不用担心”"}
{"time": 1775563517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1344534243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=751997853]\"布丁会用不到鸡蛋吗？\"艾琳奈皱眉思考，大而圆的眼睛显得她有些娇憨，说着你们已经开始穿过校门，\"纯奶油的话...是不是更像奶茶?\""}
{"time": 1775563564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011837775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“常温冰激凌？”"}
{"time": 1775563611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462523441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=790180818]\"做了什么?我不关心。\"艾琳的上本事依然保持这个姿势，但是已经迈步往外走\"你们之间发生了什么...?一定有过什么，才对。\""}
{"time": 1775563673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946330155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2011837775]那股阻力感再度出现在你身侧 ，正在这时!"}
