{"time": 1775586386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960491969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=160973484]\"你之前说，她和艾洛温有仇，但实际上...态度来看...\"皱眉，\"应该是你对她做了什么，严重吗？\"叹口气，\"不管怎么样，这件事得摆平才行。\""}
{"time": 1775586392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1347821786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你想坐牢？）"}
