{"time": 1775586552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177132384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=960491969]“我要是说，其实不是我，你信吗？”背着手慢悠悠往外走，去隔壁商店“该说是误会还是一厢情愿呢？”"}
{"time": 1775586570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1835587977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=FAC6F7AAA2330ED0261C3095B9EE298B.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhT9rvei0MBjVFLIWW7V4cxguI3iSBir6wwg_woovZrwta_ckwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQTvYle4NgGCszv1McSL33eHoC-RaCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAESMFfR0R2voOzHt7ZEsxlQJSVJe11Mcwj-LyoRIVxVlf81BX642JWtC-6Gbayd4W8QhQ,file_size=210347]"}
{"time": 1775586590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "217946249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=946330155]校园卡发出微光护在你的身侧，阻力顿消，不一会儿就走出了校门。想来在校外你还有个据点的样子，艾琳奈轻车熟路地领着你们往一个巷子里走，一边哼着有些走调的曲子。"}
{"time": 1775586591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "124102614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（上次折神发这个不是说选亚索，然后我说菜刀队）"}
{"time": 1775586610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417224119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后我在评论区看到了更标准的答案 ap亚索）"}
