{"time": 1775586679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393847485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=565246274]（发条感觉不对啊，兰博大招不得烧死你这种没位移的）"}
{"time": 1775586704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "600874269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（正经来说感觉塞拉斯吧（）"}
{"time": 1775586711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045480565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=177132384]\"我总是会相信你。\"艾琳扶了扶额头，\"潜意识这么认为，虽然理性上...没有任何证据。然后呢?\""}
{"time": 1775586814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "828221507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是我我也选发条）"}
{"time": 1775586822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1312193032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（三个人都能带球进去）"}
{"time": 1775586837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1637792132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（兰博大招没那么变态，叉子不中就差点意思）"}
{"time": 1775587096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1623618912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我路过她的村子的时候，正好赶上天灾……说是人祸可能也说得过去吧。”在货架间游荡“人死的九九十十，我也命悬一线。结果刚好赶上她们回村，发现只有我还有气”"}
{"time": 1775587100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1921143775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个咖啡厅艾琳奈经常去吗”"}
{"time": 1775588027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602208045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（睡着了？）"}
{"time": 1775588034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1255631984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡着了？）"}
{"time": 1775610918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "251612593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我都不知道什么时候睡着的)"}
{"time": 1775614444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136352784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（问）"}
{"time": 1775614607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "415322243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可吧)"}
{"time": 1775615006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1515211612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1623618912]（）"}
{"time": 1775615084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393725033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1921143775]（）"}
{"time": 1775615211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1044576999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1623618912]紫色的瞳孔盯着你的眼睛，像是要把你看透一般，但很快就移开了直视的视线，过去也尝尝有这样的事。你的事情她总是不曾过多涉足。你听见她微不可闻地叹息一声，\"嗯...\"伸手拂过自己垂落的发梢，\"一路到现在，很辛苦吧...\""}
{"time": 1775615285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522106963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1921143775]\"嘛，一周会去一次到两次?\"艾琳奈停下哼歌，眨眨眼开口，\"主要是看那边什么时候推出新品啦...一周不吃饭也想尝一尝...也有这种时候吧...\""}
{"time": 1775615586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807239087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？那看起来真的很喜欢了”"}
{"time": 1775615636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448642750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=6B7EBBCEB3C6A99BA7BF3E8AA5BF6D7A.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTX2G2UK262oikCYCNXsEHhUXRoXBiIoQ0g_woot-3L2ZvdkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQgFevivbFWK89SSEvMP_2Z3oCt-uCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAQSMHKShLgfIbfRYLXL7pAkDHCdKD2ZfvciMqZJk1Wbjor-uQNv-tpJBDKc0K8Kkmcoqw,file_size=217224]"}
{"time": 1775615644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "147099061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你右手加强了）"}
{"time": 1775615668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727164074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这幅度诗人啊）"}
{"time": 1775615669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1232895116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不加强我也随便杀)"}
{"time": 1775615823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743791289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1807239087]\"嘛...毕竟我也没什么钱啦...平常都是靠卡里每个月的补助过日子...\"艾琳奈不好意思地笑了笑，\"唉...要是能管住自己的嘴的话就更好了...\""}
{"time": 1775615823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579966041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1044576999]呼吸顿了顿，因为无处安放而在货架上游走的手放下来，连带着眼神也低下去，低着头朝她那边靠了靠“嘛……突然说这种话，万一把我弄哭了怎么办？”"}
{"time": 1775616154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947406711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1579966041]\"那就只能是小哭包自己的问题了。\"她轻轻笑出了声，伸手揽住了你，另一只手拂了拂你的眼眶，\"这不是没有哭吗？\"一双精致的浅紫色瞳孔离得极近。"}
{"time": 1775616736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994614725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "差不多应该也快到了吧"}
{"time": 1775616780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "255076551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（悲报，刷怪笼刷多少怪自动爆掉那个mod没有这个版本的，似乎只能用火把了）"}
{"time": 1775616892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123100575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真是……”抿了抿嘴，用余光看着那双眼睛“对我这样的人，不用表达理解也可以的。我可是带着很艰巨的任务踏上旅途的，忍不住在你这里停下来了怎么办？”"}
{"time": 1775616923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2119398655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（咦，好像找到能用的了）"}
{"time": 1775617270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010109528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1994614725]确实到了，而且有点眼熟，这家店似乎就是之后广场街角的那家咖啡厅，你去过不止一次。"}
{"time": 1775617335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984150285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“原来是这家啊...”"}
{"time": 1775617347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1064614423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "找个偏僻的角落坐下"}
{"time": 1775617767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523667760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1123100575]\"难道我会有什么意见?\"她轻轻笑着 不过主动松开了你，\"不过我也无意打断你那艰巨的任务——但今晚的时间恰好很长...\"瞳孔扫到一侧的货架上，拿起了一条红色的发带。"}
{"time": 1775617808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859657467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1064614423]\"原来...这家?\"艾琳奈听到你的话停在门口，扭头有些不解地看向你，\"诺薇菈不是第一次来吗？嗯...\""}
{"time": 1775617840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1312386847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“之前来过一两次啦....”"}
{"time": 1775618209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331099791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1312386847]\"诶...不是经过长途跋涉才来的嘛？\"她推开门，对着里面的老板打了声招呼，\"今天要梦龙蛋糕!\"\n里面的装潢和之后有所变化，现在显得简约了很多，没有之后那些堆砌的书刊"}
{"time": 1775618279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1686072334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对啊....但在来到中环之后，去学院之前，来过这里么”"}
{"time": 1775618458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1306686246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1523667760]“停下来恐怕也只是早晚的事。”随便逛逛，不打算现在就去拿危险物品“毕竟在意的事情越来越多，指不定哪天就让天平换个方向倾斜了……”"}
{"time": 1775618529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099111239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过讽刺的是，如果没有这么些事情……靠我自己的话，有生之年不知道能不能完成那个任务”"}
{"time": 1775618794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299678242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1686072334]她走到靠窗的一个桌子边坐下，\"嘛，虽然我有点好奇...好吧，我就是很好奇。诺薇菈和露莉亚之前在做什么...为什么要到这里来...嗯...\"她看着窗外发呆，\"艾琳什么也不说，但我也不是那么笨啦...\""}
{"time": 1775619078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1865740393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1099111239]\"我能帮上忙吗？\"她拿起丝带走到你身后，\"或者说，要我帮忙吗？哦...不要动哦?\"她的手指卷上你的头发."}
{"time": 1775619180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "797401215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看眼露露"}
{"time": 1775619220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341267324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也没做什么啦.....就像我之前说的那样啦”"}
{"time": 1775619350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "472649742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1865740393]“不建议你来淌这浑水哦？那句话怎么说来着……”听她的话站住不动，说起来不是还没付款吗？“你和伊斯塔把日子过好比什么都重要”"}
{"time": 1775619407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2135097272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1341267324]\"果然还是不可以说啦。\"她的视线从窗外收回，\"就当我没问过好啦，你们也去看看想吃什么?\""}
{"time": 1775619705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1049289579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=472649742]\"姐姐...\"她的话停了一瞬，\"毕竟是姐姐...我应该不用...很操心...\"此乃谎言，不过手上的动作不停，丝带在你的发间穿过，在右后脑上绑出了一个漂亮的蝴蝶结。"}
{"time": 1775619883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242075202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看眼菜单“艾琳奈除了梦龙蛋糕还想吃什么吗”"}
{"time": 1775620027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714174454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=242075202]\"蓝莓慕斯?嗯...这种夹心泡芙也很不错。\"说着她摇摇头，\"诺薇菈不用想着我啦，我要是想吃的话会自己买的。\""}
{"time": 1775620077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "798659622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1049289579]“需要的哦，要说为什么……就当是我的直觉吧。”家族传统真是可怕的事情“自认要照顾人的人最擅长勉强自己了……真是的，有这种觉悟的话就不要让人担心啊……”声音越来越小"}
{"time": 1775620136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519264352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没关系啦，艾琳奈下午带我们逛了那么久，请你吃点东西也合情合理啦”"}
{"time": 1775620174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277012298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露呢，吃什么”"}
{"time": 1775620189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887371020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是啊，吃什么）"}
{"time": 1775620543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007294347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(看不出来你钱还不少)"}
{"time": 1775620630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617487021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=798659622]\"...\"艾琳的手停了停，\"呼...不用说我也知道的，好啦。仅限今天这个很长的晚上，要想去的地方吗？\""}
{"time": 1775620734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186527748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "很不解风情地开口“没有……还要给妃花带晚饭来着。”说起来，是不是刚刚戴上了头绳？于是开始找镜子"}
{"time": 1775620887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734975233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(总之我调了好久，现在刷怪笼刷10只怪就会自动停止刷，不过出了点小bug"}
