{"time": 1775665437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987761636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1667648165]“好像稍微差点意思……还没见过这儿的舞厅”幻想着并不会出现的舞步，寻找香辣的香味找着目标"}
{"time": 1775665468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286732657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(感觉不太重要，但是万一用的上呢)"}
