{"time": 1775665586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1317331229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=432534181]\"没关系——\"短发很柔软，她一边被你摸着一边从兜里摸出一把奶糖放在餐盘上，\"送给艾琳奈姐姐，今天要开心哦～\""}
{"time": 1775665619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781332078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1775665664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "973973500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=987761636]\"你想参加了？\"她跟着你走，很快就到了这家柜台前，\"嘛，虽然早就知道你是耐不住寂寞的类型，但社交的需求未免也来得太快了吧。\""}
{"time": 1775665876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "324878846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真的假的，我自认为我还挺能接受孤独终老的。”和她一起排队“无非是宴会上有些少见的事情会变得很正常”"}
{"time": 1775666182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1296622621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1317331229]\"当然还有这两位姐姐...\"她又摸了摸，又拿出一把水果软糖放在餐盘上，\"送给姐姐们，艾琳奈姐姐的朋友都是好人...\""}
{"time": 1775666205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677390986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢你啦小朋友，你叫什么啊”"}
{"time": 1775666288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062507030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=324878846]\"看你这几天火急火燎的，哪有半分孤独终老的样子。\"她耸肩，\"而且也没见过你一个人做什么吧？骗骗我可以哦?\""}
{"time": 1775666369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194595903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=677390986]\"艾玛...\"她抬头对你露出一个明媚的笑，粉色的瞳孔一眨一眨，带着这个年纪特有的稚嫩和天真，很是可爱。"}
{"time": 1775666410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1102079375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你好啊艾玛，我叫诺薇拉，她叫露莉亚”"}
{"time": 1775666464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971419691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我讨厌魔裁（）"}
{"time": 1775666510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206222125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（为什么）"}
{"time": 1775666541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310220972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我也不太喜欢，但是你是为什么?)"}
{"time": 1775666604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374280939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2062507030]“不一样啦，我倒觉得现在认识的人太多了。”一样耸肩“如果一开始没有认识的话，我可以在自己的书房里呆到发霉……什么的”"}
{"time": 1775666619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2000330067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（赫赫）"}
