{"time": 1775666739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1567209782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=5BF05CDF0FD69FF05C4D3A8009676424.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQ7aMjiYWsQJJ0CgMlWrh2NHoaT-hix2QUg_wooiIm_idrekwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQS5Dj854rWTU0J5tKsrn-OXoCJhOCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMF2D1kCUcT4fnwWXAUCKGmgAZVzwRKI36FV3nMC5NV17fXnxyzqrQEmyBjNCOe5Kzg,file_size=93361]"}
{"time": 1775666796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047772371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1102079375]\"诺薇菈姐姐，露莉亚姐姐。\"她像是要把你们记住一样，一人复述了一边，然后点点脑袋，\"今天要开心哦。\"蹦蹦跳跳着离开了。"}
{"time": 1775666867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "356027756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=374280939]\"哼～\"她轻哼一声，大概有些不置可否的意思，"}
{"time": 1775666872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186761602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说起来，这东西怎么点单)"}
{"time": 1775666888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445838107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我真服了匈牙利炖菜)"}
{"time": 1775666903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1242401361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（按份点呗）"}
{"time": 1775666938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "707392233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1055456152][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “她不是很陌生是什么意思？”"}
{"time": 1775666975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1825855019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*自己倒是没那么喜欢辛辣口，不过懒得排别的队伍了，点个同柜台的红烩饭"}
{"time": 1775667047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "147084022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=356027756]\"一份，嗯...\"艾琳看着制作的过程，看见翻飞的调料静静补充了一句，\"不用加太多辣椒。\"她看向你，\"感觉对我而言都有点过量了...你吃得了吗？\""}
{"time": 1775667230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661633281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=707392233]\"就是感觉啦...感觉...\"她拿起装着牛奶的杯子，轻轻抿了一口，\"自己应该认识她，这样的感觉，但是明明从来没见过...\""}
{"time": 1775667257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137974198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？这么玄乎吗”"}
{"time": 1775667264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101796485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "抿一口可可"}
{"time": 1775667282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68153347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……应该，不太行……我的那份只要一半……不，微辣吧”缩了缩脖子“虽然和现状无关，不过听说吃辣的时候哭的话分辨不出来是辣的还是伤心”"}
{"time": 1775667497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250366405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2101796485]\"啊...\"她放下杯子，手拍在一起，\"就和那个...那个话剧啦，这个妹妹我哪里见过一样，艾琳还有...辛德拉同学我都有类似的感觉啦。\""}
{"time": 1775667590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946347202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？前世缘分？感觉越说越玄乎了”"}
{"time": 1775667619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076528511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=68153347]\"这算什么?\"她拉着你去到等餐的队伍，\"突然想起来的tips，还是冷笑话?\"她生硬地笑了两声，\"我笑了，很成功。\""}
{"time": 1775667797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "45272036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“想到哪里说哪里咯。”等餐的时候站着闭上眼，现在倒有点像洋荷了“虽然知道不太可能，但现在是不是有点像那什么……闺蜜？”"}
{"time": 1775667956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893383137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=946347202]\"没那么玄乎吧。\"她开始切起自己的蛋糕，里面的流心奶油流满了一片餐盘，\"只是一种感觉啦...也不影响各自的生活，说出来给你们聊聊天。\""}
{"time": 1775668008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181790424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“明天就知道了”在喝一口可可“对了，辛德拉是谁？”"}
{"time": 1775668016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375754061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=45272036]\"少来，你才认识我几天。\"她拍开你的手，偷笑到声音却传到你耳边，\"哎呀呀，这里有个自作多情的人呢～\""}
{"time": 1775668186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "774354854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1181790424]\"嗯...?\"她皱眉看着你，一时没开口。\n露莉亚放下咬了一口的马卡龙，叹了口气，指了指自己的太阳穴，\"你再想想，诺诺。刚刚才见过的。\""}
{"time": 1775668260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1753492239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（oh，原来我知道龙神化名辛德拉啊）"}
{"time": 1775668286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489933974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "锤一下自己的脑袋“hhh，年纪老了，脑子不好使了”"}
{"time": 1775668491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903662232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=489933974]\"...\"对方一时间不知道应这句话。\n\"我看确实。\"露露说完继续解决自己的马卡龙，同时给你递了一个绿色的。"}
{"time": 1775668572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2405284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=375754061]“几天？”像是反问，手还停在原处“可不是自作多情，只是说说而已……毕竟，是不可能的事嘛，说过的吧？我也姓摩根，所以我们应该算一家人才对”"}
{"time": 1775668594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "256395834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“春风若有怜花意，可否许我再少年”接过绿色马卡龙，小口小口的进食"}
{"time": 1775668737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107779949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你无敌了）"}
{"time": 1775668739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1433788992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你待会是不是要说蝴蝶飞不过沧海了)"}
{"time": 1775668847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "344116682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2405284]\"嗯哼?如果不是分家的话，最起码也是本家来的人吧。\"她接过自己的餐盘，红润润的油光昭示着辣度，\"毕竟我自认在家族里只是小透明，不会有其他人调查我的。\""}
{"time": 1775668953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1641705197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=256395834]香草和巧克力的味道充斥着口腔，充盈的糖分确实让人很是满足，不过手里的杯子却被露露拿走，双手握着轻轻啜饮。"}
{"time": 1775669003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "746744765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好好吃啊...”但感觉有点奇怪，按理说应该不是索然无味才对么"}
{"time": 1775669030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1268250961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，喰种）"}
{"time": 1775669232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441728373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=746744765]没人会回答你在内心里的发言，桌上一时没人说话，看起来都被糖分暂时征服了。"}
{"time": 1775669263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "202899301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "仔细品尝一下，感受下有没有血的感觉"}
{"time": 1775669380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1796447391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=202899301]并没有什么血的味道，就是普通的食材。"}
{"time": 1775669419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1716422953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不应该啊，怎么这么好吃"}
{"time": 1775669444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588702808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自己好久没体验过这种感觉了"}
{"time": 1775669498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "806612903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个，我去在点个东西”起身去前台点份曲奇吧"}
{"time": 1775669829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153628686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=806612903]“...”露露看着你，似乎想说什么，但是最后什么也没说，收回了视线，毕竟是你自己的决定。“怎么了？”反倒是艾琳奈开了口，“要是不够的话...诺薇菈可以试一下我这个啦...”"}
{"time": 1775669880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "100677389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？可以吗，我就尝一小小口”"}
{"time": 1775670006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242413509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"她点头，拿出刀叉分了四分之一的蛋糕出来，奶油从里面流出得更多。"}
{"time": 1775670041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1465221537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=8A9A314B2E19194B0952B229EC570038.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTdAI-CZtkP0Vg41j_xFaMfw6oThxiFvgsg_woo5tDRr-bekwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQRT-vi90Jd-XXds4hGUn2tHoCNjGCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMJpXmCNPgSnSjV0Se0IdeCk5No7Yx-uP2OwUlxlSZ8R3PjW-wkujbPm2OIGiWTOWiw,file_size=188165]"}
{"time": 1775670063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1927669123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“太多了...”只取了一半“这么多就够了 谢谢艾琳奈了”"}
{"time": 1775670102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "797889120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后继续小口小口的尝试"}
{"time": 1775670221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1400815124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "外壳的巧克力脆脆的，但是入口即化，内层的蛋糕松软，配上软得几乎要烂掉的奶油，你的味蕾奇怪地满足起来，餐盘上还有不少奶糖和软糖，露莉亚从里面挑了一个绿色的递到你嘴边。"}
{"time": 1775670339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133639286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "直接吃下那颗糖“谢谢...好好吃...”好奇怪，怎么会这样，有些搞不懂，收起一颗糖，到时候给斑比尝尝"}
{"time": 1775670368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399332198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡了喵）"}
{"time": 1775670440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1750791169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是好困)"}
{"time": 1775670442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000588827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我是怎么了)"}
{"time": 1775670446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445471713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(今天睡好久)"}
{"time": 1775688212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "43199899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=344116682]“别说的那么生分嘛。”搓了搓鼻尖，忍住打喷嚏的冲动“什么叫调查啦，我的动机很单纯的”"}
{"time": 1775688236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1872487482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你是?)"}
{"time": 1775688304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1170189560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（听到折神喊伊神）"}
{"time": 1775688308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1030473896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不小心醒了睡不着）"}
{"time": 1775688311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1509664980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（很难受）"}
{"time": 1775688326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891756642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不急，再试试睡会）"}
