{"time": 1775693801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314164349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么粥起来了）"}
{"time": 1775697782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "141845457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(蛋糕奶茶好像确实不错)"}
{"time": 1775697788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93361843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(感觉像在喝蛋糕)"}
{"time": 1775697855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171107681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1775697875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504917463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然我大概知道是什么个味道，但是这个描述有点）"}
{"time": 1775698442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2014652211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过红烩比起辣椒应该番茄更多吧）"}
{"time": 1775698552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112841064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你懂的，我不知道)"}
{"time": 1775698573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "815571770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我只能说先看看辣了再说)"}
{"time": 1775698813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96385550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=DD8CED241C907D64CEC209C076B7A398.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSTt0SKl6V-t0TaYMHItX351eqsLRiosAog_wootOS8x9HfkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQBpFZX0bspwVv91yWSDyeEnoCnlWCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMMgtxYcwmwUFYwJFnwfExYuFjYsp4k4dSo8UBntivIRCp62XGme9f-pTL2MHzhLgcw,file_size=170024]"}
{"time": 1775698817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1219505352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(虽然但是)"}
{"time": 1775698825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962577415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我觉得红色辣椒属于不辣的范畴)"}
{"time": 1775698927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123998103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（彩椒确实吧）"}
{"time": 1775698948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487713326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过红烩确实是番茄和红酒居多）"}
{"time": 1775701652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "277449470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=43199899]\"那就是没否认?\"她眨着眼开口，往一个四人座的空桌子旁坐下，用叉子有些兴致地拨开炖肉表面的蔬菜，拿叉子戳戳，\"结论面前，动机不重要。\""}
{"time": 1775702177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382275478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好像有什么误解……算了，不重要”舀起一勺裹满汤汁的烩饭“你就当我的接近是，但求心安？”"}
{"time": 1775702459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1797817560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=382275478]\"唔...就当是这样吧。\"她结束这个话题，小口吃起来，\"呼呼...还是有点辣...\"一边吃一边吹着气"}
{"time": 1775702676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213861239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "把勺中的那口吹凉一点再送入口中，差点就能和茄汁分庭抗礼的肉香很给人满足感，相比起来轻松不少"}
{"time": 1775702784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759574788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "入口还是微微带着辣意，\"听说辣味是一种痛觉哦?那喜欢吃辣的人是不是一般都很能吃苦?\"坐在对面的女孩带着调侃的语气响起，\"说起来我也算得上其中佼佼者。\""}
{"time": 1775702842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1922459003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能是酸儿辣女，吗）"}
{"time": 1775702906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760608075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2133639286]（）"}
{"time": 1775703042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861680740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不是同一种东西吧？硬要说的话其实更像困了的时候掐自己一把”侃侃而谈“这种程度我也可以——”把自己的盘子向她推一点，同时对她的盘子伸出餐叉"}
{"time": 1775703115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688478658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2133639286]林檎的香味在你齿间溢散，不喜欢水果软糖的都很没有品味。露莉亚笑着把手从你唇前拿开，自己捉起一只浅蓝色的塞入嘴里。"}
{"time": 1775703240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186039434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉这家店有点奇怪...算了不想了，先好好享受甜品算了"}
{"time": 1775703499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468279353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1861680740]她露出一个你可以吗的表情，把盘子推向你，\"但是长期吃辣不就是长期奋斗嘛，艰难苦困，玉汝于成。\"说完扬起脑袋，一副快夸我的样子。"}
{"time": 1775703557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213579566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1186039434]过了一会，曲奇被艾玛端上了桌。看上去都是刚刚新鲜出炉，表面焦脆，撒着熏黄的芝麻。"}
{"time": 1775703599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924495737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（曲奇撒芝麻不撒坚果很没有品味）"}
{"time": 1775703638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1113523199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大家都尝尝？”把曲奇推到中间，然后拿一个品尝"}
{"time": 1775703984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792089258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1113523199]入口酥脆，带着奶油的香甜，和某种坚果的芳香，想来是打碎和在面粉里，上一次吃这种小饼干还是在家里母亲给你做。"}
{"time": 1775704060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501192801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有点愣住了...眼角甚至留下了几滴泪水"}
{"time": 1775704210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "219954790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=468279353]“好好好，说明艾琳很厉害……如果可以的话我是不想吃苦啦。曾经的人生理想是按部就班到老死，偶尔关心一下不让人放心的姐姐”插起一块看起来颜色就不太妙的肉放进嘴里，嚼了几下就咳嗽起来，最后囫囵吞下肉块，吐着舌头哈气"}
{"time": 1775704269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "805901617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1501192801]\"怎么了...?\"露莉亚伸出手，应袖子拂去你眼角的眼泪，另一只手从身后环住你。"}
{"time": 1775704340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1930006579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...只是..有点..想家了”字一两个一两个的蹦出来，努力去控制自己冷静下来，不要失态"}
{"time": 1775704721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637627069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=219954790]\"那...听起来还不错。\"她看着你的样子不免有些窃笑出声，\"哈哈...说你不行啦。\"收回了自己的盘子，从随身的腰包里掏出一个小水杯递给你，嘴角勾着，捧着自己的脸看着你。"}
{"time": 1775705024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445430234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有点变态，感觉换个性别这里就是cigarette了）"}
{"time": 1775705026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887950232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1930006579]露莉亚拉了拉你，把你的脑袋拉进她的怀里，另一只手轻轻拍着你的背，\"不哭不哭...\"她对着艾琳奈比了一下，对方点点头，端着盘子去了另外一边，\"真是小哭包...但好在...我在这里...想哭就哭吧。\""}
{"time": 1775705074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8646716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(为什么是烟)"}
{"time": 1775705129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677109154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....”趴在露露怀里小声的啜泣，脑海里都是上次一家三口围在一起吃小饼干的温馨画面"}
{"time": 1775705209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410058930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=637627069]接过水杯，仰头往嘴里倒了两口——自然是不沾嘴。温度慢慢降下来，但脸上还是有点泛红光“……好吧，看了不是很有这方面的天赋”"}
{"time": 1775705263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904257754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一点儿子学父亲的模样偷尝烟酒发现完全接受不了还倍感疑惑的刻板印象画面吧）"}
{"time": 1775705285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1467728739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（品味的年龄局限性）"}
{"time": 1775705287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461331811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(感觉不如儿子拿父亲的阎魔刀)"}
{"time": 1775705305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330740566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没有任何局限性)"}
{"time": 1775705310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "684791057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(give me yamoto)"}
{"time": 1775705481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357708594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=677109154]她轻轻地拍着你的背，语气轻柔，\"有时候我也会过去的事情...嗯...\""}
{"time": 1775705554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239816291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=410058930]\"多练习就好了。\"她看完全程才算有些心满意足，\"这种东西只要多吃一吃，总有一天会习惯...哦，喜欢上的。\""}
{"time": 1775705597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711774775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“都怪...都怪这曲奇..太好吃了”"}
{"time": 1775705680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604291011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=711774775]\"小哭包...还找借口。\"露露弹了弹你的额头，\"我当然不是说要把那些事情放下...\"她拿着杯子喝了一口，可可的香味弥散，\"而是因为记着那些不能忘记的...我才能在今天继续坚持下去。\""}
{"time": 1775705768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874790014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我..都懂...”擦擦眼泪，也喝一口可可“我去卫生间洗把脸去...”"}
{"time": 1775705817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "726470903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1239816291]“光听着就挺痛苦的了……”指指自己的盘子“这不是挺好的么？”"}
{"time": 1775705911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1324446963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1874790014]\"真是。\"她的手帕递在你的手上，起身给你让开位子，\"快去快回哦?\""}
{"time": 1775705970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1384690425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=726470903]\"说不明白的。\"对方撇了撇嘴，看着你的盘子，\"啧，寡淡。\""}
{"time": 1775705979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61296493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯...”去洗手间狠狠的洗一下脸，把泪痕都洗干净"}
{"time": 1775706169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2056921904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=61296493]洗手间没有开灯，光照有些暗。镜子里的自己说实话有些不太体面，眼角的泪痕明显，眼神有些憔悴，连带着头发都黯淡无光。"}
{"time": 1775706170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023374273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1384690425]“平平淡淡才是真嘛。”轻松地扯淡，不多废话了 该干饭干饭，一会还得去帮妃花拿晚餐"}
{"time": 1775706204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336161029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "稍微打理一下，顺便确认一下是不是四下无人"}
{"time": 1775706313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636331483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=336161029]你环视四周，洗手间里当然没有其他人，除了你和你在镜子里的人像。"}
{"time": 1775706380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1387551554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "心灵对话一下“斑比酱，好奇怪啊，这的食物明明没有血气，但感觉吃着好好吃，是不是不太正常啊”"}
{"time": 1775706412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "802270829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1023374273]晚餐在和谐轻松的氛围里结束～"}
{"time": 1775706511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "643404577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么时候有那个环节）"}
{"time": 1775706521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "775645908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我的痛苦在你之上.jpg）"}
{"time": 1775706804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "372556120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1387551554]斑比没有回应，下一秒你似乎看见镜子里的自己眨了一下眼睛。"}
{"time": 1775706819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1603158368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1775706822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681419720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（掺冰了）"}
{"time": 1775706859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2021006920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "揉揉眼睛，然后轻轻敲敲镜子"}
{"time": 1775706908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470753151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=802270829]找张纸巾擦擦嘴“那，还要帮舍友带饭，我就先走咯？”"}
{"time": 1775707008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "771120484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=470753151]\"我还以为今天晚上会很长呢～\"她偏过头，同时摆摆手，\"不管了，你走吧。\""}
{"time": 1775707042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133246710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（忽然想到我之前锤头会不会锤到斑比（））"}
{"time": 1775707095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005450331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2021006920]你敲了敲镜子，镜子的自己没有动"}
{"time": 1775707103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712813969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2133246710](不会，她是血)"}
{"time": 1775707114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708465239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？？？？？？？？？？？？？？”"}
{"time": 1775707116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036945486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=771120484]“抱歉啦……”站起身来“改天吧。不过，不然你以为我期待舞会干什么？”"}
{"time": 1775707143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1249920451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没有动是一动不动？）"}
{"time": 1775707160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1536369864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(✓)"}
{"time": 1775707177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564601575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "稍微往后退几步“你...你..是谁”"}
{"time": 1775707197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "872472020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(草，这句话让我想起了五六七)"}
{"time": 1775707342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195398114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2036945486]\"谁知道呢～\"她坐着没动，手里摆弄着刀叉，斜眼看向你，\"兴许是想和帅气男生跳舞吧。果然是社交界冉冉升起的一年级新星。\"语气带着做作的遗憾"}
{"time": 1775707416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93741621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（已婚.jpg）"}
{"time": 1775707498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522010141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1564601575]镜子里的自己不仅没有后退，反而往前走了两步，手指啪嗒按在了镜子前，\"你...你...是谁\""}
{"time": 1775707543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "774480938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总之，明天见啦。”收拾餐具，然后去找甜品店"}
{"time": 1775707581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "776482918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "稍微靠近一点点“你先说你是谁...”"}
{"time": 1775707646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683994535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=774480938]食堂里当然有现成的"}
{"time": 1775707838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "575006366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "要一个看起来就很热乎的巧克力派和一杯热可可，看着就感觉糖分超标了。随后大概是先回小卖部"}
{"time": 1775707946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614519478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=776482918]\"我就是你。\"你自己的脸贴到镜子前，被挤压得扁平，\"还能不是吗？\""}
{"time": 1775707992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "873212546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.......”在揉揉自己的眼睛“你要干嘛”"}
