{"time": 1775708142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149291672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*先回宿舍吧.jpg。之后再出门买注射针"}
{"time": 1775708280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "516717429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=873212546]\"不如说，你想干什么?\"你的面孔狰狞，在昏暗下狞笑，\"你的那些恐惧，黑暗，沉重的秘密...只有你和我知道\""}
{"time": 1775708567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421639421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哪有...我的秘密都是轻松阳光的.. ”"}
{"time": 1775708588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1892200889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这是人能说出来的话吗）"}
{"time": 1775708738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031670231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1149291672]妃花坐在自己的座位上，正在提笔写着什么，听见开门的声音扭过头看向你，同时合上自己的本子。"}
{"time": 1775708747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095170691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=421639421]\"...\"对方沉默不语"}
{"time": 1775708898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1238520466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，我还在想需不需要再叫醒你一次。”把晚饭放在她桌上"}
{"time": 1775708969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689966441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你到底是谁...”"}
{"time": 1775709083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1187899440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1238520466]\"我都说伊芙是瞎操心啦。\"她笑着看着你，\"给我带了什么～\"她拆开了封装带，\"真的是甜品诶...\""}
{"time": 1775709109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1296631979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1689966441]\"我是最真实的你，事到如今，为什么还要逃避。\""}
