{"time": 1775709227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81608135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我没有逃避...既然你说你是我，那我怎么想你不是都知道么”"}
