{"time": 1775760456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "924752408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*找找针管，当然还有创可贴"}
{"time": 1775760495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58318090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你在这里找到了针管和纱布，它们安静地放在一个角落里。"}
{"time": 1775760645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1296744945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*确认是医用的就打包带走，还有一个量杯。看起来倒像是医学院的学生了"}
{"time": 1775760886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97435589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1296744945]\"一共收您一个金币。\"前台的服务员微笑着开口，你发觉她有些眼熟。"}
{"time": 1775760911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156047930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*谁啊.jpg"}
{"time": 1775761206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665467230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "虽然浑身都被店员服包得满满当当，但帽子缝隙露出的金色发丝和口罩之上警惕的蓝色瞳孔仍然让你想起了某人。"}
{"time": 1775761841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660162123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "抬了抬眉毛，不太打算点破，更没打算给小费"}
{"time": 1775762087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1060550008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*刷卡付款走人.jpg"}
{"time": 1775762134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144811316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她只是皱皱眉，似乎期待你做出什么反应，不过见你没说话，她偏过脑袋公事公办，刷完卡把卡递给你，注视你离开。"}
{"time": 1775762261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990035326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么，原来在期待我认出你来？”歪了歪头“我还以为你罩的这么严实就是为了不被认出来”"}
{"time": 1775762530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1447683938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"少来。\"口罩下的脸似乎鼓了鼓，随后泄了气，\"算了，你快走吧。我懒得理你。\"对方冷哼一声，抱起手臂，脑袋偏向一边，微微扬起。"}
{"time": 1775762609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127397135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛。”都这样了，索性在柜台前逗逗她“勤工俭学也不是什么见不得人的事嘛……还是说在躲哪个特定的人？”"}
{"time": 1775762872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2108573255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "电气在帽子旁炸响，\"少...少来!\"她立刻把脑袋扭过来瞪着你，\"我没有要躲的人，这...这是兴趣...兴趣!\""}
{"time": 1775763047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747819190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“别生气嘛……”这么说着，依旧是一副玩味的表情“我还没说什么呢……要是你知道我买这针是为了扎自己，你会开心点吗？”"}
{"time": 1775763242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1633424267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"和...和我有什么关系!?\"她在柜台后伸出双手用力推你，\"你爱扎扎，别碍我的眼，下次死在我面前我也不管了!\""}
{"time": 1775763338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "404119411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "说完她立刻捂住嘴，偏过脑袋，\"快走快走，在这挡着我看着脑子痛。\""}
{"time": 1775763347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "488764430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是谁）"}
{"time": 1775763363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596228502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎，真的假的……”往后退两步，不让她推实了“我估计是不怎么会开心，毕竟上次也没把我晾在那嘛”"}
{"time": 1775763393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "959570253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你不是睡了吗我的宝宝)"}
{"time": 1775763407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170356352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(没睡着)"}
