{"time": 1775763536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "174326307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=596228502]\"你知道?\"她骤然回身，用力地瞪着你，\"你知道还要在这跟我说这些?\"紧接着她一抽身，在自己的椅子上坐下，\"我没找你要赔偿不错了。\""}
{"time": 1775763542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "657711524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不认识（）"}
{"time": 1775763552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129324267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你确实不认识）"}
{"time": 1775763554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011168094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好像是误会你偷她东西？）"}
{"time": 1775763582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100998757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是)"}
{"time": 1775763737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970004104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“干嘛，我们充其量只是两清而已吧。”拍灰般拍了拍手“我可是很照顾你尊……哦不，兴趣地装不认识你，结果不高兴的是你诶……”"}
{"time": 1775763958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1187855343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那我该高兴吗？\"她的呼吸急促，电流在周身噼里啪啦作响，过了好几息才平复下来，\"不想看见你了...\"语气带着一丝不易察觉的委屈。"}
{"time": 1775764125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "206837881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来我昨天看卡才记起来伊芙已经20岁了）"}
{"time": 1775764211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794811777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了好了，不逗你了。”半倚靠在柜台上“我又没说不谢谢你，虽然不是什么大事，但搬两个人搬那么远也辛苦你啦……所以，是谁又欺负你了？”"}
{"time": 1775764274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "446912106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来是20)"}
{"time": 1775764278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561414948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那翔哥多少)"}
{"time": 1775764282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1953823689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(16还是12)"}
{"time": 1775764349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1762233642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(虽然感觉褪黑素没什么大用，但是先睡)"}
