{"time": 1775787413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118149140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（又躺了？）"}
{"time": 1775787566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2046435736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(并非)"}
{"time": 1775787821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412722356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(大梦谁先觉，平生我自知。)"}
{"time": 1775787991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394084973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1124959781]\"呵呵...\"镜子里的自己冷笑，脸上的表情有些扭曲，\"你就是我...这就是我的真实。\"她手中的剑微微用力，在镜子里的脖子上留下一道浅浅的血痕，你感觉自己的脖子一疼，似乎真的被人在用剑割开，\"我犯下了，最恶劣的罪行。\""}
{"time": 1775788629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269877987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一般来说最恶劣也就是食人了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1775788819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "919345859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摸着自己的脖子“你到底在说什么啊，我明明什么都没干”转身想要逃跑，感觉这面镜子太奇怪了"}
{"time": 1775789021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116741482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1794811777]\"我...我...没...没有!\"她的声音微微发颤，\"没有人能欺负我...我很厉害...\"随后又是深呼吸，\"你都买完了，买完赶紧走。\""}
{"time": 1775789164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839305217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=919345859]镜子里的自己没有下一步动作，目视着你离开。一出洗手间，外面骤然的亮光刺得你有些睁不开眼，和里面昏暗的环境对比鲜明。除了脖子上隐隐作痛的血线在提醒你刚刚发生的事情。"}
{"time": 1775789219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050231532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "用手稍微遮挡一下，然后大气不敢喘的回到位置上"}
{"time": 1775789370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584538809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1050231532]艾琳奈已经把餐盘搬了回来，上面还剩着你点的曲奇和糖果。露莉亚似乎察觉你有些不对劲，你坐下她就靠过来，手搭在你遮挡的手腕上，\"怎么了？\""}
{"time": 1775789424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711281126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1116741482]“嚯，没问题，我这就消失。”既然这样，也没有硬帮的打算，拿起自己的东西这就溜了"}
{"time": 1775789470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319139526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呼呼...”总算敢喘气了，顺便把手放下来，然后朝艾琳奈也招招手，三人凑在一起，小声说道“我刚刚好像在卫生间...遇到鬼了”"}
{"time": 1775789709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395788366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1711281126]她没有搭腔，离开时你的余光瞥到她的脑袋倒是埋了下去。杂货铺外是静静的夜色，明明白天发生过那样的事情，到现在却是平静地像是安稳的水面。"}
{"time": 1775789779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123055117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1319139526]\"哈?\"艾琳奈惊呼一声，随即捂住自己的嘴巴。露莉亚看见了你脖子上的血痕，皱着眉，\"什么意思?\""}
{"time": 1775789853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "360189087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*思考一下，有什么地方比较适合……偷偷给自己扎一针？"}
{"time": 1775789865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "333182235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“洗手间的镜子....里面的我会自己动，她朝自己脖子上划了一刀，然后”指着脖子的伤口“在之后我就跑了”"}
{"time": 1775790015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375468908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你在马路上给自己来一下也只会被人当神经病而已啊)"}
{"time": 1775790022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981216301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还要偷偷干吗)"}
{"time": 1775790054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1793103604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那不就是不想被当神经病（））"}
{"time": 1775790159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711389133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=333182235]\"镜子里的自己会自己动?\"艾琳奈捂着嘴都不能掩盖住惊呼，\"诺薇菈不会是在开玩笑吧...是在吓我对不对...?\"\n\"伤口不是假的。\"露莉亚的手指拂过伤口，有些痒痒的，\"为了做戏要做到这一步吗？\""}
{"time": 1775790186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337746781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=360189087]如果不在意卫生条件的话，没人的地方显然都可以咯。"}
{"time": 1775790209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560322167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(扎针也就一下子的事了)"}
{"time": 1775790290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906089437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“再怎么说 我也不会有病到砍自己脖子一下吧”"}
{"time": 1775790320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122104600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要不剩下这些打包，我们先离开吧”有点后怕"}
{"time": 1775790561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337488071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，我的蓝牙耳机右边掉电好快）"}
{"time": 1775790564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759551075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉是坏了）"}
{"time": 1775790617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1198964465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=337746781] 既然这样，干脆去艾琳宿舍的天台好了"}
{"time": 1775790864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163349734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2122104600]\"...嗯...\"艾琳奈有些害怕，起身的时候还在时不时打量着洗手间那边，动作倒是很利索，收拾了一下就全部打包进了一个盒子递给了你。\n露莉亚皱着眉不知在想什么，\"难不成是...什么邪祟?\""}
{"time": 1775790891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "147206068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1198964465](为什么是去她宿舍天台)"}
