{"time": 1775793568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341260360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=459626235]针尖刺破皮肤，异物进入的身体带来的排斥感和触觉传回的疼痛一同上涌到大脑，尤其是视觉上的目击...你的手有些抖，殷红流入导管，在压力下往试管里流去。"}
{"time": 1775793627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "771604527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“行”然后去跟露露和艾琳奈在分一下"}
{"time": 1775793716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167540215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=341260360]好像……成功了。双手都有点颤抖，于是不再去看针口，转而盯着刻度看。一手扶着管子，一手去摸创可贴"}
{"time": 1775793933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215600423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=771604527]曲奇和糖果被你们几人简单分了一下，身体有些疲惫感涌出，脖子上的伤口还有些刺痛。一时间宿舍里没人说话，只剩下艾琳翻书的声音。"}
{"time": 1775794033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "420316175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1167540215]\"你倒是勤勉，选在这里是为了让我看见吗？\"斑比的声音在你身侧响起，但却不见人。"}
{"time": 1775794223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1722628298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=420316175]差点吓了一跳，应激般左右看了看“……就近而已。新鲜点还有什么不满意的？”"}
{"time": 1775794413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "881794985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "糖果还能留一下，把剩下的曲奇吃完，然后去洗漱一下，困了，想睡觉了"}
{"time": 1775794422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017118328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1722628298]\"不够新鲜。\"斑比点评道，\"我直接咬一口，还省得麻烦。\""}
{"time": 1775794467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2129661753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=881794985]曲奇不知道是不是放久了的原因，有些无味，或者说味道有些寡淡，像是褪了色一般。"}
{"time": 1775794573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52857360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "怎么会这样，百思不得其解，难道只有在那家店里吃才会好吃，挠挠头，不过还是尽量把剩下的吃完吧，也没几片了"}
{"time": 1775794588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "407356908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2017118328]“才不要，天知道你会不会趁机做点什么……你都在这了，也就不用我再下去找你们一趟了吧”"}
{"time": 1775794925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028847679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=52857360]吃到最后如同在吃没有味道的土，甚至有些反胃感让你忍不住干呕。"}
{"time": 1775794957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192135249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "喝水压一下...剩下的还是不勉强自己了，拿给露露"}
{"time": 1775795013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260819379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=407356908]风中没有传来回音，对方显然对你的提议不感兴趣。不过对话的档口，100cc的血倒是抽满了。"}
{"time": 1775795025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500237505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一天抽100，你比赤木还能抽)"}
{"time": 1775795086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1264038050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "拔针上药.jpg。收拾好东西就拿着管子下去"}
{"time": 1775795137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "406056310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "”自然是塞了口的.jpg"}
{"time": 1775795367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1976314746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=192135249]似乎是你的脸色不太好看，露莉亚收下曲奇放在桌上，拉着你去了阳台，小声询问，\"怎么感觉诺诺一天到晚多灾多病的，哪里不舒服?\""}
{"time": 1775795407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269114087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没事...摇摇头，只是感觉曲奇又不好吃了...明明在店里的时候还很好吃的”"}
{"time": 1775795485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654774091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=406056310]拔针倒是没什么感觉，只觉得突然轻快了些，导管里还残存着些血迹，你从天台下道二楼，好在没有宿舍是开着门的。"}
{"time": 1775795558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857321905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=269114087]\"嗯...那家店有点古怪...\"露露对着你的肚子伸手，掌心发出萤黄色的亮光，你顿时感觉肚子好受了些。"}
{"time": 1775795593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051997765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢露露..我感觉好受些了..”然后看一眼阳台的镜子"}
{"time": 1775795630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "541521319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=654774091]把试管放在201的窗台上，敲敲门，随后在有人开门之前去到楼梯间躲起来"}
{"time": 1775795672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422329660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2051997765]镜子里的自己看着你，眼神里带着探究，与此同时，敲门声响起，打断了你的思绪。"}
{"time": 1775795796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454786896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谁诶?\"艾琳奈的声音传到门外和阳台，紧接着起身开门左顾右盼，\"没人啊...?\"她有些疑惑，似乎是看见了试管，但没有去拿，\"奇怪...\""}
{"time": 1775795808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910619602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（外卖放门口就可以了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1775795902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037230726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（早晚练成赤血操术）"}
{"time": 1775795994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1327906106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了露露....不用担心我了，差不多也该去休息了”"}
{"time": 1775796103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688466818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"露露点点头。\n\"门口没人诶?\"艾琳奈回头看着室内的几人，\"只有一个试管...不知道是谁做的红色药水。\""}
{"time": 1775796159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1913871644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看了一眼“emmm，我看看”过去接过那个试管"}
{"time": 1775796199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "842074738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃饭）"}
{"time": 1775796385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1198705563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "明晃晃的感觉，你不会认错，里面是不知道谁的血。"}
{"time": 1775796408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456581328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "暗处躲着的伊芙看见诺薇菈出来拿走了试管，jpg"}
{"time": 1775796507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677051066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "反正那个大吸血鬼知情，这样也算交货成功了。后续的事情不用自己管了，还是早些回去吧"}
{"time": 1775796690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244471947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不赖)"}
