{"time": 1775796708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088384990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(该睡了)"}
{"time": 1775796736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702667115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（神了）"}
{"time": 1775797198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1586793677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看眼容量100ml,想到之前见到的伊芙，应该是约定吧“emmm，这个好像是给我的”"}
{"time": 1775805211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596476544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好困）"}
{"time": 1775813350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1925939066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1775813410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096765768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊神不可能醒的）"}
{"time": 1775813415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1088997462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（最早也得六点半吧）"}
{"time": 1775813465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "836412935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说你的那个）"}
{"time": 1775813473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1288338180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=5BF05CDF0FD69FF05C4D3A8009676424.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQ7aMjiYWsQJJ0CgMlWrh2NHoaT-hix2QUg_woo87_u2fzikwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQHZ_1dJcdohZG0adEOOzswXoCl6OCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMNlmK_miuJavlLcbCE7YVosmVPKp8msDa6ZHfIUaPztpPYG0bOGRioXqzzRj8Y5oeg,file_size=93361]"}
{"time": 1775813478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "709066087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（呵呵）"}
{"time": 1775813507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2124580300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（他已经在三角洲了）"}
{"time": 1775814327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1956642879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1586793677]\"给你的?\"艾琳奈仔细看了看里面的液体，倒也没过多的心眼，\"诺薇菈在学校里还有熟人嘛？\""}
{"time": 1775814418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560205373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“估计是辛德拉同学吧，刚刚在楼下还看见她来着”"}
{"time": 1775814906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780421660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=677051066]一路无事，你顺利到了自己的宿舍，妃花在摆弄自己的戒指，卡珊德拉则是对着门坐着，似乎在专门等你。"}
{"time": 1775814930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "890009464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1560205373]\"她?\"艾琳偏过脑袋，\"她为什么给你这个...?\""}
{"time": 1775815320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098936548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想了想“艾琳下次见到她自己问她吧”自己就不乱说了，万一说错话了"}
{"time": 1775815930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "65580945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1098936548]\"...\"她的眼神落在你身上，有些狐疑，不过最后还是收回了视线，\"嗯...明天的课准备好了吗？\""}
{"time": 1775815956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267348565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃...预习吗”"}
{"time": 1775815973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014123111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那自己当然一点也没看"}
{"time": 1775815979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "713414413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1780421660]累的很.jpg，左胳膊还隐隐作痛，看卡珊德拉一眼，就准备去洗漱了"}
{"time": 1775816063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332111321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1014123111]\"预言课姑且不算...还有魔导器课哦?\""}
{"time": 1775816121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265617380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃，谢谢艾琳提醒，对了，老师这两节课讲到哪里了”"}
{"time": 1775816516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957266010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=713414413]\"不和我说说今天的奇遇?\"她皱着眉，手里摩挲着一本书的书脊，书名背在阴影里看不清。"}
{"time": 1775816749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374442787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“反正你不都知道？……哦，还是说那时候你……”低头看了看胸针，往她那边靠了靠"}
{"time": 1775816776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795691196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1265617380]\"预言课的话，洋荷教授只讲了序章。希姆教授还没有开始讲课本内容。\""}
{"time": 1775816812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1732818600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢艾琳了”然后回自己位置开始看书"}
{"time": 1775817059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "992863857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=374442787]她把一旁空座位的椅子拽过来，\"我很忙的，一般都不会看你那边，不过今天确实是看不清。\"她摇头，\"当时也尝试过，不过——完全没办法呢。\""}
{"time": 1775817121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853248698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1732818600]\"先练习魔导器相关的应用吧。\"艾琳这么开口，手里捧着那几个玻璃球，左捣鼓一下右捣鼓一下。"}
{"time": 1775817162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1640587382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自己用这几个戒指也算比较熟练吧"}
{"time": 1775817200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242145336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=992863857]“我倒是想说啦……”叹了口气“但是做不到嘛”"}
{"time": 1775817537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634924821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1640587382]\"嗯，我觉得希姆教授可能不会喜欢用这种成品展示出的效果的。\"她歪头看着你的戒指，\"有效的魔力转换，控制自己的输出，我想这些才是她对这门课的期待。\""}
{"time": 1775817578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026072662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这个谁懂啊，还是先看看书怎么说"}
{"time": 1775817652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56992422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=242145336]\"做不到?\"脑袋歪了些许，白色的短发一偏，金色的瞳孔被遮住，只留下蓝色的眼睛看向你，\"那不是...最有趣的情形吗？\""}
{"time": 1775817668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "836881904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说起来，你为什么不用解析解析大吸血鬼)"}
{"time": 1775817697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449675472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2026072662]魔导器的课本第一章，认识各种魔导器，jpg"}
{"time": 1775817719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744273349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好经典）"}
{"time": 1775817828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1953925273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=56992422]“契约很难说得上是有趣的东西吧。”往自己的座位一摊“不过只限于我不能主动透露就是了”"}
{"time": 1775817895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485370881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看书，研究研究魔导器，然后在看看另一本书"}
{"time": 1775818206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871085984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=485370881]预言术的书是一本大部头的巨著，光是书封面上的作者名就密密麻麻写了很多行，更别说前面十几页的作序了。序章之后的第一节是《有关水晶球》"}
{"time": 1775818252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2056834481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "本身就有点累，看这么多字更是昏昏欲睡，强忍着看完这些，去洗漱一下"}
{"time": 1775818261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309712516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1953925273]她的嘴角勾起，打了个响指，你胸前的胸针变成一张黑色的面具，和刚来的时候戴上的那张一样。"}
{"time": 1775818294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1612764283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“if you want it”*耸了耸肩，这次倒是没有不配合的理由"}
{"time": 1775818392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556475971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2056834481]倒是还没到深夜，你洗漱完也才堪堪十点不到。"}
{"time": 1775818489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1972328658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好像有点早，趴在阳台上，背对着其他人，确定其他人没看自己在干嘛，把那个试管打开"}
{"time": 1775818501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175259756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "心里想到“斑比酱，今日份的血”"}
{"time": 1775820324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "569519950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1612764283]妃花被你们的动静吸引了注意，一直在旁边看着，这下更是凑了过来，\"诶...?发生什么了吗？\"目光落在面具上，有些担忧。"}
{"time": 1775820371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199370344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1175259756]\"我看着那家伙取的。\"斑比的声音在你耳边响起，\"留给你了。\""}
{"time": 1775820403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104577223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？哎，谢谢斑比赏赐”"}
{"time": 1775820457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565859374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=569519950]“没事啦，一点女孩子的秘密。”拿起面具戴上"}
{"time": 1775820480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938224932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "将血饮尽，然后把试管好好清洗一下"}
{"time": 1775820908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1127908681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=938224932]鲜血甘甜，冲淡了刚刚还在嘴里残留的寡淡味道，其中带有点些许毒素更像是刺激性的调料，喝下去只觉舒爽，一下就有了精神。"}
{"time": 1775821016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041686829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1565859374]透过面具的眼睛你看见卡珊德拉的脑袋歪向自己的手臂，眼看着就要滑倒，妃花及时扶住了她，\"啊?\"\n紧接着你的身体不再受控，跟着伸手却是从后面揽住了妃花，\"啊?\""}
{"time": 1775821265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "621608179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2041686829]“不用担心不用担心。”语气平缓“只是有人灵魂暂时出窍而已”"}
{"time": 1775821411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594691926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=621608179]尽管被你揽着，妃花还是帮卡珊德拉扶了正，随后你一用力，把她拉到了你身边抱住，诱人心神的香味扑鼻而来，\"呼呼...\"你自己的声音。"}
{"time": 1775821510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "317655250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“别拿我的身体占人家便宜诶”半开玩笑地吐槽一句"}
{"time": 1775821583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058642173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉精神抖擞，又能再看好多好多书"}
{"time": 1775821670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982770602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（血吸得越多越像吸血鬼.jpg）"}
{"time": 1775821795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916981760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=317655250]\"帮你多做好事罢了。\"自己的声音响在自己的耳边，\"反正我看妃花也不讨厌。\"\n妃花红了脸，身体软绵绵地靠在你怀里。然后就在一瞬，你拿回了身体的控制权，面具剥落变回胸针落在你的胸口上。"}
{"time": 1775821854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462381545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2058642173]你此时甚至有些兴奋，但却对声音更加敏感，隐约能听见夜色里悠远的虫鸣。"}
{"time": 1775821988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519613036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=916981760]“希望这屋子里都是直的。”咳了咳，暂时没动“好了好了，应该不用我提醒你保密？”"}
{"time": 1775822322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "921733013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1519613036]\"有这个必要?\"对面的女孩半睁着眼，挑了挑眉，\"嘻嘻～我要是不保密会怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1775822666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1524047618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“可能……也不会怎么样”耸了耸肩“反正也不是我说的，传的多了容易被找上门而已”"}
{"time": 1775822925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076284850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过她们要找我麻烦也不是非得要个理由就是了”"}
