{"time": 1775964607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1047705391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "魔导器和预言"}
{"time": 1775965395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "755100663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1047705391]看完魔导器的绪论，夜已深。艾琳和艾琳奈陆续洗漱好，已经上了床。露莉亚看了一眼你，走过来轻声，\"还不睡么\""}
{"time": 1775965466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "443474000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "点点头“我还不是很困..不过既然大家都睡了”伸个懒腰“露露，晚安💤”"}
{"time": 1775965838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "46316917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=443474000]\"嗯...\"她伸出手帮你按揉着肩膀，\"早点休息...\""}
{"time": 1775965895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "263112582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢露露了....”稍微收拾一下，把东西都整理好，等所有人上床了，把灯关了，也去睡了"}
{"time": 1775965925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1762958250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "睡前摸着印信，希望晚上还没见到埃忒尔姐姐和萨雷法姐姐"}
{"time": 1775966086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533598163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1762958250]梦中是一片朦胧的水雾，它们温柔地包裹着你，簇拥着你往前，或者说漂浮"}
{"time": 1775966108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "405669958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟随雾气向前，看样子应该能见到她们"}
{"time": 1775966242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773150258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=405669958]萨蕾法躺在水雾的中心，虽然身下没有任何依靠，但就那么静静地漂浮着，闭着眼睛假寐，有水珠凝在睫毛上一抖一抖。"}
{"time": 1775966272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428398232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好像在睡觉？在一旁静静等她醒来"}
{"time": 1775966650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916064830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"来都来了?怎么不说话?\"她眯起一只眼，金色的瞳孔在雾中显得稍暗，抖落了睫毛上的露珠"}
{"time": 1775966921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981186419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我还以为萨雷法姐姐在睡觉呢”挠挠头"}
{"time": 1775966946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007987383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，姐姐真厉害，我已经成功进到学院了”"}
{"time": 1775967169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "490277644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这件事你得感谢埃忒尔啦。\"她捂着嘴偷笑，\"不过睡前还在想我这件事——\"双脚落地，萨蕾法站起身，\"嗯哼～想聊天?\""}
{"time": 1775967471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1950362063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”点点头“萨雷法姐姐知道龙晶是什么吗”"}
{"time": 1775967520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2021084441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1338767221]（）"}
{"time": 1775967537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589469072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥还不睡吗（）"}
{"time": 1775967854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1662531558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我其实不知道他睡没睡)"}
{"time": 1775968047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962844072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1950362063]\"当然知道哦～\"她的手指点在下巴上，皱着眉看向你，眼神有些探究，\"诺薇菈不知道吗？嗯...应该历史课会提到，故事书里也会有才对。\""}
{"time": 1775968076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1548918512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃....我只是听过这个名字，但具体是什么确实不太清楚”"}
{"time": 1775968175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828784903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1338767221]\"随你吧。\"卡珊德拉收回视线，不再看你，\"如果不是知道你深重到近乎罪孽的欲望，想来...\"停下来，看着自己摊开的手心，\"我也很久没收过利息了...\""}
{"time": 1775968296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256520764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1548918512]\"原初之龙巴哈姆特的碎片...\"萨蕾法皱眉，\"可以让人...\"摇头，\"生物觉醒权能，最重要的是...是由它挑选对象。\""}
{"time": 1775968414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "43412320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“......那应该很珍贵吧”"}
{"time": 1775968608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598540127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=43412320]\"嗯...\"她点头，\"但这...只对于被选中的人才是...龙晶中的混乱，对普通人而言...是绝对的毒药。\""}
{"time": 1775968668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934359230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是存在在那里，就会出现不可弥补，不可避免的龙化吧...\"萨蕾法似乎是想到了什么，摇着头叹气。"}
{"time": 1775968707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1432006643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那萨雷法姐姐有办法处理龙晶吗...”"}
{"time": 1775969195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325628050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1432006643]\"嗯...封存。\"她金色的瞳孔完全盯住你，语气也不再闲适，而是带上认真，\"龙晶无法摧毁，只能封印。\""}
{"time": 1775969290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331888805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(吃个饭)"}
{"time": 1775969517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2084838090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“封存...难道是找个地方埋了，然后立块碑？”"}
{"time": 1775969714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904656932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1828784903]“罪孽吗？还好吧。”弹了弹指甲“后悔、追思……不都是人之常情么？在想怎么活着之余，总要想着改变些东西，才是人吧”"}
{"time": 1775969773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068746785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2084838090]\"也有这样的做法吧。\"萨蕾法微微抬头，似乎在思考着，\"封印的形式有很多，千奇百怪，无奇不有。像这种立碑镇压也算一种...?\""}
{"time": 1775969878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "83037488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但感觉立碑镇压好容易被破坏，有好事之人挖出来就完了”"}
{"time": 1775970104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203188868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=83037488]\"这也是没办法的事情。\"雾气在逐渐消散，涓涓水流声传到你的耳边，她轻叹一口气，\"所以像这种，一般会有人接下看守的职责。\""}
{"time": 1775970162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1999325981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“萨雷法姐姐有没有什么更好的办法...”"}
{"time": 1775970224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91682878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我知道有个地方的龙晶是这样保存的..但却被人强硬的挖了出来，最后全村横死”"}
{"time": 1775970245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1386587750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "语速逐渐变快"}
{"time": 1775970379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "196202055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=904656932]\"即使已经在通往地狱的小路上呐喊狂奔?\"卡珊德拉的语气平静。"}
{"time": 1775970490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "41739148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1386587750]你说到一半，嘴巴前却竖起她的手指，金瞳温柔地打量着你，随后缓缓摇了摇头，\"不可以继续说了哦...\""}
{"time": 1775970536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1087284099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然不知道为什么...但还是乖乖闭了嘴，自己不能得寸进尺"}
{"time": 1775970917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "959826791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1087284099]她收回手，径直躺下，自然地浮在空中，\"还想聊什么吗？\""}
{"time": 1775970992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "105179990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.......”有些沉默，摇了摇头“对不起，萨雷法姐姐...”"}
{"time": 1775971049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "306572511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=196202055]“人之常情啦”摆摆手“你不也差不多么？从接到请帖的时候就在等来到……哦，回到这里的事了吧？”"}
{"time": 1775971233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788575214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=105179990]\"为什么要道歉?\"浑圆的水球在她身边升起，盘旋，\"这不是你的错。\""}
{"time": 1775971344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1039679826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=306572511]\"也许更早也说不定呢。\"寝室的灯突然毫无征兆地熄掉，你听到衣物摩挲和擦拭着什么的声音，\"哦豁?是不是有点晚了，这下没办法聊天了呢。\""}
{"time": 1775971359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1243023912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(午安)"}
{"time": 1775971403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396101917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(何谓午安)"}
{"time": 1775971407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280896540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我刚出门)"}
{"time": 1775971417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "964843638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就是我要睡会）"}
{"time": 1775971456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "492495229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(睡去吧)"}
{"time": 1775971460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804752655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“反正你和我聊天也不是非得靠嘴。”努了努嘴，轻轻拍拍妃花，随后用魔力照亮一下室内“妃花就先回床上吧？”"}
{"time": 1775971776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549813748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1804752655]\"熄灯代表着睡觉时间到，好孩子都该安安静静上床才对。\"语气里带着挪揄，你怎么调动魔力也没有一丝光亮。"}
{"time": 1775971943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154004368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么这熄灯号还带禁魔的……？”有点傻眼“好吧，好吧……看得清吗？妃花？”"}
{"time": 1775972263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "913149881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1154004368]\"嗯...\"妃花的声音有些小心翼翼，反倒是对面的卡珊德拉先绷不住，发出了两声咯咯的笑声，光亮陡然恢复，\"知道你没看过校规了。\"她的话题转变地自然。"}
{"time": 1775972377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857337250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=913149881]“反正违反了会有人提醒……而且我看那东西约束力也没那么足吧”先扶妃花起身“比如反霸凌什么的”"}
{"time": 1775972445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97412610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=857337250]\"总有看不见的地方嘛。\"卡珊德拉站在自己的床前，\"而且那也不是所谓的戒律，自然也没有特别的效力。\""}
{"time": 1775972585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "988899436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总之确实是……懒得看了。喔，坏了……”皱了皱眉“还没洗漱……”"}
{"time": 1775972856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "477513931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=988899436]\"我看你也不差这么一天两天嘛。\"卡珊德拉翻上自己的床，\"不陪你熬了，我要早睡早起。\"说着盖上被子躺得很规整。"}
{"time": 1775973139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138132597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行吧行吧，晚安。”也不想说太多，而自己今天确实很累。不过上床前起码还是要去擦拭一下身体"}
{"time": 1775973386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "825901927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1138132597]等你大致弄完之后，寝室里已经只剩微微的呼吸音，妃花给你留了一盏桌上的小灯。四肢有些沉重，不过意识倒还算得上清明。"}
{"time": 1775973577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234750004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "确认一下妃花那边没有奇怪的动静，也就熄灯上床，隔着睡衣捂着针扎的伤口“……被艾琳知道肯定要挨骂的吧”"}
{"time": 1775973839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733149227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=234750004]寝室里安安静静，落针可闻，你小声的吐槽当然没有收到任何人的回应，床垫有点硬，远不如在住院部的柔软，可以让人生生陷在其中。"}
{"time": 1775973986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985428779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "没什么需要感怀的事，打了个大大的哈欠，毕竟沙发草坪甚至棺材都睡过了，只要够累，哪儿都可以是床。闭上眼睛，应该很快就能睡着"}
{"time": 1775974131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352276047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rh"}
{"time": 1775974131, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1352276047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上真由理]试图在黑暗中窥见岁月史书"}
{"time": 1775974131, "type": "reply_private", "message_id": "1352276047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "在演奏厅中[浅上真由理]演奏出: 1D20=18"}
{"time": 1775974253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1777413718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=985428779]这一觉睡得很安稳，早餐的阳光洒在脸上的时候，浑身上下依然带着独属于深眠的倦意。"}
{"time": 1775974874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095276466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（看起来是歇了）"}
