{"time": 1776135025, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2058647742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[诺薇拉]演奏出: 1D100=94"}
{"time": 1776135026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1125596081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1776135026, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1125596081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊芙]演奏出: 1D100=23"}
{"time": 1776135032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "675053404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我是高手）"}
{"time": 1776135095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007821533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1776135097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1070228576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1134515654]\"卡珊德拉?\"妃花眨眨眼，她的水晶球里蒙着层淡淡的雾，和你澄澈透明的玻璃有些不同，\"唔...\"她仔细看着，\"好像不在学校...好暗的房间...\""}
{"time": 1776135192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "183093275", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1428920038]四周的声音在离你远去，仿佛只剩下眼前的画面，那就是...什么也没有，在水晶中，你什么也没看见，但它已经昭示了结果。"}
{"time": 1776135204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1228909971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1428920038]四周的声音在离你远去，仿佛只剩下眼前的画面，那就是...什么也没有，在水晶中，你什么也没看见。"}
{"time": 1776135290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412119478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "为什么...因为自己根本不可能回去吗...那杀了...算了，冷静冷静，不能做这种事情...算了，那预言一下幕后黑手在哪？"}
{"time": 1776135535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023399917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1070228576]“嗯……果然没那么好找嘛。”耸了耸肩“那我……”看回自己的水晶球，集中精神……去想妃花会遇到的危险"}
{"time": 1776135726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619589301", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你似乎捕捉到了一点影子，一个上下颠倒的房间，一闪而过的粉色长发，然后...水晶球表面裂开，触觉，听觉，嗅觉一瞬回归，额头上满是汗珠。"}
{"time": 1776135734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221810596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=412119478]你似乎捕捉到了一点影子，一个上下颠倒的房间，一闪而过的粉色长发，然后...水晶球表面裂开，触觉，听觉，嗅觉一瞬回归，额头上满是汗珠。"}
{"time": 1776135812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "7107826", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呼.....”大口大口的喘气，被水晶球爆裂的声音吓了一大跳，有点惊魂未定"}
{"time": 1776135815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004443206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1023399917]玻璃没有任何改变，你努力去看，依然只看见自己的脸庞。\n\"好像被看见了...\"妃花在一旁讪笑了两声，用自己的手遮住水晶球。"}
{"time": 1776135832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438982607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那也没爆裂，只是表面开裂了一点)"}
{"time": 1776135842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1057367880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（粉色是谁来着）"}
{"time": 1776135844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121441520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呼.....”大口大口的喘气，被水晶球裂开的声音吓了一大跳，有点惊魂未定"}
{"time": 1776135849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792768735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不知道）"}
{"time": 1776135862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246135511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（爱莉希雅（）"}
{"time": 1776135899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1205666959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可能是里榭娜？）"}
{"time": 1776135938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663358788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉粉毛太多了）"}
{"time": 1776136042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020006395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2004443206]皱了皱眉，不知道这是真的无事发生还是自己功力不够，但违和感萦绕在胸口挥之不去，叹了口气“被看见了？卡珊德拉？”"}
{"time": 1776136099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094819000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=121441520]看眼周围不知道自己的动静有没有被注意到"}
{"time": 1776136329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2089416996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(其实是长夜月)"}
{"time": 1776136333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813991449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=B40325CD63E392E4E061C144B1271336.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTPzOsqQ7tfiAC7DPD1ozDryuMp3xih0wwg_woo5rulua_skwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQdDVIBceLbkGg6FZqYRFHWHoCjZ-CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMN6L5u9L9ZO4xr29ohVDCeILGN9evkx3v6eGsFuFXPxLvN_lU1TxwnUuUy-_6OXstg,file_size=207265]"}
{"time": 1776136481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1291980441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来狼尊配队好像要3欢愉？）"}
{"time": 1776136498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "11495505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（狼火爻霍）"}
{"time": 1776136939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1321065058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2094819000]教室里很多叽叽喳喳的声音，因此轻微的开裂声并没有被留意到。只有坐在你旁边的露莉亚和艾琳看了过来，艾琳奈则是抱着自己的水晶球抓耳挠腮。"}
{"time": 1776136988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "982984799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么回事?\"露莉亚手里的玻璃球没什么动静，脑袋靠了过来，眉头微蹙。"}
{"time": 1776137013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747766910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我预言了一下，结果就这样了...应该没事吧”"}
{"time": 1776137045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584885130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1020006395]\"嗯...\"妃花移开手，水晶球里的雾气已经散去，\"突然对我打个招呼...\""}
{"time": 1776137329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1451226841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1584885130]“正常嘛，她其实可以直接从我这看见是什么情况的吧。”手放在自己的水晶球上“……结果我的什么都看不见诶”"}
{"time": 1776137422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610783022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=747766910]\"这样...?\"艾琳指着你开裂的水晶球，疑惑跃然脸上。露莉亚半开玩笑地开口，尽管眉头依然没有松开，\"不会是磕到了吧？笨手笨脚。\""}
{"time": 1776137790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973010421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1451226841]玻璃球还是那副清澈的样子，\"嗯...\"妃花欲言又止，停了一下然后开口，\"伊芙想知道什么?\""}
{"time": 1776138023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710461552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1973010421]“嗯……你猜？”故意不肯说明白“之前是不是目标太具体了……我换个问法好了。”尝试再次对水晶球发问……有人在对妃花图谋不轨吗？"}
{"time": 1776138191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371269524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你再过一个d100好了)"}
{"time": 1776138235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "606899877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1776138235, "type": "reply", "message_id": "606899877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊芙]演奏出: 1D100=37"}
{"time": 1776138240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "718857043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（拉）"}
{"time": 1776138504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1838897599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1710461552]玻璃中泛起了一丝雾气，但又很快消散，你发现自己很难集中精神去注意那些内含的东西。"}
{"time": 1776138624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778927105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“唔唔……”有些气馁，放下水晶球靠在椅子上“没活没活啦……”"}
{"time": 1776138710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618349066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1610783022][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “.....怎么可能啊”"}
{"time": 1776138762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637778594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不知道还能不能用”试试用它占卜一下希古娜的位置"}
