{"time": 1776160894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410751951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（理论上你应该看得到我）"}
{"time": 1776160920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522526010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看到伊芙过来，把昨晚洗干净的试管顺手还给她"}
{"time": 1776161067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2055367996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，你还带着呐？”顺手拿过来“省的我专门跑一趟”"}
{"time": 1776161088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "873159736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "懒得回了，直接去找露露她们"}
{"time": 1776161095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "818508483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说起来……”挑了挑眉，不过没有继续说"}
{"time": 1776161146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "122919891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“什么？”回头看眼她"}
{"time": 1776161211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974079198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（对了，今晚有mc或者101吗）"}
{"time": 1776161228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325766398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*诶，不说话了"}
{"time": 1776161236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "185689831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "似有似无地看一眼艾琳"}
{"time": 1776161269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167412822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "瞪伊芙一眼“不想说就不说........”然后回去"}
{"time": 1776161279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "873097141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "洋荷只是稍微看了你们一眼，迈步准备离开。"}
{"time": 1776161316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1671123567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（违约条例到最后都没确定.jpg）"}
{"time": 1776161348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1654515082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=185689831]对方显然也在看着这边，不过看你们分开也就随之挪开了视线。"}
{"time": 1776161375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1995501886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“中午吃食堂？”"}
{"time": 1776161555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61112708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看来也没想象中的有种嘛。”把试管收好，一蹦一跳地跟上洋荷“老师~艾琳奈同学，她是银龙吗？”"}
{"time": 1776161636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "616927072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1995501886]\"还能不吃食堂吗？\"露莉亚随口接上话，指了指你的口袋，一切尽在不言中。"}
{"time": 1776161675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122058001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾琳奈和艾琳怎么说”"}
{"time": 1776161930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085902800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=61112708]洋荷的脚步没停，几步已经到了教室外，听到你的问话，她偏头看向你，惜字如金，\"是。\""}
{"time": 1776162030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460310830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1122058001]\"也不能天天吃点心啦...\"艾琳奈和水晶球较劲了一节课，不过现在已经偃旗息鼓，有些垂头丧气。\"食堂的菜式还不错，值得多吃几次。\"这是艾琳。"}
{"time": 1776162083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1913420111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好啊，那一起吧”出发，目标食堂“对了，露露刚刚有占卜出什么名堂吗”"}
{"time": 1776162153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928128826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“果然呢，毕竟同为龙属，她见到师母的第一感觉是熟悉诶。”离了人群，便换个称谓“我当初……哦，后来第一次见师母的时候根本抬不起头来……不过她本人好像没有这方面的自知诶？”"}
{"time": 1776162305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410070245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1913420111]\"看见了好吃懒散的诺诺，摸着自己浑圆的肚皮打嗝。\"她无奈地摊手，\"真是糟糕的未来。\""}
{"time": 1776162332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "627243443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？你都预言了什么奇奇怪怪的东西啊”"}
{"time": 1776162677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1136630177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1928128826]\"我没有外放气息。\"今天的天气有些一般，天色阴沉沉的，空气里有些闷热，\"她很迟钝，没有觉醒血脉...不，应该是，是有人刻意封印了。\""}
{"time": 1776162883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85169826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=627243443]\"没办法呢，毕竟是我所见的未来，好胖好胖诶...\"她伸手戳戳你的肚子，你们一起路过第一排，妃花安安静静地在座位上坐着。"}
{"time": 1776162913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "872782995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真是的”再回忆一下哪个粉头发，有没有什么更多的信息，不过看见妃花先打个招呼“妃花姐姐....”"}
{"time": 1776163020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1677499674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1136630177]“恐怕不只是血脉……或许还有记忆……什么的，吧。”回个头朝她们远去的方向看一眼“师母有没有什么，插个手之类的打算？要我去盯一盯吗？”"}
{"time": 1776163364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522254971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=872782995]粉色的长发一闪而过，除此之外没有其他的画面。听见你的话，妃花才抬起头，轻轻舒了口气，\"诺诺?\""}
{"time": 1776163428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27633259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好久不见啊，妃花姐姐...介绍一下，这个是我好朋友诺诺，这两位是我室友 艾琳和艾琳奈”也不知道妃花认不认识那两个，先介绍再说吧"}
{"time": 1776163598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53812140", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1522254971]（谁？.jpg）"}
{"time": 1776163624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1789713155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦，原来你们搭上了）"}
{"time": 1776163636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1558077109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1677499674]你看见她们停在第一排。\"没有。\"语气依然古井无波，不过视线倒是穿越人群看向了那边，盯了两眼收了回来，\"...没有。\""}
{"time": 1776163728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "430989577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=27633259]\"艾琳...艾琳奈...\"她点点头，\"初次见面，我叫妃花。\"随后她看向露莉亚，\"你也叫诺诺?\"微微歪头，翠色的瞳孔里流露出不解，\"难怪会是好朋友呢。\""}
{"time": 1776163775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609359576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1558077109]“明白明白，我看着办啦。”手背在身后停下脚步“那就，不送了？”"}
{"time": 1776163789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659214268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有铸币）"}
{"time": 1776163813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "385783219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（打错字了）"}
{"time": 1776163817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463935673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么不提醒我）"}
{"time": 1776163844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077049938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呸呸呸，说错了，她叫露莉亚....你可以叫她露露，嘴快了，对不起喵”"}
{"time": 1776163861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "273270852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "以后还是不要同时边想事情边和别人聊天了"}
{"time": 1776164212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854959934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=609359576]\"...\"你似乎看见她嘴角勾起了一瞬，但又像是花了眼，不能确定。也没有得到回话，洋荷轻飘飘地离开了。"}
{"time": 1776164336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179922090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1077049938]露莉亚不动声色地拧了拧你的手臂，\"露莉亚...我知道了...\"妃花的脸上挂着笑，她继而转向你，\"该说好久不见吗?\""}
{"time": 1776164404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453113207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“仔细想想好像确实上次见面就是几天前的事情，也不是很久以前啦？妃花姐姐在等伊...额...辛德拉？”"}
{"time": 1776164414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1738419384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1854959934]“哼嗯~”心情好了些，慢悠悠走回去"}
{"time": 1776164455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "661966814", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=974079198]（@yiln）"}
