{"time": 1776164675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1233560352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(天下英雄闻我名无不丧胆)"}
{"time": 1776164768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695476763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1453113207]\"嗯...\"妃花轻点脑袋，与此同时，你看见伊芙从门外走了回来，看上去心情不错的样子。"}
{"time": 1776164793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358018983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“唔...那我们先走了，拜拜”挥挥手告别"}
{"time": 1776165001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1548958058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“走得那么快干嘛。”不紧不慢扶起妃花“我难道很吓人？”"}
{"time": 1776165034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659792006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“hh，我看见你就害怕”"}
{"time": 1776165255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011373939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说得好像你是什么弱势群体一样，起码等我哪天进了学生会再说吧。”这么说着，眼神完全没往诺薇拉那边看，而是看向艾琳和艾琳奈“这个点了，去吃饭？”"}
{"time": 1776165664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "14615118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "艾琳奈点点头，\"正准备去食堂啦...\"艾琳饶有兴趣地听完你们的对话，\"在做什么?玩猫抓老鼠的游戏吗？\""}
{"time": 1776165702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337697584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃....好像差不多”"}
{"time": 1776165803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369418097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“天知道。明明我才是弱势群体。”把刚刚的话题一笔带过“来都来了，一起去？”"}
{"time": 1776165832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998623730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看眼露露，看看她怎么说"}
{"time": 1776165876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1963099498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=61038F40C461BC526FECEB22B59B96FE.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRdRds9ctJJ7-7cDlkRkcR5BHYv6hjR2AMg_wooyK_cwJ3tkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQAfyPlb77h_P5Yb70-NcJdXoC0MiCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMBUgCxc4yw32nDET0MUabBWcyODXcLueQs4aRleThsSR-si5k0qmyL07lG65M-g5xA,file_size=60497]"}
{"time": 1776166194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609011352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "露莉亚冷哼了一声，微微翻了个白眼，但到底没开口明确拒绝"}
{"time": 1776166445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "666790681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "才不管她们同不同意，难不成自己和谁吃饭还要她们允许？绕到另一边牵上艾琳“走吧？”"}
{"time": 1776166678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211322599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?\"艾琳扭头看了看你，由着你牵着，耸耸肩，\"今天吃什么?\""}
{"time": 1776166765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1334010210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "露露没拒绝，自己要是拒绝也太不知道怎么说，反正感觉不利于和艾琳艾琳奈的维持还行的关系，那就跟着吧"}
{"time": 1776166967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1029126850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我想试试炖菜，不过你恐怕想吃别的吧。我记得巴尔干风味那边是都有的。”侃侃而谈“刚刚课上有试着预言些什么吗？”"}
{"time": 1776167003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858008223", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"吃什么?\"不甘示弱一样，露莉亚也问了你一样的问题，妃花跟在队伍最后，艾琳奈和她小声聊着天。"}
{"time": 1776167010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1440816663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1334010210]\"吃什么?\"不甘示弱一样，露莉亚也问了你一样的问题，妃花跟在队伍最后，艾琳奈和她小声聊着天。"}
{"time": 1776167040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "905760175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rh"}
{"time": 1776167040, "type": "reply", "message_id": "905760175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上真由理]试图在黑暗中窥见岁月史书"}
{"time": 1776167040, "type": "reply_private", "message_id": "905760175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "在演奏厅中[浅上真由理]演奏出: 1D20=10"}
{"time": 1776167052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1600631195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露呢，我觉得昨天那个还挺好吃的，露露要不要也试试”"}
{"time": 1776167072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1127107308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1029126850]\"我估计是没什么预言的天赋。\"她的手指卷着发梢，\"什么都没看见。\""}
{"time": 1776167302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565043203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1600631195]\"昨天，哪个?\""}
{"time": 1776167340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766986778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“鸭血粉丝汤啦...好吃的不得了”"}
{"time": 1776167367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1953410225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1127107308]“喔，差不多差不多。”点了点头“或许是缘分没到吧，我也什么都没看见……实在不行，就重修吧”"}
{"time": 1776167724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383315854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "昨天的糖还剩几颗，分给露露一颗"}
