{"time": 1776190510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "100406223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1953410225]\"重修...?应该没到那种程度吧。\"摇摇头，\"本身预言也是看个人天赋的嘛...学院应该也知道不能强求。\""}
{"time": 1776190535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107943227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看了一眼艾琳奈，一切尽在不言中"}
{"time": 1776190588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001353092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=766986778]\"呃啊，我吃点饭吧，鸭血粉丝听着就是吃不饱的东西。\"她接过你手里的糖果，随手放到嘴巴里抿住。"}
{"time": 1776190636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "368661647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=868481352]与其说是在哪里站着，不如说是在半空中，借过一般留下半缕背影。"}
{"time": 1776190673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809018685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么会..吃不饱的话，可以加点饼”"}
{"time": 1776190694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644344742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1107943227]她正在和妃花讨论着什么，似乎是在说自己喜欢的甜品，津津有味的样子，完全没注意你的视线。\n艾琳拉回你，摇头，\"不一样啦。\""}
{"time": 1776190810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890953643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=809018685]\"感觉鸭血的味道...嗯...很滑腻?\"她吃完糖才开口，\"以前我就不怎么喜欢啦...但是爸妈非要我吃下去...\""}
{"time": 1776190895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025646773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=644344742]“或许吧，不过我觉得艾琳奈掌握预言魔法也只是时间问题……说掌握可能不准确，应该说精通吧。”怀抱着胳膊，胸有成竹地下定论"}
{"time": 1776190903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094759420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我以前也感觉一般般...不过现在我也没多少东西能挑了，对了”声音忽然变小“我刚刚课上占卜幕后之人，看见了一个粉头发的女的”"}
{"time": 1776191037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1345332891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这走在一起声音变小也)"}
{"time": 1776191048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "89616574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我还以为是）"}
{"time": 1776191055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "761417444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(龙神过个聆听吧)"}
{"time": 1776191070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "55450719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd"}
{"time": 1776191070, "type": "reply", "message_id": "55450719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊芙]演奏出: 1D20=10"}
{"time": 1776191083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661007464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是好像和我也没什么关系？）"}
{"time": 1776191087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122073323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（粉毛太多了）"}
{"time": 1776191096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832922385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙 艾琳\n我 露露\n妃花 艾琳奈）"}
{"time": 1776191102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138573106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（像这样）"}
{"time": 1776191108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199623895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（零零散散的）"}
{"time": 1776191112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909424938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（像这样）"}
{"time": 1776191317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095167920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1025646773]\"为什么诶?\"艾琳没回头，\"天赋是与生俱来的...我觉得...\"似乎是觉得再说有些失礼，\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1776191422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844650523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2094759420]\"粉头发?\"露莉亚皱皱眉，\"诺诺到底看什么了？为什么还有粉头发的女生?\""}
{"time": 1776191470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103607265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就是一个上下颠倒的房间，里面有个侧身的飞着的粉头发的女生，再多就没有了”"}
{"time": 1776191665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146180071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1095167920]“她也不是一般人啦，嗯……要我卖个关子吗？”"}
{"time": 1776191670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594720674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1103607265]\"我是说，到底是想要知道什么啦，知道什么才是前提吧...\""}
{"time": 1776191719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "781156704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2146180071]\"算了，我不想听。\"她摆手，\"徒增烦恼罢了。\""}
{"time": 1776191756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533318704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1594720674][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “幕后黑手啊，露露你不会忘了我们要干嘛吧”"}
{"time": 1776191914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594966443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=781156704]“呼嗯，听你的。”眯着眼睛回头看看“大家都会有不得了的未来吧”"}
{"time": 1776191936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1481654102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=533318704]\"粉头发...我没有见过啦，没有其他特征?\"露莉亚闻言稍微认真了一些，\"这才是裂开的原因吧？\""}
{"time": 1776192063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036451717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1594966443]目光所及，艾琳奈和妃花在队伍最后面，紧跟着你们的是两个凑在一起窃窃私语的小孩子。"}
{"time": 1776192111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1603104013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没了，只看过那么多...不过难道露露真的觉得是我笨手笨脚把水晶球弄碎了吗”"}
{"time": 1776192238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625539795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1036451717]看到夹在中间的两个多少有些觉得煞风景，气鼓鼓地扭回头“下午伊斯塔的课是哪节来着？”"}
{"time": 1776192410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629705697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不经意间看到伊芙气鼓鼓的回头，看她这样子感觉心情大好"}
{"time": 1776192520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "408150338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=629705697]露莉亚的脸上也挂着些笑，\"当然不是，那么说只是凸显诺诺比较笨嘛，不过...粉发，有想法吗？\""}
{"time": 1776192550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "671803296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摇摇头“粉头发的女生也太多了，上次骗露露那个不也是粉头发”"}
{"time": 1776192557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1467358509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=625539795]\"大家都会有不得了的未来呢～\"艾琳清清嗓子，\"第一节，和希姆教授是一节课。\""}
{"time": 1776192580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612381324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=671803296]\"说不定都不是女生?\"眨眼"}
{"time": 1776192686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "108861547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1467358509]“呃呃……要不翘了……不，魔导器课程还是……就没什么能让人同时出现在两个地方的办法吗……”"}
{"time": 1776192712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125620868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说临下课十分钟说要上厕所提前跑路）"}
{"time": 1776192831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703863842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃，粉色长发，应该是女生吧...不过好像还真不一定”"}
{"time": 1776192953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "531647226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=108861547]\"怎么可能有这种事啦。\"她耸耸肩，\"我觉得不急吧，反正姐姐...自己也搞得定的。\""}
{"time": 1776193005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822346190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=703863842]\"嗯哼?不过诺诺怀疑上次问路的那个粉发女生?\"她攥着手回忆，\"我记得是两个丸子头...穿着很宽大的大袖和服。\""}
{"time": 1776193175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050920722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没怀疑她啦，怎么会那么正巧，我的意思是粉头发的女生太多了 还是得从房间入手了”"}
{"time": 1776193314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774515890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=531647226]“你倒是一点都不急……”晃了晃她的胳膊“那是你亲姐姐诶”"}
{"time": 1776193351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857807575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么担心都不为过的吧”"}
{"time": 1776193457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1032431398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1050920722]\"房间就更没有线索了。\"她耸耸肩，在你面前挥挥手，\"倒悬?上下颠倒?谁知道会在哪里啦。\""}
{"time": 1776193504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861925437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉说到倒悬，第一反应就是血族吧”"}
{"time": 1776193518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297298430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1857807575]\"好啦好啦...\"她抓了抓你的手，\"别摇了别摇了...我有分寸的。\""}
{"time": 1776193596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1316649801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1861925437]\"那倒是很方便的事啦。\"她伸手拍拍你的脑袋，\"不过我觉得和她应该没什么关系?\""}
{"time": 1776193664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "963746665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，下午上完课去图书馆吧，在那找找吧”"}
{"time": 1776193760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622391169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1297298430]“……信你。”摇了摇头“哎，我什么时候变得操心这个操心那个的……”"}
{"time": 1776194206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323620763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(休)"}
{"time": 1776194248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "914893795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "）"}
{"time": 1776194251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "501348379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（眠）"}
