{"time": 1776238697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759464044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=622391169]（）"}
{"time": 1776238986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1790627867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=963746665]\"图书馆会有上下颠倒的房间吗？\"露露皱眉，明显不怎么信"}
{"time": 1776239020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943637599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不清楚，只是去那先找找希古娜，找到她说不定就有更多线索了”"}
{"time": 1776239025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1951473473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=622391169]\"谁知道呢？可能是到了要做老妈子的年龄了。\"她抽回手盖在嘴前窃笑，\"噗噗...\""}
{"time": 1776239349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2116082599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1943637599]\"希古娜...嗯...学院都没有她的信息。\"露露摇摇头，\"不过我们也只能去试试了。\""}
{"time": 1776239376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125025017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……真的假的”倒也没往心里去，真实原因自己心里也有数，只是随便摇摇头“或许命里总有段劳碌的日子，而我的恰好就在这段时间”"}
{"time": 1776239881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860672673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2125025017]\"不是老妈子的话，哪来那么多随口就来的老气横秋的发言?\"耸肩，\"算了，也许是家族里某个老怪物也说不定呢。\""}
{"time": 1776239895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1608518832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "说着话，食堂已经在眼前。"}
{"time": 1776240151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887894666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不如说其实是喜欢装老成的年龄吧。真老了估计就说不出这些话了”进食堂"}
{"time": 1776240168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1254700467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "进食堂"}
{"time": 1776240291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096557988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "上午第二节课结束的食堂里人满为患，大多数窗口都排着长长的队伍。"}
{"time": 1776240425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "978923067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "排队之余，看看能不能偶遇另一个紫头发吧.jpg"}
{"time": 1776240439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243696025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说起来，伊斯塔喜欢吃什么？”"}
{"time": 1776240459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "619931235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好多人，先占个位置吧”"}
{"time": 1776240491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780712536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看有没有什么连着的空着的人六人位置"}
{"time": 1776240727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1969790122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=243696025]\"嗯...姐姐喜欢的东西...\"她扭头眯了你一眼，\"那还用专门问么?\""}
{"time": 1776240816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1114438046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1780712536]这个点很难有这种座位了，最多只有两人的连坐。"}
{"time": 1776240865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1464416898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看样子只能分开坐了”跟那几个人说一声，然后占个两人位去打饭"}
{"time": 1776241060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320040326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1969790122]“那这么多次还没偶遇上一次，该说运气不好还是没缘分？”摇摇头，顺着队伍一点一点前进"}
{"time": 1776241081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1570802708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你说一声就说啊)"}
{"time": 1776241087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315830036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这人不就在你旁边)"}
{"time": 1776241112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568367753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“米娜，好像没那种六人的空位了，我们分开吧”"}
{"time": 1776241123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363498322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也算是说了吧.jpg）"}
{"time": 1776241139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391698989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（听不见，已经在排队了）"}
{"time": 1776241248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357436154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "艾琳点头表示知道了，妃花看了伊芙一眼坐下替艾琳奈占了座位。"}
{"time": 1776241324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1976781506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不如说算人数的时候为什么要算我（））"}
{"time": 1776241510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298747859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(然后呢)"}
{"time": 1776241525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026238801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去买饭，经典鸭血粉丝汤"}
{"time": 1776241974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1925779184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*完全没管后面发生了什么.jpg。依旧排队，依旧踮起脚来找紫头发"}
{"time": 1776241985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1531075683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来翔哥是不是完全不知道艾琳还有个姐姐）"}
{"time": 1776242002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "966914240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（知道有姐姐，但不知道是谁）"}
{"time": 1776242024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710194106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "排队时候顺便找找人群里的粉头发"}
{"time": 1776242227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "416010269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "露莉亚倒没有买鸭血粉丝汤，而是选了其他的菜，大概是某种肉菜的干炒。排队的人倒是不多，很快你们两就在桌前坐下了。"}
{"time": 1776242260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609992879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "边吃边找粉头发.jpg"}
{"time": 1776242293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "808570448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1925779184](你又是排的什么)"}
{"time": 1776242319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383799955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（艾琳排什么就跟着排什么啊）"}
{"time": 1776242470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "616780732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=609992879]粉发确实算不上常见，眼睛在人群里打量许久，最后只看到那么一两个符合目标的"}
{"time": 1776242501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761294797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "和印象里的比对一下"}
{"time": 1776242567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "815983516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你印象里的是什么样子?恐怕你比对不出来"}
{"time": 1776242587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30063744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "色泽长度什么的"}
{"time": 1776242603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1724931663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "算了，怎么可能幕后黑手还会来食堂吃饭"}
{"time": 1776242610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209733502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你发现了）"}
{"time": 1776242824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1872402339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1925779184]艾琳排着个小火锅的窗口，看上去红油油一片。"}
{"time": 1776242966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223543877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "开吃开吃，现在一天两顿血，味道一顿比一顿好，感觉有些开心...不过，有些事情，还是得告诉露露"}
