{"time": 1776243722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "416575754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你又知道待不了多久.jpg）"}
{"time": 1776243758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1605275688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=892664934]你四处张望的时候，艾琳已经取了自己的餐，一小盆红油飘满的铁锅，散发着刺激味蕾的辛辣味，她看了眼你，\"咦～?\""}
{"time": 1776243953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "188393966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我还不饿啦，而且排两个队好麻烦”摆了摆手“不用担心，我早上吃的晚……一会买点面包什么的就好”"}
{"time": 1776244389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "297079712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1095336482]她低头看了看你碗里漂浮的鸭血，固执地偏过头，\"既然是我自己选的...怎么我都会吃下去的...\""}
