{"time": 1776244560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328536538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=188393966]\"嗯哼?\"她笑嘻嘻地打量了你一圈，\"看来不仅是个事多的老妈子，还是个麻烦的老顽固啊？顽固?\""}
{"time": 1776244589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1259518729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=297079712][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “不喜欢鸭血的话，可以尝尝粉丝....”"}
{"time": 1776244828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331632322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=328536538]两手空空地找到座位之后就往桌子上一趴，头发散在自己这边的半张桌子上，一副受伤的样子“唔嗯……怎么艾琳也攻击我……”"}
{"time": 1776245072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479463412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1259518729]\"唉...\"她伸手拂开头发，脑袋朝你这边靠近一些，\"那诺诺喂我。\""}
{"time": 1776245119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510604671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好....”用筷子卷起粉丝，然后喂到她嘴里"}
{"time": 1776245142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78782346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=331632322]\"谁叫你表现成这个样子?\"艾琳把餐盘放下，手指搭在自己的下巴上，\"不够优雅，有失分寸～\""}
{"time": 1776245222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1707377875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=510604671]\"好烫...!\"露莉亚微张着嘴巴，刚碰到就触电般移开，一边瞪着你，一边揉揉自己的嘴唇。"}
{"time": 1776245262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "831398468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？对不起...对不起”稍微吹吹“呼....呼...对不起了露露，现在应该不烫了”"}
{"time": 1776245533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1645302380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=78782346]“毕竟我是实用主义者……而且反正没人知道我是哪来的”撑起下巴“今天晚上好像没什么事……”"}
{"time": 1776245562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063083974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=831398468]\"不要了...\"露莉亚低下头懒得再看你，自己扒起饭。"}
