{"time": 1776245628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771777252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你就不会吹她嘴.jpg）"}
{"time": 1776246400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "724831206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1645302380]\"昨晚很长，今晚就不一定了。\"她吹着火锅里捞上来的食材，就着米饭吃起来，时不时还要停下自己吹口气，看上去很像是小猫。"}
{"time": 1776246436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025788472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起么，露露，再给我一个机会呗”"}
