{"time": 1776308182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558122928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1004961507]\"第一次出远门?\"她端起盘子起身，边走边说，\"看不出来～看着就像是...很没有牵绊的那类诶?\""}
{"time": 1776308201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224924150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1478111364]她的手躲开了，不过没和你拉远距离。"}
{"time": 1776308303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940553572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“别生气了么，给你这个”剥一颗糖递给她"}
{"time": 1776308405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1324411357", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=558122928]“只是看起来吧。”跟在她后面“而且怎样会算看起来很有牵绊？口袋里装着放了家人画像的怀抱，然后时不时远眺家的方向home sick？”"}
{"time": 1776308427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "901639910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=558122928] \n “只是看起来吧。”跟在她后面“而且怎样会算看起来很有牵绊？口袋里装着放了家人画像的怀表，然后时不时远眺家的方向home sick？”"}
{"time": 1776308557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430830692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=940553572]\"哼!\"她偏了偏脑袋，总算出了声，虽然是一声带着气音的哼，随后转过头看着你，很刻意的冷脸瞪着你，微微露出虎牙。"}
{"time": 1776308578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "905110312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是哈努兄弟）"}
{"time": 1776308620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949119349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我喂露露好了”直接把糖喂到她嘴里"}
{"time": 1776308672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299368790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=901639910]\"唔...一种感觉?\"她端着盘子往回收餐具的地方走，\"我也说不好，大概...怀表会挡一次弓箭，女儿的项链会挡一次魔法这样?\""}
{"time": 1776308733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577224048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（发出一声冷酷的哼）"}
{"time": 1776308739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473577616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1949119349]\"唔唔...\"露莉亚显然没反应过来，糖已经塞进了嘴里，她瞪大眼睛，随后咬住你的手指，不过力道很轻"}
{"time": 1776308781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528372837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉露露像只小猫一样，也不是很疼，也不是很急着把手收回来"}
{"time": 1776308887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837545477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那是什么啦。太像小说桥段了，牵绊不是什么很需要展示出来的东西吧。”手背在身后“而且家也不是那么远的东西”"}
{"time": 1776308998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "825945275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1528372837]你的动作似乎有些激怒了她，她瞪了你两眼，狠狠咬了下去"}
{"time": 1776309029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "168404245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“疼疼疼...要流血啦”"}
{"time": 1776309196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439931848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=837545477]\"不怎么远?\"她放下餐盘回头，歪着头有些疑惑，\"温斯顿离这里有三个月的路程诶?而且啦...牵绊...嗯...虽然这么说很奇怪，但是我相信姐姐这点...也算是吧。\""}
{"time": 1776309358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228258009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=168404245]\"...\"她的脑袋一扬，松开嘴，闭眼紧跟着脑袋撇向一边，顺带着抱起手臂，不过糖没掉出来"}
{"time": 1776309396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "406393308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉手指有点痛，稍微吹一吹..."}
{"time": 1776309540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "6157074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=439931848]“不怎么远就是……不怎么远啦”故作神秘地比个噤声的手势“不过就我的个人经验而已，这种程度还不够”"}
{"time": 1776309553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011290454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=406393308]被咬住的地方有些淤青，但总归不太深，也没有破皮。"}
