{"time": 1776398063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1030675943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1320310166]\"我也没说什么吧？\"她嘴角勾了勾，\"现在这副样子，倒像是被偷了小鱼干的小猫。\""}
{"time": 1776398107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "907276994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2042080947]她最后打量了你一下，点点头跟上前面的队伍，依然还是保持在外围的位置。"}
{"time": 1776398132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521324793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露...明天我想去礼堂，你有什么打算吗”"}
{"time": 1776398216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924863297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1030675943]“嗯……”揉了揉自己的脸，尽量恢复到平常的状态。这样下去会叫人担心的，尽量看着艾琳“原来很在意我？”"}
{"time": 1776398300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987807678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=521324793]\"...\"她刚刚一直在旁边听着，一声不吭，现在显然也没有吱声的打算，看见你转过头，身子一转，继续往前走了。"}
{"time": 1776398369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1548918688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟在她身后喽"}
