{"time": 1776398782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031476473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过这次就原谅你了，是有一点担心吧。\""}
{"time": 1776398801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2048217289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1548918688]那你们也走到了宿舍楼下，正看见艾琳和伊芙在这里"}
{"time": 1776398842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588942851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=7014F0B032F443DDBFD6B46B043B0648.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRq8A0FfjyHgG7UEdzZrH5MLSDdchiotAYg_woonK2dr4H0kwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQKM4_efjAeu3jEjvf-Un45noC3ZmCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAESMKDzI4bhMJrNycmR3S8PYdCnbyWan7H1ewdwQDhsWmLwP5LhVkO4FgHcSCA8VYjPRQ,file_size=105000]（神了）"}
{"time": 1776398884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "372933564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(谁先干的)"}
{"time": 1776398887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1996957424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(看片?)"}
{"time": 1776398897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166048577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（要不呢）"}
{"time": 1776399704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2085123843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（全世界都知道kanavi喜欢f6）"}
{"time": 1776399713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2014689783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是可能最先干的是厂长）"}
{"time": 1776399851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "221624004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1031476473]“你也没有哪次没有原谅吧？”摇了摇头“你说得对……毕竟大部分情况下我也只做得到嘴上不饶人，可能不知不觉就养成了习惯吧”"}
{"time": 1776400206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1503326627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2048217289]她们似乎在聊着什么，不过你们走近之后，正对着你们的艾琳倒是发现了你们，对着你们挥挥手。"}
{"time": 1776400338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936875078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=221624004]她一边对你身后挥了挥手，一边开口，\"嘛，性格强势一些也没什么问题吧，我没觉得有什么不好哦?\""}
{"time": 1776400703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761704821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "过去看看"}
{"time": 1776400712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1347987258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1936875078]“嗯……算强势吗？”手掌张握一番“其实算是吓唬人吧，有时候确实能占点好处，占不了的时候……嘛，到那时候本来也没别的办法啦，我确实自然挺擅长狐假虎威的……总之，不用担心，我也没打算改啦”"}
{"time": 1776400776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1996232803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1761704821]那你正好听到了伊芙开口的后半段，\"嘛，到那时候本来也没别的办法啦，我确实自然挺擅长狐假虎威的……总之，不用担心，我也没打算改啦。\""}
{"time": 1776400933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2030213979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1347987258]艾琳对你眨了眨眼，朝你身后努努脑袋。你自然也听到越来越近的脚步。"}
{"time": 1776401080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704563859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2030213979]“知道了……总之，我没事的。先回去午休咯”"}
{"time": 1776402624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224106247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(睡着了？)"}
{"time": 1776402677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410735215", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们继续聊，我先回去了”回宿舍"}
{"time": 1776402689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572124218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一起回宿舍了"}
{"time": 1776402947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810062735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(什么也不做?)"}
{"time": 1776402955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105401943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(什么也不做?)"}
{"time": 1776403131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910084915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（显然没有我的事吧）"}
{"time": 1776403135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055019542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我看翔哥也不打算理我）"}
{"time": 1776403185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906252424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(总之，要是不打算说话各自给个动作咯，眼神之类的都行吧)"}
{"time": 1776403237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1450706963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听着那家伙好像要走了，稍微等会艾琳，不过什么也不准备说"}
{"time": 1776403249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "303946239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*不打算有什么反应，往自己宿舍楼去了"}
{"time": 1776403291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2141490806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那么你们就此分开"}
{"time": 1776403348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135915560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1450706963]艾琳似乎看了一会才过来，露莉亚已经先上楼回了宿舍，\"在等我?\""}
{"time": 1776403487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148264518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是吧，你刚刚不是朝我挥了挥手”"}
{"time": 1776403611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776556156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=148264518]\"嗯哼?\"她似乎心情还算不错，\"唔...露莉亚呢？怎么没有一起?\""}
{"time": 1776403636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "351944354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“闹了一点点点小矛盾...”"}
{"time": 1776403950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1210645904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=351944354]\"一点点?\"她和你并肩上楼，\"怎么啦？\""}
{"time": 1776403977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410920865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...没什么大事了，我到时候在好好道个歉应该就没事了”"}
{"time": 1776403997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871932146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "喂东西不小心烫到了，这种话好难说出口"}
{"time": 1776404023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1413404287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（睡会）"}
{"time": 1776404229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010523003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1410920865]她似乎是看出你的脸色有点窘迫，还有些心不在焉，走近了一些，伸出手在你面前晃晃，\"真的没事吗？嗯...\""}
{"time": 1776404264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "900504502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的啦...”拍拍脸“真的不是什么大事了”"}
{"time": 1776404443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462040834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=900504502]\"一直不说，我反而更好奇诶...\"她收回手，看向你的表情染上些笑，\"嘛～虽然闹矛盾是很正常的事情啦，不过露莉亚是不是有点太生气了？\""}
{"time": 1776404467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530920150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可能是我太笨拙了...”戳手指"}
{"time": 1776405027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069446535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1530920150]\"哦～?\"她快步走到你面前，从高到低挡在你身前，\"那样的话，我就真的很感兴趣了...说说看嘛，我说不定可以帮帮诺薇菈?\""}
{"time": 1776405093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1440435851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的吗...那..那我就告诉你了”声音逐渐变小“露露让我喂她..结果把她烫到了”"}
{"time": 1776405195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1411145925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1440435851]\"噗...\"她一时没忍住，连忙捂住嘴，脑袋偏向另一边"}
{"time": 1776405434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334702623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你别嘲笑我了”有些羞愧“所以...办法”"}
{"time": 1776405548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1492792497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=334702623]她轻轻咳了两声，\"咳咳...这个嘛。\"她点点自己的嘴唇，\"用冰冰的东西盖上去不就好啦?要我推荐吗？\""}
{"time": 1776405588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715231711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“给她买个冰激凌....”"}
{"time": 1776405616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "724480173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还有更直接的办法呢～\""}
{"time": 1776405624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190572292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1776406090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1581891099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"算了。\"她摇摇头，\"这个要你自己想啦。\""}
{"time": 1776406255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1955168992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "随后她转过身，声音带着愉悦，\"具体怎么做呢～全看诺薇菈自己咯?\""}
{"time": 1776406349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677575554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想不明白，去买冰激凌了"}
{"time": 1776406400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208856854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（冰激凌和冰淇淋的关系是类似于神奇宝贝和宠物小精灵吗）"}
{"time": 1776406910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "381257323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是一个东西吧？)"}
{"time": 1776406923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804762349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(先休息一下)"}
