{"time": 1776685036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "238245979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=677575554]她没有跟着你，自己回了宿舍。虽然大概在食堂确实买得到冰淇淋，不过等你就这么拿回去，大抵会有些化了"}
{"time": 1776685057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "920923196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1712056203]（不是中午吗）"}
{"time": 1776685060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055461578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=55358520](都行吧)"}
{"time": 1776685076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616956550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不怕，我有元素戒指可以降温，而且天也没那么热"}
{"time": 1776685078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552521997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(咦，记错了喵)"}
{"time": 1776685088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227227693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你就当前面半句不存在)"}
{"time": 1776685176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323636576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "没什么特别想做的，试管拿去清洗一下备用，随后爬上床，一边练习一下元素转化一边发呆"}
{"time": 1776685203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163828530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1616956550](你记得你分了哪两个给露露了吗)"}
{"time": 1776685221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136061340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "大概会午休一番吧，来了玛纳利亚之后总是觉得休息不够"}
{"time": 1776685267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749152074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=163828530]（风和地）"}
{"time": 1776685290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "313656924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我手上水火以太）"}
{"time": 1776685345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "892557298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=323636576]闲暇的中午像是乐曲间章的休息时间，宿舍的通风很好，空气里带着春天独有的清新感，躺了那么一会。你听到啪嗒一声的开门声。"}
{"time": 1776685378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "206128122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1616956550](那你买吧，show time)"}
{"time": 1776685414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267636904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去食堂买一个看起来好吃又好看的冰激凌"}
{"time": 1776685542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795620670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(长啥样，什么口味)"}
{"time": 1776685626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136657755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=892557298]“欢迎回来，和艾琳奈相处得还行？”有一搭没一搭地开口，末了还打个哈欠"}
{"time": 1776685665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286463509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "呃，种类有些繁多，买个三色球好了，草莓，香草，巧克力"}
{"time": 1776686022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149849956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=286463509]对方手法娴熟地给你打了一个三色球，份量看上去还可以，三个球叠在一起，每个都有半拳大小。"}
{"time": 1776686036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1548489001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一手交钱，一手接冰淇淋"}
{"time": 1776686207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "425760903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2136657755]\"嗯...\"床下传来极轻的回应，\"艾琳奈...说自己也是从乡下来的...忍不住...多说了一些...\""}
{"time": 1776686261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2080816150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1548489001]她递给你了，几种香气混杂在一起，接过的手四周的空气也变得有些凉。"}
{"time": 1776686343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588968679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=425760903]“喔，入学后的第一个朋友？”靠近床沿一些“可喜可贺，晚饭吃蛋糕庆祝一下吧”"}
{"time": 1776686365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937395617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "催动戒指，降低周围空气的温度"}
{"time": 1776686574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "735462847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=937395617]细微的冰粒出现在冰淇淋，大部分落到地上，小部分落到你手心"}
{"time": 1776686627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677031433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回宿舍喽"}
{"time": 1776686694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "241278426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "回咯"}
{"time": 1776686801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1558802965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1588968679]\"诶?感觉没必要啦...只是话题多了一些...\"她似乎到了自己的座位坐下，轻轻喘息。"}
{"time": 1776686898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990420062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=677031433]来回一折腾，午休的时间走了四分之一，回宿舍的时候里面静悄悄的，艾琳奈倒是坐在自己座位上，其他两人已经上了床。"}
{"time": 1776686968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051916095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1558802965]“……”不声不响，视线越过床沿，沉默地观察下面的情况"}
{"time": 1776687104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "69463273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1990420062][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “露露....”小声，看看她睡着没"}
{"time": 1776687179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1607521862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1051916095]妃花背对着你坐在座位上，一头橘发铺开在身后，似乎没注意到，或者说注意到了也没回头，\"不过...听她说来自乡下的时候，我感觉居然有一点...庆幸...这...不应该...\""}
{"time": 1776687278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322400570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=69463273]露露的被子微不可查地动了一下，但她背对着你，完全没有转身。"}
{"time": 1776687310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989474135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，翔哥）"}
{"time": 1776687313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842649180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（早干嘛去了）"}
{"time": 1776687321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "59392106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个，露露对不起，给你买了冰激凌吃”"}
{"time": 1776687411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "303630390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1607521862]“喔，原来是这样。”侧躺着撑着下巴，半开玩笑地说“听起来我要是也从乡下来就更好了？”"}
{"time": 1776687487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "496415908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=59392106]艾琳奈投来视线，但露露依然完全没有理你的意思，看样子难道说睡着了？"}
{"time": 1776687585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1545130237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=303630390]\"不...不对...\"妃花摇着脑袋，回头对上你的视线又低下头，\"有这种想法...庆幸什么的....我说不上来，但肯定不是正确的\""}
{"time": 1776687834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961871021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1545130237]扭回仰躺的姿势，压得床铺轻响“是我我就不会想这些事情……又不是你把人赶去乡下的。不过随便你啦，这才像你”"}
{"time": 1776687919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095775691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1961871021]\"...下次见面，要去道个歉呢...\"她似乎是自言自语，\"啊...下午的课还完全没有准备...\""}
{"time": 1776688163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "296065293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说不定你不说人家还不知道。何必呢。”语调比起反问更像陈述“入门课程没关系的啦，熬不住了的话，就先休息？”"}
{"time": 1776688251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689718180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=296065293]\"嗯...我很快就会休息的...先试一下吧...\"她那边没再传来什么动静，眠意涌上你的大脑。"}
{"time": 1776688362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "384987927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "没什么负担，想睡就睡.jpg"}
{"time": 1776688409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1843324645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "呜，睡着了，捧着冰淇淋，坐在自己位置上看着她等她醒来，同时催动魔力，别让冰淇淋花了"}
{"time": 1776688412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478602025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "化了"}
{"time": 1776688445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335002174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你要发出什么声音吗)"}
{"time": 1776688484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "616712626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "安安静静的等着"}
{"time": 1776688747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "434458873", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你听到窸窸窣窣衣服摩擦的声音，紧接着是轻轻的翻动声，露露在床上转过身，对上你的目光赶忙又闭上眼"}
{"time": 1776688759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91011600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=616712626]你听到窸窸窣窣衣服摩擦的声音，紧接着是轻轻的翻动声，露露在床上转过身，对上你的目光赶忙又闭上眼"}
{"time": 1776689416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454960131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(卧槽，好难吃的炒饭)"}
{"time": 1776689429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648853581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(从第一口夹生开始就完蛋了)"}
{"time": 1776689580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2024384552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就一直看着她~盯"}
{"time": 1776689642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082247010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那你去吃鸡腿吧）"}
