{"time": 1776704974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861669882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（这把不是我一人carry）"}
{"time": 1776704993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402994554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你carry的时候我在逛淘宝啊）"}
{"time": 1776705158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764158975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1479080671]\"...那..规矩你知道的。\"她坐起身，\"嗯...你知道吗?\""}
{"time": 1776705197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1369742999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯..我喂你好了”看眼艾琳奈，应该没看自己吧"}
{"time": 1776705439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2413057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "确认她没看自己，用血做个勺子吧"}
{"time": 1776705495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599761350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1369742999]怎么可能，艾琳奈睁着大大的眼睛盯着你这边看，嘴巴微张着没开口。露莉亚从床上下来，干脆坐在自己的桌子上"}
{"time": 1776705575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "112654052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那我离她近的手拿着冰激凌，身体挡住另一只，制造一个她看不见的盲区，然后造一个勺子"}
{"time": 1776705749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "360523190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=112654052]\"嗯?\"露露低着头，有些神色不明，双手攥着桌角。"}
{"time": 1776705796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1850423135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "用勺子崴一点“啊～张嘴，不过有点冰，不要一下吃完”"}
{"time": 1776706087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651971520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1850423135]她抿着嘴，咬着唇，视线越过你看向你身后随后躲开，从桌子上跳下来靠到你旁边，脸色红得可怕，说话断断续续\"算...算了...我自己...来...\""}
{"time": 1776706143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795143335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？...”不太理解发生了什么，把冰激凌递给她，回头看眼什么情况"}
{"time": 1776706245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "13549816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一瞬间露露的眼神似乎有些埋怨，她接过冰淇淋，挖起一勺抿了一口。\n后面也没什么特别的，艾琳奈不知何时没再看过来，自己坐了回去，不过红红的耳尖出卖了她。"}
{"time": 1776706291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61936655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "？刚刚艾琳奈在那里干嘛，算了不管了“怎么样，好吃吗，甜吗”"}
{"time": 1776706489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578449432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还可以吧...\"尽管红润的脸颊已经出卖了她，不过她还是尽量用很低的语调开口，\"反正...也就和烫的那下差不多。\""}
{"time": 1776706511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230689773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露喜欢就好”"}
{"time": 1776706726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "852865914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"喂...\"她把勺子插在冰淇淋里，空着的手拽住了你的衣袖，\"不准一天到晚...自说自话...真是的...我不喜欢...\"说着她松开手，一下挖出了半个最上面的巧克力球，\"啊～～～\""}
{"time": 1776706775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81522560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯...”点点头“谢谢露露，啊～”张开嘴"}
{"time": 1776706783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191991224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来我还没写）"}
{"time": 1776706983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1017010699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她把勺子半放在你嘴边，明显有些赌气地鼓了鼓脸颊，\"听明白我的话没有...笨蛋...\""}
{"time": 1776707033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1344430544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个自说自话...是...”"}
{"time": 1776707160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1612499191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没等你说完，她把勺子怼进你的嘴里，半块巧克力冰淇淋球直直塞进嘴里"}
{"time": 1776707313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104564623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "冰冰凉凉的，感觉还不赖，至于味道的话，只能说勺子味道不赖"}
{"time": 1776707428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1397382621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "初次感到的奶油味过后，过量摄入冰块导致的头痛紧随而至"}
{"time": 1776707458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "456584774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（为什么会头疼）"}
{"time": 1776707492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "707780617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“唔....”快速吃下冰激凌，然后敲两下头"}
{"time": 1776707505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1092333614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（脑血管收缩）"}
{"time": 1776707714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338905694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你没试过一次吃大口的雪糕嘛)"}
{"time": 1776707730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419284905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（呃，没）"}
{"time": 1776707882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266082034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=707780617]露莉亚看你这幅样子，摇摇头，把雪糕放下来，伸手帮你揉着太阳穴，\"冬天的时候没试过吃雪的家伙...\"语气带着些数落"}
{"time": 1776707901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1104235917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你吃过？）"}
{"time": 1776707937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167724281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....上次雪天追露露摔倒时候倒是吃了一口...不过也没头晕”"}
{"time": 1776708050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679595538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我肯定)"}
{"time": 1776708052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737211670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(吃过)"}
{"time": 1776708127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598126161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1167724281]她的手心温热，不紧不慢地帮你揉着太阳穴，很快那种脑子一紧的感觉就散去了。露莉亚叹口气，\"真是的...笨成这样...没人照顾的话...到底会怎么样啦?\""}
{"time": 1776708150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808913868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那露露一直陪着我就没事了..”"}
{"time": 1776708159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664472979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（肯定吃过啊）"}
{"time": 1776708163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549253308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不然怎么知道）"}
{"time": 1776708238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1834738985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（冰淇淋还好，冰沙就很明显）"}
{"time": 1776708308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "658212894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1808913868]\"只怕这么下去，我会先被诺诺整死在食堂里。\"她翻个白眼，小口小口挖着冰淇淋，自顾自吃起来"}
{"time": 1776708699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "867047350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不会啦...不会啦”"}
{"time": 1776709111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1515664022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=867047350]\"不会?\"她伸手捏了捏你的脸，随后松开，\"算了，懒得管了。\"剩下吃了一半的冰淇淋和沾了不少奶油的勺子放在桌上，\"午休都过了一半了...下午犯困怎么办？\""}
{"time": 1776709138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283136716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露再去补个觉？”"}
{"time": 1776709445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "195168124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1283136716]\"嗯...\"露露捂着嘴打了个长长的哈欠，\"诺诺不困?\""}
{"time": 1776709487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "500036885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还好？...不过我等下也去睡十几分钟吧”"}
{"time": 1776709782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399831230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=500036885]\"唔...\"她鼓了鼓脸，\"勉勉强强...\"随后最后捏了捏你的脸，爬上床盖上了被子"}
{"time": 1776709853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706202107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那一半不吃了吗...”"}
{"time": 1776710067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802158346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（秘书冲拳剑圣好有操作）"}
{"time": 1776710087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1391819444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（两波四杀挽狂澜于既倒）"}
{"time": 1776710154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468622420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=706202107]\"留给诺诺了。\"她拖着语调，轻飘飘地回你"}
{"time": 1776710205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1302902685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "端着冰激凌 自己也不是很爱吃这样，艾琳奈还没睡来着，过去找她“还不睡吗...”"}
{"time": 1776710465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "829410832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1302902685]\"我一般不午休的。\"她刚刚一直偏着头，现在听到你的声音才看向你，脸有些红，\"嗯...怎么了...\""}
{"time": 1776710498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1202576748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾琳奈不是很喜欢吃甜品么，要尝尝吗”把冰激凌递给她"}
{"time": 1776710887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361388408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1202576748]\"嗯...\"她看着被挖的有些七零八落，只剩下草莓味的冰淇淋，犹豫了一会，\"嗯...给我吗?\""}
{"time": 1776710967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "377064413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....呃...抱歉，看着有点不太好看，那艾琳奈挑个完好的部位挖块尝尝吧，真的蛮好吃的”"}
{"time": 1776711081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338846614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没...没关系...\"她连续眨了好几下眼，最后点了点头，\"那我就收下了...诺诺也...呃，诺薇菈也去睡觉吧。\""}
{"time": 1776711123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1416545053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没关系啊，艾琳奈叫我诺诺就蛮好的”"}
{"time": 1776711264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754681729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我会负责喊醒你们的。\"她接过冰淇淋放在桌上，对你点点头"}
{"time": 1776711295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018439723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢艾琳奈了...”也去睡了"}
{"time": 1776711595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "945437012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(明天见)"}
{"time": 1776711606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803806023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(该上下午的课了)"}
{"time": 1776733745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302119461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有无，虽然翔哥百分之百没醒）"}
{"time": 1776733892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632025584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是吧)"}
{"time": 1776733985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564742757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我肯定是，都行)"}
{"time": 1776734123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094394681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（很难的啦，除非下午的课我直接旷）"}
