{"time": 1776743603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564426029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1018439723]（）"}
{"time": 1776744106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835178958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1018439723]意识有些朦朦胧胧，似乎做了个梦，但梦醒时惆怅地掉了眼泪，你的胳膊被人轻轻碰了碰"}
{"time": 1776744129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637532154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "揉揉眼睛，伸个懒腰，起床"}
{"time": 1776744144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1033199064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=687892438]醒过来的时间倒是差不多，离下午希姆的课还有二十分钟左右。"}
{"time": 1776744200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "579482732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "下床，收拾好魔导器，等妃花一起出发"}
{"time": 1776744206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "252754860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=637532154]喊你起床的人见状点点头，没有再多说什么，从你床边离开，转头去喊露莉亚了。"}
{"time": 1776744408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "44920683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=579482732]她早早就在床下，不知是早就睡醒，还是没有睡着，看你下来，停下手里把玩着戒指的动作，深吸一口气，\"感觉怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1776744452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611532096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=252754860][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 去洗漱一下"}
{"time": 1776744575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619787119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=252754860]不一会儿，这间陷入睡美人陷阱的宿舍就被彻底唤醒，等你洗漱结束，里面的三人已经基本收拾好了。\n艾琳奈桌上没有看见那盒冰淇淋，露露看着你眼神有些躲闪，至于艾琳，则是在认真地摩挲左手上的手镯。"}
{"time": 1776744618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225032678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=2C881563EFE81372F528A1060782F624.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSMYeuuPovO_55P7-ZmWyHSR5J68xi61zIg_woosdaOvon-kwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ0-ADEETL3s-538AEB9cPN3oCGVmCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMMR3n1ttu1M7ANjB0u7qJS_bc7SUX-QJmLSvA4fUC6LwHHR9pJHiyDhsmU9enxkSow,file_size=830394]"}
{"time": 1776744801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "31821333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=44920683]“我？”指了指自己“我能有什么事啦，神完气足”"}
{"time": 1776744923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "537427966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=31821333]\"神完气足?\"她掩面扑哧一笑，\"没看出来诶?\""}
{"time": 1776744986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951397119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "带好魔导器课课本"}
{"time": 1776744998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "352541609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "出发！"}
{"time": 1776745051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810426064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=537427966]“说明我可能始终如一”懒得照镜子“反正一如往常嘛。没问题的”"}
{"time": 1776745179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1273173860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=352541609]那么你打头走在前面，一路上艾琳和艾琳奈在你身后小声对话，露莉亚落到最后面。"}
{"time": 1776745207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "988863428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "倒也不用那么快，回去和露莉亚并排"}
{"time": 1776745319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133500404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1810426064]\"好好好～\"她摊摊手，\"不过想到下午会做的测验...嗯...还是有点紧张了。\"说着她拉开宿舍门，清风拂面而过"}
{"time": 1776745402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837489948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=133500404]“反正轮不到我垫底，吧。”舒展一番身体，这就出发“放学后还有事呢”"}
{"time": 1776745832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785416032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=988863428]艾琳奈朝你投来一个目光，露莉亚低着头，\"嗯....\"看见你过来轻轻嗯了一声，不过没继续开口。"}
{"time": 1776745847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639267196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=837489948]\"诶?放学之后?还打算做什么吗？\""}
{"time": 1776745952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "69585660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不怎么抱希望地找找伊斯塔，然后泡一泡图书馆……虽然说周五下午更适合放松啦”过去牵起她的手“不过有些事还是要做的”"}
{"time": 1776746380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418641765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=785416032][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “怎么了，没睡够吗？”"}
{"time": 1776746493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1977344847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=69585660]妃花的手心很暖和，软软的，握在手心像是温热的钵仔糕，\"嘛～要我陪着伊芙吗？\""}
{"time": 1776746565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897266991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1977344847]“你有别的想做的事就去呗？如你所说，学院里的日子很珍贵。趁你还有心情享受的时候，不妨多放松放松？”"}
{"time": 1776746580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "31660359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=418641765]\"倒也不是啦...只是中午发了好大脾气...嗯...\"她的脸颊攀上一点红晕，\"感觉不太好...对诺诺...\""}
{"time": 1776746997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1862872945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（困了）"}
