{"time": 1776753910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1591337781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=5BF05CDF0FD69FF05C4D3A8009676424.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQ7aMjiYWsQJJ0CgMlWrh2NHoaT-hix2QUg_woo2qqrjaz-kwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQC1A0-5PSM83NMTGpuj4AnXoChoWCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMMijqg3JGuCFIj6kJ0YKkb3DWGnM5Y2JdU4XBol-eVTwHxMC8QaCVjmpLV1EPklaQg,file_size=93361]"}
{"time": 1776754918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1591833540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（1）"}
{"time": 1776755234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887198221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1897266991]\"我也不太知道能做什么...嗯...\"她抬起一只手撑着下巴，\"现在能想到的...只有看看课本这样的事诶...还不如跟着伊芙...可是...\""}
{"time": 1776755523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587797081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1839057945]\"嗯...对不起...\"她看向你这边，\"果然还是应该道个歉...毕竟，我也只剩诺诺了...\""}
{"time": 1776755649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "319940976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=887198221]“喔，只能跟着我吗？那很惨了。”露出玩味的笑意“当然没问题，不过现在早些去占个连排的位置吧”"}
{"time": 1776755804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236876514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=319940976]\"诶?\"她连忙摇着头，\"妃花倒是觉得...惨什么的，还好啦...倒是伊芙不觉得...麻烦吗？\""}
{"time": 1776756093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95258077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“安啦，我有什么见不得人的事要自己做的时候会撇下你的，那时候就麻烦不到我了。”眼睛看路，目不斜视“平时？只是看书而已，有什么所谓？”"}
{"time": 1776756093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789643053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1587797081][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “我们两个谁跟谁啊...真的不用了....”"}
{"time": 1776756953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182715770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=789643053]\"...\"她伸手掐住你的手臂，\"这又是说的什么话?我们两谁跟谁?\"倒是没怎么用力，\"感觉像是什么...不是诺诺应该说出来的话吧？\""}
{"time": 1776757065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791543407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=95258077]\"唔唔...\"你看不见她的表情，只是语气听着有些失落，\"危险的事情也可以带上我啊...\""}
{"time": 1776757399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "571693051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1182715770][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “有什么问题吗....”"}
{"time": 1776757445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656094191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=571693051]\"哎哎...都怪你，把我都变得奇怪了。\"露露陡然松开手，\"你要怎么赔我啦？\""}
{"time": 1776757459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028663274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果是去杀人呢？”说得很直白，语调也几乎没有变“不只是危不危险的问题。你知道的，我又不是没干过”"}
{"time": 1776757503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457116285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“赔和露露一辈子在一起？”"}
{"time": 1776758096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8295938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2028663274]\"...\"她拉着你停了下来，\"那我会阻止伊芙...杀人这种事...是错误的。\""}
{"time": 1776758288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418706881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=457116285]\"嗯哼?\"她抬手随意捏了捏你的脸，\"一辈子是很沉重的话题诶?真的能一辈子吗？\""}
{"time": 1776758509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95873526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”不得不也停下来，转头看向她“或许吧，其实我也不太喜欢那种感觉。我又不是什么变态杀人魔，只是没办……”顿了顿，看向自己反复张握的另一只手“好吧，这么说也挺不负责任的，但是我想不到更好的办法，也懒得想了”"}
{"time": 1776758616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1114655989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...我已经失去过露露两...一次了，不想再发生那种事情了”"}
{"time": 1776759111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330260090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=95873526]\"昨天上课的时候，皮雅西教授说过独角兽的话题吧...\"妃花深深吸了口气，\"我觉得对于我们来说也是一样的，一旦沾染了杀人这种事...就没有纯洁可言了...所以。\"她摇头，\"我不能看着这种事发生。\""}
{"time": 1776759161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136906854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1114655989]\"好啦好啦。\"露莉亚松开手，叉着腰，\"那些都不重要，重要的是...我现在还在这里，对吗？\""}
{"time": 1776759175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960016946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯....”"}
{"time": 1776759472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1066000291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=330260090]“虽然我以前不太想承认。”抬了抬眉毛“虽然是被诱骗，但是我已经杀过人了，已经发生过了。纯洁不是我期盼的东西，我有更需要在乎的东西。你在乎的话，我最多只能保证不在你眼前动手”"}
{"time": 1776760342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1342812031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1066000291]\"...\"翠色的眸子有些灰暗，脑袋耷拉下来，一时间她接不上任何话，只是默默跟着你走"}
{"time": 1776760362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184634152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=960016946]\"好啦～\"说这话，教学楼已经到了你面前，离上课还有几分钟"}
{"time": 1776760760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103426279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1342812031]“好啦。”抿了抿嘴，手上还有些掐着脖子的幻觉，故作强硬地说道“受不了的话，离开就好了。我看那几个伟光正的家伙挺对你胃口，反正投名状就在你手边……哦不，还是算了，不太安全，要不你还是去找龙芙小姐？”"}
{"time": 1776760970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900701547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只要你能弹一手好琴的话，她肯定会接纳你的”"}
{"time": 1776761003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108436982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=184634152][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 去魔导器课教室了，希望还有位置"}
{"time": 1776761533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117505313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1900701547]她紧紧握着你的手，摇摇头，\"不行...虽然伊芙这么说...总是这么说。\"皱眉，\"但是我也可以不放弃吧？\""}
{"time": 1776761561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634231520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1108436982]你们来得不早不晚，教室里零散坐着些人，大概一半左右。"}
{"time": 1776761861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621237574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1117505313]“嗯哼。”继续往教室走，刻意不去看她“当然是看你自己，你觉得有意义的话……嘛，看我有没有余力拦吧”"}
{"time": 1776761887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1605466965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "找个四人连座的位置坐下"}
{"time": 1776762080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007626763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1621237574]你们很快就走到了教室门口，刚进去就看见已经落座在第三排的艾琳宿舍四人，\"嗯...我会加油的...\""}
{"time": 1776762257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648122148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "诺薇拉和露莉亚显然坐同一侧，那就很自然地坐到另一边艾琳那侧"}
{"time": 1776762297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103122405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "如果有人就打个招呼请他们换个位置.jpg"}
{"time": 1776762561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375415188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "落座的诺薇菈自然是看见伊芙牵着妃花走进了教室，并且很自然地坐在了艾琳旁边，同一排的座位上。"}
{"time": 1776762599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "576350695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看见妃花感觉还行，看见伊芙就感觉难受的不得了....算了看书了"}
{"time": 1776762606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105689231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“下午好。”模棱两可、毫无指代的问候"}
{"time": 1776762680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781689187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一会就能看见我在课堂上掏刀了（））"}
{"time": 1776762843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "141768224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "此外顺手的事，盯着露莉亚解析一下"}
{"time": 1776763529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "674335735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=1810F897DA33372AADB441ADC8AD9BD1.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQtG2sEgIpScf3z-xIazjrBKOMNUBjC-wIg_woor-zU98_-kwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQoWFGJM1tc6QDRp1ubvYI7XoCC-qCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMBH-eTQNo9VAc3895O37Nk-wSQqWC12yt96CuA1e7HOHIvVPEDb93h5VbEcOczAfzQ,file_size=48578]"}
{"time": 1776763579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211394363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2105689231]艾琳奈和艾琳先后回了你一下，眼睛启动的同时，露莉亚扭过头看向你，你看见不属于任何一种魔力的粒子在她周身旋转，形成了一个以她为中心的小漩涡。"}
{"time": 1776763588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1546297463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=576350695]过一下灵感"}
{"time": 1776763694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299155865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=211394363]“……？不是魔力的话……应该也不是权能那么高级的东西吧。”在心里嘀咕“好像还不少……”"}
{"time": 1776763759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "216688237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1546297463].rd+1"}
