{"time": 1776822357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73069287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1536204670]很近的地方，近到就在你旁边几个座位，当然也很明显了，来自伊芙。不过这种感觉只持续了一瞬间，很快就消去了。"}
{"time": 1776822378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549013517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "死死盯着她"}
{"time": 1776822411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467019403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "完全不知情.jpg。看着讲台的方向发呆"}
{"time": 1776822411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803885342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=84792850]至少，和魔力的性质完全不同，但说不上来是什么，本身模糊到解析无法判明。"}
{"time": 1776822458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003287804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然如果是龙裔的话，左右视野应该比正常人大一点可能）"}
{"time": 1776822468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341845603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1549013517]你看过去的时候她正从露莉亚的身上收回视线，像是什么不知情人士看向讲台。露莉亚在你身后轻咳了一下。"}
{"time": 1776822512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887111563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "握紧拳头...那就好，不会想对露露做什么吗，不过听到露露的声音，先把视线收回来"}
{"time": 1776822784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932849694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=887111563]她刚刚也看向了伊芙那边，看你回头凑到你耳边小声开口，\"诺诺?刚刚是不是发生了什么?\""}
{"time": 1776822791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118829245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "鉴于中午发生过的对话，现在很不巧地和左右都没什么话题"}
{"time": 1776822954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103518360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不太清楚....她好像对你做了什么...”小声"}
{"time": 1776823028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1208488621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=118829245]艾琳只是扫了你一眼，继续琢磨自己左手的玉镯。妃花把自己的书拿出来就有些发呆，完全没有留意刚刚的事。"}
{"time": 1776823168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "542094061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "这位更是还没拿出书来就在发呆。说起来，这节课要干啥来着？"}
{"time": 1776823219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870641399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "原来是展示魔法.jpg"}
