{"time": 1776859706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218109540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "各自怀揣着的心思，都随着希姆教授走进教室被打断，她这次没有带上次的水晶球，只是手里捏着本黑色的册子，整个人看上去轻飘飘的。"}
{"time": 1776905264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1100198735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=218109540]教室里依然有些嘈杂，不过看上去教授并不介意，她自顾自坐在讲台上，摊开手里的册子，\"我给各位同学五分钟的预演时间，待会按照点名顺序依次上台。\""}
{"time": 1776905278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923084296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我说醒了自行回复)"}
{"time": 1776905309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320671111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“上台，上台干嘛”问下艾琳奈"}
{"time": 1776905434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160088783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1100198735]“好像也没什么特别的可演。”一些简单的基础魔法挨个显现“看看热闹好了，说不定有什么有意思的呢？”目光若有若无往旁边瞟"}
{"time": 1776905439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881473798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来艾琳奈为什么在这）"}
{"time": 1776905453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177187366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她不是二年级？）"}
{"time": 1776905478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1602252262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你可以问她)"}
{"time": 1776905502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "578580048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这是挂科了还是留级了）"}
{"time": 1776905580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325093977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1320671111]\"嗯?\"她转过头，略带些茫然地看着你，\"艾琳没跟你说吗？我记得...是要展示自己的魔导器的输出吧？\""}
{"time": 1776905636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "425068988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1160088783]如果你看的是诺薇菈那边，你倒是可以看见她手上的三枚戒指"}
{"time": 1776905684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262013972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说，我们两个新来的，名单上会不会没有我们啊...”"}
{"time": 1776905880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62372427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=425068988]“没意思……”撑着下巴“能见到什么独门绝学就好了”"}
{"time": 1776905998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089715542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=E35B53A4D7E5A4E277FF1C267CBF7A7E.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTEK28qJ_Ibqw4y467YXbXgTlkf-Rj0vwMg_wooxJ761eKClAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQkihGiD7DAHOGzF6ptCBognoCliCCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAESMF_RKHlgtzF_Kkgs0tVL5JMg9lSg2JMwlnnRqQUkk4TjcBMxUHx8Ap8csjdALk3ZLg,file_size=57332]（不要温和的走进那个良夜.jpg）"}
{"time": 1776906042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392220511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你当然认识这三枚戒指，曾经属于爱璃西雅，现在有三枚戴在她手上，气和土的两枚倒是不知失踪。"}
{"time": 1776906097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674807610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=262013972]\"嗯...\"艾琳奈看着讲台上的教授，\"我不清楚...可能会有?不过大家用的都是教授发下来的临时魔导器啦，诺诺呢？\""}
{"time": 1776906106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1065155017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这个话题是不是聊过一遍)"}
