{"time": 1776906261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128792813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"emmm，只能先用这个了\"伸伸手"}
{"time": 1776906306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "585758316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "艾琳似乎是听见了你们的对话，转过身慢悠悠开口，\"诺薇菈不去找一下教授吗？趁现在这个时间。\""}
{"time": 1776906348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还真是....万一名单上没有就完蛋了...”看眼露露“走吧走吧”"}
{"time": 1776906355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013624221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=62372427]“妃花有什么准备吗？”侧过脸去问问“没有的话，到时候要不要一起”"}
{"time": 1776906545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398547435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=91A426C846187A30E5B69EBDD4687227.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSLah_B7mCCOafO2FZVBIp5j3HWUhjxgxkg_woo0o272uSClAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQVkwb6iTOh65JgBsHobED_noC_POCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAESMF_RKHlgtzF_Kkgs0tVL5JMg9lSg2JMwlnnRqQUkk4TjcBMxUHx8Ap8csjdALk3ZLg,file_size=410097]"}
{"time": 1776906554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "460287692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1776906561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914285651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1776906794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417406135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2013624221]翠玉的戒指被她从手指上摘下来，此刻正安然躺在她的手心，\"诶?\"闻言她扭过头对你眨眨眼，\"伊芙不开口的话，本来我也准备拜托伊芙了...这个东西...我一个人展示不了诶...\""}
{"time": 1776907000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617643588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1186075]露露闻言站起身，给你让开出去的空间"}
{"time": 1776907014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757709456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露不一起吗？”"}
{"time": 1776907088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2064801145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯哼，戴着吧。”点点头“这种无介质传输还挺厉害的”"}
{"time": 1776907365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897515595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1757709456]\"笨，等你先出来啦。\"她又往后退了一步，在教室里无疑有些显眼"}
{"time": 1776907394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1956279910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "起身出去，去找教授"}
{"time": 1776907444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626864543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2064801145]妃花点点脑袋，\"虽然我知道是没什么用的能力...不过...能帮上忙就好了。\"碎碎念"}
{"time": 1776907591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410189654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1956279910]很难说教室的目光有没有聚集到你们身上，但很快又被嘈杂掩盖下去。即便如此也称得上众目睽睽，你们两个走上了讲台。"}
{"time": 1776907610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018887902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1626864543]\"诶...\"她突然停下来，\"她们怎么上去了？\""}
{"time": 1776907630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637264634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个教授...我们两是前天刚入学的学生，名单上有我们吗”"}
{"time": 1776907695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "730484814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你得先说你叫什么吧）"}
{"time": 1776907706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1411113429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我叫诺薇拉，她叫露莉亚”"}
{"time": 1776907759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403435925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道”耸耸肩“说起来艾琳奈同学为什么在这里？”靠在椅背上，让妃花也能看到另一边"}
{"time": 1776908048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "49204074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1411113429]希姆的表情慵懒，似乎对你的话不是很上心，随意地指了指面前摊在讲台上的册子，随后伸了个懒腰。"}
{"time": 1776908070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800773105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看一眼"}
{"time": 1776908114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106537049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=403435925]\"我...?\"艾琳奈愣了一下，酝酿了一会才开口，\"单纯...服从安排...哈哈....\""}
{"time": 1776908156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1079352563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1800773105]姓名从A到Z开始排序，你先是找到了露莉亚，随后也翻到了自己的名字。"}
{"time": 1776908191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "918203017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说起来，翔哥应该之前看过，我没有再描述一遍希姆的外貌，?)"}
{"time": 1776908225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "491811950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那你在描述一遍）"}
{"time": 1776908232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622143573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“教授...那个我们没有临时魔导器，等下用这个可以吗”给教授看看"}
{"time": 1776908266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258532770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，被喊过来的？”简单猜测“稍微，有点好奇学姐的魔法”"}
{"time": 1776908440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1847911906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:forward,id=7631763634558782226]"}
{"time": 1776908449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833504831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=A33D84870C32D3D9E924E8A3A008F702.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTo_7aHLs--K1lUFXhKRJB99j4eeBjPow0g_woovYqb5-uClAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQj7H15PfS0AnQT7KP66r04HoCNKyCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMNrOhQzwdl6xPt7f0PsHb9Gh-4PCeN_IQj4CzJw8P9vyVPJ_yzbxdqON8t3pIql8uA,file_size=217551]"}
{"time": 1776908605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "232842223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1258532770]\"倒也不是啦...我只是凑个数，负责打个卡。\"听完你的话她捏了捏自己的脖子，\"我没什么天赋才能的...去年在墨菲教授那里...\"似乎感觉自己说得有点多，她有些不好意思地低了低头"}
{"time": 1776908620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1192447084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=622143573](怎么看，出示手吗？)"}
