{"time": 1776908651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668952257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是代考勤）"}
{"time": 1776908793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1276665585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "银龙没开化之前有这么……普通吗？稍感意外，不过很快开口“那你找诺薇拉借个戒指吧，我用过，傻瓜式魔导器，简单的很”"}
{"time": 1776908938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236976314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=698204563](你给教授看不摘下来，让她看你的手)"}
{"time": 1776908963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994692029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把戒指摘下来递给她"}
{"time": 1776909002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1471583826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=622143573]\"嗯...\"她微微眯着眼，但也没有特别在意的样子，你感觉有无形之物环绕在你手指上的戒指附近。"}
{"time": 1776909123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "660592243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1276665585]\"我不用参加考核啦...来上课也是...形式?\"她摇头，\"毕竟二年级的课没有去...\""}
{"time": 1776909322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "989651691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不太懂是什么情况，只能揣着糊涂装明白，点点头“原来是这样”"}
{"time": 1776909341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095925657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看教授怎么说"}
{"time": 1776909345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1400170231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1471583826]\"也可以。\"她最后下了结论，你顿时感觉周围的什么东西消去了，\"不过根基不牢。\""}
{"time": 1776909770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1444242702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“根基不牢是....什么意思”不太懂"}
{"time": 1776909926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498085017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1444242702]\"这种魔导器会直接帮助你进行玛纳的转换，而不是自己的身体做这一步。\"她如此解释，蓝色的瞳孔没有附加什么别的情绪，\"字面意思。\""}
{"time": 1776909983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774146507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=989651691]\"嗯嗯...就是这样。\"她也没管你是真懂还是假懂，迫切想要结束这个话题，\"所以不用管我啦...\""}
{"time": 1776910003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1115071289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那....教授，还有临时的魔导器用吗”"}
