{"time": 1776928606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1324435488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=304352333]一个四分之一人高，纯白色，饱满但不过于臃肿，表面细腻如婴儿肌肤。没有拉链、缝线、标签，浑然一体的——枕头。"}
{"time": 1776928773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685607560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哈？”左眉压低，右眉抬高，看着台上的白色不明物“那是什么？”"}
{"time": 1776929003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "621076368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "此时此刻，那白色蓬松的形似枕头的东西从水晶球中抽离，落在诺薇菈手里，一端自然垂下，教室里顿时安静得落针可闻。"}
{"time": 1776929006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986414162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
