{"time": 1776929058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194844172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=685607560]安静之后顿时迎来大量的窃窃私语，\"好像...枕头?\"妃花的语气有些不确定"}
{"time": 1776929086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "491897677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这这这...对吗"}
{"time": 1776929430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979302957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=491897677]那愉快的男声在你耳边消失，希姆用只有你能听到的声音缓缓开了口，\"予你所求，白昼夜晚皆得安眠。\""}
{"time": 1776929480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594362441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我所求是这个吗。。。”叹口气，在旁边等露露，看看她能拿出个什么"}
{"time": 1776929662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042095941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "水晶球浮到露莉亚身边，绕着她转了一圈，突然的咔嚓一声，从最上层的表面开始，裂纹瞬间布满全球，紧接着碎成了一摊灰雾。希姆稍微歪了歪头，教室里陡然热闹了。"}
{"time": 1776929769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1232134375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "来了点兴致，翘着腿看好戏。如果时机成熟也做好拱火的准备"}
{"time": 1776929830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500997716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;？&#93;,file=1A49A6990E236C5085F76488667B5173.jpg,sub_type=7,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSGrlnlD5aiNf_m6k1NSpJOtMn4sxjrDyD_CiiJi5u6u4OUAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhAMZqE5l5-yz3mT9dRslfKmegJJ6IIBAm5q&amp;rkey=CAISMBuq3jPmef0mHebhE4ZmM_aoT4RCKwC2RN0RkocFtSSDs3rqj8MUdtRrQuUjL4aHXA,file_size=2027]"}
{"time": 1776929978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "35749154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“教授....这是怎么回事”"}
{"time": 1776930166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1405034796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没什么，只是她用不了我的东西。\"希姆蓝色的瞳孔落在已经呆住的露莉亚身上，紧接着落在她手上的戒指，没有理会教室里的窃窃私语，\"可能她手上的也不行。\""}
{"time": 1776930266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617122327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？那该怎么办”"}
{"time": 1776930621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468227482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我会写一份证明递到学院，这节课她可以不用来了。\"希姆的眼神重新落回到诺薇菈身上，\"当然，如果只是想试试的话，也可以继续修我的课。说不定呢。\""}
{"time": 1776930881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496665802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看样子没什么大麻烦，松了一口气“露露怎么想呢”"}
{"time": 1776930971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140613902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我还想试试...\"她的目光躲闪，下意识藏了藏跨在腰间的破旧封壳的笔记本，\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1776931057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631386177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这日记本我怎么一点印象都没有）"}
{"time": 1776931063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1346826954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦笔记本）"}
{"time": 1776931093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1039718022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢教授.. 我们先回去了”"}
{"time": 1776931263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038790287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "希姆没有再说什么，目送你们回了座位，拍了拍手，在自己的册子上点了点，\"阿拉贡。\"坐在中间的一个男生抱着一把银剑站了起来。"}
{"time": 1776931368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043984159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回到位置也开始思考，等会该怎么用这个枕头展示呢"}
{"time": 1776931529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803949283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1043984159]看上去很适合垫着脑袋睡觉，浑然一体，上面没有拉链。"}
{"time": 1776931589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626906459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不注入魔力怎么知道。”隔着两个人插一嘴“搞快点，我也想知道”"}
{"time": 1776931626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211391573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "瞪伊芙一眼，然后慢慢注入魔力，看看这玩意到底干嘛的"}
{"time": 1776931641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136344999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以我到现在也不知道我的匕首有什么特别的地方，总感觉像是注入魔力之后能吹风）"}
{"time": 1776931660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1222106314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1038790287]他走上台，对着教授半躬了个身，紧接着手一横，做了个挥剑的起手式，熊熊烈火从剑上升腾而起，剑身上的符文发出亮眼的炽热昏光。"}
{"time": 1776931682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575301278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=136344999](对啊，你已经知道了用处了)"}
{"time": 1776931686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137143446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(魔力附魔，jpg)"}
{"time": 1776931931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445035150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*台下响起稀稀拉拉的掌声……伊芙自然是没反应的。虽然自己上台之后多半还没这个效果"}
{"time": 1776932045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1770340498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1211391573]你只感觉周围的空气都变得有些香醇，顿时有些困意上涌，你不由得向，对你而言这是否也算是一种诱惑和堕落。"}
{"time": 1776932182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715147194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "阿拉贡微微躬身，剑上的火焰熄灭，他挽了个剑花收回银剑。希姆点了一下头，在册子上勾了一下，喊了下一个名字，\"艾蕾。\""}
{"time": 1776932317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1397397061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "自己在下面轮流转换元素，像是个灯带，就当练习了。说起来怎么体现妃花的部分呢？"}
{"time": 1776932338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368633496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "所以这玩意的作用就是让人变困...自己等会总不能上台睡一觉吧"}
{"time": 1776932452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1202473495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，等艾琳登台了.jpg"}
{"time": 1776932717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1975665754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1202473495]那股醇香越过中间的两人传到你的鼻尖，没来由地，你也有些困倦的感觉，艾琳奈更是已经趴下来了，艾琳也在频频揉眼眶。"}
{"time": 1776932772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168112160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1368633496]看周围几人的表现，似乎不仅你想的那样，抛开已经躺下的艾琳奈，露莉亚似乎一直在掐着自己的大腿。"}
{"time": 1776932845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "941797732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "钓了回鱼才突然反应过来，皱了皱眉，一边鼓动风元素试着荡开奇怪的气味，一边扭过头去瞪诺薇拉“喂！”"}
{"time": 1776932854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "227444089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "连忙停止魔力的灌输，在继续下去大家真的都睡着了"}
{"time": 1776932962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114041162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么不试试定向）"}
{"time": 1776933055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593696677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看伊芙瞪自己，试试脑海里想着她的样子，然后在继续灌输魔力，看能不能只让她睡着"}
{"time": 1776933661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2048393021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1593696677]恐怕是没什么用，艾琳奈已经在吸气呼气了，不过刚刚的风确实吹散了一些弥漫着的醇香。"}
{"time": 1776933694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1242947680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "停止输出魔力，然后摇摇艾琳奈"}
{"time": 1776933746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1953605046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "与此同时，艾蕾已经下了台，\"艾琳。\"声音传过，艾琳起身，拂动垂下的发丝，做了个深呼吸准备上台。"}
{"time": 1776933788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428971343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾琳奈...起床了，现在还上课呢”"}
{"time": 1776933857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649214445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*把位置让开，大概也不用说“加油”这种话"}
{"time": 1776934034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756513226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1428971343]（她又不上台，睡不就睡了（）"}
{"time": 1776934303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1819260276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1428971343]\"嗯...嗯...\"她发出了有些嘟囔不清的声音，没有要醒的意思。"}
{"time": 1776934421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428470469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "艾琳走上讲台，对着教授躬了躬身，回过身扫视了一眼整个班级，抬起左手露出手腕上的镯子，右手搭在镯子上轻轻转动镯子，半透明的晶格频空出现在她周身部分区域。"}
{"time": 1776934448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662342673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不用你费心了。”目送着艾琳，声音不算大，但是显然是对诺薇拉说“她又不用上台，非摇起来干嘛”"}
{"time": 1776934481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1276816435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“万一教授生气了呢😠”"}
{"time": 1776934582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590553870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“万一艾琳奈生气了呢”翻个白眼"}
{"time": 1776934633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498615438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "懒得理伊芙"}
